('base1-11', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Thrash\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 damage plus 10 more damage; if tails, this attack does 30 damage and Nidoking does 10 damage to itself.\'}, {\'name\': \'Toxic\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned. It now takes 20 Poison damage instead of 10 after each player\'s turn (even if it was already Poisoned).\"}]', 'Base', '3', 'Nidorino', '', 'Uses its powerful tail in battle to smash, constrict, then break its preys bones.', 'First', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Nidoking', '34', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '11', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('base1-12', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Lure\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has any Benched Pokémon, choose 1 of them and switch it with his or her Active Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fire Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard 1 Fire Energy card attached to Ninetales in order to use this attack.\'}]', 'Base', '1', 'Vulpix', '', 'Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Ninetales', '38', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '12', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('base1-13', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"Does 30 damage plus 10 more damage for each Water Energy attached to Poliwrath but not used to pay for this attack\'s Energy cost. Extra Water Energy after the 2nd doesn\'t count.\"}, {\'name\': \'Whirlpool\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon has any Energy cards attached to it, choose 1 of them and discard it.\'}]', 'Base', '3', 'Poliwhirl', '', 'An adept swimmer at both the front crawl and breaststroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers.', 'First', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '48', 'Poliwrath', '62', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '13', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('base1-14', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Agility\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Raichu.\"}, {\'name\': \'Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, Raichu does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Base', '1', 'Pikachu', '', 'Its long tail serves as a ground to protect itself from its own high-voltage power.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Raichu', '26', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '14', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('base1-15', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Trans\', \'text\': \"As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may take 1 Grass Energy card attached to 1 of your Pokémon and attach it to a different one. This power can\'t be used if Venusaur is Asleep, Confused, or Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Pokémon Power\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Solarbeam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Base', '2', 'Ivysaur', '', 'This plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight.', 'First', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '67', 'Venusaur', '3', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '15', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base1-16', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, Zapdos does 30 damage to itself.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunderbolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Discard all Energy cards attached to Zapdos in order to use this attack.\'}]', 'Base', '3', '', '', 'A legendary bird Pokémon said to appear from clouds while wielding enormous lightning bolts.', 'First', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '64', 'Zapdos', '145', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', ''),
('base1-17', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Twineedle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Poison Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Base', '', 'Kakuna', '', 'Flies at high speed and attacks using the large, venomous stingers on its forelegs and tail.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-17.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Beedrill', '15', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Base', '17', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base1-18', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon has any Energy cards attached to it, choose 1 of them and discard it.\'}]', 'Base', '2', 'Dratini', 'Dragonite', 'A mystical Pokémon that exudes a gentle aura. Has the ability to change climate conditions.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-18.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '33', 'Dragonair', '148', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '18', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('base1-19', '', '', 'Keiji Kinebuchi', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your own Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Base', '2', 'Diglett', '', 'A team of Diglett triplets. It triggers huge earthquakes by burrowing 60 miles underground.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-19.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '36', 'Dugtrio', '51', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Lightning, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '19', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('base1-2', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Dance\', \'text\': \"As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may attach 1 Water Energy card to 1 of your Water Pokémon. (This doesn\'t use up your 1 Energy card attachment for the turn.) This power can\'t be used if Blastoise is Asleep, Confused, or Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Pokémon Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \"Does 40 damage plus 10 more damage for each Water Energy attached to Blastoise but not used to pay for this attack\'s Energy cost. Extra Water Energy after the 2nd doesn\'t count.\"}]', 'Base', '3', 'Wartortle', '', 'A brutal Pokémon with pressurized water jets on its shell. They are used for high-speed tackles.', 'First', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-2.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '52', 'Blastoise', '9', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '2', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('base1-20', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Thundershock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunderpunch\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 damage plus 10 more damage; if tails, this attack does 30 damage plus Electabuzz does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Base', '2', '', 'Electivire', 'Normally found near power plants, it can wander away and cause major blackouts in cities.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-20.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Electabuzz', '125', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '20', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('base1-21', '[{\'name\': \'Buzzap\', \'text\': \"At any time during your turn (before your attack), you may Knock Out Electrode and attach it to 1 of your other Pokémon. If you do, choose a type of Energy. Electrode is now an Energy card (instead of a Pokémon) that provides 2 energy of that type. You can\'t use this power if Electrode is Asleep, Confused, or Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Pokémon Power\'}]', '', 'Keiji Kinebuchi', '[{\'name\': \'Electric Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, Electrode does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Base', '1', 'Voltorb', '', 'It stores electrical energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Electrode', '101', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '21', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('base1-22', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Whirlwind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has any Benched Pokémon, he or she chooses 1 of them and switches it with the Defending Pokémon. (Do the damage before switching the Pokémon.)\'}, {\'name\': \'Mirror Move\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If Pidgeotto was attacked last turn, do the final result of that attack on Pidgeotto to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Base', '1', 'Pidgey', 'Pidgeot', 'Very protective of its sprawling territory, this Pokémon will fiercely peck at any intruder.', 'First', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-22.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '36', 'Pidgeotto', '17', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '22', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('base1-23', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Flamethrower\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Discard 1 Fire Energy card attached to Arcanine in order to use this attack.\'}, {\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Arcanine does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Base', '3', 'Growlithe', '', 'A Pokémon that has been long admired for its beauty. It runs gracefully, as if on wings.', 'First', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Arcanine', '59', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '23', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('base1-24', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Flamethrower\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Discard 1 Fire Energy card attached to Charmeleon in order to use this attack.\'}]', 'Base', '1', 'Charmander', 'Charizard', 'When it swings its burning tail, it raises the temperature to unbearably high levels.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Charmeleon', '5', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '24', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
