('base1-26', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Base', '1', '', 'Dragonair', 'Long considered a mythical Pokémon until recently, when a small colony was found living underwater.', 'First', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Dratini', '147', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '26', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('base1-27', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Leek Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. Either way, you can\'t use this attack again as long as Farfetch\'d stays in play (even putting Farfetch\'d on the Bench won\'t let you use it again).\"}, {\'name\': \'Pot Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Base', '1', '', 'Sirfetchd', 'The sprig of green onions it holds is its weapon. This sprig is used much like a metal sword.', 'First', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '20', 'Farfetchd', '83', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '27', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('base1-28', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Flare\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Base', '1', '', 'Arcanine', 'Very protective of its territory. It will bark and bite to repel intruders from its space.', 'First', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Growlithe', '58', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '01/09/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '28', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
