('base1-3', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Scrunch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to Chansey during your opponent\'s next turn. (Any other effects of attacks still happen.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Double-edge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Chansey does 80 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Base', '1', '', 'Blissey', 'A rare and elusive Pokémon that is said to bring happiness to those who manage to catch it.', 'First', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base1/base1-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '55', 'Chansey', '113', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '01/09/1999', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '3', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
