('base2-1', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Metronome\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks. Metronome copies that attack except for its Energy costs and anything else required in order to use that attack, such as discarding Energy cards. (No matter what type the Defending Pokémon is, Clefable\'s type is still Colorless.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Minimize\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"All damage done by attacks to Clefable during your opponent\'s next turn is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Jungle', '2', 'Clefairy', '', 'A timid Fairy Pokémon that is rarely seen. It will run and hide the moment it senses people.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '34', 'Clefable', '36', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '1', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('base2-10', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Swords Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Scyther\'s Slash attack\'s base damage is 60 instead of 30.\"}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Jungle', '', '', 'Scizor', 'With ninja-like agility and speed, it can create the illusion that there is more than one of it.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '25', 'Scyther', '123', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Base', '10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base2-11', '[{\'name\': \'Thick Skinned\', \'text\': \"Snorlax can\'t become Asleep, Confused, Paralyzed, or Poisoned. This power can\'t be used if Snorlax is already Asleep, Confused, or Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Pokémon Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Body Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Jungle', '4', 'Munchlax', '', 'Very lazy. Just eats and sleeps. As its rotund bulk builds, it becomes steadily more slothful.', 'First', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '20', 'Snorlax', '143', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '11', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('base2-12', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 20 more damage; if tails, this attack does 10 damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"Does 30 damage plus 10 more damage for each Water Energy attached to Vaporeon but not used to pay for this attack\'s Energy cost. Extra Water Energy after the 2nd doesn\'t count.\"}]', 'Jungle', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'Lives close to water. Its long tail is ridged with a fin that is often mistaken for a mermaids.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Vaporeon', '134', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '6/16/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '12', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('base2-13', '[{\'name\': \'Shift\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may change the type of Venomoth to the type of any other Pokémon in play other than Colorless. This power can\'t be used if Venomoth is Asleep, Confused, or Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Pokémon Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Venom Powder\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused and Poisoned.\'}]', 'Jungle', '', 'Venonat', '', 'The dust-like scales covering its wings are color coded to indicate the kinds of poison it has.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Venomoth', '49', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Base', '13', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
