('base2-30', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Lure\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has any Benched Pokémon, choose 1 of them and switch it with his or her Active Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Acid\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your next turn.\"}]', 'Jungle', '2', 'Weepinbell', '', 'Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Victreebel', '71', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '6/16/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '30', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base2-31', '[{\'name\': \'Heal\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may flip a coin. If heads, remove 1 damage counter from 1 of your Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Vileplume is Asleep, Confused, or Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Pokémon Power\'}]', '', 'Keiji Kinebuchi', '[{\'name\': \'Petal Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads. Vileplume is now Confused (after doing damage).\'}]', 'Jungle', '2', 'Gloom', '', 'The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Vileplume', '45', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '6/16/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '31', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base2-32', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Lullaby\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Do the Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage plus 10 more damage for each of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Jungle', '2', 'Jigglypuff', '', 'The body is soft and rubbery. When angered, it will suck in air and inflate itself to an enormous size.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '36', 'Wigglytuff', '40', 'WOTC', 'Rare', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '32', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('base2-33', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Whirlwind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has any Benched Pokémon, he or she chooses 1 of them and switches it with the Defending Pokémon. (Do the damage before switching the Pokémon.)\'}, {\'name\': \'Mega Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Remove a number of damage counters from Butterfree equal to half the damage done to the Defending Pokémon (after applying Weakness and Resistance) (rounded up to the nearest 10).\'}]', 'Jungle', '', 'Metapod', '', 'In battle, it flaps its wings at high speed to release highly toxic dust into the air.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Butterfree', '12', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Base', '33', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base2-34', '[{\'name\': \'Retreat Aid\', \'text\': \'As long as Dodrio is Benched, pay Colorless less to retreat your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Pokémon Power\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Rage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage plus 10 more damage for each damage counter on Dodrio.\'}]', 'Jungle', '', 'Doduo', '', 'Uses its three brains to execute complex plans. While two heads sleep, one head stays awake.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Dodrio', '85', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Base', '34', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('base2-35', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Teleport\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Switch Exeggutor with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Big Eggsplosion\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip a number of coins equal to the number of Energy attached to Exeggutor. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Jungle', '3', 'Exeggcute', '', 'Legend has it that on rare occasions, one of its heads will drop off and continue on as an Exeggcute.', 'First', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Exeggutor', '103', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '6/16/1999', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '35', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base2-36', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Agility\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Fearow.\"}, {\'name\': \'Drill Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Jungle', '', 'Spearow', '', 'With its huge and magnificent wings, it can keep aloft without ever having to land for rest.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '27', 'Fearow', '22', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Base', '36', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('base2-37', '', '', 'Keiji Kinebuchi', '[{\'name\': \'Poisonpowder\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Foul Odor\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Both the Defending Pokémon and Gloom are now Confused (after doing damage).\'}]', 'Jungle', '1', 'Oddish', 'Vileplume, Bellossom', 'The fluid that oozes from its mouth isnt drool - it is a nectar that is used to attract prey.', 'First', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Gloom', '44', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '6/16/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '37', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('base2-38', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Tongue Wrap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Supersonic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Jungle', '3', '', 'Lickilicky', 'Its tongue can be extended like a chameleons. It leaves a stinging sensation when it licks enemies.', 'First', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Lickitung', '108', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Base', '38', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('base2-39', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Bonemerang\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Call for Friend\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Search your deck for a Fighting Basic Pokémon card and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward. (You can\'t use this attack if your Bench is full.)\"}]', 'Jungle', '1', 'Cubone', '', 'The bone it holds is its key weapon. It throws the bone skillfully like a boomerang to K.O. targets.', 'First', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Marowak', '105', 'WOTC', 'Uncommon', '', '6/16/1999', 'type: Lightning, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '39', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('base2-4', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 20 more damage; if tails, this attack does 10 damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Pin Missile\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Jungle', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'It accumulates negative ions from the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts.', 'First', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base2/base2-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '29', 'Jolteon', '135', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '6/16/1999', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Base', '4', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
