('base6-6', '', '', 'Shin-ichi Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Fascinate\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon and switch it with the Defending Pokémon. This attack can\'t be used if your opponent has no Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Poison Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Legendary Collection', '', 'Meowth', '', 'Popular with women because of its beautiful fur. The leader of the Rockets keeps one as a pet.', 'Second', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/base6/base6-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Dark Persian', '53', 'WOTC', 'Rare Holo', '', '5/24/2002', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', '', '', 'Other', '6', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
