('bw1-113', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Outrage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 more for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Blue Flare\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Fire Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', '', 'This Pokémon appears in legends. It sends flames into the air from its tail, burning up everything around it.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Reshiram', '643', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '113', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw1-114', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Outrage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bolt Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 40 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', '', 'This Pokémon appears in legends. In its tail, it has a giant generator that creates electricity.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zekrom', '644', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '114', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-115', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Energize\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach a Lightning Energy from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunderbolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard all Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Raichu', 'This is an extremely rare Pikachu card. Youre very lucky to have found it!', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pikachu', '25', 'TPCI', 'Rare Secret', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '115', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-12', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Constant Rattle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. If 1 of them is heads, this attack does 10 damage. If 2 of them are heads, this attack does 30 damage. If all of them are heads, this attack does 60 damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Giga Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal from this Pokémon the same amount of damage you did to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', '', 'Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Maractus', '556', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw1-13', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Double Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leech Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Heal 10 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Sawsbuck', 'The color and scent of their fur changes to match the mountain grass. When they sense hostility, they hide in the grass.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Deerling', '585', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw1-14', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Nature Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"Does 10 more damage for each Grass Energy attached to both your and your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Horn Leech\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Deerling', '', 'They migrate according to the seasons. People can tell the season by looking at Sawsbucks horns.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sawsbuck', '586', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '14', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw1-15', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Pignite', 'It can deftly dodge its foes attacks while shooting fireballs from its nose. It roasts berries before it eats them.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tepig', '498', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '15', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw1-16', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', 'Pignite', 'It can deftly dodge its foes attacks while shooting fireballs from its nose. It roasts berries before it eats them.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tepig', '498', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw1-17', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Fire Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heat Crash\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '3', 'Tepig', 'Emboar', 'When its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-17.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pignite', '499', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '17', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
