('bw1-23', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Firebreathing\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', 'Darmanitan', 'Darumakas droppings are hot, so people used to put them in their clothes to keep themselves warm.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Darumaka', '554', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '23', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
