('bw1-56', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Recover\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy attached to this Pokémon and heal all damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Solosis', 'Reuniclus', 'When their brains, now divided in two, are thinking the same thought, these Pokémon exhibit their maximum power.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duosion', '578', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw1-57', '[{\'name\': \'Damage Swap\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may move 1 damage counter from 1 of your Pokémon to another of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Psywave\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 more damage for each Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', 'Duosion', '', 'These remarkably intelligent Pokémon fight by controlling arms that can grip with rock-crushing power.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Reuniclus', '579', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '57', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw1-58', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Gurdurr', 'It fights by swinging a piece of timber around. It is close to evolving when it can handle the lumber without difficulty.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Timburr', '532', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw1-59', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', 'Gurdurr', 'These Pokémon appear at building sites and help out with construction. They always carry squared logs.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Timburr', '532', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw1-6', '[{\'name\': \'Royal Heal\', \'text\': \'At any time between turns, heal 10 damage from each of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Leaf Tornado\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Move as many Grass Energy attached to your Pokémon to your other Pokémon in any way you like.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Servine', '', 'They raise their heads to intimidate opponents but only give it their all when fighting a powerful opponent.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Serperior', '497', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '6', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw1-60', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Bulk Up\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, each of this Pokémon\'s attacks does 20 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', 'Timburr', 'Conkeldurr', 'They strengthen their bodies by carrying steel beams. They show off their big muscles to their friends.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gurdurr', '533', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '60', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw1-61', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Circle Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Storm Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Black & White', '3', '', '', 'When they encounter foes bigger than themselves, they try to throw them. They always travel in packs of five.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Throh', '538', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw1-62', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Low Sweep\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Beatdown\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', '', 'The sound of Sawk punching boulders and trees can be heard all the way from the mountains where they train.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sawk', '539', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw1-63', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Tomb\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', 'Krokorok', 'It moves along below the sands surface, except for its nose and eyes. A dark membrane shields its eyes from the sun.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandile', '551', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw1-64', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Torment\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks. That Pokémon can\'t use that attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', 'Sandile', 'Krookodile', 'The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Krokorok', '552', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw1-65', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Torment\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks. That Pokémon can\'t use that attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Krookoroll\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon already has any damage counters on it, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}]', 'Black & White', '3', 'Krokorok', '', 'It can expand the focus of its eyes, enabling it to see objects in the far distance as if it were using binoculars.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Krookodile', '553', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '65', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw1-66', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Liepard', 'Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Purrloin', '509', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-67', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Taunt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch the Defending Pokémon with 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sucker Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Darkness Energy attached to it, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Purrloin', '', 'Stealthily, it sneaks up on its target, striking from behind before its victim has a chance to react.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Liepard', '510', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '67', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-68', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Scrafty', 'Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scraggy', '559', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-69', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Spit Acid\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned. Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is also Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'High Jump Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Scraggy', '', 'Groups of them beat up anything that enters their territory. Each can spit acidic liquid from its mouth.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scrafty', '560', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '69', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-7', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Vine Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Simisage', 'It shares the leaf on its head with weary-looking Pokémon. These leaves are known to relieve stress.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pansage', '511', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw1-70', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Lunge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Zoroark', 'To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zorua', '570', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-71', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Nasty Plot\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Foul Play\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks and use it as this attack.\"}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Zorua', '', 'Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zoroark', '571', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '71', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-72', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Surprise Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Mandibuzz', 'Its wings are too tiny to allow it to fly. As the time approaches for it to evolve, it discards the bones it was wearing.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vullaby', '629', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw1-73', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Blindside\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Does 50 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon that has any damage counters on it. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Punishment\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is a Stage 2 Pokémon, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Vullaby', '', 'It makes a nest out of bones it finds. It grabs weakened prey in its talons and hauls it to its nest of bones.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mandibuzz', '630', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '73', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw1-74', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Bind\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', '', 'Klang', 'The two minigears that mesh together are predetermined. Each will rebound from other minigears without meshing.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Klink', '599', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw1-75', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Bind\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Gear Grind\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 60 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', 'Klink', 'Klinklang', 'By changing the direction in which it rotates, it communicates its feelings to others. When angry, it rotates faster.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Klang', '600', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '75', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('bw1-76', '[{\'name\': \'Shift Gear\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may move a Metal Energy attached to 1 of your Pokémon to another of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Gear Grind\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 80 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Black & White', '3', 'Klang', '', 'Its red core functions as an energy tank. It fires the charged energy through its spikes into an area.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Klinklang', '601', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '76', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw1-77', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Watchog', 'Using food stored in cheek pouches, they can keep watches for days. They use their tails to communicate with others.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Patrat', '504', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-78', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Hyper Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', '', 'Watchog', 'Extremely cautious, they take shifts to maintain a constant watch of their nest. They feel insecure without a lookout.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Patrat', '504', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-79', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Confuse Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Black & White', '1', 'Patrat', '', 'They make the patterns on their bodies shine in order to threaten predators. Keen eyesight lets them see in the dark.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Watchog', '505', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '79', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw1-8', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Fury Swipes\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Black & White', '2', 'Pansage', '', 'It attacks enemies with strikes of its thorn-covered tail. This Pokémon is wild tempered.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw1/bw1-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Simisage', '512', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '4/25/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '8', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
