('bw11-37', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Shell\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '1', '', 'Dewott', 'The scalchop on its stomach is made from the same elements as claws. It detaches the scalchop for use as a blade.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Oshawott', '501', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '37', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw11-38', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Water Energy attached to this Pokémon. This attack does 10 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '1', 'Oshawott', 'Samurott', 'Scalchop techniques differ from one Dewott to another. It never neglects maintaining its scalchops.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dewott', '502', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '38', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw11-39', '[{\'name\': \'Shell Armor\', \'text\': \'Any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 more damage for each Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '2', 'Dewott', '', 'Part of the armor on its anterior legs becomes a giant sword. Its cry alone is enough to intimidate most enemies.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Samurott', '503', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '39', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw11-4', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Double Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '1', '', 'Cherrim', 'The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off.', 'Fifth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cherubi', '420', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/06/2013', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw11-40', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Vibration\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Mud Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '1', '', 'Palpitoad', 'By vibrating its cheeks, it emits sound waves imperceptible to humans. It uses the rhythm of these sounds to talk.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tympole', '535', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '40', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw11-41', '', '', 'Sachiko Adachi', '[{\'name\': \'Mud Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Round\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Does 20 damage times the number of your Pokémon that have the Round attack.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '2', 'Tympole', 'Seismitoad', 'It lives in the water and on land. It uses its long, sticky tongue to capture prey.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palpitoad', '536', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '41', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw11-42', '', '', 'Hajime Kusajima', '[{\'name\': \'Round\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Does 30 damage times the number of your Pokémon that have the Round attack.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '3', 'Palpitoad', '', 'It increases the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists. It can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seismitoad', '537', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '42', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw11-43', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Outrage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Glaciate\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '2', '', '', 'It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kyurem', '646', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '43', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('bw11-44', '', '', 'Shizurow', '[{\'name\': \'Frozen Wings\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Discard a Special Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hail Blizzard\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Hail Blizzard during your next turn.\"}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '3', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kyurem-EX', '646', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Black & White', '44', 'Basic, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('bw11-45', '[{\'name\': \'Rush In\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is on your Bench, you may switch this Pokémon with your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Toyste Beach', '[{\'name\': \'Secret Sword\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Does 20 more damage for each Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '2', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Keldeo-EX', '647', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Black & White', '45', 'Basic, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw11-46', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Random Spark\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Thundering Hurricane\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 50 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '2', '', '', 'A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.', 'Fifth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zapdos', '145', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/06/2013', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '46', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw11-47', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Tag Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 4 cards. If Minun is on your Bench, draw 4 more cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Positive Ion\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Plusle', '311', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw11-48', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Negative Ion\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done by attacks from the Defending Pokémon is reduced by 30 (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Electrishower\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Minun', '312', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '48', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw11-49', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Legendary Treasures', '', '', '', 'They live on treetops and glide using the inside of a cape-like membrane while discharging electricity.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw11/bw11-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Emolga', '587', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/06/2013', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Black & White', '49', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
