('bw2-81', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Emerging Powers', '1', 'Pidove', 'Unfezant', 'Many people believe that, deep in the forest where Tranquill live, there is a peaceful place where there is no war.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw2/bw2-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tranquill', '520', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/31/2011', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '81', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw2-82', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Tailwind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach an Energy from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Feather Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 40 more damage. If tails, discard an Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Emerging Powers', '', 'Tranquill', '', 'Males have plumage on their heads. They will never let themselves fell close to anyone other than their Trainers.', 'Fifth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw2/bw2-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Unfezant', '521', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/31/2011', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Black & White', '82', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw2-83', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Powerful Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Energy attached to this Pokémon. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heal Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 50 damage from 1 of your Pokémon.\'}]', 'Emerging Powers', '2', '', '', 'Its auditory sense is astounding. It has a radar-like ability to understand its surrounding through slight sounds.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw2/bw2-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Audino', '531', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/31/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
