('bw3-57', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Searing Flame\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Lampent', 'Litwick shines a light that absorbs the life energy of people and Pokémon, which becomes the fuel it burns.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Litwick', '607', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw3-58', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Teleportation Burst\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Lampent', 'While shining a light and pretending to be a guide, it leaches off the life force of any who follow it.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Litwick', '607', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw3-59', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Luring Light\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch the Defending Pokémon with 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Will-O-Wisp\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', 'Litwick', 'Chandelure', 'This ominous Pokémon is feared. Through cities it wanders, searching for the spirits of the fallen.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lampent', '608', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '59', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw3-6', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Withdraw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', '', 'Crustle', 'The Pokémon can easily melt holes in hard rocks with a liquid secreted from its mouth.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dwebble', '557', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-60', '[{\'name\': \'Cursed Shadow\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, you may put 3 damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon in any way you like.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Eerie Glow\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned and Confused.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', 'Lampent', '', 'It absorbs a spirit, which it then burns. By waving the flames on its arms, it puts its foes into a hypnotic trance.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chandelure', '609', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '60', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw3-61', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Core Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon for each Fighting Energy attached to this Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Power Gem\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '4', 'Boldore', '', 'Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain.', 'Fifth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gigalith', '526', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '61', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw3-62', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Pummel\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', '', 'Gurdurr', 'It fights by swinging a piece of lumber around. It is close to evolving when it can handle the lumber without difficulty.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Timburr', '532', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw3-63', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Strength\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Pummel\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '3', 'Timburr', 'Conkeldurr', 'This Pokémon is so muscular and strongly built that even a group of wrestlers could not make it budge an inch.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gurdurr', '533', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '63', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw3-64', '[{\'name\': \'Craftsmanship\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon gets +20 HP for each Fighting Energy attached to it.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Top Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '4', 'Gurdurr', '', 'It it thought that Conkeldurr taught humans how to make concrete more than 2,000 years ago.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Conkeldurr', '534', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '64', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw3-65', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Chip Away\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by any effects on the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Swing Around\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '3', 'Gurdurr', '', 'They use concrete pillars as walking canes. They know moves that enable them to swing the pillars freely in battle.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Conkeldurr', '534', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '65', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw3-66', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Acrobatics\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', 'Plume Fossil', 'Archeops', 'Said to be an ancestor of bird Pokémon, they were unable to fly and moved about by hopping from one branch to another.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Archen', '566', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Put this card onto your Bench only with the effect of Plume Fossil\']', 'Black & White', '66', 'Restored', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw3-67', '[{\'name\': \'Ancient Power\', \'text\': \"Each play can\'t play any Pokémon from his or her hand to evolve his or her Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Slide\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', 'Archen', '', 'They are intelligent and will cooperate to catch prey. From the ground, they use a running start to take flight.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Banned', '', 'Archeops', '567', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '67', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw3-68', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Trickle\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thundershock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', '', 'It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a volt of electricity.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stunfisk', '618', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw3-69', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'High Jump Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Mienshao', 'In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attack. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienfoo', '619', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw3-7', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'X-Scissor\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 50 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '3', 'Dwebble', '', 'Competing for territory, Crustle fight viciously. The one whose boulder is broken is the loser of the battle.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crustle', '558', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('bw3-70', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Feint\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'High Jump Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', 'Mienfoo', '', 'It wield the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arms attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienshao', '620', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '70', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw3-71', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Dynamic Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage and the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '3', '', 'Golurk', 'These Pokémon are thought to have been created by the science of an ancient and mysterious civilization.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golett', '622', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw3-72', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer Arm\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hurricane Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 50 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '4', 'Golett', '', 'It is said that Golurk were ordered to protect people and Pokémon by the ancient people who made them.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golurk', '623', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '72', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw3-73', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Retaliate\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack during his or her last turn, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Land Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '4', '', '', 'Its charge is strong enough to break through a giant castle wall in one blow. This Pokémon is spoken of in legends.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Terrakion', '639', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw3-74', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Abundant Harvest\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Gaia Hammer\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each Benched Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s). (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', '', 'Lands visited by Landorus grant such bountiful crops that it has been hailed as The Guardian of the Fields.', 'Fifth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Landorus', '645', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw3-75', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Iron Head\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Bisharp', 'They fight at Bisharps command. They cling to their prey and inflict damage by sinking their blades into it.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pawniard', '624', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw3-76', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Finishing Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon already has any damage counters on it, this attack does 50 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Night Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', 'Pawniard', '', 'Bisharp pursues prey in the company of a large group of Pawniard. Then Bisharp finishes off the prey.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bisharp', '625', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '76', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw3-77', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', '', 'Zweilous', 'They cannot see, so they tackle and bite to learn about their surroundings. Their bodies are covered in wounds.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Deino', '633', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw3-78', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Double Hit\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Strength\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', 'Deino', 'Hydreigon', 'Since their two heads do not get along and compete with each other for food, they always eat too much.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zweilous', '634', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '78', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw3-79', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Aura\', \'text\': \'All Energy attached to this Pokémon are Darkness Energy instead of their usual type.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Berserker Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Does 40 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '3', 'Zweilous', '', 'The heads on their arms do not have brains. They use all three heads to consume and destroy everything.', 'Fifth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hydreigon', '635', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '79', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw3-8', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Mysterious Evolution\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If Shelmet is in play, search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon. (This counts as evolving this Pokémon.) Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fury Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Escavalier', 'When they feel threatened, they spit acidic liquid to drive attackers away. This Pokémon targets Shelmet.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Karrablast', '588', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-80', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Twineedle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 70 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '3', 'Karrablast', '', 'These Pokémon evolve by wearing the shell covering of a Shelmet. The steel armor protects their whole body.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Escavalier', '589', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '80', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-81', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Cut\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Bisharp', 'Blades comprise this Pokémons entire body. If battling dulls the blades, it sharpens them on stones by the river.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pawniard', '624', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-82', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Stream\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Attach a Metal Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Metal Scissors\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Does 20 more damage for each Metal Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', 'Pawniard', '', 'It leads a group of Pawniard. It battles to become the boss, but will be driven from the group if it loses.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bisharp', '625', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '82', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-83', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Devour\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"For each of your Durant in play, discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Vice Grip\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', '', 'They attack in groups, covering themselves in steel armor to protect themselves against Heatmor.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Durant', '632', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-84', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Press\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Does 20 more damage for each Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Iron Breaker\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', '', '', 'It has a body and heart of steel. Its glare is sufficient to make even an unruly Pokémon obey it.', 'Fifth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cobalion', '638', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '84', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-85', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Do the Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage times the number of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', '', '', 'It touches others with the feelers on its ears, using the sound of their heartbeats to tell how they are feeling.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Audino', '531', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '85', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw3-86', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Fraxure', 'They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Axew', '610', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('bw3-87', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Dual Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', 'Axew', 'Haxorus', 'Since a broken tusk will not grow back, they diligently sharpen their tusks on river rocks after theyve been fighting.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Fraxure', '611', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '87', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('bw3-88', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 50 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Giga Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', 'Fraxure', '', 'They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Haxorus', '612', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '88', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('bw3-89', '[{\'name\': \'Rough Skin\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), put 2 damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Clutch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '2', '', '', 'It races through narrow caves, using its sharp claws to catch prey. The skin on its face is harder than a rock.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Druddigon', '621', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '89', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('bw3-9', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', 'Amoonguss', 'For some reason, this Pokémon resembles a Poké Ball. They release poison spores to repel those who try to catch them.', 'Fifth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Foongus', '590', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '9', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-90', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Noble Victories', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cover Fossil', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', '', '[\'Look at the bottom 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal a Tirtouga you find there and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '90', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw3-91', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Noble Victories', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eviolite', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \'If the Pokémon this card is attached to is a Basic Pokémon, any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '91', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw3-92', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Noble Victories', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'N', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', '', '[\'Each player shuffles his or her hand into his or her deck. Then, each player draws a card for each of his or her remaining Prize cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '92', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw3-93', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Noble Victories', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Plume Fossil', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', '', '[\'Look at the bottom 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal an Archen you find there and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '93', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw3-94', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Noble Victories', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rocky Helmet', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"If the Pokémon this card is attached to is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if that Pokémon is Knocked Out), put 2 damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '94', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw3-95', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Noble Victories', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-95.png', 'standard: Legal, unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Super Rod', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', '', '[\'Shuffle 3 in any combination of Pokémon and basic Energy cards from your discard pile back into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '95', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw3-96', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Noble Victories', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Xtransceiver', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/16/2011', '', '', '[\'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Supporter card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '96', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw3-97', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Double Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leaf Wallop\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Leaf Wallop attack does 40 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', '', 'Its head sprouts horns as sharp as blades. Using whirlwind-like movements, it confounds and swiftly cuts opponents.', 'Fifth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Virizion', '640', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '11/16/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '97', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw3-98', '[{\'name\': \'Victory Star\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, after you flip any coins for an attack, you may ignore all effects of those coin flips and being flipping those coins again. You can\'t use more than 1 Victory Star Ability each turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Stored Power\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Move all Energy attached to this Pokémon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Victini', '494', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '98', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw3-99', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Retaliate\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack during his or her last turn, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Land Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Noble Victories', '4', '', '', 'Its charge is strong enough to break through a giant castle wall in one blow. This Pokémon is spoken of in legends.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw3/bw3-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Terrakion', '639', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '11/16/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '99', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw4-1', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Power Pinch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. For each heads, discard an Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Grip and Squeeze\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Next Destinies', '2', '', '', 'It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn in half. What it cant tear, it tosses far.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pinsir', '127', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
