('bw4-100', '[{\'name\': \'Inferno Fandango\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may attach a Fire Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Heat Crash\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '4', 'Pignite', '', 'This extremely rare Pokémon is a different color than usual. It is very hard to find.', 'Fifth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Emboar', '500', 'TPCI', 'Rare Secret', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '100', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
