('bw4-23', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Recover\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy attached to this Pokémon and heal all damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '1', '', 'Starmie', 'If its body is torn, it can grow back if the red core remains. The core flashes at midnight.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Staryu', '120', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '23', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw4-24', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Confuse Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}, {\'name\': \'Swift\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness, Resistance, or any other effects on the Defending Pokémon.\"}]', 'Next Destinies', '', 'Staryu', '', 'At the center of its body is a red core, which sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Starmie', '121', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/08/2012', '', '', '', 'Black & White', '24', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw4-25', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '2', '', '', 'It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '25', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw4-26', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Water Arrow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '2', '', '', 'It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '26', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('bw4-27', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ice Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '2', '', '', 'A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.', 'Fifth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Articuno', '144', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/08/2012', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '27', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('bw4-28', '', '', 'Reiko Tanoue', '[{\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '1', '', 'Simipour', 'The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Panpour', '515', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '28', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw4-29', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 3 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Stadium Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this attack does 30 more damage and the Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '1', 'Panpour', '', 'The tuft on its head holds water. When the level runs low, it replenishes the tuft by siphoning up water with its tail.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Simipour', '516', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '29', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw4-3', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '1', '', 'Kricketune', 'Its legs are short. Whenever it stumbles, its stiff antennae clack with a xylophone-like sound.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kricketot', '401', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '3', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw4-30', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Bared Fangs\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'If, before this Pokémon does damage, the Defending Pokémon has no damage counters on it, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '1', '', '', 'Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the others school.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Basculin', '550', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '30', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw4-31', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Icy Snow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Next Destinies', '1', '', 'Vanillish', 'The temperature of their breath is -58° F. They create snow crystals and make snow fall in the areas around them.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw4/bw4-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vanillite', '582', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/08/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '31', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
