('bw5-84', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Smash Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Whap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dark Explorers', '1', '', 'Vaporeon, Jolteon, Flareon, Sylveon, Espeon, Umbreon, Leafeon, Glaceon', 'Because its genetic makeup is irregular, it quickly changes its form due to a variety of causes.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eevee', '133', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/09/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '84', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw5-85', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Tone-Deaf\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}, {\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dark Explorers', '1', '', '', 'Its tongue is just like a humans. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chatot', '441', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '85', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw5-86', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Dark Explorers', '1', '', 'Herdier', 'The long hair around its face provides an amazing radar that lets it sense subtle changes in its surroundings.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lillipup', '506', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/09/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw5-87', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dark Explorers', '2', 'Lillipup', 'Stoutland', 'It has a black, cape-like fur that is very hard and decreases the amount of damage it receives.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Herdier', '507', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '87', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw5-88', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Special Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has a Special Energy attached to it, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ferocious Bellow\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done by attacks from the Defending Pokémon is reduced by 30 (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Dark Explorers', '3', 'Herdier', '', 'It rescues people stranded by blizzards in the mountains. Its shaggy fur shields it from the cold.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stoutland', '508', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/09/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '88', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw5-89', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Guillotine\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Stunning Uppercut\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If both of them are heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed. If both of them are tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Dark Explorers', '3', 'Fraxure', '', 'Their sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Haxorus', '612', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/09/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '89', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('bw5-9', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Dark Explorers', '1', '', 'Escavalier', 'These mysterious Pokémon evolve when they receive electrical stimulation while they are in the same place as Shelmet.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Karrablast', '588', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/09/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '9', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw5-90', '', '', 'Shizurow', '[{\'name\': \'Blow Through\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Power Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, discard an Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Dark Explorers', '1', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tornadus-EX', '641', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '05/09/2012', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Black & White', '90', 'Basic, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw5-91', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cheren', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\'Draw 3 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '91', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-92', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dark Claw', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \'If this card is attached to a Darkness Pokémon, each of the attacks of that Pokémon does 20 more damage to the Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '92', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-93', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dark Patch', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\'Attach a basic Darkness Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Darkness Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '93', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-94', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Enhanced Hammer', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\"Discard a Special Energy attached to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '94', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-95', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hooligans Jim & Cas', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 3 random cards from your opponent\'s hand. Your opponent reveals those cards and shuffles them into his or her deck.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '95', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-96', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'N', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\'Each player shuffles his or her hand into his or her deck. Then, each player draws a card for each of his or her remaining Prize cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '96', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-97', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Old Amber Aerodactyl', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\'Look at the bottom 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal an Aerodactyl you find there and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '97', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-98', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Professor Juniper', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\'Discard your hand and draw 7 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '98', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw5-99', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Dark Explorers', '', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw5/bw5-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Random Receiver', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/09/2012', '', '', '[\'Reveal cards from the top of your deck until you reveal a Supporter card. Put it into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Black & White', '99', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('bw6-1', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Flail Around\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '1', '', 'Skiploom', 'It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.', 'Fifth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hoppip', '187', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/15/2012', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw6-10', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Dig\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '1', '', 'Ninjask', 'It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.', 'Fifth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nincada', '290', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw6-100', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Double Hit\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hand Fling\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage times the number of cards in your hand.\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '1', 'Aipom', '', 'Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ambipom', '424', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '100', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw6-101', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \"Smack ‘n\' Slack\", \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '2', '', 'Vigoroth', 'It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Slakoth', '287', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '101', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
