('bw6-51', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Shadow Steal\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \"Does 50 damage times the number of Special Energy cards in your opponent\'s discard pile.\"}, {\'name\': \'Plentiful Placement\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 4 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '1', 'Drifloon', '', 'At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drifblim', '426', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw6-52', '[{\'name\': \'Safeguard\', \'text\': \'Prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon by Pokémon-EX.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 more damage for each Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '1', '', '', 'The guardians of an ancient city, they use their psychic power to attack enemies that invade their territory.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sigilyph', '561', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw6-53', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Poison Gas\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '2', '', 'Garbodor', 'Inhaling the gas they belch will make you sleep for a week. They prefer unsanitary places.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Trubbish', '568', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw6-54', '[{\'name\': \'Garbotoxin\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, each Pokémon in play, in each player\'s hand, and in each player\'s discard pile has no Abilities (except for Garbotoxin).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Sludge Toss\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '3', 'Trubbish', '', 'It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Garbodor', '569', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '54', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw6-55', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Future Sight\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 5 cards of your deck and put them back on top of your deck in any order.\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '1', '', 'Gothorita', 'They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothita', '574', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw6-56', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mind Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '1', 'Gothita', 'Gothitelle', 'Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothorita', '575', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw6-57', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Doom Decree\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If both of them are heads, the Defending Pokémon is Knocked Out.\'}, {\'name\': \'Black Magic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \"Does 20 more damage for each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '2', 'Gothorita', '', 'Starry skies thousands of light-years away are visible in the space distorted by their intense psychic power.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothitelle', '576', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '57', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw6-58', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Nap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 40 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '3', '', 'Golurk', 'The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golett', '622', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw6-59', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Devolution Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Devolve the Defending Pokémon and put the highest Stage evolution card on it into your opponent\'s hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Ghost Hammer\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon has no Weakness.\"}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '4', 'Golett', '', 'It flies around the sky at Mach speeds. Removing the seal on its chest makes its internal energy go out of control.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golurk', '623', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '59', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
