('bw6-66', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Dragons Exalted', '3', 'Roggenrola', 'Gigalith', 'Because its energy was too great to be contained, the energy leaked and formed orange crystals.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw6/bw6-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Boldore', '525', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/15/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '66', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
