('bw7-59', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Flail Around\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Grumpig', 'Using its tail like a spring, it keeps its heart beating by bouncing constantly. If it stops, it dies.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spoink', '325', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-6', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Hundred Furious Lashes\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \"Does 30 damage times the amount of Grass Energy attached to this Pokémon. This Pokémon can\'t use Hundred Furious Lashes during your next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mega Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '4', 'Tangela', '', 'Even if one of its arms is eaten, its fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tangrowth', '465', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/07/2012', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '6', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw7-60', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Psybeam\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}, {\'name\': \'Extrasensory\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If you have the same number of cards in your hand as your opponent, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '2', 'Spoink', '', 'It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does a strange dance to control foes minds.', 'Fifth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grumpig', '326', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '60', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-61', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Confuse Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Dusclops', 'It loves the crying of children. It startles bad kids by passing through walls and making them cry.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duskull', '355', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw7-62', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Astonish\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose a random card from your opponent\'s hand. Your opponent reveals that card and shuffles it into his or her deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psyshot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '2', 'Duskull', 'Dusknoir', 'It seeks drifting will-o-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dusclops', '356', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '62', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw7-63', '[{\'name\': \'Sinister Hand\', \'text\': \"As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may move 1 damage counter from 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon to another of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Shadow Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '3', 'Dusclops', '', 'It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dusknoir', '477', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '63', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('bw7-64', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Paralyzing Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Toxicroak', 'It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Croagunk', '453', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-65', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Toxicroak', 'Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Croagunk', '453', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-66', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Revenge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack during his or her last turn, this attack does 70 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Poison Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', 'Croagunk', '', 'The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxicroak', '454', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '66', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-67', '[{\'name\': \'Sparkling Particles\', \'text\': \'At any time between turns, heal 10 damage from this Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Protection\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon has no Weakness.\"}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', '', '', 'Fifth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cresselia-EX', '488', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Black & White', '67', 'Basic, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-68', '[{\'name\': \'Long-Distance Hypnosis\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep. If tails, your Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Psyshot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '2', '', 'Musharna', 'This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Munna', '517', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-69', '', '', 'Satoshi Shirai', '[{\'name\': \'Telekinesis\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dream Waltz\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'This attack can be used even if this Pokémon is Asleep. If this Pokémon is Asleep, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '3', 'Munna', '', 'The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Musharna', '518', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '69', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-7', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Sharp Scythe\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Scizor', 'The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scyther', '123', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw7-70', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Scout\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals his or her hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heart Stamp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Swoobat', 'The heart-shaped mark left on a body after a Woobat has been attached to it is said to bring good fortune.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Woobat', '527', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw7-71', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Jet Woofer\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"For each Psychic Energy attached to this Pokémon, discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Acrobatics\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', 'Woobat', '', 'It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Swoobat', '528', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/07/2012', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '71', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('bw7-72', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Point\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), the Attacking Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Bug Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '2', '', 'Whirlipede', 'Using the feelers on its head and tail, it picks up vibrations in the air to determine its preys location and state.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Venipede', '543', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-73', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Point\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), this Attacking Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '3', 'Venipede', 'Scolipede', 'Storing energy for evolution, it sits. But, when predators approach, it moves to stab them with poison spikes.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Whirlipede', '544', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '73', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-74', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Point\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), this Attacking Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Venoshock\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is Poisoned, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '4', 'Whirlipede', '', 'It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.', 'Fifth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scolipede', '545', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '74', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-75', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Psypunch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Gothorita', 'Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothita', '574', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-76', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Psypunch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Destructive Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', 'Gothita', 'Gothitelle', 'They use hypnosis to control people and Pokémon. Tales of Gothorita leading people astray are told in every corner.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothorita', '575', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '76', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('bw7-77', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Does 20 more damage for each Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Echoed Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Echoed Voice attack does 50 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', '', 'The melodies sung by Meloetta have the power to make Pokémon that hear them happy or sad.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Meloetta', '648', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw7-78', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '2', '', 'Sandslash', 'It digs deep burrows to live in. When in danger, it rolls up its body to withstand attacks.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandshrew', '27', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw7-79', '', '', 'BERUBURI', '[{\'name\': \'Sand-Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}, {\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', 'Sandshrew', '', 'The spikes on its body are made up of its hardened hide. It rolls up and attacks foes with its spikes.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandslash', '28', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/07/2012', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '79', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw7-8', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Horn Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Giga Horn\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If both of them are tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '2', '', '', 'No matter how heavy its opponents, it flings them far away with its prized horn.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Heracross', '214', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/07/2012', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw7-80', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Wicked Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', '', 'Gliscor', 'It clamps on to its chosen prey then jabs the stinger on its tail into the prey while its stunned with surprise.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gligar', '207', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/07/2012', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '80', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw7-81', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Ring\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned. The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Night Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Boundaries Crossed', '1', 'Gligar', '', 'It dances silently through the sky. When it approaches prey, it can land a critical hit in an instant.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw7/bw7-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gliscor', '472', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/07/2012', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '81', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
