('bw8-69', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Reflect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Smash Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', '', 'Beheeyem', 'Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Elgyem', '605', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-7', '[{\'name\': \'Fair-Weather Heal\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may heal 20 damage from 1 of your Pokémon that has any Grass Energy attached to it.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Random Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', 'Cherubi', '', 'If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the suns rays with its whole body.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cherrim', '421', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw8-70', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Lock Up\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Damakinesis\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Move 6 damage counters from any of your Pokémon to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', 'Elgyem', '', 'Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three fingers, but those patterns havent been decoded.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beheeyem', '606', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '70', 'Stage 1, Team Plasma', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-71', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '2', '', 'Donphan', 'It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Phanpy', '231', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw8-72', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Turn\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wreck\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this attack does 60 more damage. Discard the Stadium card.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '4', 'Phanpy', '', 'It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Donphan', '232', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '72', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('bw8-73', '[{\'name\': \'Premonition\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may look at the top 2 cards of your deck and put them back on top of your deck in any order.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouji Tajima', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '3', '', '', 'The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. Its active on the night of a full moon.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lunatone', '337', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw8-74', '', '', 'Kouji Tajima', '[{\'name\': \'Heat Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Explosion\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 90 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '3', '', '', 'Solar energy is the source of its power, so it is strong during the daytime. When it spins, its body shines.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Solrock', '338', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('bw8-75', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', '', 'Lucario', 'It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-76', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Feint\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', '', 'Lucario', 'They communicate with one another using their auras made tangible by their emotions.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '76', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-77', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Mach Cross\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', 'Riolu', '', 'A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '77', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-78', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Armor\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon has any Metal Energy attached to it, this Pokémon\'s type is both Fighting and Metal.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Satoshi Shirai', '[{\'name\': \'Hurricane Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'Does 30 more damage for each Prize card your opponent has taken.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '2', 'Riolu', '', 'By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '78', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-79', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Knock Back\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '2', '', 'Gurdurr', 'Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs.', 'Fifth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Timburr', '532', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-8', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Bug Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', '', 'Swadloon', 'Since this Pokémon makes its own clothes out of leaves, it is a popular mascot for fashion designers.', 'Fifth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sewaddle', '540', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('bw8-80', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Dynamic Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage and the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '3', 'Timburr', 'Conkeldurr', 'With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gurdurr', '533', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '80', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-81', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Facade\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon is Burned or Poisoned, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Drain Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '3', 'Gurdurr', '', 'Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Conkeldurr', '534', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '81', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('bw8-82', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Trickery\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fury Swipes\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', '', 'Liepard', 'Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Purrloin', '509', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '82', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw8-83', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Scout\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals his or her hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fasten Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', '', 'Liepard', 'Their cute act is a ruse. They trick people and steal their valuables just to see the looks on their faces.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Purrloin', '509', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw8-84', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Silent Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveal his or her hand. Discard a Supporter card you find there. Use the effect of that card as the effect of this attack.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fake Out\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', 'Purrloin', '', 'Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Liepard', '510', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '84', 'Stage 1, Team Plasma', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw8-85', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '2', '', 'Scrafty', 'Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too.', 'Fifth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scraggy', '559', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '85', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('bw8-86', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Kick Away\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Reinforced Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, this attack does 50 more damage.\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', 'Scraggy', '', 'It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scrafty', '560', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/06/2013', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '86', 'Stage 1, Team Plasma', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
