('bw8-98', '[{\'name\': \'Moon Guidance\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a card that evolves from 1 of your Pokémon and put it onto that Pokémon. (This counts as evolving that Pokémon.) Shuffle your deck afterward.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Moon Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Storm', '1', 'Clefairy', '', 'Their ears are sensitive enough to hear a pin drop from over a mile away, so theyre usually found in quiet places.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw8/bw8-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clefable', '36', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/06/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '98', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
