('bw9-59', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Plasma Freeze', '1', '', 'Primeape', 'It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bw9/bw9-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mankey', '56', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/08/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
