('bwp-BW26', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Big Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'BW Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Fraxure', 'They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly.', 'Fifth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bwp/bwp-BW26.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Axew', '610', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '03/01/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Black & White', 'BW26', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
