('bwp-BW57', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Armor Press\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Dual Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 90 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'BW Black Star Promos', '3', 'Fraxure', '', 'Their sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor.', 'Fifth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/bwp/bwp-BW57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Haxorus', '612', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '03/01/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Black & White', 'BW57', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Dragon, value: ×2'),
