('col1-55', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Fireworks\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, discard a Fire Energy attached to Cyndaquil.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Quilava', 'It is timid, and always curls itself up in a ball. If attacked, it flares up its back for protection.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Cyndaquil', '155', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
