('col1-57', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Detect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Hitmonchan during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sky Uppercut\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', '', 'Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Hitmonchan', '107', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('col1-58', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'High Jump Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', '', 'If it starts kicking repeatedly, both legs will stretch even longer to strike a fleeing foe.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Hitmonlee', '106', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('col1-59', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Jump On\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Houndoom', 'To corner prey, they check each others location using barks that only they can understand.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Houndour', '228', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('col1-6', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Volcano Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard the top 4 cards of your opponent\'s deck. If tails, discard the top 4 cards of your deck.\"}]', 'Call of Legends', '4', '', '', 'Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with Kyogre.', 'Fourth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Groudon', '383', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('col1-60', '', '', 'Hajime Kusajima', '[{\'name\': \'Smokescreen\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}, {\'name\': \'Suffocating Gas\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Weezing', 'Its thin, filmy body is filled with gases that cause constant sniffles, coughs and teary eyes.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Koffing', '109', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('col1-61', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Gyarados', 'For no reason, it jumps and splashes about, making it easy for predators like Pidgeotto to catch it mid-jump.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magikarp', '129', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('col1-62', '', '', 'Hajime Kusajima', '[{\'name\': \'Live Coal\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Magma Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Magmortar', 'It dislikes cold places, so it blows scorching flames to make the environment suitable for itself.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Magmar', '126', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('col1-63', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Flaaffy', 'Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Mareep', '179', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('col1-64', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Selfish Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top card of your deck. You may put it into your hand. If not, discard it and draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Destructive Jaw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed and discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', '', 'It chomps with its gaping mouth. Its huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Mawile', '303', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('col1-65', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Mumble\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Dual Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Each player draws 3 cards.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Mismagius', 'It loves to bite and yank peoples hair from behind without warning, just to see their shocked reactions.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Misdreavus', '200', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('col1-66', '[{\'name\': \'Ultra-Thick Skin\', \'text\': \'As long as Phanpy has Energy attached to it, any damage done to Phanpy by attacks is reduced by 10 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', 'Donphan', 'As a sign of affection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Phanpy', '231', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('col1-67', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Messenger\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle Pidgey and all cards attached to it back into your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Glide\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Pidgeotto', 'Common in grassy areas and forests, it is very docile and will chase off enemies by flapping up sand.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Pidgey', '16', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('col1-68', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Focus Energy\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Pineco\'s Surprise Attack attack\'s base damage is 80.\"}, {\'name\': \'Surprise Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', 'Forretress', 'It likes to make its shell thicker by adding layers of tree bark. The additional weight doesnt bother it.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Pineco', '204', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('col1-69', '', '', 'Wataru Kawahara', '[{\'name\': \'Prehistoric Wisdom\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Choose a card from your hand and put it in the Lost Zone. Then, draw 3 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Granite Head\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Relicanth by attacks is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', '', 'Discovered by chance during deep-sea explorations, it has not changed since ancient times.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Relicanth', '369', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('col1-7', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '3', 'Magikarp', '', 'Once it appears, it goes on a rampage. It remains enraged until it demolishes everything around it.', 'Fourth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Gyarados', '130', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('col1-70', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Whismy Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', 'Slowbro, Slowking', 'It lazes vacantly near water. If something bites its tail, it wont even notice for a whole day.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Slowpoke', '79', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('col1-71', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sharp Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', 'Granbull', 'It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Snubbull', '209', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('col1-72', '', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Nutritional Support\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Grass Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Pokémon. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Poisonpowder\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', 'Tangrowth', 'It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Tangela', '114', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('col1-73', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Fake Tears\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent can\'t play any Trainer cards from his or her hand during your opponent\'s next turn, and any damage done to Teddiursa by attack is reduced by 30 (after applying weakness and resistance).\"}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Ursaring', 'If it finds honey, its crescent mark glows. It always licks its paws because they are soaked with honey.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Teddiursa', '216', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('col1-74', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Water Energy attached to Totodile. This attack does 30 damage plus 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '2', '', 'Croconaw', 'It is small but rough and tough. It wont hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Totodile', '158', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('col1-75', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ember\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, discard a Fire Energy attached to Vulpix.\'}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', 'Ninetales', 'If it is attacked by an enemy that is stronger than itself, it feigns injury to fool the enemy and escapes.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Vulpix', '37', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('col1-76', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Cheerleaders Cheer', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Draw 3 cards. Your opponent may draw a card.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '76', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-77', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Copycat', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \"Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw a number of cards equal to the number of cards in your opponent\'s hand.\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '77', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-78', '', '', 'Takashi Yamaguchi', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Dual Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'Flip 2 coins. For each heads, search your deck for a Basic Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. If you do, shuffle your deck afterward.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '78', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-79', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Interviewers Questions', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Look at the top 8 cards of your deck. Choose as many Energy cards as you like, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '79', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-8', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Triple Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Close Combat\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Hitmontop by attacks is increased by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Call of Legends', '1', '', '', 'It launches kicks while spinning. If it spins at high speed, it may bore its way into the ground.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Hitmontop', '237', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/09/2011', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('col1-80', '', '', 'Wataru Kawahara', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lost Remover', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\"Put 1 Special Energy card attached to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon in the Lost Zone.\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '80', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-81', '', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lost World', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\", \"Once during each player\'s turn, if this player\'s opponent has 6 or more Pokémon in the Lost Zone, the player may choose to win the game.\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '81', 'Stadium', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-82', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Professor Elms Training Method', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Search your deck for an Evolution card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '82', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-83', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Professor Oaks New Theory', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 6 cards.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '83', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-84', '', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Research Record', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'Look at the top 4 cards of your deck and put as many of them as you like back on top of your deck in any order. Then, put the remaining cards on the bottom of your deck in any order.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '84', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-85', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Sages Training', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Look at the top 5 cards of your deck. Choose any 2 cards you find there and put them into your hand. Discard the other cards.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '85', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('col1-86', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Darkness Energy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\"If the Pokémon Darkness Energy is attached to attacks, the attack does 10 more damage to the Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance). Ignore this Effect if the Pokémon that Darkness Energy is attached to isn\'t Darkness. Darkness Energy provides Darkness Energy. (Doesn\'t count as a basic Energy card.)\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '86', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
('col1-87', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '', 'Call of Legends', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/col1/col1-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Metal Energy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/09/2011', '', '', '[\"Damage done by attacks to the Pokémon that Metal Energy attached to is reduced by 10 (after applying Weakness and Resistance). Ignore this effect if the Pokémon that Metal Energy is attached to isn\'t Metal. Metal Energy provides Metal Energy. (Doesn\'t count as a basic Energy card.)\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '87', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
