('dp1-5', '', '', 'Nakaoka', '[{\'name\': \'Meteor Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flare Blitz\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Discard all Fire Energy attached to Infernape.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '', 'Monferno', '', 'It uses a special kind of martial arts involving all its limbs. Its fire never goes out.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Infernape', '392', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2007', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '5', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +30'),
('dp1-50', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnosis\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Dream Eater\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is not Asleep, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '', 'Gastly', 'Gengar', 'It can slip through any obstacle. It lurks inside walls to keep an eye on its foes.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Haunter', '93', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: +20'),
('dp1-51', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Yawn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sand Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '2', '', 'Hippowdon', 'It lives in arid places. Instead of perspiration, it expels grainy sand from its body.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Hippopotas', '449', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '51', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp1-52', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Fasten Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunder Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '', 'Shinx', 'Luxray', 'Its claws loose electricity with enough amperage to cause fainting. They live in small groups.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '19', 'Luxio', '404', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '52', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp1-53', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Karate Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40-\', \'text\': \'Does 40 damage minus 10 damage for each damage counter on Machoke.\'}, {\'name\': \'Seismic Toss\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '2', 'Machop', 'Machamp', 'MACHOKEs boundless power is very dangerous, so it wears a belt that suppresses its energy.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '39', 'Machoke', '67', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '53', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp1-54', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Tri Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Magnetic Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Before doing damage, you may choose 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon that has any Energy attached to it and switch that Pokémon with 1 of the Defending Pokémon.\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '2', 'Magnemite', 'Magnezone', 'It is actually three MAGNEMITE linked by magnetism. A group can set off a magnetic storm.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Magneton', '82', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '54', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp1-55', '[{\'name\': \'Baby Evolution\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put Mantine from your hand onto Mantyke (this counts as evolving Mantyke) and remove all damage counters from Mantyke.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Friends\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Water Basic Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', 'Mantine', 'A friendly Pokémon that captures the subtle flows of seawater using its two antennae.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Mantyke', '458', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp1-56', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a Fire Energy card and attach it to Monferno.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fury Swipes\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '', 'Chimchar', 'Infernape', 'To intimidate attackers, it stretches the fire on its tail to make itself appear bigger.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Monferno', '391', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp1-57', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Dirty Trick\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy card attached to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Razor Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Seedot', 'Shiftry', 'The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Nuzleaf', '274', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '57', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp1-58', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Shower\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Brine\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon that has any damage counters on it. This attack does 40 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Piplup', 'Empoleon', 'It lives alone, away from others. Apparently, every one of them believes it is the most important.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '20', 'Prinplup', '394', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '58', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp1-59', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Overrun\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Blaze Up\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If tails, discard a Fire Energy attached to Rapidash and this attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '', 'Ponyta', '', 'It gallops at nearly 150 mph. With its mane blazing ferociously, it races as if it were an arrow.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '34', 'Rapidash', '78', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '59', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp1-6', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Feint\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Aura Sphere\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Riolu', '', 'It has the ability to sense the auras of all things. It understands human speech.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '6', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp1-60', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Storm Up\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this attack does 30 damage plus 20 more damage. Discard that Stadium card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Crash Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Rhydon does 10 damage to itself. Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon, if any.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '2', 'Rhyhorn', 'Rhyperior', 'Its brain developed after it stood up on its hind legs. Its drill horn bores tunnels through solid rock.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Rhydon', '112', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '60', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp1-61', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Wild Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', 'Lucario', 'The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +10');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('dp1-62', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Flail\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage times the number of damage counters on Seaking.\'}, {\'name\': \'Horn Drill\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Goldeen', '', 'It makes its nest by hollowing out boulders in streams with its horn. It defends its eggs with its life.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '41', 'Seaking', '119', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '62', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp1-63', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Harden\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, If Silcoon would be damaged by an attack, prevent that attack\'s damage done to Silcoon if that damage is 30 or less.\"}, {\'name\': \'Entangling String\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '3', 'Wurmple', 'Beautifly', 'It anchors itself by wrapping twigs with the silk from its body. It motionlessly awaits evolution.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '8', 'Silcoon', '266', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '63', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp1-64', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Whirlwind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Clutch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '', 'Starly', 'Staraptor', 'It flies around forests and fields in search of bug Pokémon. It stays within a huge flock.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '21', 'Staravia', '397', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp1-65', '[{\'name\': \'ANALYZE\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown A is on your Bench, you may look at the top 2 cards of your deck and put them back on top of your deck in any order.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Nakaoka', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Unown A', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp1-66', '[{\'name\': \'BOUNCE\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown B is on your Bench, you may flip a coin. If heads, discard all cards attached to any 1 of your Unown and shuffle that Pokémon back into your deck.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Nakaoka', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '12', 'Unown B', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp1-67', '[{\'name\': \'CALL\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown C is on your Bench, you may flip coin. If heads, search your deck for any 1 Unown and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Nakaoka', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Unown C', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp1-68', '[{\'name\': \'DRAW\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown D is on your Bench, you may flip a coin. If heads, each player may draw a card. (You draw your card first.)\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Nakaoka', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '14', 'Unown D', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp1-69', '[{\'name\': \'Baby Evolution\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put Marill from your hand onto Azurill (this counts a evolving Azurill) and remove all damage counters from Azurill.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Delivery\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put any 1 card from your discard pile into your hand.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', 'Marill', 'A Pokémon that lives by water. It moves quickly on land by bouncing on its big tail.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Azurill', '298', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp1-7', '[{\'name\': \'Gleam Eyes\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, when you play Luxray from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon, you may look at your opponent\'s hand. If your opponent\'s Bench isn\'t full, choose 1 Basic Pokémon from your opponent\'s hand, and put it onto his or her Bench. Then, switch it with the Defending Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Mikiko Takeda', '[{\'name\': \'Lightning Star\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Move all Lightning Energy attached to Luxray to 1 of your Benched Pokémon. (Ignore this effect if you don\'t have any Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Luxio', '', 'It has eyes that can see through anything. It spots and captures prey hiding behind objects.', 'Fourth ', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '48', 'Luxray', '405', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '7', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +30'),
('dp1-70', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Amnesia\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks. That Pokémon can\'t use that attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Scavenge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a Trainer card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', 'Bibarel', 'With nerves of steel, nothing can perturb it. It is more agile and active than it appears.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Bidoof', '399', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp1-71', '[{\'name\': \'Baby Evolution\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put Sudowoodo from your hand onto Bonsly (this counts as evolving Bonsly) and remove all damage counters from Bonsly.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Fake Tears\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent can\'t play any Trainer cards from his or her hand during your opponent\'s next turn, and any damage done to Bonsly by attacks is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', 'Sudowoodo', 'It looks as if it is always crying. It is actually adjusting its bodys fluid levels by eliminating excess.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Bonsly', '438', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: +10'),
('dp1-72', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Splash About\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Buizel has less Energy attached to it than the Defending Pokémon, this attack does 10 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', 'Floatzel', 'It has a flotation sac that is like an inflatable collar. It floats on water with its head out.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Buizel', '418', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp1-73', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Jump Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', '', 'Lopunny', 'It slams foes by sharply uncoiling its rolled ears. It stings enough to make a grown-up cry in pain.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp1/dp1-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Buneary', '427', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
