('dp2-99', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Drowsy\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Both Slakoth and the Defending Pokémon are now Asleep.\'}]', 'Mysterious Treasures', '1', '', 'Vigoroth', 'It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp2/dp2-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Slakoth', '287', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '99', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-1', '[{\'name\': \'Jamming\', \'text\': \"After your opponent plays a Supporter card from his or her hand, put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. You can\'t use more than 1 Jamming Poké-Body each turn.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Cluster Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"You may discard all Lightning Energy attached to Ampharos. If you do, this attack does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon that has any Energy cards attached to it. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Flaaffy', '', 'The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tails light.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '52', 'Ampharos', '181', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +30'),
('dp3-10', '[{\'name\': \'Phoenix Turn\', \'text\': \"Once during your opponent\'s turn, if Ho-Oh would be Knocked Out by damage from an attack, you may flip a coin. If heads, Ho-Oh isn\'t discarded. Instead, remove all damage counter, Special Conditions, and other effects from Ho-Oh. Then, discard all cards attached to Ho-Oh (except for Energy cards). This counts as Ho-Oh being Knocked Out and your opponent takes a Prize card.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Rainbow Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage times the number of different types of basic Energy cards attached to Ho-Oh.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', '', 'Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Ho-Oh', '250', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('dp3-100', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Delusion\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If Psyduck is Confused, draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Migraine\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused. If tails, Psyduck is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Golduck', 'If its usual headache worsens, its starts exhibiting odd powers. It cant remember doing so, however.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Psyduck', '54', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '100', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-101', '[{\'name\': \'Balloon Sting\', \'text\': \"Once during your opponent\'s turn, if Qwilfish is your Active Pokémon and is damage by an attack (even if Qwilfish is Knocked Out), you may flip a coin. If heads, the Attacking Pokémon is now Poisoned. Put 2 damage counters instead of 1 on that Pokémon between turns.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kenkichi Toyama', '[{\'name\': \'Nerve Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Qwilfish', '211', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '101', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-102', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Confuse Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Kirlia', 'It uses the thorns on its head to sense human emotions. It is said to appear in front of cheerful people.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-102.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Ralts', '280', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '102', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-103', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', 'Raticate', 'Cautious in the extreme, its hardy vitality lets it live in any kind of environment.', 'Fourth ', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-103.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Rattata', '19', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '103', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('dp3-104', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Grope\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 2 cards of your deck, choose 1 of them, and put it into your hand. Put the other card on the bottom of your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Furret', 'It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-104.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Sentret', '161', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '104', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-105', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Shell Rest\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Remove 2 damage counters from Shellder.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tongue Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Cloyster', 'It swims backwards by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Shellder', '90', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '105', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-106', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Shell Hunting\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 in any combination of Shellos West Sea and Shellos East Sea and put them on your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sprinkle Water\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', 'Gastrodon', 'Its colors and shapes differ from region to region. In the Sinnoh region, two types are confirmed.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Shellos East Sea', '422', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '106', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-107', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Mud Spatter\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Recover\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard a Water Energy attached to Shellos West Sea and remove all damage counters from Shellos West Sea.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Gastrodon', 'Its colors and shapes differ from region to region. In the Sinnoh region, two types are confirmed.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-107.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '25', 'Shellos West Sea', '422', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '107', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-108', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Toxic Spore\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Breloom', 'It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-108.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Shroomish', '285', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '108', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-109', '[{\'name\': \'Pot Shell\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Shuckle by your opponent\'s Pokémon that has any Special Energy cards attached to it.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Emi Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Ferment Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned. As long as the Defending Pokémon remains Poisoned by this attack, it can\'t use any Poké-Body.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It stores berries in its shell. The berries eventually ferment to become delicious juices.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '25', 'Shuckle', '213', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '109', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-11', '[{\'name\': \'Cotton Spore\', \'text\': \"Whenever Jumpluff would be damaged by your opponent\'s attack, flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to Jumpluff by that attack.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Cottonweed Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip 2 coins. Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. For each heads, this attack does 30 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Skiploom', '', 'Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Jumpluff', '189', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '11', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp3-110', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Gossip\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hang Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Banette', 'It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Shuppet', '353', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '110', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: +10'),
('dp3-111', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Dish Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card from the top and the bottom of your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Synchro Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If any basic Energy card attached to Spinda is the same type as any Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon, this attack does 10 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '25', 'Spinda', '327', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '111', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-112', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Bubble\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Water Energy attached to Squirtle. This attack does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Wartortle', 'It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-112.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Squirtle', '7', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '112', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-113', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Lead\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Supporter card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Frighten Horn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon isn\'t an Evolved Pokémon, that Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Stantler', '234', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '113', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-114', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Sun Soak\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, remove all damage counters from Sunkern, search your deck for an Evolution card that evolves from Sunkern, and put it onto Sunkern. (This counts as evolving Sunkern.) Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Sunflora', 'It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Sunkern', '191', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '114', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-115', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Inviting Trap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch the Defending Pokémon with 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sand Tomb\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Vibrava', 'It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '9', 'Trapinch', '328', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '115', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp3-116', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Stun Spore\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Signal Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Venomoth', 'Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At nights, its kind is drawn by light.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '25', 'Venonat', '48', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '116', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-117', '', '', 'Satoshi Ohta', '[{\'name\': \'Speed Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Big Explosion\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Voltorb does 50 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Electrode', 'It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-117.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '29', 'Voltorb', '100', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '117', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-118', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Yawn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Splatter\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 10 damage to that Pokémon. This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Quagsire', 'It lives in cold water, half burying itself in mud at the bottom to sleep.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Wooper', '194', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '118', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +20'),
('dp3-119', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Bebes Search', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \"Choose a card from your hand and put it on top of your deck. Search your deck for a Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward. (If this is the only card in your hand, you can\'t play this card.)\"]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '119', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-12', '', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Tongue Reel\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. If you choose a Benched Pokémon, switch the Defending Pokémon with that Pokémon. This attack does 20 damage to the Pokémon you chose. Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Boundless Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Lickilicky can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '4', 'Lickitung', '', 'It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting to close to it will leave you soaked with drool.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Lickilicky', '463', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '12', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +30'),
('dp3-120', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Night Maintenance', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'Search your discard pile for up to 3 in any combination of Pokémon and basic Energy cards. Show them to your opponent and shuffle them into your deck.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '120', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-121', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'PlusPower', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'Attach PlusPower to 1 of your Pokémon. Discard this card at the end of your turn.\', \'If the Pokémon PlusPower is attached to attacks, the attack does 10 more damage to the Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '121', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-122', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Professor Oaks Visit', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Draw 3 cards. Then, choose a card from your hand and put it on the bottom of your deck.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '122', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-123', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Professor Rowan', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \"Choose 1 card in your hand and shuffle the rest of your cards into your deck. Then, draw 4 cards. (If this is the only card in your hand, you can\'t play this card.)\"]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '123', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-124', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Rival', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Reveal the top 5 cards of your deck. Your opponent chooses 3 of those cards. Put those cards into your hand and put other 2 cards on top of your deck. Shuffle your deck afterward.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '124', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-125', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Roseannes Research', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Search your deck for up to 2 in any combination of Basic Pokémon and basic Energy cards, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '125', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-126', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Team Galactics Mars', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \"Draw 2 cards. Then, choose a card from your opponent\'s hand without looking and put it on the bottom of his or her deck.\"]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '126', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-127', '', '', 'Shin-ichi Yoshikawa', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Potion', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'Remove 2 damage counters from 1 of your Pokémon (remove 1 damage counter if that Pokémon has only 1).\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '127', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-128', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Switch', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\'Switch 1 of your Active Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '128', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp3-129', '', '', 'Takumi Akabane', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Darkness Energy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\"If the Pokémon Darkness Energy is attached to attacks, the attack does 10 more damage to the Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance). Ignore this effect if the Pokémon that Darkness Energy is attached to isn\'t Darkness. Darkness Energy provides Darkness Energy. (Doesn\'t count as a basic Energy card.)\"]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '129', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
('dp3-13', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Dish\', \'text\': \'At any time between turns, remove 1 damage counter from Ludicolo.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Nature Power\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If you have a Stadium Card in play, this attack does 60 damage plus 20 more damage. If your opponent has a Stadium card in play, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Lombre', '', 'If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It cant help breaking out into a dance.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '47', 'Ludicolo', '272', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '13', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +30'),
('dp3-130', '', '', 'Takumi Akabane', '', 'Secret Wonders', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Metal Energy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '[\"Damage done by attacks to the Pokémon that Metal Energy is attached to is reduced by 10 (after applying Weakness and Resistance). Ignore this effect if the Pokémon that Metal Energy is attached to isn\'t Metal. Metal Energy provides Metal Energy. (Doesn\'t count as a basic Energy card.)\"]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '130', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
('dp3-131', '[{\'name\': \'Teleportation\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), choose 1 of your Active Pokémon or 1 or your Benched Pokémon and switch Gardevoir with that Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Gardevoir is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Bring Down\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 Pokémon (yours or your opponent\'s) with the fewest remaining HP (excluding Gardevoir) and that Pokémon is now Knocked Out.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Gardevoir', '', '', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal', 'X', 'Gardevoir LV.X', '282', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo LV.X', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Put this card onto your Active Gardevoir. Gardevoir LV.X can use any attack, Poké-Power, or Poké-Body from its previous level.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '131', 'Level-Up', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('dp3-132', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Feint Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 40 damage to that Pokémon. This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness, Resistance, Poké-Powers, Poké-Bodies, or any other effects on that Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Darkness Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon would be Knocked Out by damage from this attack, you may search your discard pile for any 1 card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Honchkrow', '', '', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal', 'X', 'Honchkrow LV.X', '430', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo LV.X', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '[\'Put this card onto your Active Honchkrow. Honchkrow LV.X can use any attack, Poké-Power, or Poké-Body from its previous level.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '132', 'Level-Up', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: +30'),
('dp3-14', '', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Silver Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon and return it to your opponent\'s hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psychic Destruction\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon has any Energy cards attached to it, this attack\'s base damage is 40 instead of 120.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', '', 'It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Lugia', '249', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '14', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp3-15', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Balance\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If you have less cards in your hand than your opponent, draw cards until you have the same number of cards as your opponent. (If you have more or the same number of cards in your hand as your opponent, this attack does nothing.)\'}, {\'name\': \'Re-creation\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose an attack on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon in his or her discard pile. Re-creation copies that attack except for its Energy cost. (You must still do anything else required for that attack.) Mew performs that attack.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe MEW to be the ancestor of Pokémon.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Mew', '151', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '15', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp3-16', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Rumble\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), when you attach a Lightning Energy card from your hand to Raikou, you may put 1 damage counter on 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Climb\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Discard 3 cards from the top of your deck. This attack does 50 damage plus 10 more damage for each Lightning Energy card you discarded. Then, attach those Lightning Energy cards to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', '', 'It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Raikou', '243', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-17', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Sleep Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep and Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Magical Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 40 damage plus 30 more damage and remove 3 damage counters from Roserade.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Roselia', '', 'It attracts prey with a sweet aroma, then downs it with thorny whips hidden in its arms.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-17.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '37', 'Roserade', '407', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '17', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-18', '', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Direct Hit\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness, Resistance, Poké-Powers, Poké-Bodies, or any other effects on the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dragon Finish\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard 2 basic Fire Energy cards or 2 basic Water Energy cards attached to Salamence. If you discarded 2 basic Fire Energy cards, this attack does 100 damage to the Defending Pokémon. If you discarded 2 Basic Water Energy cards, this attack does 100 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) (If you can\'t discard cards, this attack does nothing.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Shelgon', '', 'As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changes, and wings grew out.', 'Fourth ', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-18.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '62', 'Salamence', '373', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '18', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +30'),
('dp3-19', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Recover\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you put Suicune from your hand onto your Bench, you may search your discard pile for up to 3 Water Pokémon, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Cure Stream\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done by attacks from the Defending Pokémon is reduced by 20 (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-19.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Suicune', '245', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '19', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-2', '[{\'name\': \'Waterlog\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may attach as many basic Water Energy cards from your hand to any of your Pokémon in any way you like. If you do, your turn ends. This power can\'t be used if Blastoise is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \"Does 50 damage plus 20 more damage for each Water Energy attached to Blastoise but not used to pay for this attack\'s Energy cost. You can\'t add more than 40 damage in this way.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Wartortle', '', 'The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.', 'Fourth ', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-2.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '52', 'Blastoise', '9', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '2', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +30'),
('dp3-20', '[{\'name\': \'Miracle Aroma\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may flip a coin. If heads, choose either Asleep, Burned, or Poisoned. The Defending Pokémon is now affected by that Special Condition. This power can\'t be used if Venusaur is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Giant Bloom\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, remove 4 damage counters from Venusaur.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Ivysaur', '', 'After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-20.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '51', 'Venusaur', '3', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '20', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp3-21', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Baleful Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose a card from your opponent\'s hand without looking and discard it. If you discarded a Trainer, Supporter, or Stadium card, choose 1 more card from your opponent\'s hand without looking and discard it.\"}, {\'name\': \'Raid\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"If you played Absol from your hand during this turn, this attack\'s base damage is 40 instead of 10.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It senses disasters coming and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Absol', '359', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '21', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-22', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Dash\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you play Arcanine from your hand to evolve 1 of your Benched Pokémon, you may switch Arcanine with 1 of your Active Pokémon. If you do, you may move any number of Energy cards attached to that Pokémon to Arcanine.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Inferno Onrush\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Arcanine does 40 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Growlithe', '', 'Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-22.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '48', 'Arcanine', '59', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '22', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +30'),
('dp3-23', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Ghost Head\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put as many damage counters as you like on Banette. (You can\'t put more than Banette\'s remaining HP.) Put that many damage counters on the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Spiteful Pain\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If Banette is in your discard pile, this attack does 40 damage plus 40 more damage, then search your discard pile for Banette, show it to your opponent, and shuffle it into your deck.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Shuppet', '', 'A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Banette', '354', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '23', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: +20'),
('dp3-24', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Dig Trap\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. If heads, prevent all effects of an attack, including damage, done to Dugtrio during your opponent\'s next turn. If Dugtrio is your Active Pokémon at the end of your opponent\'s next turn, put 6 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pit Trap\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Your opponent flips a coin. If tails, this attack does 50 damage plus 50 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Diglett', '', 'Its three heads moves alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Dugtrio', '51', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '24', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp3-25', '[{\'name\': \'Motor Drive\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may search your discard pile for a Lightning Energy card and attach it to Electivire. This power can\'t be used if Electivire is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Discharge\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Discard all Lightning Energy attached to Electivire. Flip a coin for each Lightning Energy you discarded. This attack does 50 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Electabuzz', '', 'It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '50', 'Electivire', '466', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '25', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +30'),
('dp3-26', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Shift\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, if Electrode would be Knocked Out by damage from an attack, you may use this power. Electrode isn\'t discarded. Instead, attach it as an Energy card to 1 of your Pokémon. While attached, this card is a Special Energy card and provides every type of Energy but provides only 1 Energy at a time. (Has no effect other than providing Energy.)\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Ion Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'You may do 40 damage plus 60 more damage. If you do, Electrode does 100 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Voltorb', '', 'It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Electrode', '101', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '26', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-27', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Keen Eye\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 cards and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Baton Pass\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'You may switch Furret with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. If you do, move as many Energy cards attached to Furret as you like to the new Active Pokémon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Sentret', '', 'The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Furret', '162', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '27', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-28', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Encore\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks. That Pokémon can use only that attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Break Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'You may do 40 damage plus 20 more damage. If you do, Golduck is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Psyduck', '', 'A Pokémon that lives in lakes. It swims faster than any human swimming champion.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '39', 'Golduck', '55', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '28', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-29', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Double Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 2 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 30 damage to each of them. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Megaton Rock\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"You may do 40 damage instead of 80 to the Defending Pokémon. If you do, during your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Golem by attacks is reduced by 40 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '4', 'Graveler', '', 'It sheds its hide once a year. Its boulderlike body is so tough, even dynamite cant harm it.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '52', 'Golem', '76', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '29', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: +30'),
('dp3-3', '[{\'name\': \'Fury Blaze\', \'text\': \"If your opponent has 3 or less Prize cards left, each of Charizard\'s attacks does 50 more damage to the Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Blast Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard 2 Energy cards attached to Charizard. If tails, discard 4 Energy cards attached to Charizard. (If you can\'t, this attack does nothing.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Charmeleon', '', 'It is said that CHARIZARDs fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '55', 'Charizard', '6', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '3', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +40'),
('dp3-30', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Icy Kiss\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"If Jynx was damaged by an attack during your opponent\'s last turn, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Lovely Kiss\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Move 2 damage counters from Jynx to the Defending Pokémon. If Smoochum is anywhere under Jynx, move 4 damage counters instead.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', '', 'It cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Jynx', '124', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '30', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp3-31', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Body\', \'text\': \'When you attach a Fire Energy card from your hand to Magmortar, remove 2 damage counters from Magmortar.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Does 20 damage times the number of Fire Energy attached to Magmortar.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fireball Bazooka\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Does 20 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Magmar', '', 'It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees F from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '52', 'Magmortar', '467', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '31', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +30'),
('dp3-32', '[{\'name\': \'Minus Charge\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if any Pokémon were Knocked Out during your opponent\'s last turn, you may draw 2 cards. You can\'t use more than 1 Minus Charge Poké-Power each turn. This power can\'t be used if Minun is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Tag Play —\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'If you have Plusle on your Bench, you may move an Energy card attached to Minun to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Minun', '312', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '32', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-33', '', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Silver Wind\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'During your next turn, if an attack does damage to the Defending Pokémon (after applying Weakness and Resistance), that attack does 40 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Raging Scales\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If Mothim has any damage counters on it, this attack does 30 damage plus 40 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Burmy', '', 'It loves the honey of flowers and steals honey collected by COMBEE.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '39', 'Mothim', '414', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '33', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-34', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Rub\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned. Before doing damage, you may switch 1 of the Defending Pokémon with 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. The new Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pride Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Nidoqueen on your Bench. This attack does 60 damage plus 30 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Nidorino', '', 'One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '55', 'Nidoking', '34', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '34', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +30'),
('dp3-35', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Mirror Move\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If Pidgeot was damaged by an attack during your opponent\'s last turn, this attack does the same amount of damage done to Pidgeot to the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Whirlwind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Pidgeotto', '', 'By flapping its wings with all its might, PIDGEOT can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.', 'Fourth ', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '50', 'Pidgeot', '18', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '35', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +30');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('dp3-36', '[{\'name\': \'Plus Charge\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out during your opponent\'s last turn, you may search your discard pile for up to 2 basic Energy cards, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. You can\'t use more than 1 Plus Charge Poké-Power each turn. This power can\'t be used if Plusle is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Tag Play +\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"If you have Minun on your Bench, you may do 20 damage to any 1 Benched Pokémon instead. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Plusle', '311', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '36', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-37', '[{\'name\': \'Rough Skin\', \'text\': \"If Sharpedo is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if Sharpedo is Knocked Out), put 2 damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Strike Wound\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon has 2 or more damage counters on it, this attack does 60 damage plus 20 more damage. This attack damage isn\'t affected by Weakness, Resistance, Poké-Powers, Poké-Bodies, or any other effects on that Pokémon.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Carvanha', '', 'Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as The Bully of the Sea.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '39', 'Sharpedo', '319', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '37', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-38', '[{\'name\': \'Grass Whistle\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may remove 1 damage counter from each of your Grass Pokémon. You can\'t use more than 1 Grass Whistle Poké-Power each turn. This power can\'t be used if Sunflora is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Petal Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads. If you get 2 or more heads, Sunflora is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Sunkern', '', 'It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Sunflora', '192', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '38', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-39', '[{\'name\': \'Set\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Unown S, Unown E, and Unown T on your Bench, you may flip a coin. If heads, search your discard pile for an Energy card, show it to your opponent, and put it on top of your deck.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Unown S', '201', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '39', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-4', '[{\'name\': \'Burning Coat\', \'text\': \"Whenever 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from Entei\'s attacks, discard the top 3 cards from your opponent\'s deck.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Blaze Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) Flip a coin. If tails, discard 2 Fire Energy attached to Entei.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', '', 'It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Entei', '244', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp3-40', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Engage\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may use this power. Each of your Active Pokémon\'s type is Darkness until the end of your turn. If that Pokémon is no longer your Active Pokémon, this effect ends.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Shadow Charge\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Darkness Energy cards and attach them to any of your Pokémon in any way you like. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Chip Off\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has 6 or more cards in his or her hand, discard a number of cards without looking until your opponent has 5 cards left in his or her hand.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Sneasel', '', 'They live in cold regions, forming groups of four or five that hunt prey with impressive coordination.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Weavile', '461', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '40', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: +20'),
('dp3-41', '[{\'name\': \'Plant Cloak\', \'text\': \'If Wormadam Plant Cloak has 2 or more Grass Energy attached to it, Wormadam Plant Cloak gets +40 HP.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Leaf Hurricane\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon has fewer remaining HP than Wormadam Plant Cloak, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Burmy Plant Cloak', '', 'When BURMY evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémons body. The cloak is never shed.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '36', 'Wormadam Plant Cloak', '413', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '41', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-42', '[{\'name\': \'Sandy Cloak\', \'text\': \'Prevent all effects of attacks, excluding damage, done to Wormadam Sandy Cloak.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Push Over\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Does 40 damage plus 10 damage for each Fighting Energy attached to Wormadam Sandy Cloak.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Burmy Sandy Cloak', '', 'When BURMY evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémons body. The cloak is never shed.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '37', 'Wormadam Sandy Cloak', '413', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '42', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-43', '[{\'name\': \'Trash Cloak\', \'text\': \'If Wormadam Trash Cloak has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, any damage done to Wormadam Trash Cloak by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Iron Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'Wormadam Trash Cloak does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Burmy Trash Cloak', '', 'When BURMY evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémons body. The cloak is never shed.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '38', 'Wormadam Trash Cloak', '413', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '43', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-44', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Shift\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, if Xatu is on your Bench, you may choose 1 Special Condition from 1 of your Active Pokémon and remove that Special Condition. Then, 1 of the Defending Pokémon is now affected by that Special Condition that you chose.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each Energy attached to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Natu', '', 'This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the suns movement all day.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Xatu', '178', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '44', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-45', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Drain Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Remove from Breloom a number of damage counters equal to the amount of Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Homing Uppercut\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost is 0, this attack does 60 damage plus 60 more damage.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Shroomish', '', 'Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Breloom', '286', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp3-46', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Fire Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flare Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, discard a Fire Energy attached to Charmeleon and this attack does 50 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Charmander', 'Charizard', 'In the rocky mountains where CHARMELEON live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '29', 'Charmeleon', '5', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '46', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp3-47', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Withdraw\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to Cloyster by attacks during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Spine Missile\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip 4 coins. For each heads, choose an opponent\'s Pokémon in play and this attack does 20 damage to those Pokémon. (You may choose the same Pokémon more than once.) (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Shellder', '', 'It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Cloyster', '91', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '47', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-48', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Rapid Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon, if any. You switch Donphan with 1 of your Benched Pokémon, if any.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bash In\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'70+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, this attack does 70 damage plus 60 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Phanpy', '', 'It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '48', 'Donphan', '232', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp3-49', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Swords Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Farfetch\'d\'s Leek Slap attack\'s base damage is 60.\"}, {\'name\': \'Leek Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Farfetch\'d can\'t use Leek Slap.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Sirfetchd', 'It cant live without the stalk it holds. Thats why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Farfetchd', '83', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '49', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-5', '[{\'name\': \'Irritating Buzz\', \'text\': \"As long as Flygon is your Active Pokémon, put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon between turns, excluding Fighting Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Sonic\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If you attach a Fighting Energy card from your hand to Flygon during this turn, this attack does 60 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Vibrava', '', 'It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as The Desert Spirit.', 'Fourth ', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '60', 'Flygon', '330', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '5', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +30'),
('dp3-50', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Attract Current\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Lightning Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Pokémon. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Electromagnetic Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, Flaaffy does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Mareep', 'Ampharos', 'If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Flaaffy', '180', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-51', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Leech Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Remove 1 damage counter from Ivysaur.\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Bulbasaur', 'Venusaur', 'When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flowers coming bloom.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '24', 'Ivysaur', '2', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-52', '[{\'name\': \'Camouflage\', \'text\': \"If any basic Energy card attached to Kecleon is the same as the Attacking Pokémon\'s type, any damage done by attacks from the Pokémon to Kecleon is reduced by 40 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Blind Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does no damage to the Defending Pokémon. Instead, this attack does 20 damage to 1 of your Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It can freely change its bodys color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesnt change, however.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Kecleon', '352', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-53', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Research\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a Supporter card and use the effect of that card as the effect of this attack. (The Supporter card remains in your discard pile.)\'}, {\'name\': \'Telekinesis\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 40 damage to that Pokémon. This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Ralts', 'Gardevoir, Gallade', 'It is highly perceptive of its Trainers feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Kirlia', '281', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '53', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp3-54', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Torment\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent can\'t play any Supporter cards from his or her hand during his or her next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Absorb\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Remove 2 damage counters from Lombre.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Lotad', 'Ludicolo', 'It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Lombre', '271', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '54', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-55', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Healing Milk\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. For each heads, remove 3 damage counters from 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Continuous Tumble\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', '', 'It is said that kids who drink MILTANKs milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Miltank', '241', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-56', '[{\'name\': \'Toxic Sludge\', \'text\': \"At the end of each player\'s turn, each of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon that has any Grass Energy attached to it is now Poisoned. If that Pokémon is already Poisoned, Toxic Sludge Poké-Body does nothing to that Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Panic Liquid\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon is now Confused and can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Grimer', '', 'A toxic fluids seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Muk', '89', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp3-57', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Spirited Drill\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, each of Nidorino\'s attacks does 20 more damage to the Defending Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Poison Horn\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Nidoran ♂', 'Nidoking', 'It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Nidorino', '33', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '57', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp3-58', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Quick Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Pidgey', 'Pidgeot', 'It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '21', 'Pidgeotto', '17', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '58', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-59', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Grip and Squeeze\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Power Guillotine\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Flip 2 coins. If either of them is tails, this attack\'s base damage is 10 instead of 100.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn in half. What it cant tear, it tosses far.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Pinsir', '127', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-6', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Sonic Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put damage counters on the Defending Pokémon until it is 50 HP away from being Knocked Out. If you do, your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psychic Cut\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'You may choose as many of your face-down Prize cards as you like and put them face up. If you do, this attack does 60 damage plus 20 more damage for each Prize card you chose. (These cards remain face up for the rest of the game.)\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Kirlia', '', 'A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '55', 'Gallade', '475', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '6', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +30'),
('dp3-60', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Healing\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Quagsire is your Active Pokémon and the Defending Pokémon has any Water Energy attached to it, you may remove 3 damage counters from Quagsire.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Muddy Water\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', 'Wooper', '', 'It has a sluggish nature. It lies at the rivers bottom, waiting for prey to stray into its mouth.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '38', 'Quagsire', '195', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '60', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +30'),
('dp3-61', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw Off\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 60 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sneaky Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If Raticate has any Darkness Energy attached to it, this attack does 20 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Rattata', '', 'It whittles its constantly growing fangs by gnawing on hard things. It can chew apart cinder walls.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '29', 'Raticate', '20', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '61', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-62', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Sleep Powder\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Roserade', 'ROSELIA raised on clean drinking water are known to grow vividly colored flowers.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Roselia', '315', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-63', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Rummage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 5 cards of your deck. Choose as many Trainer cards as you like, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. Put the other cards back on top of your deck. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Shadow Sneak\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If you and your opponent have a different number of Prize cards left, this attack does 20 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Sableye', '302', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', ''),
('dp3-64', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Focus Energy\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Shelgon\'s Protect Charge attack\'s base damage is 80.\"}, {\'name\': \'Protect Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Shelgon by attacks is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Bagon', 'Salamence', 'Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Shelgon', '372', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +20'),
('dp3-65', '[{\'name\': \'Cotton Balloon\', \'text\': \"If Skiploom has any Grass Energy attached to it, any damage done to Skiploom by attacks from your opponent\'s Evolved Pokémon is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'U-turn\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Switch Skiploom with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '', 'Hoppip', 'Jumpluff', 'It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '20', 'Skiploom', '188', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '65', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-66', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Color Pick\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 basic Energy cards, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Trace\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose an attack on 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. Trace copies that attack except for its Energy cost. (You must still do anything else required for that attack.) Smeargle performs that attack.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Smeargle', '235', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-67', '[{\'name\': \'Baby Evolution\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put Jynx from your hand onto Smoochum (this counts as evolving Smoochum) and remove all damage counters from Smoochum.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Psykiss\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose a Special Energy card attached to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon and have your opponent shuffle that card into his or her deck.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Jynx', 'It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Smoochum', '238', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-68', '[{\'name\': \'Kind\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may remove 2 damage counters from 1 of the Defending Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Unown K', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-69', '[{\'name\': \'Nod\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Unown N, Unown O, and Unown D on your Bench, you may ask your opponent to take a Prize card. If he or she does, you take a Prize card. If he or she doesn\'t, draw a card.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '16', 'Unown N', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-7', '[{\'name\': \'Telepass\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may search your opponent\'s discard pile for a Supporter card and use the effect of that card as the effect of this power. (The Supporter card remains in your opponent\'s discard pile.) You can\'t use more than 1 Telepass Poké-Power each turn. This power can\'t be used if Gardevoir is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Lock\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent can\'t use any Poké-Powers on his or her Pokémon.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', 'Kirlia', '', 'It will try to guard its trusted Trainer with its life. It has the ability to see the future.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '55', 'Gardevoir', '282', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '7', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +30'),
('dp3-70', '[{\'name\': \'ONE\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Unown O, Unown N, and Unown E on your Bench and you have 1 card left in your hand, you may draw cards until you have 7 cards in your hand.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '12', 'Unown O', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-71', '[{\'name\': \'X-RAY\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Unown X on your Bench, you may look at the top card of your opponent\'s deck and put it back on top of his or her deck.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Unown X', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-72', '[{\'name\': \'ZERO\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown Z is on your Bench and you have no cards in your deck, you may discard all cards attached to Unown Z and put Unown Z on top of your deck.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Remove as many damage counters as you like from each Unown you have in play. Put that many damage counters on the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '16', 'Unown Z', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-73', '[{\'name\': \'Dangerous Scales\', \'text\': \"If Venomoth is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if Venomoth is Knocked Out), the Attacking Pokémon is now Asleep and Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Disturbance Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of an attack, excluding damage, done to Venomoth during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Venonat', '', 'It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Venomoth', '49', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '73', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp3-74', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Trapinch', 'Flygon', 'It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '37', 'Vibrava', '329', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '74', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp3-75', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Giant Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Wartortle can\'t use Giant Wave during your next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Shell Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', 'Squirtle', 'Blastoise', 'It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Wartortle', '8', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '75', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp3-76', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage plus 10 more damage for each damage counter on Bagon.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Shelgon', 'Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Bagon', '371', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '76', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +10'),
('dp3-77', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Shake Vine\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bullet Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Ivysaur', 'For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '14', 'Bulbasaur', '1', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-78', '[{\'name\': \'Wear Cloak\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Burmy Plant Cloak is your Active Pokémon, you may search your discard pile for a basic Grass Energy card and attach it to Burmy Plant Cloak.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Plant Cloak Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Burmy Plant Cloak has any Grass Energy attached to it, this attack does 10 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Wormadam', 'To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Burmy Plant Cloak', '412', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-79', '[{\'name\': \'Wear Cloak\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Burmy Sandy Cloak is your Active Pokémon, you may search your discard for a basic Fighting Energy card and attach it to Burmy Sandy Cloak.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Sandy Cloak Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Burmy Sandy Cloak has any Fighting Energy attached to it, this attack does 10 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Wormadam', 'To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Burmy Sandy Cloak', '412', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-8', '[{\'name\': \'Osmotic Pressure\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Gastrodon West Sea in play, you may move up to 3 damage counters from Gastrodon East Sea to 1 of your Gastrodon West Sea.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Dwindling Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80-\', \'text\': \'Does 80 damage minus 10 damage for each damage counter on Gastrodon East Sea.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '4', 'Shellos East Sea', '', 'It has a pliable body without any bones. If any part of its body is torn off, it grows right back.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Gastrodon East Sea', '423', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '8', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +30'),
('dp3-80', '[{\'name\': \'Wear Cloak\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Burmy Trash Cloak is your Active Pokémon, you may search your discard for a basic Metal Energy card and attach it to Burmy Trash Cloak.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Trash Cloak Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Burmy Trash Cloak has any Metal Energy attached to it, this attack does 10 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Wormadam', 'To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Burmy Trash Cloak', '412', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '80', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-81', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite Away\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose a card from your opponent\'s hand without looking and discard it.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Sharpedo', 'They can swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Carvanha', '318', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-82', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Lava Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Charmeleon', 'The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '8', 'Charmander', '4', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '82', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp3-83', '', '', 'Lee HyunJung', '[{\'name\': \'Double Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Clefable', '', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '17', 'Clefairy', '35', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Moon Stone: Clefairy can evolve during the turn you play it.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-84', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Rally\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 different types of Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hook\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Cursola', 'Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently cant live in polluted waters.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Corsola', '222', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '84', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +20');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('dp3-85', '', '', 'Takao Unno', '[{\'name\': \'Down Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card from the bottom of your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mud Spatter\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Dugtrio', 'A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Diglett', '50', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '85', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp3-86', '', '', 'Hiroki Fuchino', '[{\'name\': \'Astonish\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 card from your opponent\'s hand without looking. Look at that card you chose, then have your opponent shuffle that card into his or her deck.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Dusclops', '', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Duskull', '355', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '[\'Reaper Cloth: Duskull can evolve during the turn you play it.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: +10'),
('dp3-87', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Thundershock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, Electabuzz does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', 'Electivire', 'Half of all blackouts occur when this Pokémon appears at power plants and eats electricity.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Electabuzz', '125', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '87', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-88', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Mud Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Gunky\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', 'Muk', 'It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moons X-rays. It appears among filth.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Grimer', '88', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '88', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-89', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Dig Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', 'Arcanine', 'A Pokémon with a loyal nature. It will remain motionless until it is given an order by its Trainer.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '20', 'Growlithe', '58', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '89', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp3-9', '', '', 'Kazuyuki Kano', '[{\'name\': \'Raging Flood\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each damage counter on Gastrodon West Sea. Then, remove 2 damage counters from Gastrodon West Sea.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wild Waves\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on each Benched Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s).\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '4', 'Shellos West Sea', '', 'It has a pliable body without any bones. If any part of its body is torn off, it grows right back.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Gastrodon West Sea', '423', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '9', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: +30'),
('dp3-90', '[{\'name\': \'Cottonweed\', \'text\': \'If Hoppip has any Grass Energy attached to it, the Retreat Cost for Hoppip is 0.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Motofumi Fujiwara', '[{\'name\': \'Hover Heal\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Remove all Special Conditions from Hoppip.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Skiploom', 'It drifts on winds. It is said that when HOPPIP gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.', 'Fourth ', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Hoppip', '187', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '90', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp3-91', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Lick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '3', '', 'Lickilicky', 'Instead of hands, it uses its tongue, which is twice its height. Its sticky saliva grips anything.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '27', 'Lickitung', '108', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '91', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp3-92', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Water Sport\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Lotad has less Energy attached to it than the Defending Pokémon, this attack does 10 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Lombre', 'It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that cant swim.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Lotad', '270', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '92', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-93', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Fire Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Smog\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '2', '', 'Magmortar', 'Born in the spout of a volcano, its body is covered by flames that shimmer like the sun.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '27', 'Magmar', '126', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '93', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp3-94', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Thundershock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Flaaffy', 'Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Mareep', '179', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '94', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp3-95', '', '', 'Yusuke Ohmura', '[{\'name\': \'Feint Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 20 damage to that Pokémon. This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness, Resistance, Poké-Powers, Poké-Bodies, or any other effects on that Pokémon.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Honchkrow', '', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Murkrow', '198', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '[\'Dusk Stone: Murkrow can evolve during the turn you play it.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '95', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp3-96', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Bothering Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. If heads, discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Future Sight\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top 5 cards of either player\'s deck and put them back on top of that player\'s deck in any order.\"}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Xatu', 'It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '9', 'Natu', '177', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '96', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-97', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Poison Skin\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If either of them is heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Nidorino', 'It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Nidoran ♂', '32', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '97', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp3-98', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Flail\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage times the number of damage counters on Phanpy.\'}, {\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Phanpy does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Donphan', 'It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '14', 'Phanpy', '231', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '98', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp3-99', '', '', 'Hironobu Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Growl\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done by attacks from the Defending Pokémon is reduced by 20 (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Secret Wonders', '1', '', 'Pidgeotto', 'It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp3/dp3-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '8', 'Pidgey', '16', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2007', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '99', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-1', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Fire Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a Fire Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flame Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard 2 Fire Energy attached to Blaziken. This attack does 80 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Combusken', '', 'Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '56', 'Blaziken', '257', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +30'),
('dp4-10', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Power Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 10 damage for each basic Energy card attached to Tangrowth to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Stick and Absorb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Remove 3 damage counters from Tangrowth. The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Tangela', '', 'It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '38', 'Tangrowth', '465', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '10', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp4-100', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Great Encounters', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Moonlight Stadium', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '[\"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\", \"The Retreat Cost for each Psychic and Darkness Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s) is 0.\"]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '100', 'Stadium', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp4-101', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Great Encounters', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Premier Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '[\'Search your deck or your discard pile for a Pokémon LV.X, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. If you search your deck, shuffle your deck afterward.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '101', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp4-102', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Great Encounters', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-102.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rare Candy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '[\'Choose 1 of your Basic Pokémon in play. If you have a Stage 1 or Stage 2 card that evolves from that Pokémon in your hand, put that card on the Basic Pokémon. (This counts as evolving that Pokémon.)\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '102', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp4-103', '[{\'name\': \'Full Moon Dance\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may move 1 damage counter from either player\'s Pokémon to another Pokémon (yours or your opponent\'s). This power can\'t be used if Cresselia is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Shizurow', '[{\'name\': \'Moon Skip\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is Knocked Out by this attack, take 1 more Prize card.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Cresselia', '', '', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-103.png', 'unlimited: Legal', 'X', 'Cresselia LV.X', '488', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo LV.X', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Put this card onto your Active Cresselia. Cresselia LV.X can use any attack, Poké-Power, or Poké-Body from its previous level.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '103', 'Level-Up', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('dp4-104', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Shadow\', \'text\': \'Each basic Darkness Energy card attached to your Darkness Pokémon now has the effect \"If the Pokémon Darkness Energy is attached to attacks, the attack does 10 more damage to the Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\" You can\\\'t use more than 1 Dark Shadow Poké-Body each turn.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Shizurow', '[{\'name\': \'Endless Darkness\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep. Flip 2 coins instead of 1 between turns. If either of them is tails, the Defending Pokémon is still Asleep. If both of them are tails, the Defending Pokémon is Knocked Out.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Darkrai', '', '', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-104.png', 'unlimited: Legal', 'X', 'Darkrai LV.X', '491', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo LV.X', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '[\'Put this card onto your Active Darkrai. Darkrai LV.X can use any attack, Poké-Power, or Poké-Body from its previous level.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '104', 'Level-Up', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('dp4-105', '[{\'name\': \'Time Skip\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may have your opponent flip 2 coins. If both of them are heads, your turn ends. If both of them are tails, after your opponent draws a card at the beginning of his or her next turn, his or her turn ends. This power can\'t be used if Dialga is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Flash\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Dialga can\'t use Metal Flash.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Dialga', '', '', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal', 'X', 'Dialga LV.X', '483', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo LV.X', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Put this card onto your Active Dialga. Dialga LV.X can use any attack, Poké-Power, or Poké-Body from its previous level.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '105', 'Level-Up', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('dp4-106', '[{\'name\': \'Restructure\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may have your opponent switch 1 of your Active Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. Then, you switch 1 of the Defending Pokémon with 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Palkia is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Reflect\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"You may move all Energy cards attached to Palkia to your Benched Pokémon in any way you like. (Ignore this effect if you don\'t have any Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '3', 'Palkia', '', '', 'Fourth ', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal', 'X', 'Palkia LV.X', '484', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo LV.X', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Put this card onto your Active Palkia. Palkia LV.X can use any attack, Poké-Power, or Poké-Body from its previous level.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '106', 'Level-Up', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('dp4-11', '[{\'name\': \'Serene Grace\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you play Togekiss from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon, you may look at the top 10 cards of your deck, choose as many basic Energy cards as you like, and attach them to your Pokémon in any way you like. Put the other cards back on top of your deck. Shuffle your deck afterward.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Air Scroll\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 40 damage plus 30 more damage. If tails, remove 3 damage counters from Togekiss.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Togetic', '', 'It will never appear where there is strife. Its sightings have become rare recently.', 'Fourth ', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '51', 'Togekiss', '468', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '11', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +30'),
('dp4-12', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Dragonbreath\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Cotton Cloud\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Altaria by attacks from your opponent\'s Evolved Pokémon is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Swablu', '', 'It looks like a fluffy cloud when it is in flight. It hums with its soprano voice.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Altaria', '334', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '12', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +20'),
('dp4-13', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Band Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Does 30 damage times the number of Beedrill you have in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Twineedle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 50 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '', 'Kakuna', '', 'Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '41', 'Beedrill', '15', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '13', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp4-14', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Parallel Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'After your attack, remove from 1 of your Pokémon the number of damage counters equal to the damage you did to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Dozing Scales\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Asleep. If tails, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '', 'Metapod', '', 'It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.', 'Fourth ', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '36', 'Butterfree', '12', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '14', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp4-15', '[{\'name\': \'Cosmic Power\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may choose up to 2 cards from your hand and put them on the bottom of your deck in any order. If you do, draw cards until you have 6 cards in your hand. This power can\'t be used if Claydol is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Baltoy', '', 'An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Claydol', '344', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '15', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: +20'),
('dp4-16', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Time Bellow\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flash Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"You may return all Energy cards attached to Dialga to your hand. If you do, remove the highest Stage Evolution card from the Defending Pokémon and shuffle that card into your opponent\'s deck.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', '', 'It has the power to control time. It appears in Sinnoh-region myths as an ancient deity.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '68', 'Dialga', '483', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-17', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Ambient Noise\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip 2 coins. If the first coin is heads, this attack does 50 damage to the Defending Pokémon. If the first coin is tails, this attack does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) If the second coin is heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused. If the second coin is tails, your opponent can\'t play any Trainer, Supporter, or Stadium cards from his or her hand during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '3', 'Loudred', '', 'Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-17.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '58', 'Exploud', '295', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '17', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +30'),
('dp4-18', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 card from your opponent\'s hand without looking and discard it.\"}, {\'name\': \'Black Fire\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'You may discard a Fire or Darkness Energy attached to Houndoom. If you discard a Fire Energy, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned. If you discard a Darkness Energy, this attack does 40 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Houndour', '', 'Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-18.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '41', 'Houndoom', '229', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '18', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp4-19', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Dream Catcher\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is Asleep, move all damage counters from Hypno to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Drowzee', '', 'Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even if someone just woke up.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-19.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Hypno', '97', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '19', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-2', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Moon Twinkle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, remove 2 damage counters from Cresselia.\'}, {\'name\': \'Lunar Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'You may discard 2 Energy attached to Cresselia. If you do, remove all damage counters from 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Shiny particles are released from its wings like a veil. It is said to represent the crescent moon.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-2.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '48', 'Cresselia', '488', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '2', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-20', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Crabhammer\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Scissor Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon would be be Knocked Out by this attack, Kingler does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '3', 'Krabby', '', 'The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-20.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '33', 'Kingler', '99', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '20', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-21', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Carry In\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Pokémon Tool Card, a Supporter card, and a basic Energy card, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '47', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '21', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-22', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Miraculous Light\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Remove 2 damage counters and all Special Conditions from Latias.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mist Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard a Fire Energy and a Water Energy attached to Latias.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-22.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Latias', '380', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '22', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +20'),
('dp4-23', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a basic Energy card and attach it to Latios. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Luster Purge\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Discard 3 Energy attached to Latios.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', '', 'A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '47', 'Latios', '381', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '23', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +20'),
('dp4-24', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Pick Out\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 face-down Prize card (yours or your opponent\'s) and put it face up. If that card is a Supporter card, use the effect of that card as the effect of this attack. (That card remains face up for the rest of the game.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Jaw Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'During your next turn, if an attack does damage to the Defending Pokémon (after applying Weakness and Resistance), that attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Mawile', '303', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '24', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp4-25', '[{\'name\': \'Marvel Scale\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Milotic by your opponent\'s Pokémon LV.X.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Twister\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If both are tails, this attack does nothing. For each heads, discard an Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Feebas', '', 'When people bicker, it is said to arise from the depths of lakes to becalm violent hearts.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '47', 'Milotic', '350', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '25', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-26', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Spacial Rend\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Stadium card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward. If there is any Stadium card in play, discard it.\'}, {\'name\': \'Transback\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"You may flip a coin. If heads, discard all Energy attached to Palkia and put the Defending Pokémon and all cards attached to it on top of your opponent\'s deck. Your opponent shuffles his or her deck afterward.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', '', 'It has the ability to distort space. It is described as a deity in Sinnoh-region mythology.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '67', 'Palkia', '484', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '26', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-27', '[{\'name\': \'Anger Point\', \'text\': \"If Primeape has any damage counters on it, Primeape\'s attacks do 40 more damage to the Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Whump\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Primeape is now Confused. Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Mankey', '', 'It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '41', 'Primeape', '57', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '27', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-28', '[{\'name\': \'Trump Card\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out during your opponent\'s last turn, search your deck for any 1 card and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward. This power can\'t be used if Slowking is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Psych Up\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Slowking\'s Psych Up attack\'s base damage is 60.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Slowpoke', '', 'Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '41', 'Slowking', '199', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '28', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-29', '[{\'name\': \'HEAL\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Unown H, Unown E, Unown A, and Unown L on your Bench, you may remove all Special Conditions from 1 of your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Discard a card from your hand. (If you can\'t discard a card from your hand, this attack does nothing.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '12', 'Unown H', '201', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '29', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-3', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Reach Over\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for an Energy card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Darkness Pursuit\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon is Cresselia, this attack\'s base damage is 100.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '38', 'Darkrai', '491', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '3', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-30', '[{\'name\': \'Sleeping Pulse\', \'text\': \'As long as Wailord remains Asleep between turns, remove 1 damage counter from Wailord.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Sink Deep\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'If Wailord has any damage counters on it, Wailord is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '4', 'Wailmer', '', 'The biggest of all Pokémon. It can dive to a depth of almost 10,000 feet on only one breath.', 'Fourth ', '200', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Wailord', '321', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '30', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('dp4-31', '[{\'name\': \'Toxic Virus\', \'text\': \'At any time between turns, each player puts 1 more damage counter on his or her Poisoned Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Offensive Gas\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused and Poisoned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Koffing', '', 'It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Weezing', '110', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '31', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-32', '[{\'name\': \'Good Night Melody\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may use this power. Each Active Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s) is now Asleep. This power can\'t be used if Wigglytuff is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Ballon Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If Igglybuff is anywhere under Wigglytuff, this attack does 40 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Jigglypuff', '', 'Its fine fur feels sublime to the touch. It can expand its body by inhaling air.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Wigglytuff', '40', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '32', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-33', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Deadly Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is Poisoned, this attack does 10 damage plus 40 more damage. If the Defending Pokémon is not Poisoned, that Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wrap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Ekans', '', 'The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Arbok', '24', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '33', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-34', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Pin Missile\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Needle Arm\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon already has any damage counters on it, this attack does 50 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Cacnea', '', 'It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the days desert heat.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '36', 'Cacturne', '332', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '34', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-35', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Bulk Up\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, each of Combusken\'s attacks does 30 more damage to the Defending Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Double Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 50 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Torchic', 'Blaziken', 'Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '24', 'Combusken', '256', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '35', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp4-36', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Present\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for any 1 card and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ice Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It carries food rolled up in its tail. It has the habit of sharing food with people lost in mountains.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Delibird', '225', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '36', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: +20'),
('dp4-37', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Agility\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of an attack, including damage, done to Floatzel during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Jet\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Buizel', '', 'It floats using its well-developed floatation sac. It assists in the rescues of drowning people.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Floatzel', '419', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '37', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-38', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Temptation\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with 1 of the Defending Pokémon. This attack does 10 damage to the new Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psychic Snap\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If Gorebyss has any Psychic Energy attached to it, this attack does 30 damage plus 20 more damage and the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '', 'Clamperl', '', 'It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '34', 'Gorebyss', '368', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '38', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('dp4-39', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Daunt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done by attacks from the Defending Pokémon is reduced by 20 (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Rage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Does 40 damage plus 10 more damage for each damage counter on Granbull.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Snubbull', '', 'It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '34', 'Granbull', '210', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '39', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-4', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Darkness Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'You may have your opponent switch the Defending Pokémon with 1 or his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sleep Hole\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is Asleep, this attack does 40 damage plus 40 more damage. If the Defending Pokémon is not Asleep, that Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Darkrai', '491', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-40', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Greenness\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Grass Energy cards, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Poison Breath\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Treecko', 'Sceptile', 'It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Grovyle', '253', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '40', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-41', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Palm Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 damage plus 40 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Spirited Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"If Hariyama has fewer remaining HP than the Defending Pokémon, this attack\'s base damage is 80.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '3', 'Makuhita', '', 'It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '38', 'Hariyama', '297', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '41', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +30'),
('dp4-42', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Scary Face\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack or retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Threaten and Drop\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If Huntail has any Darkness Energy attached to it, this attack does 30 damage plus 20 more damage and discard a Special Energy card, if any, attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Clamperl', '', 'It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '33', 'Huntail', '367', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '42', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-43', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Switcheroo\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move a Pokémon Tool card attached to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon to another of your opponent\'s Pokémon (excluding Pokémon that already has a Pokémon Tool attached to it). (If an effect of this attack is prevented, this attack does nothing.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Overrun\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '', 'Zigzagoon', '', 'It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '24', 'Linoone', '264', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '43', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-44', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Bass Control\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 20 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 40 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Whismur', 'Exploud', 'The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Loudred', '294', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '44', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-45', '[{\'name\': \'Magma Armor\', \'text\': \"Magcargo can\'t be Asleep or Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Lava Plume\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'You may discard the top card of your deck. If you do, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '3', 'Slugma', '', 'Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '35', 'Magcargo', '219', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp4-46', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Muddy Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 30 damage to that Pokémon and 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s other Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Mudkip', 'Swampert', 'Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Marshtomp', '259', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '46', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +20'),
('dp4-47', '[{\'name\': \'Emerge\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if Metapod is your Active Pokémon, you may flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a card that evolves from Metapod and put it onto Metapod. (This counts as evolving Metapod.) Shuffle your deck afterward. This power can\'t be used if Metapod is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Caterpie', 'Butterfree', 'A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '9', 'Metapod', '11', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '47', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-48', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Guzzle\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Choose up to 2 basic Water Energy cards from your hand and attach them to Pelipper. Remove 2 damage counters for each Energy card attached in this way.\'}, {\'name\': \'Jet Return\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Does 30 times the number of Energy cards attached to Pelipper. Then, put all Energy cards attached to Pelipper on top of your deck. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Wingull', '', 'It dips its large bill in the sea, then scoops up numerous prey along with water.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Pelipper', '279', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-49', '[{\'name\': \'Download\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard a Supporter card from your hand and use the effect of that card as the effect of this power. This power can\'t be used if Porygon2 is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Speed Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Porygon', 'Porygon-Z', 'With planetary development software installed, it became capable of working in space.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '39', 'Porygon2', '233', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '49', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-5', '', '', 'Hironobu Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Smash Short\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, this attack does 10 damage plus 30 more damage. Discard that Pokémon Tool card, look at your opponent\'s hand, and discard any Pokémon Tool cards of the same name you find there.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It makes fur balls that crackle with static electricity. It stores them with berries in tree holes.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Pachirisu', '417', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '5', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-50', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Swagger\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fury Swipes\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Glameow', '', 'It is a brazen brute that barges its way into another Pokémons nest and claims it as its own.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '47', 'Purugly', '432', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-51', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Primal Calling\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Trainer Cards that have Fossil in their names, show them to your opponent, and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sleep Swirl\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Both Relicanth and the Defending Pokémon are now Asleep.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Relicanth', '369', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '51', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-52', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent can\'t play any Trainer cards from his or her hand during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Poison Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 damage plus 30 more damage and the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', '', 'For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '26', 'Seviper', '336', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-53', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Air Crash\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Steel Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Skarmory by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Despite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Skarmory', '227', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-54', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Amnesia\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks. That Pokémon can\'t use that attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Zen Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Slowpoke', '', 'Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '39', 'Slowbro', '80', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '54', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-55', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Speed Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Sweet Kiss\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Your opponent may draw a card.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', 'Togepi', 'Togekiss', 'It is said to appear in front of kindly people to scatter a glowing down called joy dust.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Togetic', '176', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '55', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-56', '[{\'name\': \'FAKE\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown F is on your Bench, you may use this power. Put a coin next to your Active Pokémon without showing your opponent and cover it with your hand. Your opponent guesses if the coin is heads or tails. If he or she is wrong, draw a card.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"You may flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. If heads, this attack\'s base damage is 30.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Unown F', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-57', '[{\'name\': \'GUARD\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown G is on your Bench, you may discard all cards attached to Unown G and attach Unown G to 1 of your Pokémon as a Pokémon Tool card. As long as Unown G is attached to a Pokémon, prevent all effects of attacks, excluding damage, done to that Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"If Unown G has any damage counters on it, this attack\'s base damage is 10.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '17', 'Unown G', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-58', '', '', 'Satoshi Ohta', '[{\'name\': \'Tsunami\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '3', '', 'Wailord', 'On sunny days, it lands on beaches to bounce like a ball and play. It spouts water from its nose.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '14', 'Wailmer', '320', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp4-59', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Cutting Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has Seviper in play, this attack does 40 damage plus 50 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Zangoose', '335', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp4-6', '[{\'name\': \'Conversion\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard a basic Energy card from your hand. Porygon-Z is the same type as that Energy Card until the end of your turn. This power can\'t be used if Porygon-Z is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Tri Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Porygon2', '', 'Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokémon. It began acting oddly, however.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '54', 'Porygon-Z', '474', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '6', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +30'),
('dp4-60', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Balance\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If you have less cards in your hand than your opponent, draw cards until you have the same number of cards as your opponent. (If you have more or the same number of cards in your hand as your opponent, this attack does nothing.)\'}, {\'name\': \'Spin Turn\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Switch Baltoy with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Claydol', 'It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Baltoy', '343', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: +10'),
('dp4-61', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Floatzel', 'It has a flotation sac that is like an inflatable collar. It floats on water with its head out.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '14', 'Buizel', '418', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-62', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}, {\'name\': \'Poison Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Cacturne', 'By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive 30 days without water.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '12', 'Cacnea', '331', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp4-63', '[{\'name\': \'Pupate\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if Caterpie is your Active Pokémon, you may flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a card that evolves from Caterpie and put it onto Caterpie. (This counts as evolving Caterpie.) Shuffle your deck afterward. This power can\'t be used if Caterpie is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Metapod', 'It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Caterpie', '10', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp4-64', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Clamp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sparkling Pearl\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Huntail, Gorebyss', 'It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Clamperl', '366', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-65', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnosis\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Hypno', 'It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Drowzee', '96', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-66', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Shed Skin\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Remove 2 damage counters from Ekans.\'}, {\'name\': \'Poison Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', 'Arbok', 'It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '16', 'Ekans', '23', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-67', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Fast Evolution\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for an Evolution card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Milotic', 'It is famous for its shabby appearance. While populous, they tend to cluster in set locations.', 'Fourth ', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '4', 'Feebas', '349', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-68', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Captivate\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with 1 of the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Purugly', 'It claws if displeased and purrs when affectionate. Its fickleness is very popular among some.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '14', 'Glameow', '431', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-69', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Ember\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, discard a Fire Energy attached to Houndour.\'}, {\'name\': \'Smash Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Houndoom', 'It conveys its feelings using different cries. It works in a pack to cleverly take down prey.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Houndour', '228', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp4-7', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Astonish\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 card from your opponent\'s hand without looking. Look at that card you chose, then have your opponent shuffle that card into his or her deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Telebeam\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 damage plus 30 more damage and the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '38', 'Rotom', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Darkness, value: +20'),
('dp4-70', '[{\'name\': \'Baby Evolution\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put Jigglypuff from your hand onto Igglybuff (this counts as evolving Igglybuff) and remove all damage counters from Igglybuff.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Inquire\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Draw a card. If you didn\'t play any Supporter card from your hand during this turn, draw 2 more cards.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Jigglypuff', 'It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Igglybuff', '174', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-71', '[{\'name\': \'Scent Conduct\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Grass Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward. This power can\'t be used if Illumise is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Firefly Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon has any Poké-Bodies, that Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'With its sweet aroma, it guides VOLBEAT to draw signs with light in the night sky.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '29', 'Illumise', '314', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-72', '', '', 'Kenkichi Toyama', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnotic Gaze\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Expand\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Jigglypuff by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Wigglytuff', 'When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Jigglypuff', '39', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-73', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Stiffen\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Kakuna by attacks is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Spit Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Weedle', 'Beedrill', 'While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '9', 'Kakuna', '14', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '73', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-74', '', '', 'Lee HyunJung', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Smogscreen\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned. If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', 'Weezing', 'Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell, they are also explosive.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Koffing', '109', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-75', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Irongrip\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Guillotine\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', 'Kingler', 'It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '8', 'Krabby', '98', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-76', '[{\'name\': \'Gravity Change\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard a card from your hand. Then, if you have Solrock in play, draw a card. This power can\'t be used if Lunatone is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Knock Over\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'You may discard any Stadium card in play.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '31', 'Lunatone', '337', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '76', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp4-77', '', '', 'Motofumi Fujiwara', '[{\'name\': \'Rendezvous\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Reveal the top card of your deck and put it into your hand. If that card is a Pokémon, draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Synchro Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Luvdisc and the Defending Pokémon have the same amount of Energy attached to them, this attack does 10 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Luvdisc', '370', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-78', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Arm Thrust\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. If heads, discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', 'Hariyama', 'It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Makuhita', '296', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-79', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Light Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage plus 10 more damage for each damage counter on Mankey.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Primeape', 'It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '14', 'Mankey', '56', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-8', '[{\'name\': \'Wild Growth\', \'text\': \"Each basic Grass Energy card attached to your Grass Pokémon provides GrassGrass Energy instead. You can\'t use more than 1 Wild Growth Poké-Body each turn.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Leaf Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 50 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '3', 'Grovyle', '', 'The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '52', 'Sceptile', '254', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '8', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp4-80', '', '', 'Emi Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Mud Spatter\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Endeavor\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage plus 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Marshtomp', 'To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Mudkip', '258', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '80', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +10'),
('dp4-81', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Calculate\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 3 cards of your deck and put them back on top of your deck in any order.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sharpen\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Porygon2', 'The worlds first artificially created Pokémon. It can travel through electronic space.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Porygon', '137', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-82', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Rest\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Remove all Special Conditions and 3 damage counters from Slowpoke. Slowpoke is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tumble Over\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Slowpoke can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', 'Slowbro, Slowking', 'Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Slowpoke', '79', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '82', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-83', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Steady Firebreathing\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Body Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', 'Magcargo', 'Its body is made of magma. If it doesnt keep moving, its body will cool and harden.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Slugma', '218', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp4-84', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Granbull', 'Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Snubbull', '209', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '84', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-85', '[{\'name\': \'Sunlight\', \'text\': \"If you have Lunatone in play, damage done to your opponent\'s Pokémon by your Psychic or Fighting Pokémon isn\'t affected by resistance.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Sol Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a basic Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'A new Pokémon species, rumored to be from the sun. It gives off light while spinning.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '29', 'Solrock', '338', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '85', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: +20'),
('dp4-86', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Super Speed\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of an attack, including damage, done to Swablu during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Shoot Through\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Altaria', 'Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someones head, it looks like a cotton hat.', 'Fourth ', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Swablu', '333', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-87', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Vine Invite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with 1 of the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Grass Knot\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"Does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each Colorless Energy in the Defending Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost (after applying effects to the the Retreat Cost).\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', '', 'Tangrowth', 'It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '12', 'Tangela', '114', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '87', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp4-88', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Yawn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Find a Friend\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Togetic', 'Its shell is said to be stuffed with happiness that it shares with kindhearted people.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '4', 'Togepi', '175', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '88', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-89', '', '', 'Hiroki Fuchino', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Combusken', 'A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Torchic', '255', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '89', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('dp4-9', '[{\'name\': \'Wash Out\', \'text\': \"As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may move a Water or Fighting Energy attached to 1 of your Benched Pokémon to your Active Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Swampert is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer Arm\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card from your opponent\'s deck.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '2', 'Marshtomp', '', 'It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '53', 'Swampert', '260', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '9', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +30');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('dp4-90', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage plus 10 more damage for each Energy attached to Treecko but not used to pay for this attack\'s Energy cost. You can\'t add more than 20 damage in this way.\"}, {\'name\': \'Absorb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Remove 1 damage counter from Treecko.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Grovyle', 'The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Treecko', '252', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '90', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp4-91', '[{\'name\': \'LINK\', \'text\': \"Unown L can use any attack from any Unown in play (both yours and your opponent\'s). (You still have to pay for that attack\'s Energy cost.)\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Search either player\'s discard pile for up to any 2 cards, show them to your opponent, and put them on top of that player\'s deck in any order you like.\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Unown L', '201', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '91', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp4-92', '[{\'name\': \'Light Conduct\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Illumise in play, you may search your discard pile for a Supporter card, show it to your opponent, and put it on top of your deck. This power can\'t be used if Volbeat is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Firefly Light\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', '', 'It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves ILLUMISEs sweet aroma.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '34', 'Volbeat', '313', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '92', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp4-93', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'String Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Kakuna', 'It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '5', 'Weedle', '13', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '93', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('dp4-94', '', '', 'Takao Unno', '[{\'name\': \'Mumble\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Uproar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Loudred', 'Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs.  If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '8', 'Whismur', '293', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '94', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-95', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Water Drip\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Pelipper', 'It makes its nest on steep sea cliffs. Riding updrafts, it soars to great heights.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Wingull', '278', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '95', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp4-96', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Pull Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for any 1 card, show it to your opponent, and put it on top of your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Stab\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Great Encounters', '1', '', 'Linoone', 'It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '6', 'Zigzagoon', '263', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '96', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp4-97', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '', 'Great Encounters', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Amulet Coin', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '[\"Attach Amulet Coin to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it. If that Pokémon is Knocked Out, discard this card.\", \'If the Pokémon Amulet Coin is attached to is your Active Pokémon at the end of your turn, draw a card.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '97', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp4-98', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Great Encounters', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Felicitys Drawing', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Discard up to 2 cards from your hand. If you discard 1 card, draw 3 cards. If you discard 2 cards, draw 4 cards.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '98', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp4-99', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '', 'Great Encounters', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp4/dp4-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Leftovers', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2008', '', '', '[\"Attach Leftovers to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it. If that Pokémon is Knocked Out, discard this card.\", \'If the Pokémon Leftovers is attached to is your Active Pokémon at the end of your turn, remove 1 damage counter from the Pokémon.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '99', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('dp5-1', '[{\'name\': \'Freezing Screech\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you put Articuno from your hand onto your Bench, you may flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon. That Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzard\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. If tails, this attack does 10 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', '', '', 'A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Articuno', '144', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('dp5-10', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Charge\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you put Moltres from your hand onto your Bench, you may flip a coin. If heads, search your discard pile for up to 3 Fire Energy cards and attach them to Moltres.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Scorching Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Discard all Fire Energy attached to Moltres.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', '', '', 'One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '47', 'Moltres', '146', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('dp5-100', '[{\'name\': \'Mode Crash\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), when you put Porygon-Z LV.X from your hand onto your Active Porygon-Z, you may discard all of your opponent\'s Special Energy cards in play.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}, {\'name\': \'Decode\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may search your deck for up to any 2 cards and shuffle your deck afterward. Then, put those cards on top of your deck in any order. This power can\'t be used if Porygon-Z is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', 'Porygon-Z', '', '', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal', 'X', 'Porygon-Z LV.X', '474', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo LV.X', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Put this card onto your Active Porygon-Z. Porygon-Z LV.X can use any attack, Poké-Power, or Poké-Body from its previous level.\']', 'Diamond & Pearl', '100', 'Level-Up', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('dp5-11', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Zone Shift\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Pearl Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"You may return an Energy card attached to Palkia to your hand. If you do, choose an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon and return it to your opponent\'s hand.\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '3', '', '', '', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '62', 'Palkia', '484', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\"Lustrous Orb: If an Active Pokémon has Weakness to Water type, Palkia\'s attacks do 20 more damage to that Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"]', 'Diamond & Pearl', '11', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp5-12', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Evolution Wish\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from 1 of your Pokémon and put it onto that Pokémon. (This counts as evolving that Pokémon.) Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Water Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', '', '', 'A Pokémon that lives in warm seas. It inflates the flotation sac on its head to drift and search for food.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Phione', '489', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp5-13', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Trans\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for up to 2 basic Energy cards and attach them to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Reflect Energy\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Move an Energy card attached to Rotom to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', '', '', 'Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '37', 'Rotom', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Darkness, value: +20'),
('dp5-14', '[{\'name\': \'Sheet Lightning\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, when you put Zapdos from your hand onto your Bench, you may flip a coin. If heads, put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Raging Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Does 40 damage to 1 of your Pokémon, and don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance to this damage.\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', '', '', 'A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Zapdos', '145', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '14', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('dp5-15', '[{\'name\': \'Primal Claw\', \'text\': \"After your opponent\'s Pokémon uses a Poké-Power, put 2 damage counters on that Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Supersonic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Old Amber', '', 'A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Aerodactyl', '142', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '15', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp5-16', '[{\'name\': \'Cursed Alloy\', \'text\': \"As long as Bronzong is your Active Pokémon, put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent\'s Pokémon that has any Poké-Powers between turns.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Pain Amplifier\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent\'s Pokémon that already has damage counters on it.\"}, {\'name\': \'Coating\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Bronzong by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '3', 'Bronzor', '', 'One caused a news sensation when it was dug up at a construction site after a 2,000-year sleep.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Bronzong', '437', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Fire, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '16', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp5-17', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 2 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 30 damage to each of them. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Surf Together\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \"Does 50 damage plus 10 more damage for each of your Benched Pokémon. Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does 10 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', 'Prinplup', '', 'It swims as fast as a jet boat. The edges of its wings are sharp and can slice apart drifting ice.', 'Fourth ', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-17.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '49', 'Empoleon', '395', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '17', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +30'),
('dp5-18', '[{\'name\': \'Sunlight Veil\', \'text\': \"Each of your Pokémon that evolves from Eevee gets +20 HP. You can\'t use more than 1 Sunlight Veil Poké-Body each turn.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Morning Sun\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'You may move an Energy card attached to Espeon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'Its fur has the look and feel of velvet. The orb on its forehead glows when it uses psycho-power.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-18.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Espeon', '196', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '18', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp5-19', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Fire Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Kindle\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy card attached to Flareon and then discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', 'Eevee', '', 'It has a flame sac in its body. Its body temperature tops 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit before battle.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-19.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Flareon', '136', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '19', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp5-2', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Future Sight\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top 5 cards of either player\'s deck and put them back on top of that player\'s deck in any order.\"}, {\'name\': \'Healing Light\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Remove 1 damage counter from each of your Pokémon.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', '', '', 'Shiny particles are released from its wings like a veil. It is said to represent the crescent moon.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-2.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Cresselia', '488', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '2', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp5-20', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Icy Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'As a protective technique, it can completely freeze its fur to make its hairs stand like needles.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-20.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Glaceon', '471', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '20', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: +20'),
('dp5-21', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Vacuum Sand\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a Fighting Energy card and attach it to Hippowdon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sand Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Fighting Energy attached to Hippowdon. This attack does 50 damage plus 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '3', 'Hippopotas', '', 'Its huge mouth is almost seven feet across. It has enough power to completely crush a car.', 'Fourth ', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Hippowdon', '450', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '21', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('dp5-22', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Mach Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Mega Bravo\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Discard all Fire Energy attached to Infernape. This attack does 40 damage times the amount of Fire Energy you discarded.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '', 'Monferno', '', 'Its crown of fire is indicative of its fiery nature. It is beaten by none in terms of quickness.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-22.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Infernape', '392', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '22', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +30'),
('dp5-23', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Lightning Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"You may discard 2 Energy attached to Jolteon. If you do, this attack\'s base damage is 90 instead of 50.\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '', 'Eevee', '', 'It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the furs on its body as if it were sharp needles.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '39', 'Jolteon', '135', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Metal, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '23', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp5-24', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Sprial Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Remove 1 damage counter from Leafeon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leaf Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 50 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Leafeon', '470', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '24', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp5-25', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'(+) Spark\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"If Plusle is on your Bench, this attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '24', 'Minun', '312', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '25', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp5-26', '[{\'name\': \'Primal Swirl\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, when you play Omastar from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon, you may remove the highest Stage Evolution card from each of your opponent\'s Benched Evolved Pokémon and put those cards back into his or her hand. You can\'t use more than 1 Primal Swirl Poké-Power each turn.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Send Back\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Omanyte', '', 'It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.', 'Fourth ', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '53', 'Omastar', '139', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '26', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +30'),
('dp5-27', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Charm\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done by attacks from the Defending Pokémon is reduced by 20 (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Whirlpool\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', '', '', 'A Pokémon that lives in warm seas. It inflates the flotation sac on its head to drift and search for food.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '20', 'Phione', '489', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '27', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('dp5-28', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'– Boost\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If Minun is on your Bench, this attack does 20 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.', 'Fourth ', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '27', 'Plusle', '311', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '28', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('dp5-29', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Special Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon has any Special Energy cards attached to it, this attack does 30 damage plus 50 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'X-Scissor\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 50 damage plus 40 more damage.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Scyther', '', 'It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Scizor', '212', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '29', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp5-3', '[{\'name\': \'Darkness Shade\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you put Darkrai from your hand onto your Bench, you may choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon. That Pokémon is now Asleep.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Slumber\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"At the end of your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dark Resolve\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'If the Defending Pokémon is Asleep, remove 4 damage counters from Darkrai.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', '', '', 'It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '48', 'Darkrai', '491', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '3', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp5-30', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Frenzy Plant\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Torterra can\'t use Frenzy Plant during your next turn.\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '4', 'Grotle', '', 'Groups of this Pokémon migrating in search of water have been mistaken for moving forests.', 'Fourth ', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '51', 'Torterra', '389', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '30', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +30'),
('dp5-31', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Paralyze Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned. Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed and Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Croagunk', '', 'The toxin made in its poison sacs is pumped to the knuckle claws through tubes down its arms.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '32', 'Toxicroak', '454', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '31', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('dp5-32', '[{\'name\': \'Moonlight Veil\', \'text\': \"Each of your Pokémon that evolves from Eevee has no Weakness, and that Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost is 0.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Confuse Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'The light of the moon changed Eevees genetic structure. It lurks in darkness for prey.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '43', 'Umbreon', '197', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '32', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp5-33', '[{\'name\': \'PUT\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Unown P is on your Bench, you may put 1 damage counter on 1 of your Pokémon (excluding any Unown).\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Each player discards the top card of his or her deck. This attack does 20 damage plus 20 more damage for each Unown discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', '', '', 'Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or Unown came first.', 'Fourth ', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '17', 'Unown P', '201', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '33', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('dp5-34', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Cleanse Away\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Remove 2 damage counters from each of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Whirlpool\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'It has evolved to be suitable for aquatic life. It can invisibly melt away into water.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Vaporeon', '134', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '34', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp5-35', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Astonish\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 card from your opponent\'s hand without looking. Look at that card you chose, then have your opponent shuffle that card into his or her deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hang High\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 40 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '1', 'Aipom', '', 'To eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '34', 'Ambipom', '424', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '35', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp5-36', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Fury Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Drill Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '', 'Spearow', '', 'It has the stamina to fly all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.', 'Fourth ', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '29', 'Fearow', '22', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '36', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('dp5-37', '', '', 'Daisuke Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Planting\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Attach a Grass Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Body Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '3', 'Turtwig', 'Torterra', 'The shell is hardened soil. Some Pokémon come to peck the berries growing on the trees on its back.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Grotle', '388', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2008', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '37', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('dp5-38', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Comet Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '3', '', '', 'It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.', 'Fourth ', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '28', 'Kangaskhan', '115', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '38', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('dp5-39', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Lap Up\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Majestic Dawn', '2', '', 'Lickilicky', 'Instead of hands, it uses its tongue, which is twice its height. Its sticky saliva grips anything.', 'Fourth ', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/dp5/dp5-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '23', 'Lickitung', '108', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/01/2008', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Diamond & Pearl', '39', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
