('ex2-66', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Dish\', \'text\': \'At any time between turns, remove 1 damage counter from Lotad.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sandstorm', '1', '', 'Lombre', '', 'Third', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/ex2/ex2-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lotad', '270', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '9/18/2003', '', 'Colorless', '', 'EX', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
