('ex7-16', '[{\'name\': \'Sticky Goo\', \'text\': \'As long as Dark Muk is your Active Pokémon, your opponent pays ColorlessColorless more to retreat his or her Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Slimy Water\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage times the number of Colorless Energy in the Defending Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost (after applying effects to the Retreat Cost).\"}, {\'name\': \'Acidic Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned and Poisoned.\'}]', 'Team Rocket Returns', '1', 'Grimer', '', '', 'Third', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/ex7/ex7-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Dark Muk', '89', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2004', '', 'Colorless', '[\'This Pokémon is both Grass Darkness type.\']', 'EX', '16', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass, Darkness', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
