('ex8-39', '[{\'name\': \'Intimidating Pattern\', \'text\': \"As long as Masquerain is your Active Pokémon, any damage done by an opponent\'s attack is reduced by 20 (before applying Weakness and Resistance). You can\'t use more than 1 Intimidating Pattern Poké-Body each turn.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Stun Spore\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Deoxys', '', 'Surskit', '', '', 'Third', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/ex8/ex8-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Masquerain', '284', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2005', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'EX', '39', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
