('ex9-7', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Swift\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness, Resistance, Poké-Powers, Poké-Bodies, or any other effects on the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tail Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Emerald', '1', 'Electrike', '', '', 'Third', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/ex9/ex9-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Manectric', '310', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/01/2005', 'type: Metal, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'EX', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
