('g1-35', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Sinister Fog\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned. Put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Creep Show\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon has 3 or more damage counters on it, that Pokémon is Knocked Out.\"}]', 'Generations', '', 'Haunter', '', 'Hiding in peoples shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake.', 'Sixth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/g1/g1-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gengar', '94', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '2/22/2016', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'XY', '35', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
