('hgss1-27', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Sharpen Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip 3 coins. For each heads, discard a card from your opponent\'s hand without looking.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sneaky Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If Persian has any Darkness Energy attached to it, this attack does 30 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', 'Meowth', '', 'Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Persian', '53', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '27', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-28', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Sleeping Face\', \'text\': \'As long as Pichu is Asleep, prevent all damage done to Pichu by attacks.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Playground\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Each player may search his or her deck for as many Basic Pokémon as he or she likes, put them onto his or her Bench, and shuffle his or her deck afterward. (You put your Pokémon on the Bench first.) Pichu is now Asleep.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '', '', 'Pikachu', 'Despite its small size, it can zap even adult humans. However, if it does so, it also surprises itself.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Pichu', '172', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/10/2010', '', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '28', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', ''),
('hgss1-29', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fury Swipes\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '', 'Sandshrew', '', 'If it digs at an incredible pace, it may snap off its spike and claws. They grow back in a day.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Sandslash', '28', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '29', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-3', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Fairy Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Return 1 of your Pokémon and all cards attached to it to your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Moon Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', 'Clefairy', '', 'With its acute hearing, it can pick up sounds from far away. It usually hides in quiet places.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Clefable', '36', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '3', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-30', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Sleeping Face\', \'text\': \'As long as Smoochum is Asleep, prevent all damage done to Smoochum by attacks.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Antics\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move an Energy card attached to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon to another of your opponent\'s Pokémon. Smoochum is now Asleep.\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '', '', 'Jynx', 'Its lips are the most sensitive part of its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Smoochum', '238', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/10/2010', '', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '30', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', ''),
