('hgss1-37', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Recover\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard a Water Energy attached to Corsola and remove all damage counters from Corsola.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If both of them are heads, this attack does 20 damage plus 50 more damage.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', 'Cursola', 'It continuously sheds and grows. The tip of its head is prized as a treasure because of its beauty.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Corsola', '222', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '37', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-38', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Big Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '2', 'Totodile', 'Feraligatr', 'If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Croconaw', '159', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '38', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-39', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Snowy Present\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card for each Water Energy attached to all of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hail\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', '', 'It nests at the edge of sharp cliffs. It spends all day carrying food to its awaiting chicks.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Delibird', '225', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '39', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-4', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '3', 'Magikarp', '', 'Once it appears, it goes on a rampage. It remains enraged until it demolishes everything around it.', 'Fourth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Gyarados', '130', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '4', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-40', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Hurl\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Double Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'70×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 70 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '3', 'Phanpy', '', 'It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its tackle is strong enough to knock down a house.', 'Fourth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Donphan', '232', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '40', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-41', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Glare\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fade Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Return Dunsparce and all cards attached to it to your hand.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', '', 'When spotted, this Pokémon escapes backward by furiously boring into the ground with its tail.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Dunsparce', '206', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '41', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-42', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Spear\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 20 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Thundershock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', 'Mareep', 'Ampharos', 'As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool wont grow.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Flaaffy', '180', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '42', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-43', '', '', 'Sachiko Adachi', '[{\'name\': \'Green Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card for each of your Grass Pokémon in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage plus 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '2', '', '', 'This powerful Pokémon thrusts its prized horn under its enemies bellies, then lifts and throws them.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Heracross', '214', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '43', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-44', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Sleeping Face\', \'text\': \'As long as Igglybuff is Asleep, prevent all damage done to Igglybuff by attacks.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Graffiti\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Igglybuff is now Asleep. During your opponent\'s next turn, the attack cost of each of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks is Colorless more.\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '', '', 'Jigglypuff', 'Its extremely flexible and elastic body makes it bounce continuously—anytime, anywhere.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Igglybuff', '174', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '44', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('hgss1-45', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Group Swim\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Water Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Mantine can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', '', 'As it majestically swims, it doesnt care if Remoraid attach to it for scavenging its leftovers.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Mantine', '226', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '45', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-46', '[{\'name\': \'Green Shield\', \'text\': \'Each of your Grass Pokémon has no Weakness.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Sharpen\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '2', 'Caterpie', 'Butterfree', 'It prepares for evolution by hardening its shell as much as possible to protect its soft body.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Metapod', '11', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '46', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-47', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Moomoo Squeeze\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Moomoo Milk card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Body Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '3', '', '', 'If it is around babies, the milk it produces contains much more nutrition than usual.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Miltank', '241', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-48', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Sleep Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep. Remove 4 damage counters from Parasect.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '2', 'Paras', '', 'The larger the mushroom on its back grows, the stronger the mushroom spores it scatters.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Parasect', '47', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-49', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Flare\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Flamethrower\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy attached to Quilava.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', 'Cyndaquil', 'Typhlosion', 'This Pokémon is fully covered by nonflammable fur. It can withstand any kind of fire attack.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Quilava', '156', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '49', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-5', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Triple Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Close Combat\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Hitmontop by attacks is increased by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', '', 'It launches kicks while spinning. If it spins at high speed, it may bore its way into the ground.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Hitmontop', '237', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '5', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-50', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Offensive Needle\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned. If tails, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', '', 'To fire its poison spikes, it must inflate its body by drinking over 2.6 gallons of water all at once.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Qwilfish', '211', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '50', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-51', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Knock Away\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '', 'Hoppip', 'Jumpluff', 'The bloom on top of its head opens and closes as the temperature fluctuates up and down.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Skiploom', '188', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('hgss1-52', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Big Yawn\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Both Slowbro and the Defending Pokémon are now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Madkinesis\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Does 30 damage plus 20 more damage for each Psychic Energy attached to Slowbro.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '2', 'Slowpoke', '', 'If the tail-biting Shellder is thrown off in a harsh battle, it reverts to being an ordinary Slowpoke.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Slowbro', '80', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '52', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-53', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Cosmic Cyclone\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Choose as many Water Energy attached to your Pokémon as you like. This attack does 20 damage times the number of Energy you chose. Shuffle those cards back into your deck.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '', 'Staryu', '', 'The middle section of its body is called the core. It glows in a different color each time it is seen.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Starmie', '121', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '53', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-54', '[{\'name\': \'RETURN\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you put Unown from your hand onto your Bench, you may return all Energy attached to 1 of your Pokémon to your hand.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', '', 'Their shapes look like hieroglyphs on ancient tablets. It is said that the two are somehow related.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Unown', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '54', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-55', '[{\'name\': \'FLASH\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you put Unown from your hand onto your Bench, you may look at the top 5 cards of your deck and put them back on top of your deck in any order.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', '', 'Its flat, thin body is always stuck on walls. Its shape appears to have some meaning.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Unown', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-56', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Double Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Expand\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Wigglytuff by attacks is reduced by 10 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '2', 'Jigglypuff', '', 'It has a very fine fur. Take care not to make it angry, or it may inflate steadily and hit with a Body Slam.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Wigglytuff', '40', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-57', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', 'Metapod', 'Its feet have suction cups designed to stick to any surface. It tenaciously climbs trees to forage.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Caterpie', '10', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-58', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Happy Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, remove 3 damage counters from Chansey.\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '2', '', 'Blissey', 'It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Chansey', '113', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-59', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', 'Bayleef', 'Its pleasantly aromatic leaf has the ability to check the humidity and temperature.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Chikorita', '152', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-6', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Mass Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage times the number of Pokémon in play (both yours and your opponent\'s).\"}, {\'name\': \'Leaf Guard\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Jumpluff by attacks is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '', 'Skiploom', '', 'Once it catches the wind, it deftly controls its cotton-puff spores—it can even float around the world.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Jumpluff', '189', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '6', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss1-60', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Minimize\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Clefairy by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '1', '', 'Clefable', 'The moonlight that it stores in the wings on its back apparently gives it the ability to float in midair.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss1/hgss1-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Clefairy', '35', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
