('hgss2-6', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Switch Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 30 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) Switch Octillery with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Ink Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Unleashed', '2', 'Remoraid', '', 'It traps foes with the suction cups on its tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss2/hgss2-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Octillery', '224', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/12/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '6', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
