('hgss4-42', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Eruption\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Each player discards the top card of his or her deck. This attack does 20 damage times the number of Energy cards discarded in this way.\'}, {\'name\': \'Combustion\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', '', 'Magmortar', 'The fiery surface of its body gives off a wavering, rippling glare that is similar to the sun.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Magmar', '126', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '42', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-43', '', '', 'Noriko Hotta', '[{\'name\': \'Speed Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Tri Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Magnemite', 'Magnezone', 'The Magnemite are united by a magnetism so powerful, it dries all moisture in its vicinity.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Magneton', '82', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '43', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-44', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Bonemerang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 60 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bone Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this attack does 20 damage plus 60 more damage. Discard that Stadium card.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Cubone', '', 'It has been seen pounding boulders with the bone it carries in order to tap out messages to others.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Marowak', '105', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '44', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-45', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', 'Nidoran ♀', 'Nidoqueen', 'It has a calm and caring nature. Because its horn grows slowly, it prefers not to fight.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Nidorina', '30', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-46', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Horn Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Lunge\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Nidoran ♂', 'Nidoking', 'Quick to anger, it stabs enemies with its horn to inject a powerful poison when it becomes agitated.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Nidorino', '33', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '46', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-47', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Gust\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Twister\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If both of them are tails, this attack does nothing. For each heads, discard an Energy attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Pidgey', 'Pidgeot', 'It renders its prey immobile using well-developed claws, then carries the prey more than 60 miles to its nest.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Pidgeotto', '17', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '47', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-48', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzard\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. If tails, this attack does 10 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '3', 'Swinub', 'Mamoswine', 'Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly.', 'Fourth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Piloswine', '221', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-49', '[{\'name\': \'Mapping\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you play Porygon2 from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon, you may search your deck for a Stadium card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'3-D Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', 'Porygon', 'Porygon-Z', 'Further research enhanced its abilities. Sometimes, it may exhibit motions that were not programmed.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Porygon2', '233', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '49', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-5', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Icy Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Snowstorm\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"Does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon that has any damage counters on it. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Triumphant', '4', 'Piloswine', '', 'A frozen Mamoswine was dug from ice dating back 10,000 years. This Pokémon has been around a long, long, long time.', 'Fourth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Mamoswine', '473', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '5', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-50', '', '', 'Sachiko Adachi', '[{\'name\': \'Tentavolve\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'If Tentacruel evolved from Tentacool during this turn, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed and Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hyper Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', 'Tentacool', '', 'In battle, it extends all 80 of its tentacles to entrap its opponent inside a poisonous net.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Tentacruel', '73', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-51', '[{\'name\': \'CURE\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when you put Unown from your hand onto your Bench, remove all Special Conditions from your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Hidden Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', '', 'Its flat, thin body is always stuck on walls. Its shape appears to have some meaning.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Unown', '201', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '51', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-52', '', '', 'Hajime Kusajima', '[{\'name\': \'Double Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 2 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 20 damage to each of them. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '3', '', 'Wailord', 'It bounces playfully like a ball. The more seawater it swallows, the higher it bounces.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Wailmer', '320', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-53', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Poisonpowder\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Corrode Target\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, look at your opponent\'s hand, choose 1 card, and discard it.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Bellsprout', 'Victreebel', 'Even though it is filled with acid, it does not melt because it also oozes a protective fluid.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Weepinbell', '70', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '53', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-54', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Shoot Through\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'U-turn\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Switch Yanmega with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Yanma', '', 'The beat of its wings is so powerful that it accidentally dislodges full-grown trees when it takes off in flight.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Yanmega', '469', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '54', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-55', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Imitate\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw cards until you have the same number of cards in your hand as your opponent.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Ambipom', 'Its tail is so powerful that it can use it to grab a tree branch and hold itself up in the air.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Aipom', '190', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-56', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Mountain Eater\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard the top card of your deck. Then, remove 2 damage counters from Aron.\'}, {\'name\': \'Confront\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', '', 'Lairon', 'When it evolves, it sheds the steel carapace that covered its whole body and develops a new one.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Aron', '304', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-57', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Inviting Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch the Defending Pokémon with 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Careless Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Bellsprout does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Weepinbell', 'Even though its body is extremely skinny, it is blindingly fast when catching its prey.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Bellsprout', '69', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-58', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Iron Defense\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Bronzor during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Bronzong', 'Ancient people believed that the pattern on Bronzors back contained a mysterious power.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Bronzor', '436', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-59', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Focus Energy\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Carvanha\'s Bite attack\'s base damage is 40.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Sharpedo', 'They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Carvanha', '318', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-6', '[{\'name\': \'Pheromone Stamina\', \'text\': \'Nidoking gets +20 HP for each Nidoqueen you have in play.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Venomous Horn\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '3', 'Nidorino', '', 'Its tail is thick and powerful. If it binds an enemy, it can render the victim helpless quite easily.', 'Fourth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Nidoking', '34', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '6', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-60', '[{\'name\': \'Lonely Bone\', \'text\': \"Any damage done to Cubone by your opponent\'s attacks is reduced by 20 for each Marowak in your discard pile (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Bone Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Marowak', 'If it is sad or lonely, the skull it wears shakes and emits a plaintive and mournful sound.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Cubone', '104', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-61', '', '', 'Shizurow', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Veil\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Diglett during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mini Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Dugtrio', 'If a Diglett digs through a field, it leaves the soil perfectly tilled and ideal for planting crops.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Diglett', '50', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-62', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Gentle Wrap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Dragonair', 'This Pokémon is full of life energy. It continually sheds its skin and grows steadily larger.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Dratini', '147', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-63', '', '', 'Takashi Yamaguchi', '[{\'name\': \'Sneaky Placement\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Haunter', 'Its body is made of gas. Despite lacking substance, it can envelop an opponent of any size and cause suffocation.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Gastly', '92', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-64', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Remove 3 damage counters from 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Vulcan Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Volbeat you have in play. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', '', 'Its fragrance attracts a swarm of Volbeat, so they draw over 200 patterns in the night sky.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Illumise', '314', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-65', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Kricketune', 'When its antennae hit each other, it sounds like the music of a xylophone.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Kricketot', '401', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-66', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Tongue Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. This attack does 30 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Triumphant', '2', '', 'Lickilicky', 'Its long tongue, slathered with a gooey saliva, sticks to anything, so it is very useful.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lickitung', '108', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('hgss4-67', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Steady Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 10 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mach Cross\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', '', 'Machoke', 'Always brimming with power, it passes time by lifting boulders. Doing so makes it even stronger.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Machop', '66', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-68', '', '', 'Noriko Hotta', '[{\'name\': \'Magnetic Switch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Switch Magnemite with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thundershock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Magneton', 'The units at the sides of its body generate antigravity energy to keep it aloft in the air.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Magnemite', '81', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-69', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Friend Search\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 5 cards of your deck, choose 1 Pokémon you find there, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Nidorina', 'Although not very combative, it will torment its foes with poison spikes if it is threatened in any way.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Nidoran ♀', '29', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-7', '[{\'name\': \'Dimension Transfer\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may flip a coin. If heads, search your discard pile for a Trainer card, show it to your opponent, and put it on top of your deck. This power can\'t be used if Porygon-Z is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Suspicious Beam β\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'If Porygon-Z has no Rainbow Energy attached to it, Porygon-Z does 20 damage to itself and Porygon-Z is now Confused.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', 'Porygon2', '', 'Its programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error…', 'Fourth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Porygon-Z', '474', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '7', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-70', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Pheromone Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'If Nidoran ♀ is on your Bench, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Horn Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Nidorino', 'It raises its big ears to check its surroundings. It will strike first if it senses any danger.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Nidoran ♂', '32', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-71', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Messenger\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle Pidgey and all cards attached to it back into your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Glide\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Pidgeotto', 'Common in grassy areas and forests, it is very docile and will chase off enemies by flapping up sand.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Pidgey', '16', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-72', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Rear Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Flare\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Rapidash', 'It is a weak runner immediately after birth. It gradually becomes faster by chasing after its parents.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Ponyta', '77', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-73', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Sharpen\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Recover\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy attached to Porygon and remove 4 damage counters from Porygon.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Porygon2', 'A manmade Pokémon that came about as a result of research. It is programmed with only basic motions.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Porygon', '137', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-74', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Tripping Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. If tails, this attack does 30 damage to 1 of your Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Golduck', 'It has mystical powers but doesnt recall that it has used them. That is why it always looks puzzled.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Psyduck', '54', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-75', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Disable\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 of the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks. That Pokémon can\'t use that attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Haunt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put 1 damage counter on the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Banette', 'It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice, or so its said. Its very active at night.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Shuppet', '353', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-76', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Paralyzing Clamp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Drapion', 'It burrows under the sand to lie in wait for prey. Its tail claws can inject its prey with a savage poison.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Skorupi', '451', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '76', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-77', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Sleep Pearl\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep. Switch Spoink with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Grumpig', 'It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from Clamperl on its head.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Spoink', '325', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-78', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '[{\'name\': \'Wing Flick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches the Defending Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Altaria', 'Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Swablu', '333', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-79', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Ice Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '2', '', 'Piloswine', 'It rubs its snout on the ground to find and dig up food. It sometimes discovers hot springs.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Swinub', '220', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-8', '[{\'name\': \'Fiery Spirit\', \'text\': \"Rapidash can\'t be Confused.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Ring of Fire\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon is now Burned and can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Ponyta', '', 'At full gallop, its four hooves barely touch the ground because it moves so incredibly fast.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Rapidash', '78', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '8', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-80', '', '', 'Sachiko Adachi', '[{\'name\': \'Gentle Wrap\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Tentacruel', 'It drifts aimlessly in waves. Very difficult to see in water, it may not be noticed until it stings.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Tentacool', '72', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '80', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-81', '', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Leech Life\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Remove from Venonat the number of damage counters equal to the damage you did to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Venomoth', 'Poison oozes from all over its body. It catches and eats small bugs at night that are attracted by light.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Venonat', '48', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-82', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Illumisile\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If you don\'t have Illumise in play, this attack does nothing. Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. This attack does 30 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Firefly Light\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned and Confused.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', '', 'It emits light from its tail to communicate. It loves the sweet aroma given off by Illumise.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Volbeat', '313', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '82', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-83', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Magnetic Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 damage plus 10 more damage. If tails, Voltorb does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Electrode', 'It rolls to move. If the ground is uneven, a sudden jolt from hitting a bump can cause it to explode.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Voltorb', '100', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-84', '[{\'name\': \'Free Flight\', \'text\': \"If Yanma has no Energy attached to it, Yanma\'s Retreat Cost is 0.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', 'Yanmega', 'Its large eyes can scan 360 degrees. It looks in all directions to seek out insects as its prey.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Yanma', '193', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '84', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-85', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Black Belt', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \"You may use this card only if you have more Prize cards left than your opponent. During this turn, each of your Active Pokémon\'s attacks does 40 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '85', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('hgss4-86', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Indigo Plateau', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '[\"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\", \"Each Pokémon LEGEND in play (both yours and your opponent\'s) gets +30 HP.\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '86', 'Stadium', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('hgss4-87', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Junk Arm', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '[\"Discard 2 cards from your hand. Search your discard pile for a Trainer card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. You can\'t choose Junk Arm with the effect of this card.\"]', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '87', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('hgss4-88', '', '', 'Wataru Kawahara', '', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Seeker', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'Each player returns 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon and all cards attached to it to his or her hand. (You return your Pokémon first.)\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '88', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('hgss4-89', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Twins', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '[\'You can play only one Supporter card each turn. When you play this card, put it next to your Active Pokémon. When your turn ends, discard this card.\', \'You may use this card only if you have more Prize cards left than your opponent. Search your deck for any 2 cards and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '89', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('hgss4-9', '[{\'name\': \'Heal Block\', \'text\': \"If you have Lunatone in play, damage counters can\'t be removed from any Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s). (Damage counters can still be moved.)\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Sun Flash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', '', 'When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Solrock', '338', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '9', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-90', '', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Rescue Energy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '[\'Rescue Energy provides Colorless Energy. If the Pokémon this card is attached to is Knocked Out by damage from an attack, put that Pokémon back into your hand. (Discard all cards attached to that Pokémon.)\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '90', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
('hgss4-91', '[{\'name\': \'Eye of Disaster\', \'text\': \'As long as Absol is your Active Pokémon, whenever your opponent puts a Basic Pokémon from his or her hand onto his or her Bench, put 2 damage counters on that Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Vicious Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 Pokémon from your hand and put it in the Lost Zone. (If you can\'t put a Pokémon in the Lost Zone, this attack does nothing.)\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Absol', '359', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '91', 'Basic, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-92', '[{\'name\': \'Forest Breath\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if Celebi is your Active Pokémon, you may attach a Grass Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Celebi is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Time Circle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage done to Celebi by attacks from your opponent\'s Stage 1 or Stage 2 Pokémon.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Celebi', '251', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '92', 'Basic, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-93', '[{\'name\': \'Energymite\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may use this power. If you do, Electrode is Knocked Out. Look at the top 7 cards of your deck. Choose as many Energy cards as you like and attach them to your Pokémon in any way you like. Discard the other cards. This power can\'t be used if Electrode is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Gigashock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Triumphant', '1', 'Voltorb', '', '', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Electrode', '101', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '93', 'Stage 1, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-94', '[{\'name\': \'Catastrophe\', \'text\': \"As long as Gengar is your Active Pokémon, if any of your opponent\'s Pokémon would be Knocked Out, put that Pokémon in the Lost Zone instead of discarding. (Discard all cards attached to that Pokémon.)\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Takashi Yamaguchi', '[{\'name\': \'Hurl into Darkness\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at your opponent\'s hand and choose a number of Pokémon you find there up to the number of Psychic Energy attached to Gengar. Put the Pokémon you chose in the Lost Zone.\"}, {\'name\': \'Cursed Drop\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 4 damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '', 'Haunter', '', '', 'Fourth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Gengar', '94', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '94', 'Stage 2, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-95', '[{\'name\': \'Fighting Tag\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if Machamp is on your Bench, you may move all Fighting Energy attached to your Active Pokémon to Machamp. If you do, switch Machamp with your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Shizurow', '[{\'name\': \'Crushing Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Discard a Special Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Champ Buster\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \'Does 100 damage plus 10 more damage for each of your Benched Pokémon that has any damage counters on it.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '3', 'Machoke', '', '', 'Fourth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Machamp', '68', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '95', 'Stage 2, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-96', '[{\'name\': \'Magnetic Draw\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may draw cards until you have 6 cards in your hand. This power can\'t be used if Magnezone is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Noriko Hotta', '[{\'name\': \'Lost Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Put as many Energy cards attached to your Pokémon as you like in the Lost Zone. This attack does 50 damage times the number of Energy cards put in the Lost Zone in this way.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '3', 'Magneton', '', '', 'Fourth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Magnezone', '462', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '96', 'Stage 2, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-97', '[{\'name\': \'Lost Link\', \'text\': \"Mew can use the attacks of all Pokémon in the Lost Zone (both yours and your opponent\'s). (You still need the necessary Energy to use each attack.)\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'See Off\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for 1 Pokémon and put it in the Lost Zone. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}]', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Mew', '151', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '97', 'Basic, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-98', '[{\'name\': \'Insight\', \'text\': \"If you have the same number of cards in your hand as your opponent, the attack cost of each of Yanmega\'s attacks is 0.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Noriko Hotta', '[{\'name\': \'Linear Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 40 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Sonicboom\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '', 'Yanma', '', '', 'Fourth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Yanmega', '469', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prime', '', '11/03/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '98', 'Stage 1, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-99', '', '', 'Shinji Higuchi + Noriko Takaya', '[{\'name\': \'Lost Crisis\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Choose 2 Energy attached to Darkrai & Cresselia LEGEND and put them in the Lost Zone. If any of your opponent\'s Pokémon would be Knocked Out by damage from this attack, put that Pokémon and all cards attached to it in the Lost Zone instead of discarding it.\"}, {\'name\': \"Moon\'s Invite\", \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move as many damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon as you like to any of your opponent\'s other Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', 'Triumphant', '2', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Darkrai & Cresselia LEGEND', '488, 491', 'TPCI', 'LEGEND', '', '11/03/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Put this card from your hand onto your Bench only with the other half of Darkrai & Cresselia LEGEND.\', \'When this Pokémon has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', '99', 'LEGEND', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness, Psychic', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2, type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hgss4-FOUR', '', '', 'Milky Isobe', '', 'Triumphant', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hgss4/hgss4-FOUR.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Alph Lithograph', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Secret', '', '11/03/2010', '', '', '[\'LOOK AT ALL OF YOUR FACE DOWN PRIZE CARDS!\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'FOUR', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('hsp-HGSS01', '', '', 'Takashi Yamaguchi', '[{\'name\': \'Combustion\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Sacred Fire\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 80 damage to that Pokémon. This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '3', '', '', 'A legend says that its body glows in seven colors. A rainbow is said to form behind when it flies.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS01.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Ho-Oh', '250', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS01', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS02', '', '', 'Takashi Yamaguchi', '[{\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Aeroblast\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 50 damage plus 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'It is said that it quietly spends its time deep at the bottom of the sea because its powers are too strong.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS02.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lugia', '249', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS02', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS03', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Recharge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Lightning Energy card and attach it to Pikachu. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunderbolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Discard all Energy attached to Pikachu.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Raichu', 'It occasionally uses an electric shock to recharge a fellow Pikachu that is in a weakened state.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS03.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Pikachu', '25', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS03', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('hsp-HGSS04', '[{\'name\': \'Tenacious Bind\', \'text\': \"As long as Wobbuffet is your Active Pokémon, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost is ColorlessColorless more.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Trip Over\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '3', '', '', 'To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS04.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Wobbuffet', '202', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS04', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS05', '[{\'name\': \'Insomnia\', \'text\': \"Hoothoot can\'t be Asleep.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Noctowl', 'It has a perfect sense of time. Whatever happens, it keeps rhythm by precisely tilting its head in time.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS05.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Hoothoot', '163', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS05', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS06', '[{\'name\': \'Night Scope\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may look at your opponent\'s hand. This power can\'t be used if Noctowl is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', 'Hoothoot', '', 'When it needs to think, it rotates its head 180 degrees to sharpen its intellectual power.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS06.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Noctowl', '164', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS06', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS07', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Dance\', \'text\': \"As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may attach a Water Energy from your hand to 1 of your Water Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Feraligatr is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Kent Kanetsuna', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Crunch\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'Does 60 damage plus 10 more damage for each damage counter on the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '3', 'Croconaw', '', '', 'Fourth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS07.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Feraligatr', '160', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS07', 'Stage 2, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS08', '[{\'name\': \'Leaf Trans\', \'text\': \"As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may move a Grass Energy attached to 1 of your Pokémon to another of your Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Meganium is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Noriko Hotta', '[{\'name\': \'Solarbeam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '2', 'Bayleef', '', '', 'Fourth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS08.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Meganium', '154', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Water, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS08', 'Stage 2, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS09', '[{\'name\': \'Afterburner\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may search your discard pile for a Fire Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Pokémon. If you do, put 1 damage counter on that Pokémon. This power can\'t be used if Typhlosion is affected by a Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Wataru Kawahara', '[{\'name\': \'Flare Destroy\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy card attached to Typhlosion and discard an Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '2', 'Quilava', '', '', 'Fourth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS09.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Typhlosion', '157', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS09', 'Stage 2, Prime', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS10', '', '', 'Wataru Kawahara', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Assist\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a basic Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Infinite Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'If Latios is on your Bench, remove 2 damage counters from each of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'It communicates using telepathy. Its body is covered in down that refracts light to make it invisible.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS10.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Latias', '380', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS11', '[{\'name\': \'Luster Float\', \'text\': \'If you have Latias in play, the Retreat Cost for Latios is 0.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Wataru Kawahara', '[{\'name\': \'Infinite Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy attached to Latios.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS11.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Latios', '381', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS11', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS12', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Sleeping Face\', \'text\': \'As long as Cleffa is Asleep, prevent all damage done to Cleffa by attacks.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Eeeeeeek\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Shuffle your hand into your deck, then draw 6 cards. Cleffa is now Asleep.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '', '', 'Clefairy', 'Because of its unusual, star-like silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS12.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Cleffa', '173', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('hsp-HGSS13', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Sleeping Face\', \'text\': \'As long as Smoochum is Asleep, prevent all damage done to Smoochum by attacks.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Antics\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move an Energy card attached to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon to another of your opponent\'s Pokémon. Smoochum is now Asleep.\"}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '', '', 'Jynx', 'Its lips are the most sensitive part of its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS13.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Smoochum', '238', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', '', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', ''),
('hsp-HGSS14', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Ferry\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your discard pile for a Supporter card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'It ferries people across the sea on its back. It may sing an enchanting cry if it is in a good mood.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS14.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS14', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS15', '[{\'name\': \'Fermenting Liquid\', \'text\': \'Whenever you attach an Energy card from your hand to Shuckle, draw a card.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Shell Stunner\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to Shuckle by attacks during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'It stores berries inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS15.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Shuckle', '213', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS15', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS16', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunder Jolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, Plusle does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS16.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Plusle', '311', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS17', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tag Team Boost\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Plusle is on your Bench, this attack does 10 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'Exposure to electricity from Minun and Plusle promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS17.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Minun', '312', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS17', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS18', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '', 'https://static.tcgcollector.com/content/images/e8/c4/b0/e8c4b0e2644f1675916752e8b26cd616d8f1ce1cc987d1aa88a3fa167572f596.jpg', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Tropical Tidal Wave', '', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', '', '[\'Flip a coin. If heads, discard all Trainer and Stadium cards your opponent has in play. If tails, discard all Trainer and Stadium cards you have in play.\']', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS18', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('hsp-HGSS19', '', '', 'Noriko Hotta', '[{\'name\': \'Zap Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, Raikou can\'t use Zap Cannon.\"}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'The rain clouds it carries let it fire thunderbolts at will. They say that it descended with lightning.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS19.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Raikou', '243', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS19', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS20', '', '', 'Yuri Umemura', '[{\'name\': \'Flare Blitz\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard all Fire Energy attached to Entei.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'Volcanoes erupt when it barks. Unable to contain its sheer power, it races headlong around the land.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS20.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Entei', '244', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS20', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS21', '', '', 'Hideaki Hakozaki', '[{\'name\': \'Sheer Cold\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'Said to be the embodiment of north winds, it can instantly purify filthy, murky water.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS21.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Suicune', '245', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS21', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS22', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Stiffen\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to Porygon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Version Update\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for Porygon2, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Porygon2', 'It is a manmade Pokémon. Since it doesnt breathe, people are eager to try it in any environment..', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS22.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Porygon', '137', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS22', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS23', '[{\'name\': \'Shortcut\', \'text\': \'The Retreat Cost for each Porygon, Porygon2, and Porygon-Z you have in play is Colorless less.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Porygon2 does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '2', 'Porygon', 'Porygon-Z', 'This upgraded version of Porygon is designed for space exploration. It cant fly, though.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS23.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Porygon2', '233', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS23', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('hsp-HGSS24', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Detect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Hitmonchan during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sky Uppercut\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'HGSS Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes.', 'Fourth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/hsp/hsp-HGSS24.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Hitmonchan', '107', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/10/2010', '', 'Colorless', '', 'HeartGold & SoulSilver', 'HGSS24', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
