('pgo-8', '', '', 'saino misaki', '[{\'name\': \'Tail on Fire\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Fire Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Pokémon GO', '1', '', 'Charmeleon', 'It has a preference for hot things. When it rains, steam is said to spout from the tip of its tail.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pgo/pgo-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charmander', '4', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '07/01/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
