('pl1-51', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Teleportation Burst\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'You may switch Kirlia with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Super Psy Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Platinum', '1', 'Ralts', 'Gardevoir, Gallade', 'If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl1/pl1-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '24', 'Kirlia', '281', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/11/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +20'),
('pl1-52', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Interrupt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, look at your opponent\'s hand and choose 1 card, then have your opponent shuffle that card into his or her deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Gentle Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Platinum', '1', 'Lotad', 'Ludicolo', 'It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl1/pl1-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '30', 'Lombre', '271', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/11/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '52', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('pl1-53', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Aura Sphere\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Do the Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Platinum', '', 'Riolu', '', 'A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl1/pl1-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '42', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/11/2009', '', '', '', 'Platinum', '53', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
