('pl2-21', '[{\'name\': \'Sticky Hold\', \'text\': \'If Gastrodon East Sea is switched or retreats to your Bench, move as many Energy cards attached to Gastrodon East Sea as you like to the new Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Calling Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Gastrodon and put them onto your Bench as Basic Pokémon. Put 2 damage counters on each of them. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rising Rivals', '1', 'Shellos East Sea', '', '', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl2/pl2-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '40', 'Gastrodon East Sea', '423', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '5/16/2009', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '21', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: +30'),
