('pl2-RT3', '[{\'name\': \'Heat Shift\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may use this power. Heat Rotom\'s type is Fire until the end of your turn.\", \'type\': \'Poké-Power\'}]', '', 'Lee HyunJung', '[{\'name\': \'Warm Up\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Fire Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Benched Pokémon. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heat Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}]', 'Rising Rivals', '1', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl2/pl2-RT3.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Heat Rotom', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '5/16/2009', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', 'RT3', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Darkness, value: +20'),
