('pl3-101', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Hook\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Corkscrew Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Supreme Victors', '1', '', 'Toxicroak', 'It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl3/pl3-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Croagunk', '453', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/19/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '101', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: +10'),
('pl3-102', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Doduo does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Supreme Victors', '', '', 'Dodrio', 'The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl3/pl3-102.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '12', 'Doduo', '84', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/19/2009', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Platinum', '102', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('pl3-103', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Drifloon does 10 damage to itself.\'}, {\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}]', 'Supreme Victors', '1', '', 'Drifblim', 'Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a Signpost for Wandering Spirits.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl3/pl3-103.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '10', 'Drifloon', '425', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/19/2009', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '103', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: +10'),
('pl3-104', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Surprise Attack\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}, {\'name\': \'Count and Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Draw a card for each of your opponent\'s Pokémon that isn\'t an Evolved Pokémon.\"}]', 'Supreme Victors', '1', '', 'Milotic', 'It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.', 'Fourth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl3/pl3-104.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '5', 'Feebas', '349', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/19/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '104', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
('pl3-105', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Knuckle Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Focus Fist\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Supreme Victors', '2', '', 'Graveler', 'At rest, it looks just like a rock. Carelessly stepping on it will make it swing its fists angrily.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl3/pl3-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '9', 'Geodude', '74', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/19/2009', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '105', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('pl3-106', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Supreme Victors', '1', '', 'Gabite', 'It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl3/pl3-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '12', 'Gible', '443', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/19/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '106', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +10'),
('pl3-107', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Flail\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage times the number of damage counters on Goldeen.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fury Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Supreme Victors', '1', '', 'Seaking', 'Though it appears very elegant when swimming with fins unfurled, it can jab powerfully with its horn.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl3/pl3-107.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '7', 'Goldeen', '118', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/19/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '107', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +10'),
