('pl4-42', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Psyshot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Shadow Bind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Arceus', '1', 'Gastly', 'Gengar', 'It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '37', 'Haunter', '93', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Colorless, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '42', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: +20'),
('pl4-43', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Discharge\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Discard all Lightning Energy attached to Luxio. Flip a coin for each Energy card you discarded. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', 'Shinx', 'Luxray', 'Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '25', 'Luxio', '404', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '43', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('pl4-44', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Head Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '', 'Electrike', '', 'It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Manectric', '310', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Metal, value: -20', '', '', 'Platinum', '44', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +20'),
('pl4-45', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Water Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each Water Energy attached to Pelipper.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '2', 'Wingull', '', 'It is a messenger of the skies, carrying small Pokémon and eggs to safety in its bill.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '49', 'Pelipper', '279', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: +20'),
('pl4-46', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Ascension\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from Ponyta and put it onto Ponyta. (This counts as evolving Ponyta.) Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Combustion\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', 'Rapidash', 'As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '8', 'Ponyta', '77', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '46', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
('pl4-47', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Searing Flame\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'The Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flare\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '', 'Ponyta', '', 'When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Rapidash', '78', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', '', '', '', 'Platinum', '47', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +20'),
('pl4-48', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Scrunch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to Shelgon during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dragon Bump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If Shelgon has any basic Fire Energy and any basic Water Energy attached to it, this attack does 40 damage plus 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', 'Bagon', 'Salamence', 'Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '34', 'Shelgon', '372', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +20'),
('pl4-49', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Magical Needle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Remove 2 damage counters from 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Cloak Scale\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'If you have Wormadam Sandy Cloak in play, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned, Confused, and Poisoned.\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', 'Burmy Plant Cloak', '', 'When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '46', 'Wormadam Plant Cloak', '413', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '49', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('pl4-5', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Flash\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon tries to attack during your opponent\'s next turn, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack does nothing.\"}, {\'name\': \'Gadget Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'If Luxray has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, you may do 100 damage instead of 60 to the Defending Pokémon. If you do, discard that Pokémon Tool card.\'}]', 'Arceus', '', 'Luxio', '', 'It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young.', 'Fourth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '53', 'Luxray', '405', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Metal, value: -20', '', '', 'Platinum', '5', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: +30'),
('pl4-50', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Hang Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Cloak Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If you have Wormadam Trash Cloak in play, this attack does 60 damage plus 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', 'Burmy Sandy Cloak', '', 'When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '45', 'Wormadam Sandy Cloak', '413', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Lightning, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('pl4-51', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Cloak Shard\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 10 damage to that Pokémon. If you have Wormadam Plant Cloak in play, this attack does 40 damage to that Pokémon instead. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Serve Trash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"You may search your opponent\'s discard pile for any 1 card, show it to your opponent, and put it on top of his or her deck.\"}]', 'Arceus', '1', 'Burmy Trash Cloak', '', 'When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.', 'Fourth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '44', 'Wormadam Trash Cloak', '413', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +20'),
('pl4-52', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Smash Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Super Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Burned.\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', 'Shelgon', 'Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '18', 'Bagon', '371', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Colorless, value: +10'),
('pl4-53', '', '', 'Wataru Kawahara', '[{\'name\': \'Raid\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"If you played Beedrill G from your hand during this turn, this attack\'s base damage is 40 instead of 10.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fury Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', '', '', 'Fourth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '56', 'Beedrill G', '15', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '53', 'Basic, SP', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('pl4-54', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnosis\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '2', '', 'Bronzong', 'There are researchers who believe this Pokémon reflected like a mirror in the distant past.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '15', 'Bronzor', '436', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '54', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('pl4-55', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Bunny Hop\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon that doesn\'t have any damage counters on it. This attack does 20 damage to that Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', 'Lopunny', 'Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder.', 'Fourth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '17', 'Buneary', '427', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: +10'),
('pl4-56', '[{\'name\': \'Cloak Evolution\', \'text\': \'Burmy Plant Cloak can evolve during the turn you play it.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', 'Wormadam, Mothim', 'Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Burmy Plant Cloak', '412', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('pl4-57', '[{\'name\': \'Cloak Evolution\', \'text\': \'Burmy Sandy Cloak can evolve during the turn you play it.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', 'Wormadam, Mothim', 'Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Burmy Sandy Cloak', '412', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('pl4-58', '[{\'name\': \'Cloak Evolution\', \'text\': \'Burmy Trash Cloak can evolve during the turn you play it.\', \'type\': \'Poké-Body\'}]', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', 'Wormadam, Mothim', 'Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.', 'Fourth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '11', 'Burmy Trash Cloak', '412', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: +10'),
('pl4-59', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Friends\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Fire Basic Pokémon, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Steady Firebreathing\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Arceus', '1', '', 'Charmeleon', 'The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.', 'Fourth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/pl4/pl4-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '13', 'Charmander', '4', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2009', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Platinum', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: +10'),
