('si1-12', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Gentle Song\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If Lapras has any damage counters on it, remove 2 of them from it (1 if it only has 1). If the Defending Pokémon has any damage counters on it, remove 2 of them from it (1 if it only has 1). The Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ice Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', '', '', 'This gentle Pokémon can understand human language and allows people to ride on its back.', 'Second', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('si1-13', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Sharpshooter\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. Flip a number of coins equal to the number of Grass Energy attached to Exeggutor. This attack does 10 damage times the number of heads to that Pokémon. Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance.\"}]', 'Southern Islands', '2', 'Exeggcute', '', 'This Pokémon has a unique cry, as all three of its heads are always talking independently of one another.', 'Second', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Exeggutor', '103', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Other', '13', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('si1-14', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Revelation\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Trainer card, show it to your opponent, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Does 10 damage plus 10 more damage for each Energy card attached to the Defending Pokémon.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '2', 'Slowpoke', '', 'Its nonchalant reaction to everything somehow gives this Pokémon an imposing presence.', 'Second', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Slowking', '199', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Other', '14', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('si1-15', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"Does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each Water Energy attached to Wartortle but not used to pay for this attack\'s Energy cost. You can\'t add more than 20 damage in this way.\"}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', 'Squirtle', 'Blastoise', 'When attacked, this Pokémon withdraws into its shell, although it cant quite pull in all of its long tail.', 'Second', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Wartortle', '8', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '15', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('si1-16', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Lick Wounds\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 Pokémon (yours or your opponent\'s) with damage counters on it and remove 2 damage counters from it (1 if it only has 1).\"}, {\'name\': \'Tongue Stretch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This attack does 20 damage to that Pokémon. Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance.\"}]', 'Southern Islands', '2', '', 'Lickilicky', 'This Pokémon uses its six-foot tongue as if it were a hand. The origin of its anaesthetic properties is still a mystery.', 'Second', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Lickitung', '108', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Other', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('si1-17', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Paradise Pollen\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, remove 2 damage counters from Vileplume (1 if it only has 1). Then, if you have any Benched Pokémon with damage counters on them, choose 1 of them and remove 2 damage counters from it (1 if it only has 1).\'}, {\'name\': \'Horrid Pollen\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed. If tails, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '2', 'Gloom', '', 'This Pokémon makes a loud jangling noise when it shakes its petals to spread poison powder.', 'Second', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-17.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Vileplume', '45', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Other', '17', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('si1-18', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rampage\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Does 20 damage plus 10 more damage for each damage counter on Primeape. Flip a coin. If tails, Primeape is now Confused (after doing damage).\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', 'Mankey', '', 'This Pokémon only calms down when there are no other animals or people around—which means no one has ever seen it when its not angry.', 'Second', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-18.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Primeape', '57', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '18', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('si1-2', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Supersonic Flight\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slicing Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '', 'Pidgeotto', '', 'This Pokémon searches for food while flying at Mach 2. Its large claws make fearsome weapons.', 'Second', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-2.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Pidgeot', '18', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Other', '2', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('si1-3', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Body Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '3', '', 'Steelix', 'This Pokémon burrows through the earth at high speed, looking for food. The tunnels it digs are used by Diglett as nests.', 'Second', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Onix', '95', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Other', '3', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('si1-4', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Bawl\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Confused.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', '', 'Togetic', 'This Pokémon is still immature. When threatened, it releases poison from its head and tries to drive its enemies away.', 'Second', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Togepi', '175', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
('si1-5', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Strange Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Each player flips a coin. Each player who gets heads chooses a total of 3 damage counters from among his or her Pokémon and removes them. (If the player\'s Pokémon have fewer total damage counters than that, he or she removes all of them.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', 'Bulbasaur', 'Venusaur', 'A sure sign spring is on its way is when the seed on this Pokémons back flowers.', 'Second', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Ivysaur', '2', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '5', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('si1-6', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Sharp Teeth\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 damage plus 30 more damage; if tails, this attack does 10 damage.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '', 'Rattata', '', 'This Pokémon sometimes hunts for food in rivers, swimming using the small webs between the toes on its rear legs.', 'Second', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Raticate', '20', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', '', '', 'Other', '6', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('si1-7', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Agility\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Ledyba.\"}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', '', 'Ledian', 'When it senses enemies approaching, this Pokémon releases an orange fluid from the joints in its legs and flees.', 'Second', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Ledyba', '165', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('si1-8', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Tempting Eyes\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon and switch it with the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', '', 'Wigglytuff', 'After lulling its enemies with its large eyes, this Pokémon sings them to sleep with a relaxing melody.', 'Second', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Jigglypuff', '39', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', 'type: Psychic, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('si1-9', '', '', 'Keiko Fukuyama', '[{\'name\': \'Fly\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to Butterfree. If tails, this attack does nothing (not even damage).\"}, {\'name\': \'Rainbow Powder\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon is now Paralyzed. If tails, the Defending Pokémon is now Poisoned.\'}]', 'Southern Islands', '1', 'Metapod', '', 'The poison scales on its wings are waterproof, allowing this Pokémon to be active even on rainy days.', 'Second', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/si1/si1-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal', '', 'Butterfree', '12', 'WOTC', '', '', '7/31/2001', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Other', '9', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-1', '', '', 'Kanako Eo', '[{\'name\': \'Nap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', '', 'Metapod', 'When attacked by bird Pokémon, it resists by releasing a terrifically strong odor from its antennae, but it often becomes their prey.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Caterpie', '10', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-10', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Sharp Blade Quill\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Leaf Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', 'Rowlet', 'Decidueye', 'A bit of a dandy, it spends its free time preening its wings. Its preoccupation with any dirt on its plumage can leave it unable to battle.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dartrix', '723', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '10', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-100', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Rage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Horn Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Mad Bull-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Sun & Moon', '3', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tauros-GX', '128', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '100', 'Basic, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-101', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Evolution\', \'text\': \'When you attach a basic Energy card from your hand to this Pokémon during your turn, you may search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon that is the same type as that Energy card and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, draw a card.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', '', 'Vaporeon, Jolteon, Flareon, Sylveon, Espeon, Umbreon, Leafeon, Glaceon', 'Possessing an unbalanced and unstable genetic makeup, it conceals many possible evolutions.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eevee', '133', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '101', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-101a', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Evolution\', \'text\': \'When you attach a basic Energy card from your hand to this Pokémon during your turn, you may search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon that is the same type as that Energy card and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, draw a card.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', '', 'Vaporeon, Jolteon, Flareon, Sylveon, Espeon, Umbreon, Leafeon, Glaceon', 'Possessing an unbalanced and unstable genetic makeup, it conceals many possible evolutions.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-101a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eevee', '133', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '101a', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-102', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Teeter Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', '', '', 'Its steps are staggering and unsteady, but Spinda thinks its walking in a straight line.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-102.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spinda', '327', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '102', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-103', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Work Up\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s attacks do 20 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', '', 'Herdier', 'Because it doesnt yelp, its extremely popular with Trainers who live in apartment buildings.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-103.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lillipup', '506', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '103', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-104', '[{\'name\': \'Treasure Hunt\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may put an Item card from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', 'Lillipup', 'Stoutland', 'Its dense black fur grows continuously. The high cost of keeping its hard fur properly groomed make this a troublesome Pokémon to train.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-104.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Herdier', '507', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '104', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-105', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Ferocious Bellow\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks do 50 less damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '3', 'Herdier', '', 'Intelligent, good-natured, and valiant, its a trustworthy partner on rescue teams.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stoutland', '508', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '105', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-106', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', '', 'Trumbeak', 'This Pokémon feeds on berries, whose leftover seeds become the ammunition for the attacks it fires off from its mouth.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pikipek', '731', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '106', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm1-107', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Bullet Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', 'Pikipek', 'Toucannon', 'By bending its beak, it can produce a variety of call and brand itself a noisy nuisance for its neighbors.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-107.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Trumbeak', '732', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '107', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm1-108', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Echoed Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Echoed Voice attack does 60 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Beak Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Trumbeak', '', 'Within its beak, its internal gas ignites, explosively launching seeds with enough power to pulverize boulders.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-108.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toucannon', '733', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '108', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm1-109', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', '', 'Gumshoos', 'With its sharp fangs, it will bite anything. It did not originally live in Alola but was imported from another region.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Yungoos', '734', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '109', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-11', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Leaf Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Brave Bird\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', 'Dartrix', '', 'It fires arrow quills from its wings with such precision, they can pierce a pebble at distances over a hundred yards.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Decidueye', '724', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '11', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-110', '[{\'name\': \'Search the Premises\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may have your opponent reveal their hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt Bounce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Gumshoe Chance-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Yungoos', '', '', 'Seventh', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gumshoos-GX', '735', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '110', 'Stage 1, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-111', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', '', 'Bewear', 'Despite its adorable appearance, when it gets angry and flails about, its arms and legs could knock a pro wrestler sprawling.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stufful', '759', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '111', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-112', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Bear Hug\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Superpower\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'You may do 40 more damage. If you do, this Pokémon does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '3', 'Stufful', '', 'This immensely dangerous Pokémon possesses overwhelming physical strength. Its habitat is generally off-limits.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-112.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bewear', '760', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '112', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-113', '[{\'name\': \'Instruct\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may draw cards until you have 3 cards in your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 more damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', '', '', 'Deep in the jungle, high in the lofty canopy, this Pokémon abides. On rare occasions, it shows up at the beach to match wits with Slowking.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Oranguru', '765', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '113', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm1-114', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Big Malasada', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Heal 20 damage and remove a Special Condition from your Active Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '114', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-115', '', '', 'Yoshinobu Saito', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crushing Hammer', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '115', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-116', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Energy Retrieval', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Put 2 basic Energy cards from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '116', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-117', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-117.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Energy Switch', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Move a basic Energy from 1 of your Pokémon to another of your Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '117', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-118', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Exp. Share', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"When your Active Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack, you may move 1 basic Energy card from that Pokémon to the Pokémon this card is attached to.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '118', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-119', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Great Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Look at the top 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal a Pokémon you find there and put it into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '119', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-12', '[{\'name\': \'Feather Arrow\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put 2 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hollow Hunt-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 cards from your discard pile into your hand. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Dartrix', '', '', 'Seventh', '240', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Decidueye-GX', '724', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '12', 'Stage 2, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-120', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hau', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Draw 3 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '120', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-121', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ilima', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Each player shuffles their hand into their deck and flips a coin. If heads, that player draws 6 cards. If tails, they draw 3 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '121', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-122', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lillie', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\"Draw cards until you have 6 cards in your hand. If it\'s your first turn, draw cards until you have 8 cards in your hand.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '122', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-123', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nest Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '123', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-124', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Poison Barb', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"If the Pokémon this card is attached to is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), the Attacking Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '124', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-125', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Poké Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '125', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-126', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pokémon Catcher', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\"Flip a coin. If heads, switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '126', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-127', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Potion', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Heal 30 damage from 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '127', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-128', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Professor Kukui', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\"Draw 2 cards. During this turn, your Pokémon\'s attacks do 20 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '128', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-129', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rare Candy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\"Choose 1 of your Basic Pokémon in play. If you have a Stage 2 card in your hand that evolves from that Pokémon, put that card onto the Basic Pokémon to evolve it. You can\'t use this card during your first turn or on a Basic Pokémon that was put into play this turn.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '129', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-13', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Vice Grip\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', '', 'Charjabug', 'They often gather near places frequented by electric Pokémon in order to avoid being attacked by bird Pokémon.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grubbin', '736', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-130', '', '', 'Yoshinobu Saito', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Repel', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '130', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-131', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rotom Dex', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'After counting your Prize cards, shuffle them into your deck. Then, take that many cards from the top of your deck and put them face down as your Prize cards.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '131', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-132', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Switch', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Switch your Active Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '132', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-133', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Team Skull Grunt', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Your opponent reveals their hand. Discard 2 Energy cards from it.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '133', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-134', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Timer Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Flip 2 coins. For each heads, search your deck for an Evolution Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '134', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-135', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ultra Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Discard 2 cards from your hand. If you do, search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '135', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm1-136', '', '', '', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Double Colorless Energy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'Double Colorless Energy provides ColorlessColorless Energy.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '136', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
('sm1-137', '', '', '', '', 'Sun & Moon', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rainbow Energy', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', '', '[\'This card provides Colorless Energy. While in play, this card provides every type of Energy but provides only 1 Energy at a time. When you attach this card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon, put 1 damage counter on that Pokémon.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '137', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
