('sm1-18', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', '', 'Steenee', 'A delectable aroma pours from its body. They are often swallowed whole by Toucannon lured by that wafting deliciousness.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-18.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bounsweet', '761', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '18', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-19', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Sweet Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Bounsweet', 'Tsareena', 'The sepals on its head developed to protect its body. These are quite hard, so even if pecked by bird Pokémon, this Pokémon is totally fine.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-19.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Steenee', '762', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '19', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-2', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Iron Defense\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bug Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '3', 'Caterpie', 'Butterfree', 'Its shell is filled with its soft innards. It doesnt move much because of the risk it might carelessly spill its innards out.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-2.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Metapod', '11', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-20', '[{\'name\': \'Queenly Majesty\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may have your opponent reveal their hand. Then, discard a card from it.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Trop Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage and remove all Special Conditions from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Steenee', '', 'Its long, striking legs arent just for show but to be used to kick with skill. In victory, it shows off by kicking the defeated, laughing boisterously.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-20.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tsareena', '763', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '20', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm1-21', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', '', 'Arcanine', 'Its both clever and loyal, but if a stranger tries to invade its territory, it barks threateningly.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Growlithe', '58', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '21', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm1-22', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Searing Flame\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Firestorm\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'190\', \'text\': \'Discard 3 Fire Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Growlithe', '', 'Overflowing with beauty and majesty, this strong Pokémon appears in ancient Eastern folklore.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-22.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arcanine', '59', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '22', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm1-23', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Body Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Sun & Moon', '3', '', '', 'Coal is the source of Torkoals energy. Large amounts of coal can be found in the mounts where they live.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Torkoal', '324', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '23', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm1-24', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Flare\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '1', '', 'Torracat', 'While grooming itself, it builds up fur inside its stomach. It sets the fur alight and spews fiery attacks, which change based on how it coughs.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Litten', '725', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '24', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm1-25', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Fury Swipes\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flamethrower\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Litten', 'Incineroar', 'At its throat, it bears a bell of fire. The bell rings brightly whenever this Pokémon spits fire.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Torracat', '726', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '25', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm1-26', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Fire Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Darkest Lariat\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 100 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '3', 'Torracat', '', 'This Pokémon has a violent, selfish disposition. If its not in the mood to listen, it will ignore its Trainers orders with complete nonchalance.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Incineroar', '727', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '26', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
