('sm1-28', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Confusion Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Both Active Pokémon are now Confused.\'}]', 'Sun & Moon', '2', '', 'Golduck', 'As a result of headaches so fierce they cause it to cry, it sometimes uses psychokinesis without meaning to.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm1/sm1-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Psyduck', '54', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '28', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
