('sm10-134', '', '', 'Yumi', '[{\'name\': \'Ball Roll\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Unbroken Bonds', '2', '', 'Wigglytuff', 'Recordings of Jigglypuffs strange lullabies can be purchased from department stores. These CDs can be found near the bedding area.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm10/sm10-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jigglypuff', '39', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/03/2019', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '134', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
