('sm10-60', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Crushing Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Discard a Special Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Discharge\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Discard all Lightning Energy from this Pokémon. This attack does 50 damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Unbroken Bonds', '1', '', '', 'It electrifies its claws and tears its opponents apart with them. Even if they dodge its attack, theyll be electrocuted by the flying sparks.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm10/sm10-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zeraora', '807', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/03/2019', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
