('sm10-66', '[{\'name\': \'Sound Veil\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may prevent all effects of your opponent\'s attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon until the end of your opponent\'s next turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Severe Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned. Put 4 damage counters instead of 1 on that Pokémon between turns.\"}]', 'Unbroken Bonds', '', 'Golbat', '', 'Its fangs are so sharp, if it bites you in the dark and sucks your blood, you wont notice any pain or realize youve been bitten.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm10/sm10-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crobat', '169', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/03/2019', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Sun & Moon', '66', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
