('sm11-173', '[{\'name\': \'Snack Search\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may flip a coin. If heads, put a card from your discard pile on top of your deck. If you use this Ability, your turn ends.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sowsow', '', 'Unified Minds', '', '', 'Snorlax', 'It hides food under its long fur, but it sometimes forgets about it and causes a stinky disturbance.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm11/sm11-173.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Munchlax', '446', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '08/02/2019', '', '', '', 'Sun & Moon', '173', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', ''),
