('sm11-66', '[{\'name\': \'Electric Swamp\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is in your hand and you have at least 4 Lightning Energy cards in play, you may play this Pokémon onto your Bench. If you do, move any number of Lightning Energy from your other Pokémon to this Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Hover Over\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Unified Minds', '3', 'Eelektrik', '', 'With their sucker mouths, they suck in prey. Then they use their fangs to shock the prey with electricity.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm11/sm11-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eelektross', '604', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/02/2019', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '66', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
