('sm11-79a', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Zone\', \'text\': \"Don\'t apply Psychic Weakness when Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s) take damage from attacks.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Star Search\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for an Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Psychic Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Star Shield-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Unified Minds', '1', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm11/sm11-79a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jirachi-GX', '385', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '08/02/2019', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '79a', 'Basic, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
