('sm11-98', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Suffocating Gas\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Unified Minds', '1', '', 'Salazzle', 'The males will do whatever the females tell them. They give the females most of their food. Due to malnutrition, the males cant evolve.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm11/sm11-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Salandit', '757', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/02/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '98', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm11-99', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Slashing Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Unified Minds', '1', 'Salandit', '', 'Salazzle lives deep in caves and forces the Salandit it has attracted with its pheromones to serve it.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm11/sm11-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Salazzle', '758', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '08/02/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '99', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm115-1', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '1', '', 'Metapod', 'Perhaps because it would like to grow up quickly, it has a voracious appetite, eating a hundred leaves a day.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Caterpie', '10', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/23/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
