('sm115-4', '', '', 'OOYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '1', '', 'Parasect', 'Whether its due to a lack of moisture or a lack of nutrients, in Alola the mushrooms on Paras dont grow up quite right.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Paras', '46', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/23/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm115-40', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Moon Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Fairy\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '2', 'Clefairy', '', 'It cant help but hear a pin drop from over half a mile away, so it lives deep in the mountains where there arent many people or Pokémon.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clefable', '36', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/23/2019', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '40', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm115-41', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Singing Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '1', '', 'Wigglytuff', 'Recordings of Jigglypuffs strange lullabies can be purchased from department stores. These CDs can be found near the bedding area.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jigglypuff', '39', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/23/2019', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '41', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm115-42', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Rolling Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Fairy\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 more damage for each heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Lovely Star-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Fairy\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"Heal all damage from this Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Hidden Fates', '2', 'Jigglypuff', '', '', 'Seventh', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wigglytuff-GX', '40', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '8/23/2019', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '42', 'Stage 1, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm115-43', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Happy Mime\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Each player draws a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 40 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '1', '', '', 'Its pantomime skills are wonderful. You may become enraptured while watching it, but next thing you know, Mr. Mime has made a real wall.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mr. Mime', '122', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/23/2019', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '43', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm115-44', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Trinity Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Water\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'210\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Sky Legends-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Shuffle this Pokémon and all cards attached to it into your deck. If this Pokémon has at least 1 extra Fire, Water, and Lightning Energy attached to it (in addition to this attack\'s cost), this attack does 110 damage to 3 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Hidden Fates', '3', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '300', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Moltres & Zapdos & Articuno-GX', '144, 145, 146', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '8/23/2019', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'TAG TEAM rule: When your TAG TEAM is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '44', 'Basic, TAG TEAM, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm115-45', '', '', 'Eri Yamaki', '[{\'name\': \'Leek Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '1', '', 'Sirfetchd', 'The plant stalk it holds is its weapon. The stalk is used like a sword to cut all sorts of things.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Farfetchd', '83', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/23/2019', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '45', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm115-46', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Double-Edge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '2', '', 'Blissey', 'It seems that other Pokémons efforts to take its delicious, nutritious egg away from it caused Chansey to get faster at fleeing.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chansey', '113', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/23/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '46', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm115-47', '', '', 'You Iribi', '[{\'name\': \'Parental Fury\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 40 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '2', '', '', 'Kangaskhan protects its child by keeping it in its pouch. It has zero forgiveness for those who harm its child and will beat them down.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kangaskhan', '115', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/23/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm115-48', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Curiosity\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Spin Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this Pokémon does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Hidden Fates', '1', '', 'Vaporeon, Jolteon, Flareon, Sylveon, Espeon, Umbreon, Leafeon, Glaceon', 'The question of why only Eevee has such unstable genes has still not been solved.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm115/sm115-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eevee', '133', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/23/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '48', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
