('sm12-118', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Reverse Shoulder Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If your Benched Pokémon have any damage counters on them, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', '', '', 'When it tightens its belt, it becomes stronger. Wild Throh use vines to weave their own belts.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Throh', '538', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '118', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm12-119', '', '', 'Motofumi Fujiwara', '[{\'name\': \'Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', '', 'Pangoro', 'It follows Pangoro around like a henchman. When Pancham makes a big mistake, its leaf gets taken away.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pancham', '674', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '119', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm12-12', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Synthesis\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Grass Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leaf Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', '', '', 'The bunches of fruit growing around the necks of Tropius in Alola are especially sweet compared to those in other regions.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tropius', '357', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm12-120', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Light Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Magnum Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', 'Pancham', '', 'This rowdy Pokémon boasts great physical strength. Many Trainers are also smitten by its lively character.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pangoro', '675', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '120', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm12-121', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Confront\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', '', 'Crabominable', 'Its hard pincers are well suited to both offense and defense. Fights between two Crabrawler are like boxing matches.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crabrawler', '739', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '121', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm12-122', '[{\'name\': \'Solid Shell\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Freezing Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Water Energy attached to it, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '4', 'Crabrawler', '', 'It stores coldness in its pincers and pummels its foes. It can even smash thick walls of ice to bits!', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crabominable', '740', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '122', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm12-123', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', 'Lycanroc', 'As they develop, their disposition grows more violent and aggressive. Many Trainers find them too much to handle and abandon them.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rockruff', '744', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '123', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm12-124', '[{\'name\': \'Boiling Blood\', \'text\': \"If your opponent has any Pokémon-GX or Pokémon-EX in play, this Pokémon\'s attacks cost ColorlessColorlessColorless less.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'so-taro', '[{\'name\': \'Voltage Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon has any Special Energy attached to it, this attack does 70 more damage.\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', 'Rockruff', '', 'It has no problem ignoring orders it doesnt like. It doesnt seem to mind getting hurt at all—as long as it can finish off its opponent.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lycanroc', '745', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '124', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm12-125', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Spike Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Seismic Toss\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', '', 'They use their saliva to stick leaves to their shoulders. You can tell what troop they belong to from the position of the leaves.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Passimian', '766', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '125', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm12-126', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Astonish\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Choose a random card from your opponent\'s hand. Your opponent reveals that card and shuffles it into their deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hook\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', '', 'Palossand', 'It likes the shovel on its head, so Sandygast will get serious and fight any children who come to take it back.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandygast', '769', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '126', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm12-127', '', '', 'OOYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 20 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '4', 'Sandygast', '', 'Each of its grains of sand has its own will. Palossand eats small Pokémon and siphons away their vital essence while theyre still alive.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palossand', '770', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '127', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm12-128', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Swagger\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hook\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', 'Persian', 'Its impulsive, selfish, and fickle. Its very popular with some Trainers who like giving it the attention it needs.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Meowth', '52', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '128', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-129', '[{\'name\': \'Smug Face\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon by your opponent\'s TAG TEAM Pokémon and Ultra Beasts, and by your opponent\'s Pokémon that have any Special Energy attached to them.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Claw Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Stalking Claws-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 120 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. This damage isn\'t affected by Weakness, Resistance, or any other effects on that Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', 'Alolan Meowth', '', '', 'Seventh', '200', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Persian-GX', '53', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '129', 'Stage 1, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-13', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bug Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', 'Kricketune', 'It chats with others using the sounds of its colliding antennae. These sounds are fall hallmarks.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kricketot', '401', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm12-130', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Melt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Nasty Goo\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', '', 'Muk', 'There are a hundred or so of them living in Alolas waste-disposal site. Theyre all hard workers who eat a lot of trash.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Grimer', '88', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '130', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-131', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Panic Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned, Confused, and Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sludge Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '4', 'Alolan Grimer', '', 'There are over a hundred kinds of poison inside its body. Chemical reactions between different poisons are the source of its vitality.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Muk', '89', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '131', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-132', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Agility\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', 'Sharpedo', 'Theyre such cowards that they wont hunt alone. When five or so of them get together, they suddenly turn ferocious!', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Carvanha', '318', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '132', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('sm12-133', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Ominous News\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard a Special Energy from 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dirty Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"Discard a card from your hand. If you can\'t discard a card, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', '', 'The only thing unlucky about Absol is its appearance. It protects fields and warns people of disaster, so one ought to be grateful for it.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Absol', '359', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '133', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-134', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Bag Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. Discard an Item card you find there.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', 'Bisharp', 'After shredding its prey, it sharpens its blades on a stone by the river. Each Pawniard has its own favorite sharpening stone.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pawniard', '624', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '134', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-135', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Corner\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Slashing Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Slashing Strike during your next turn.\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', 'Pawniard', '', 'No matter how strong the Bisharp, its said that if the blade on its head is chipped, it will retire from its position as the boss.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bisharp', '625', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '135', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-136', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Mountain Munch\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Red Banquet\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from this attack, take 1 more Prize card.\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '4', '', '', 'Although its alien to this world and a danger here, its apparently a common organism in the world where it normally lives.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Guzzlord', '799', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '136', 'Basic, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm12-137', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Run Around\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Metal Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', 'Sandslash', 'After fleeing a volcanic eruption, it ended up moving to an area of snowy mountains. Its ice shell is as hard as steel.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Sandshrew', '27', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '137', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm12-138', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Curve Strike\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Reinforced Needle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', 'Alolan Sandshrew', '', 'It runs across snow-covered plains at high speeds. It developed thick, sharp claws to plow through the snow.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Sandslash', '28', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '138', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm12-139', '', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'name\': \'Thumping Fall\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Discard any number of Pokémon with a Retreat Cost of exactly 4 from your hand. This attack does 50 damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}, {\'name\': \'Iron Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 100 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '4', 'Onix', '', 'Tempered underground under high pressure and heat, its body is harder than any metal.', 'Seventh', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Steelix', '208', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '139', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm12-14', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Improvisational Performance\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If you have exactly 1 card in your hand, this attack does 100 more damage. If you have exactly 3 cards in your hand, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused. If you have exactly 6 cards in your hand, this attack does 30 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '2', 'Kricketot', '', 'It crosses its knifelike arms in front of its chest when it cries. It can compose melodies ad lib.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kricketune', '402', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '14', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm12-140', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Calling\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 TAG TEAM cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Dark Clamp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '1', '', '', 'A cunning and terrifying Pokémon, its cuteness makes opponents let down their guard—and then it swallows them whole with its huge jaws.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mawile', '303', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '140', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm12-141', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Hard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Triple Nose\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 40 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Cosmic Eclipse', '3', 'Nosepass', '', 'Although it can control its units known as Mini-Noses, they sometimes get lost and dont come back.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm12/sm12-141.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Probopass', '476', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '141', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
