('sm3-140', '[{\'name\': \'Secret Spring\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may attach a Fairy Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Infinite Force\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 damage times the amount of Energy attached to both Active Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Twilight-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Shuffle 10 cards from your discard pile into your deck. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', 'Kirlia', '', '', 'Seventh', '230', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gardevoir-GX', '282', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '140', 'Stage 2, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2');
