('sm3-38', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Gnash Teeth\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Synchronoise\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon that shares a type with your opponent\'s Active Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', '', '', 'When it unleashes its psychic power from the protuberance on its head, the grating sound of grinding teeth echoes through the area.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bruxish', '779', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '38', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
