('sm3-67', '[{\'name\': \'Toppling Wind\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may discard the top 3 cards of your opponent\'s deck.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Wrecker\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance. This Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '4', 'Rhydon', '', 'From holes in its palms, it fires out Geodude. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rhyperior', '464', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '67', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm3-68', '[{\'name\': \'Heal Block\', \'text\': \"If you have Solrock in play, Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s) can\'t be healed.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Lunar Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', '', '', 'Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lunatone', '337', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm3-69', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Double Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Solar Heat\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', '', '', 'Solar energy is the source of its power, so it is strong during the daytime. When it spins, its body shines.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Solrock', '338', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm3-7', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Bind Down\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', '', 'Tangrowth', 'Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tangela', '114', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
