('sm3-71', '[{\'name\': \'Stance\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may prevent all effects of your opponent\'s attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon until the end of your opponent\'s next turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Submarine Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', 'Riolu', '', 'Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '71', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm3-72', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Guard\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from Basic Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn. This Pokémon can\'t use Quick Guard during your next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Brick Break\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance or any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', '', '', 'Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sawk', '539', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm3-73', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Light Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', '', 'Crabominable', 'While guarding its weak points with its pincers, it looks for an opening and unleashes punches. When it loses, it foams at the mouth and faints.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crabrawler', '739', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm3-74', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Gutsy Hammer\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 10 damage to itself for each damage counter on it.\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 40 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '4', 'Crabrawler', '', 'It aimed for the top but got lost and ended up on a snowy mountain. Being forced to endure the cold, this Pokémon evolved and grew fur.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crabominable', '740', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '74', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm3-75', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Dangerous Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon, this attack does 30 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Corner\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', 'Rockruff', '', 'The more intimidating the opponent it faces, the more this Pokémons blood boils. It will attack with no regard for its own safety.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lycanroc', '745', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '75', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
