('sm3-81', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Focus Energy\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Bite attack\'s base damage is 60.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', '', 'Raticate', 'With its incisors, it gnaws through doors and infiltrates peoples homes. Then, with a twitch of its whiskers, it steals whatever food it finds.', 'Seventh', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Rattata', '19', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
