('sm3-85', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Hone Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Slash attack\'s base damage is 80.\"}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', '', 'Weavile', 'It has a cunning yet savage disposition. It waits for parents to leave their nests, and then it sneaks in to steal their eggs.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sneasel', '215', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '85', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm3-86', '', '', 'Satoshi Shirai', '[{\'name\': \'Rule of Evil\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 60 damage to each Pokémon that has an Ability (both yours and your opponent\'s). (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '', 'Sneasel', '', 'They travel in groups of four or five, leaving signs for one another on trees and rocks. They bring down their prey with coordinated attacks.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Weavile', '461', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', '', '', 'Sun & Moon', '86', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm3-87', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dark Raid\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has already used their GX attack, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', '', '', 'It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Darkrai', '491', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '87', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm3-88', '[{\'name\': \'Restoration\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is in your discard pile, you may put it onto your Bench. Then, attach a Darkness Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'PLANETA', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Cleave\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dead End-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is affected by a Special Condition, that Pokémon is Knocked Out. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Darkrai-GX', '491', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '88', 'Basic, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm3-88a', '[{\'name\': \'Restoration\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is in your discard pile, you may put it onto your Bench. Then, attach a Darkness Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'PLANETA', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Cleave\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dead End-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is affected by a Special Condition, that Pokémon is Knocked Out. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '2', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-88a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Darkrai-GX', '491', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '88a', 'Basic, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm3-89', '', '', 'OOYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Constrict\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', '', 'Malamar', 'Opponents who stare at the flashing of the light-emitting spots on its body become dazed and lose their will to fight.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Inkay', '686', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '89', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm3-9', '', '', 'Ayaka Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Agility\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', '', 'Ledian', 'They are timid and grow uneasy when not in a swarm with others of their kind. The pattern on their backs differs slightly from one to another.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ledyba', '165', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/05/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '9', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm3-90', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Psybeam\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Energy Slosh\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'You may move all Energy attached to this Pokémon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Burning Shadows', '1', 'Inkay', '', 'It wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, and it forces others to do whatever it wants.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm3/sm3-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Malamar', '687', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '08/05/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '90', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
