('sm35-11', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'High-Pressure Heat\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s High-Pressure Heat attack does 50 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Flamethrower\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Shining Legends', '3', '', '', 'Coal is the source of Torkoals energy. Large amounts of coal can be found in the mountains where they live.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm35/sm35-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Torkoal', '324', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '10/06/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '11', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm35-12', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Flare\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shining Legends', '3', '', 'Volcarona', 'Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm35/sm35-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Larvesta', '636', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '10/06/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm35-13', '[{\'name\': \'Heat Cyclone\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may have your opponent switch their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Heat Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shining Legends', '1', 'Larvesta', '', 'A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm35/sm35-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Volcarona', '637', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '10/06/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '13', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm35-14', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Outrage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Scorching Breath\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Shining Legends', '3', '', '', 'This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm35/sm35-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Reshiram', '643', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '10/06/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '14', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm35-15', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Live Coal\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shining Legends', '1', '', 'Torracat', 'While grooming itself, it builds up fur inside its stomach. It sets the fur alight and spews fiery attacks, which change based on how it coughs.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm35/sm35-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Litten', '725', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '10/06/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '15', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm35-16', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Swagger\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fire Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shining Legends', '1', 'Litten', 'Incineroar', 'At its throat, it bears a bell of fire. The bell rings brightly whenever this Pokémon spits fire.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm35/sm35-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Torracat', '726', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '10/06/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '16', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
