('sm4-13', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Continuous Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Crimson Invasion', '3', '', 'Camerupt', 'Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm4/sm4-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Numel', '322', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
