('sm4-16', '[{\'name\': \'Escape\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may shuffle this Pokémon and all cards attached to it into your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crimson Invasion', '1', 'Staryu', '', 'Its shining core is thought to receive and transmit enigmatic signals. It has been known to cause headaches in those who approach it.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm4/sm4-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Starmie', '121', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '16', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
