('sm4-64', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Crunch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Crimson Invasion', '1', '', '', 'It uses its docile-looking face to lull foes into complacency, then bites with its huge, relentless jaws.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm4/sm4-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mawile', '303', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2017', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2');
