('sm4-77', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'War Cry\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If you have fewer Pokémon in play than your opponent, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Clanging Scales\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 more damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Crimson Invasion', '2', 'Hakamo-o', '', 'When it spots enemies, it threatens them by jingling the scales on its tail. Weak opponents will crack and flee in panic.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm4/sm4-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kommo-o', '784', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '77', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2'),
('sm4-78', '[{\'name\': \'Moomoo Malt\', \'text\': \'As long as this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, whenever you attach an Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon, heal 90 damage from that Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Sitdown Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Crimson Invasion', '2', '', '', 'Its milk is high in calories and packed with nutrients. Therefore, if you drink too much of it, you may wind up with a body like Miltanks.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm4/sm4-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Miltank', '241', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm4-79', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crimson Invasion', '1', '', 'Altaria', 'For some reason, it likes to land on peoples heads softly and act like its a hat.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm4/sm4-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Swablu', '333', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/03/2017', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
