('sm4-80', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Draco Melody\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Dragon Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Cotton Guard\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Crimson Invasion', '1', 'Swablu', '', 'It flies gracefully through the sky. Its melodic humming makes you feel like youre in a dream.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm4/sm4-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Altaria', '334', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/03/2017', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '80', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
