('sm5-109', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Own the Place\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"If your opponent has a Stadium card in play, discard it. If you do, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Toss Aside\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Discard random cards from your opponent\'s hand until they have 3 cards in their hand.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', 'Glameow', '', 'To make itself appear intimidatingly beefy, it tightly cinches its waist with its twin tails.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Purugly', '432', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '109', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm5-11', '[{\'name\': \'Weather Guard\', \'text\': \'Your Grass Pokémon have no Weakness.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', 'Cherubi', '', 'If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the suns rays with its whole body.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cherrim', '421', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '11', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm5-110', '[{\'name\': \'Roto Motor\', \'text\': \"If you have 9 or more Pokémon Tool cards in your discard pile, ignore all Energy in the attack cost of each of this Pokémon\'s attacks.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Fan\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', 'Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Fan Rotom', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'Sun & Moon', '110', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm5-111', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Glide\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', '', 'The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shaymin', '492', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '111', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm5-112', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Scout\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Gumshoos', 'It wanders around in a never-ending search for food. At dusk, it collapses from exhaustion and falls asleep on the spot.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-112.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Yungoos', '734', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '112', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm5-113', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Identify\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. If you find a Pokémon there, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Whap Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', 'Yungoos', '', 'It adores having Rattata and Raticate for dinner, but as its diurnal, it never encounters them. This Pokémon boasts incredible patience.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gumshoos', '735', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '113', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm5-114', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Resource Management\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put 3 cards from your discard pile on the bottom of your deck in any order.\'}, {\'name\': \'Profound Knowledge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', '', '', 'Deep in the jungle, high in the lofty canopy, this Pokémon abides. On rare occasions, it shows up at the beach to match wits with Slowking.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Banned', '', 'Oranguru', '765', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '114', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm5-115', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Merciless Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon already has any damage counters on it, this attack does 30 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Headbang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', '', '', 'The heavy control mask it wears suppresses its intrinsic capabilities. This Pokémon has some hidden special power.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Type: Null', '772', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '115', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm5-116', '[{\'name\': \'Gyro Unit\', \'text\': \'Your Basic Pokémon in play have no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Turbo Drive\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Rebel-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage for each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', 'Type: Null', '', '', 'Seventh', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Silvally-GX', '773', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '116', 'Stage 1, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm5-117', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Outrage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Dragon Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 2 cards of your deck.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '3', '', '', 'This Pokémon is friendly to people and loves children most of all. It comes from deep in the mountains to play with children it likes in town.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-117.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drampa', '780', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '117', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm5-118', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ancient Crystal', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"The Regirock, Regice, Registeel, or Regigigas this card is attached to takes 30 less damage from your opponent\'s attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '118', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', '');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('sm5-119', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cynthia', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 6 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '119', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-119a', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-119a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cynthia', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 6 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '119a', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-12', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Chomp Chomp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Loom Over\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90-\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 less damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', '', 'It binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Carnivine', '455', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm5-120', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cyrus ◇', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'You can play this card only if your Active Pokémon is a Water or Metal Pokémon.\', \'Your opponent chooses 2 Benched Pokémon and shuffles the others, and all cards attached to them, into their deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\', \"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '120', 'Supporter, Prism Star', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-121', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Electric Memory', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \'The Silvally-GX this card is attached to is a Lightning Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '121', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-122', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Escape Board', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"The Retreat Cost of the Pokémon this card is attached to is Colorless less, and it can retreat even if it\'s Asleep or Paralyzed.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '122', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-122a', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-122a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Escape Board', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"The Retreat Cost of the Pokémon this card is attached to is Colorless less, and it can retreat even if it\'s Asleep or Paralyzed.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '122a', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-123', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Fire Memory', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \'The Silvally-GX this card is attached to is a Fire Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '123', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-124', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gardenia', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Heal 80 damage from 1 of your Pokémon that has any Grass Energy attached to it.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '124', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-125', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lillie', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Draw cards until you have 6 cards in your hand. If it\'s your first turn, draw cards until you have 8 cards in your hand.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '125', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-125a', '', '', 'Mana Ibe', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-125a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lillie', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Draw cards until you have 6 cards in your hand. If it\'s your first turn, draw cards until you have 8 cards in your hand.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '125a', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-126', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Looker', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Draw 3 cards from the bottom of your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '126', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-127', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Looker Whistle', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Search your deck for up to 2 cards named Looker, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '127', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-128', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mars', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Draw 2 cards. If you do, discard a random card from your opponent\'s hand.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '128', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-129', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Missing Clover', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'You may play 4 Missing Clover cards at once.\\n• If you played 1 card, look at the top card of your deck.\\n• If you played 4 cards, take a Prize card. (This effect works one time for 4 cards.)\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '129', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-13', '[{\'name\': \'Breath of the Leaves\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, once during your turn (before your attack), you may heal 50 damage from 1 of your Pokémon that has any Energy attached to it.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Grand Bloom-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"For each of your Benched Basic Pokémon, search your deck for a card that evolves from that Pokémon and put it onto that Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', 'Eevee', '', '', 'Seventh', '200', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Leafeon-GX', '470', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '13', 'Stage 1, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm5-130', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mt. Coronet', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\"Once during each player\'s turn, that player may put 2 Metal Energy cards from their discard pile into their hand.\", \"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '130', 'Stadium', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-131', '', '', 'Eske Yoshinob', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Order Pad', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for an Item card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '131', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-132', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pal Pad', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Shuffle 2 Supporter cards from your discard pile into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '132', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-133', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pokémon Fan Club', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '133', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-134', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Unidentified Fossil', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Play this card as if it were a 60-HP Colorless Basic Pokémon. At any time during your turn (before your attack), you may discard this card from play.\', \"This card can\'t retreat.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '134', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-135', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Volkner', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Search your deck for an Item card and a Lightning Energy card, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '135', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-135a', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-135a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Volkner', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'Search your deck for an Item card and a Lightning Energy card, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '135a', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm5-136', '', '', '', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Super Boost Energy ◇', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'This card provides Colorless Energy.\', \'While this card is attached to a Stage 2 Pokémon, it provides every type of Energy but provides only 1 Energy at a time. If you have 3 or more Stage 2 Pokémon in play, it provides every type of Energy but provides 4 Energy at a time.\', \"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '136', 'Special, Prism Star', 'Energy', '', ''),
('sm5-137', '', '', '', '', 'Ultra Prism', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Unit Energy GrassFireWater', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', '', '[\'This card provides Colorless Energy.\', \'While this card is attached to a Pokémon, it provides Grass, Fire, and Water Energy but provides only 1 Energy at a time.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '137', 'Special', 'Energy', '', ''),
