('sm5-51', '', '', 'Asako Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Creepy Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hang Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Drifblim', 'If for some reason its body bursts, its soul spills out with a screaming sound.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drifloon', '425', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '51', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm5-52', '', '', 'Yumi', '[{\'name\': \'Damage Transport\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move 4 damage counters from each of your Pokémon to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Wind Wheel\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', 'Drifloon', '', 'Even while under careful observation, large flocks of Drifblim flying at dusk will inexplicably disappear from view.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drifblim', '426', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '52', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm5-53', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Lightless World\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put 2 Supporter cards from your discard pile into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Terrify\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon, it can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', '', 'It was bound to a fissure in an Odd Keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spiritomb', '442', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', ''),
('sm5-54', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Hone Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Pierce attack\'s base damage is 90.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', '', 'Drapion', 'It burrows under the sand to lie in wait for prey. Its tail claws can inject its prey with a savage poison.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Skorupi', '451', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '54', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-55', '', '', 'Studio Bora Inc.', '[{\'name\': \'Dangerous Stinger\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed and Poisoned.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '3', 'Skorupi', '', 'It has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car. The tips of its claws release poison.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drapion', '452', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '55', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-56', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Swagger\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Toxicroak', 'Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Croagunk', '453', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-57', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Exact Revenge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Fighting Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack during their last turn, this attack does 70 more damage.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', 'Croagunk', '', 'Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxicroak', '454', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '57', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-58', '[{\'name\': \'Chaotic Star\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may attach 2 Psychic Energy cards from your hand to it.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Crisis Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', '', '', 'It was banished for its violence. It silently gazed upon the old world from the Distortion World.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Giratina ◇', '487', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '58', 'Basic, Prism Star', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm5-59', '', '', 'chibi', '[{\'name\': \'Lunar Payback\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy from this Pokémon. If you do, switch all damage counters on this Pokémon with those on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 more damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', '', 'Those who sleep holding Cresselias feather are assured of joyful dreams. It is said to represent the crescent moon.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cresselia', '488', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-6', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Synthesis\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Grass Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Headbutt Bounce\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', '', 'Grotle', 'It undertakes photosynthesis with its body, making oxygen. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Turtwig', '387', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm5-60', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Teleport\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Cosmoem', 'Its body is gaseous and frail. It slowly grows as it collects dust from the atmosphere.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cosmog', '789', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-61', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Teleport\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '3', 'Cosmog', 'Solgaleo, Lunala', 'Theres something accumulating around the black core within its hard shell. People think this Pokémon may come from another world.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cosmoem', '790', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '61', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-62', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Full Moon Star\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"For each of your opponent\'s Pokémon in play, attach a Psychic Energy card from your discard pile to your Pokémon in any way you like.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psystorm\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage times the amount of Energy attached to all Pokémon.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '3', '', '', 'Said to live in another world, this Pokémon devours light, drawing the moonless dark veil of night over the brightness of day.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lunala ◇', '792', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '62', 'Basic, Prism Star', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm5-63', '[{\'name\': \'Invasion\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is on your Bench, you may switch it with your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Flash\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \"Moon\'s Eclipse-GX\", \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"You can use this attack only if you have more Prize cards remaining than your opponent. Prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dawn Wings Necrozma-GX', '800', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '63', 'Basic, GX, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm5-64', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Corkscrew Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Headstrike\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', 'Unidentified Fossil', 'Rampardos', 'In rock layers where Cranidos fossils are found, the fossilized trunks of trees snapped in two are also often found.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cranidos', '408', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm5-65', '', '', 'Yoshinobu Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Clean Hit\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is an Evolution Pokémon, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Wild Crash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon, it is Knocked Out.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', 'Cranidos', '', 'Records exist of a revived fossil that evolved into Rampardos. It proceeded to escape and then destroy a skyscraper with a headbutt.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rampardos', '409', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '65', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm5-66', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Detect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Lucario', 'Its tough enough to run right through the night, and its also a hard worker, but its still just a youngster.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-67', '[{\'name\': \'Precognitive Aura\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if you have Garchomp in play, you may search your deck for a card and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Missile Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', 'Riolu', '', 'They can detect the species of a living being—and its emotions—from over half a mile away. They control auras and hunt their prey in packs.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '67', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm5-68', '', '', 'Yumi', '[{\'name\': \'Eleventh Hour Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'If there are 3 or fewer cards in your deck, this attack does 130 more damage.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '3', '', 'Hippowdon', 'It enshrouds itself with sand to protect itself from germs. It does not enjoy getting wet.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hippopotas', '449', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm5-69', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Tomb\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dust Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 more damage for each Colorless in your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '4', 'Hippopotas', '', 'It blasts internally stored sand from ports on its body to create a towering twister for attack.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hippowdon', '450', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '69', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm5-7', '', '', 'OOYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '2', '', 'Grotle', 'It undertakes photosynthesis with its body, making oxygen. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Turtwig', '387', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm5-70', '[{\'name\': \'Power Huddle\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, your Passimian\'s attacks do 30 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Evolution Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Hurl\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', '', 'They battle with hard berries for weapons. Their techniques are passed from the boss to the group, generation upon generation.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Passimian', '766', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
