('sm5-71', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Mean Look\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Honchkrow', 'Seen as a symbol of bad luck, its generally disliked. Yet it gives presents—objects that sparkle or shine—to Trainers its close to.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Murkrow', '198', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm5-72', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Rip and Run\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard a random card from your opponent\'s hand. Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Speed Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', 'Murkrow', '', 'If its Murkrow cronies fail to catch food for it, or if it feels they have betrayed it, it will hunt them down wherever they are and punish them.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Honchkrow', '430', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '72', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm5-73', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Sneaky Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"You can use this attack only if you go second, and only on your first turn. Discard an Energy from 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Ambush\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Weavile', 'It uses its claws to poke holes in eggs so it can slurp out the insides. Breeders consider it a scourge and will drive it away or eradicate it.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sneasel', '215', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
