('sm5-94', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Psywave\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Magical Swap\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move any number of damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon to their other Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', '', 'This guardian deity of Akala is guilelessly cruel. The fragrant aroma of flowers is the source of its energy.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tapu Lele', '786', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '94', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm5-95', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \"Exeggutor\'s Paradise\", \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'For each of your Benched Exeggcute, search your deck for an Alolan Exeggutor or Alolan Exeggutor-GX and put it onto that Exeggcute to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Draco Meteor Barrage\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Grass Energy attached to this Pokémon. This attack does 80 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '3', 'Exeggcute', '', 'Alola is the best environment for this Pokémon. Local people take pride in its appearance, saying this is how Exeggutor ought to look.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Exeggutor', '103', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '95', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2'),
('sm5-96', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Ascension\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Gabite', 'It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gible', '443', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '96', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2'),
('sm5-97', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Hiding\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Fighting Energy attached to it, it has no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Ultra Prism', '1', '', 'Gabite', 'It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm5/sm5-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gible', '443', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '97', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2'),
