('sm6-31', '[{\'name\': \'Jet Geyser\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard a Water Energy card from your hand. If you do, your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Sauna Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '3', '', '', 'It expels its internal steam from the arms on its back. It has enough power to blow away a mountain.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Volcanion ◇', '721', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '31', 'Basic, Prism Star', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm6-32', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Spider Web\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Araquanid', 'When it comes across enemies or potential prey, this Pokémon smashes its water-bubble-covered head into them.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dewpider', '751', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '32', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-33', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Bubble\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bubble Trap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'If 1 of your Pokémon used Bubble during your last turn, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', 'Dewpider', '', 'Despite what its appearance suggests, it cares for others. If it finds vulnerable, weak Pokémon, it protectively brings them into its water bubble.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Araquanid', '752', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '33', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-34', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Searching Magnet\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Lightning Energy cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Magneton', 'It sends out electromagnetic waves, which let it float through the air. Touching it while its eating electricity will give you a full-body shock.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magnemite', '81', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '34', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm6-35', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Zap Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Zap Cannon during your next turn.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Magnemite', 'Magnezone', 'It has about three times the electrical power of Magnemite. For some reason, outbreaks of this Pokémon happen when lots of sunspots appear.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magneton', '82', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '35', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm6-36', '[{\'name\': \'Magnetic Circuit\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may attach a Lightning Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Yoshinobu Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Zap Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Zap Cannon during your next turn.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Magneton', '', 'As it zooms through the sky, this Pokémon seems to be receiving signals of unknown origin, while transmitting signals of unknown purpose.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magnezone', '462', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '36', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm6-37', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Whap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Heliolisk', 'The frills on either side of its head have cells that generate electricity when exposed to sunlight.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Helioptile', '694', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '37', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm6-38', '', '', 'otumami', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Volt Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', 'Helioptile', '', 'It stimulates its muscles with electricity, boosting the strength in its legs and enabling it to run 100 yards in five seconds.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Heliolisk', '695', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '38', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm6-39', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Dazzle Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Cablegram\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"If you have exactly 3 Prize cards remaining, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', '', 'It appeared from the Ultra Wormhole. It raided a power plant, so people think it energizes itself with electricity.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Xurkitree', '796', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '39', 'Basic, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm6-4', '[{\'name\': \'Blessings of the Frost\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may attach a Grass Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Hypno Hammer\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '3', 'Snover', '', 'It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Abomasnow', '460', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '4', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm6-40', '[{\'name\': \'Roto Motor\', \'text\': \"If you have 9 or more Pokémon Tool cards in your discard pile, ignore all Energy in the attack cost of each of this Pokémon\'s attacks.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Plasma Slice\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', '', 'Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rotom', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '40', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm6-41', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Memory Skip\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks. That Pokémon can\'t use that attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', '', 'It is said that its emergence gave humans the intelligence to improve their quality of life.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Uxie', '480', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '41', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('sm6-42', '[{\'name\': \'Silent Waves\', \'text\': \"If you have Azelf in play, your opponent\'s Pokémon in play have no Resistance.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Mind Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If Uxie is on your Bench, this attack does 50 more damage.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', '', 'It sleeps at the bottom of a lake. Its spirit is said to leave its body to fly on the lakes surface.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mesprit', '481', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '42', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-43', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Abduction\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"You can use this attack only if you go second, and only on your first turn. Shuffle 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon and all cards attached to it into their deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', '', 'It is thought that Uxie, Mesprit and Azelf all came from the same egg.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Azelf', '482', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '43', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-44', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Teaser\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move an Energy from 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon to another of their Pokémon.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Meowstic', 'It has enough psychic energy to blast everything within 300 feet of itself, but it has no control over its power.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Espurr', '677', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '44', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-45', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Teleportation Burst\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', 'Espurr', '', 'The eyeball patterns on the interior of its ears emit psychic energy. It keeps the patterns tightly covered because that power is too immense.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Meowstic', '678', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-46', '[{\'name\': \'Final Hour\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack, put 3 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', '', 'Doublade', 'If anyone dares to grab its hilt, it wraps a blue cloth around that persons arm and drains that persons life energy completely.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Honedge', '679', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '46', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm6-47', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Sound\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', '', 'Doublade', 'If anyone dares to grab its hilt, it wraps a blue cloth around that persons arm and drains that persons life energy completely.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Honedge', '679', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm6-48', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Curse of the Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on each of your opponent\'s Pokémon that has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Honedge', 'Aegislash', 'The complex attack patterns of its two swords are unstoppable, even for an opponent greatly accomplished at swordplay.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Doublade', '680', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm6-49', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Ticking Knock Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'During your next turn, if the Defending Pokémon is damaged by an attack, it will be Knocked Out.\'}, {\'name\': \'Draining Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Doublade', '', 'Apparently, it can detect the innate qualities of leadership. According to legend, whoever it recognizes is destined to become king.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Aegislash', '681', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '49', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sm6-5', '[{\'name\': \'Abnormal Outbreak\', \'text\': \'You can use this Ability only if you go second. Once during your first turn (before your attack), you may search your deck for a Spewpa and a Vivillon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Spewpa', 'The powder that covers its body regulates its temperature, so it can live in any region or climate.', 'Seventh', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scatterbug', '664', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '5', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm6-50', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnosis\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Malamar', 'It flashes the light-emitting spots on its body, which drains its opponents will to fight. It takes the opportunity to scuttle away and hide.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Inkay', '686', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '50', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-51', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Recharge\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may attach a Psychic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'You Iribi', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Sphere\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Inkay', '', 'It lures prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Malamar', '687', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-52', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Hook\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Dragalge', 'It looks just like rotten kelp. It hides from foes while storing up power for its evolution.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Skrelp', '690', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-53', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Point\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), the Attacking Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Twister\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Flip 2 coins. For each heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon. If both of them are tails, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', 'Skrelp', '', 'Tales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live, never to return.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dragalge', '691', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '53', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-54', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Hyperspace Ring\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Item cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psy Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', '', 'It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hoopa', '720', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '54', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-55', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Spit Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Knockout Reviver\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if this Pokémon is Knocked Out, your opponent can\'t take any Prize cards for it.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Naganadel', 'This Ultra Beast is well enough liked to be chosen as a first partner in its own world.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Poipole', '803', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '55', 'Basic, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-56', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Beast Raid\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each of your Ultra Beasts in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Jet Needle\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Stinger-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Both players shuffle their Prize cards into their decks. Then, each player puts the top 3 cards of their deck face down as their Prize cards. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', 'Poipole', '', '', 'Seventh', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Naganadel-GX', '804', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '56', 'Stage 1, GX, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-57', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Burdensome Bone\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', '', 'Marowak', 'The skull it wears on its head is that of its dead mother. According to some, it will evolve when it comes to terms with the pain of her death.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cubone', '104', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-58', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Giga Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Heal from this Pokémon the same amount of damage you did to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '4', 'Grotle', '', 'Small Pokémon occasionally gather on its unmoving back to begin building their nests.', 'Seventh', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Torterra', '389', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '58', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-59', '[{\'name\': \'Flaming Fighter\', \'text\': \"Put 6 damage counters instead of 2 on your opponent\'s Burned Pokémon between turns.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Burst Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', 'Monferno', '', 'It tosses its enemies around with agility. It uses all its limbs to fight in its own unique style.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Infernape', '392', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '59', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-6', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Ultra Evolution\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for Vivillon and put it onto this Scatterbug to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Spewpa', 'The powder that covers its body regulates its temperature, so it can live in any region or climate.', 'Seventh', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scatterbug', '664', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm6-60', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Ascension\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Gabite', 'It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gible', '443', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-61', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Ascension\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', 'Gible', 'Garchomp', 'Shiny objects are its passion. It can be found in its cave, scarcely moving, its gaze fixed on the jewels its amassed or Carbink it has caught.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gabite', '444', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '61', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-62', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Royal Blades\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \'If you played Cynthia from your hand during this turn, this attack does 100 more damage.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '', 'Gabite', '', 'The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Garchomp', '445', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/04/2018', '', '', '', 'Sun & Moon', '62', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-63', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Swagger\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '1', '', 'Toxicroak', 'Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Croagunk', '453', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-64', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Exact Revenge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Psychic Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack during their last turn, this attack does 70 more damage.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Croagunk', '', 'Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxicroak', '454', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-65', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Act Tough\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Darkness Energy attached to it, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', '', 'Pangoro', 'Theres no point to the leaf in its mouth, aside from an effort to look cool. Its mischievous, so its not well suited to inexperienced Trainers.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pancham', '674', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm6-66', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Allotment\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '3', '', 'Barbaracle', 'They stretch and then contract, yanking their rocks along with them in bold hops. They eat seaweed that washes up on the shoreline.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Binacle', '688', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-67', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Seven Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"If you have exactly 7 cards in your hand, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Claw Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '3', 'Binacle', '', 'Barbaracles legs and hands have minds of their own, and they will move independently. But they usually follow the heads orders.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Barbaracle', '689', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '67', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-68', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Crunch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Unidentified Fossil', 'Tyrantrum', 'Its immense jaws have enough destructive force that it can chew up an automobile. It lived 100 million years ago.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyrunt', '696', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '68', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-69', '[{\'name\': \'Tyrannical Heart\', \'text\': \"As long as you don\'t have more Pokémon in play than your opponent, this Pokémon\'s attacks do 60 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance), and it takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'hatachu', '[{\'name\': \'Crunch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '3', 'Tyrunt', '', 'Nothing could stop this Pokémon 100 million years ago, so it behaved like a king.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyrantrum', '697', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '69', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm6-7', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'String Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Forbidden Light', '2', 'Scatterbug', 'Vivillon', 'The beaks of birds cant begin to scratch its stalwart body. To defend itself, it spews powder.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm6/sm6-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spewpa', '665', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/04/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
