('sm7-106', '[{\'name\': \'Dragon Wind\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, once during your turn (before your attack), you may switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Dragon Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Celestial Storm', '3', 'Shelgon', '', 'It flies around on its wings, which have grown in at last. In its happiness, it gushes hot flames, burning up the fields it passes over.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Salamence', '373', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/03/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '106', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2'),
