('sm7-25', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Ember\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Celestial Storm', '1', '', 'Combusken', 'A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Torchic', '255', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/03/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '25', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
