('sm7-32', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Water Reserve\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Water Energy cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Celestial Storm', '1', '', 'Marshtomp', 'To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mudkip', '258', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/03/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '32', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
