('sm7-35', '[{\'name\': \'Power Draw\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard a card from your hand. If you do, draw 3 cards.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 more damage times the amount of Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Celestial Storm', '3', 'Marshtomp', '', 'It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Swampert', '260', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '08/03/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '35', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
