('sm7-93', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Single Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Celestial Storm', '3', '', 'Metang', 'With magnetic traction, it pulls its opponents in close. When theyre in range, it slashes them with its rear claws.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beldum', '374', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '08/03/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '93', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm7-94', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Bullet Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Celestial Storm', '3', 'Beldum', 'Metagross', 'It adores magnetic minerals, so it pursues Nosepass at speeds exceeding 60 mph.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Metang', '375', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '08/03/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '94', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm7-95', '[{\'name\': \'Extend\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, your turn does not end when you play Steven\'s Resolve.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Meteor Mash\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Meteor Mash attack does 60 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Celestial Storm', '4', 'Metang', '', 'A linkage of two Metang, this Pokémon can perform any calculation in a flash by utilizing parallel processing in its four brains.', 'Seventh', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Metagross', '376', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/03/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '95', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm7-96', '[{\'name\': \'Exoskeleton\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 20 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Silver Fist\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon has an Ability, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}]', 'Celestial Storm', '3', '', '', 'Its body is said to be harder than any kind of metal. A study has revealed that its body is hollow.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Registeel', '379', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '08/03/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '96', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm7-97', '[{\'name\': \'Wish Upon a Star\', \'text\': \"If you took this Pokémon as a face-down Prize card during your turn and your Bench isn\'t full, before you put it into your hand, you may put it onto your Bench and take 1 more Prize card.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Perish Dream\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon is now Asleep. At the end of your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon will be Knocked Out.\"}]', 'Celestial Storm', '1', '', '', 'It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jirachi ◇', '385', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '08/03/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '[\"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '97', 'Basic, Prism Star', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm7-98', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Steelworks\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 4 cards of your deck and attach any number of Metal Energy cards you find there to 1 of your Pokémon. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Steel Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Celestial Storm', '3', '', '', 'Boiling blood, like magma, circulates through its body. It makes its dwelling place in volcanic caves.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Heatran', '485', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/03/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '98', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm7-99', '[{\'name\': \'Full Metal Body\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Metal Energy attached to it, it has no Weakness.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Rising Dash\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Celestial Storm', '3', 'Cosmoem', '', 'It is said to live in another world. The intense light it radiates from the surface of its body can make the darkest of nights light up like midday.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm7/sm7-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Solgaleo', '791', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '08/03/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '99', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm75-1', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Fire Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '2', '', 'Charmeleon', 'From the time it is born, a flame burns at the tip of its tail. Its life would end if the flame were to go out.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charmander', '4', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm75-10', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Charring Breath\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon isn\'t Burned, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '2', '', '', 'It draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Heatmor', '631', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
