('sm75-19', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Water Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', '', 'Gyarados', 'Its reckless leaps make it easy pickings for predators. On the bright side, many Pokémon enjoy longer life spans, thanks to Magikarp.', 'Seventh', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-19.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magikarp', '129', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '19', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm75-2', '[{\'name\': \'Burning Fighter\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may discard the top 5 cards of your deck. If any of those cards are Fire Energy cards, attach them to this Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Flamethrower\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '2', 'Charmander', 'Charizard', 'When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the air temperature to unbearably high levels.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-2.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charmeleon', '5', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '2', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm75-20', '[{\'name\': \'Commotion\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), put 2 damage counters on each of your Benched Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Wild Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'You may discard any Stadium card in play.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '4', 'Magikarp', '', 'There are people who swear that any place Gyarados appears is fated for destruction.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-20.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gyarados', '130', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '20', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm75-21', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Bullet\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Hydro Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage times the amount of Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '2', '', '', 'These Pokémon were once near extinction due to poaching. Following protective regulations, there is now an overabundance of them.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '21', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-22', '', '', 'Hironobu Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Leer\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fury Swipes\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', '', 'Croconaw', 'Its powerful, well-developed jaws are capable of crushing anything. Even its Trainer must be careful.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-22.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Totodile', '158', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '22', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-23', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Sweep Away\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 3 cards of your deck.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '2', 'Totodile', 'Feraligatr', 'Once it bites down, it wont let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-23.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Croconaw', '159', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '23', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-24', '[{\'name\': \'Downpour\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may discard a Water Energy card from your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Riptide\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 more damage for each Water Energy card in your discard pile. Then, shuffle those cards into your deck.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '3', 'Croconaw', '', 'When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears its victim up.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Feraligatr', '160', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '24', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-25', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', '', 'Quagsire', 'When the temperature cools in the evening, they emerge from water to seek food along the shore.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wooper', '194', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '25', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-26', '[{\'name\': \'Wash Out\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn (before your attack), you may move a Water Energy from 1 of your Benched Pokémon to your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Hydro Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 more damage times the amount of Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '2', 'Wooper', '', 'This carefree Pokémon has an easygoing nature. While swimming, it always bumps into boat hulls.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Quagsire', '195', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '26', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-27', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Bubble Shoot\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage times the amount of Water Energy attached to this Pokémon to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', '', 'Cursola', 'Pursued by Mareanie for the branches on its head, this Pokémon will sometimes snap its own branches off as a diversion while it escapes.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Corsola', '222', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '27', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-28', '[{\'name\': \'Submerge\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks (both yours and your opponent\'s).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', '', 'Milotic', 'Although unattractive and unpopular, this Pokémons marvelous vitality has made it a subject of research.', 'Seventh', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Feebas', '349', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '28', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-29', '', '', 'hatachu', '[{\'name\': \'Aurora Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Split\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This attack does 40 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', 'Feebas', '', 'It lives at the bottom of clear lakes. In times of war, it shows itself, which soothes peoples minds and hearts.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Milotic', '350', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '29', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-3', '[{\'name\': \'Resolute Flame\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon\'s attacks do 30 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon for each of their Pokémon-GX and Pokémon-EX in play.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Fiery Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '2', 'Charmeleon', '', 'Its wings can carry this Pokémon close to an altitude of 4,600 feet. It blows out fire at very high temperatures.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charizard', '6', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '3', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm75-30', '[{\'name\': \'Murmurs of the Sea\', \'text\': \"Your Water Pokémon can\'t be Confused. If those Pokémon are already Confused, remove that Special Condition.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Water Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', '', '', 'It drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Phione', '489', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '30', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm75-31', '[{\'name\': \'Meet Up\', \'text\': \"Your Wishiwashi-GX in play get +20 HP, and their attacks do 20 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Dragon Majesty', '1', '', '', 'Its awfully weak and notably tasty, so everyone is always out to get it. As it happens, anyone trying to bully it receives a painful lesson.', 'Seventh', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm75/sm75-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wishiwashi', '746', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '09/07/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '31', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
