('sm8-105', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Pin Missile\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Toxapex', 'It plunges the poison spike on its head into its prey. When the prey has weakened, Mareanie deals the finishing blow with its 10 tentacles.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mareanie', '747', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '105', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm8-106', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Nightcap\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"You can use this attack only if your opponent has exactly 2 Prize cards remaining. Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon\'s attacks and use it as this attack.\"}, {\'name\': \'Void Tentacles\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused and Poisoned.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'One of the Ultra Beasts, its unclear whether or not this Pokémon is sentient, but sometimes it can be observed behaving like a young girl.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nihilego', '793', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '106', 'Basic, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm8-107', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Eye Opener\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at your face-down Prize cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Naganadel', 'This Ultra Beast is well enough liked to be chosen as a first partner in its own world.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-107.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Poipole', '803', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '107', 'Basic, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm8-108', '[{\'name\': \'Charging Up\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Turning Point\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If you have exactly 3 Prize cards remaining, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', 'Poipole', '', 'It stores hundreds of liters of poisonous liquid inside its body. It is one of the organisms known as UBs.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-108.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Naganadel', '804', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '108', 'Stage 1, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm8-109', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Land Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '4', '', 'Steelix', 'It usually lives underground. It searches for food while boring its way through the ground at 50 miles per hour.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Onix', '95', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '109', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-11', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Multiply\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for Hoppip and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Skiploom', 'It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.', 'Seventh', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hoppip', '187', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '11', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm8-110', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Reply Strongly\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon was damaged by an attack during your opponent\'s last turn while it was your Active Pokémon, this attack does 80 more damage.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', '', 'Apparently, the larger the green parts of this Pokémon, the more collectors value it. Its a particular favorite among elderly people.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sudowoodo', '185', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '110', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm8-111', '', '', 'Asako Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Last Resort\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', 'Donphan', 'It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Phanpy', '231', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '111', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-112', '[{\'name\': \'Sturdy\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has full HP and would be Knocked Out by damage from an attack, this Pokémon is not Knocked Out, and its remaining HP becomes 10.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Rolling Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Rolling Spin attack does 70 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', 'Phanpy', '', 'The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-112.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Donphan', '232', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '112', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-113', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Rapid Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. If you do, your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Triple Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 40 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'If you are enchanted by its smooth, dance-like kicks, you may get a closer experience with one than youd like.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hitmontop', '237', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '113', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm8-114', '[{\'name\': \'Submerge\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks (both yours and your opponent\'s).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Pupitar', 'Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Larvitar', '246', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '114', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-115', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Second Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon already has 3 or more damage counters on it, this attack does 70 more damage.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Pupitar', 'Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Larvitar', '246', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '115', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-116', '[{\'name\': \'Hard Shell Evolution\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by your opponent\'s attacks until the end of your opponent\'s next turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', 'Larvitar', 'Tyranitar', 'Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pupitar', '247', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '116', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-117', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Diamond Gate\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Supporter card and a Stadium card, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 20 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'Although this Pokémon is not especially rare, its glittering, jewel-draped body draws attention from people.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-117.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Carbink', '703', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '117', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-118', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Spoil the Fun\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If you go second, this attack does 60 more damage during your first turn.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Persian', 'When its delicate pride is wounded, or when the gold coin on its forehead is dirtied, it flies into a hysterical rage.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Meowth', '52', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '118', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-119', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Empty Threat\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'90-\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 less damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', 'Alolan Meowth', '', 'It looks down on everyone other than itself. Its preferred tactics are sucker punches and blindside attacks.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Persian', '53', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '119', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-12', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Skiploom', 'It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.', 'Seventh', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hoppip', '187', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm8-120', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Retaliate\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack during their last turn, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dark Cutter\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'With its black fur, it blends into the darkness. It bides its time, and when prey appears, this Pokémon goes for its threat, and then eats it.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Umbreon', '197', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '120', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-121', '[{\'name\': \'Lost Out\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from this Pokémon\'s attacks, put that Pokémon and all cards attached to it in the Lost Zone instead of the discard pile.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Dusty Ruckus\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Basic Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Lay the Smackdown-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'220\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', 'Pupitar', '', '', 'Seventh', '250', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyranitar-GX', '248', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '121', 'Stage 2, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-122', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Dugtrio', 'Its golden hairs function as sensors. It pokes them out of its burrow to monitor its surroundings.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Diglett', '50', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '122', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-123', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Digging Dash\', \'cost\': [], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 0, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', 'Alolan Diglett', '', 'These Pokémon are cherished in the Alola region, where they are thought to be feminine deities of the land incarnate.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Dugtrio', '51', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '123', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-124', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Thorny Eruption\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Lost Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'190\', \'text\': \'Put this Pokémon and all cards attached to it in the Lost Zone.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', 'Pineco', '', 'It remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters piece of its hard shell to drive its enemies away.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Forretress', '205', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '124', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-125', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Iron Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 50 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '4', 'Onix', '', 'It chews its way through boulders with its sturdy jaws. Its eyes can see in the darkness underground.', 'Seventh', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Steelix', '208', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '125', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-126', '[{\'name\': \'Exoskeleton\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Special Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon has any Special Energy attached to it, this attack does 70 more damage.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', 'Scyther', '', 'Once it has identified an enemy, this Pokémon smashes it mercilessly with pincers hard as steel.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scizor', '212', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '126', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2');
