('sm8-153', '[{\'name\': \'Happiness Supplement\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may remove a Special Condition from your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Powerful Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Energy attached to this Pokémon. This attack does 80 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', 'Chansey', '', 'Its fluffy fur coat acts as a sensor, enabling it to read the feelings of people and Pokémon.', 'Seventh', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-153.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Blissey', '242', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '153', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-154', '[{\'name\': \'Almighty Evolution\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put any Stage 1 card from your hand onto this Pokémon to evolve it. You can\'t use this Ability during your first turn or the turn this Pokémon was put into play.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'With its astonishing capacity for metamorphosis, it can get along with anything. It does not get along well with its fellow Ditto.', 'Seventh', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-154.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ditto ◇', '132', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '[\"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '154', 'Basic, Prism Star', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-155', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Vaporeon, Jolteon, Flareon, Sylveon, Espeon, Umbreon, Leafeon, Glaceon', 'Current studies show it can evolve into an incredible eight different species of Pokémon.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-155.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eevee', '133', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '155', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-156', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Mystifying Horns\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Enhanced Horns\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', '', 'The curved antlers change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-156.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stantler', '234', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '156', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-157', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Stunning Likeness\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. You may use the effect of a Supporter card you find there as the effect of this attack.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'It draws symbols all over the place to mark its territory. In towns with many Smeargle, the walls are covered in graffiti.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-157.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Smeargle', '235', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '157', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-158', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Milk Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \'Reveal any number of Moomoo Milk cards in your hand. This attack does 60 damage for each card you revealed in this way.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', '', '', 'Most people raise it for its milk, but its quite tough and strong, so its also well suited for battle.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-158.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Miltank', '241', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '158', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-159', '', '', 'PLANETA Igarashi', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pelagic Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Pelagic Blade during your next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Lost Purge-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put your opponent\'s Active Pokémon and all cards attached to it in the Lost Zone. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-159.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lugia-GX', '249', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '159', 'Basic, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm8-16', '[{\'name\': \'Fresh Squeezed\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 3 basic Energy cards and discard them. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Drink\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach 2 basic Energy cards from your discard pile to your Pokémon in any way you like.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'It stores berries inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shuckle', '213', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-160', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Rainbow Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each type of basic Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', '', 'It will reveal itself before a pure-hearted Trainer by shining its bright, rainbow-colored wings.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-160.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ho-Oh', '250', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '160', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm8-161', '[{\'name\': \'Unit Color 1\', \'text\': \'As long as this Pokémon has Unit Energy GrassFireWater attached to it, it is a Grass, Fire, and Water Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'OOYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Tongue Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is an Evolution Pokémon, this attack does 50 more damage.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'It changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-161.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kecleon', '352', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '161', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-162', '[{\'name\': \'Unit Color 3\', \'text\': \'As long as this Pokémon has Unit Energy FightingDarknessFairy attached to it, it is a Fighting, Darkness, and Fairy Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'OOYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Gentle Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'It changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-162.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kecleon', '352', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '162', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
