('sm8-53', '[{\'name\': \'Secret Alleyway\', \'text\': \'If you have any Fairy Pokémon in play, this Pokémon has no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Ninetales', 'In hot weather, this Pokémon makes ice shards with its six tails and sprays them around to cool itself off.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Vulpix', '37', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
