('sm8-57', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Happy Delivery\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose any number of your Benched Pokémon that don\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to them. For each of those Pokémon, search your deck for a Pokémon Tool card and attach it to that Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Flap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'It has a generous habit of sharing its food with people and Pokémon, so its always scrounging around for more food.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Delibird', '225', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm8-58', '[{\'name\': \'Mantine Surf\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Energy attached to it, it has no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', '', '', 'While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores Remoraid that cling to its fins seeking food scraps.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mantine', '226', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm8-59', '[{\'name\': \'Frozen Flow\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, you may have your opponent switch their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Aurora Gain\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'Said to be the embodiment of north winds, it can instantly purify filthy, murky water.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Suicune', '245', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-6', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Mini Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Heal 10 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Bayleef', 'It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chikorita', '152', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-60', '[{\'name\': \'Phantom Winds\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is on your Bench, you may shuffle it and all cards attached to it into your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Cure Stream\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks do 30 less damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Brinicles-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Suicune-GX', '245', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '60', 'Basic, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-61', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Secondary Chills\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"You can use this attack only if you go second, and only on your first turn. Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', 'Beartic', 'Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cubchoo', '613', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm8-62', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Resolute Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon-GX or a Pokémon-EX, this attack does 60 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Blizzard Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', 'Cubchoo', '', 'It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beartic', '614', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '62', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm8-63', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Field Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has a Stadium card in play, discard it.\'}, {\'name\': \'Freezing Flames\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Fire Energy attached to it, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', '', '', 'It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'White Kyurem', '646', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sm8-64', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Disarming Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Brionne', 'This Pokémon snorts body fluids from its nose, blowing balloons to smash into its foes. Its famous for being a hard worker.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Popplio', '728', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-65', '', '', 'Yusuke Ohmura', '[{\'name\': \'Blot\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Heal 10 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Brionne', 'This Pokémon can control water bubbles. It practice diligently so it can learn to make big bubbles.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Popplio', '728', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-66', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Captivate\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', 'Popplio', 'Primarina', 'It cares deeply for its companions. When its Trainer is feeling down, it performs a cheery dance to try and help.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Brionne', '729', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '66', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-67', '[{\'name\': \'Harmonics\', \'text\': \'Whenever you attach an Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon, except with an attack, Ability, or Trainer card, attach up to 2 Energy cards to that Pokémon instead of 1.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Hypno Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', 'Brionne', '', 'Its singing voice is its chief weapon in battle. This Pokémons Trainer must prioritize the daily maintenance of its throat at all costs.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Primarina', '730', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '67', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-68', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Spike Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Toxapex', 'Its found crawling on beaches and seafloors. The coral that grows on Corsolas head is as good as a five-star banquet to this Pokémon.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mareanie', '747', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-69', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Venom Fever\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Poisoned, this attack does 50 damage for each damage counter on that Pokémon.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', 'Mareanie', '', 'Those attacked by Toxapexs poison will suffer intense pain for three days and three nights. Post-recovery, there will be some aftereffects.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxapex', '748', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '69', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-7', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Soothing Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', 'Chikorita', 'Meganium', 'The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bayleef', '153', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-70', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Mind Bend\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Follow the Wound\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 60 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon that has any damage counters on it. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'It stuns its prey with psychokinesis and then grinds them to mush with its strong teeth. Even Shellders shell is no match for it.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bruxish', '779', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm8-71', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', 'Electivire', 'Electricity leaks from it in amounts far greater than the amount of electricity it eats.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Electabuzz', '125', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('sm8-72', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Electrocharge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Lightning Energy cards and attach them to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'High-Voltage Knuckle\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'190\', \'text\': \'Discard 3 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '4', 'Electabuzz', '', 'When it gets excited, it thumps its chest. With every thud, thunder roars and electric sparks shower all around.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Electivire', '466', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '72', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-73', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Lightning Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Lanturn', 'It lives in the depths beyond the reach of sunlight. It flashes lights on its antennae to communicate with others of its kind.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chinchou', '170', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-74', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Salvage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Shuffle 4 Item cards from your discard pile into your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Signal Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', 'Chinchou', '', 'This Pokémon flashes a bright light that blinds its prey. This creates an opening for it to deliver an electrical attack.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lanturn', '171', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '74', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-75', '[{\'name\': \'Fluffy Pillow\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, you may leave your opponent\'s Active Pokémon Asleep.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Flaaffy', 'It stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mareep', '179', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-76', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Flaaffy', 'It stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mareep', '179', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '76', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-77', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Signal Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', 'Mareep', 'Ampharos', 'If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flaaffy', '180', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '77', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-78', '[{\'name\': \'Unseen Flash\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put 2 Lightning Energy cards from your hand in the Lost Zone. If you do, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Satoshi Shirai', '[{\'name\': \'Split Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', 'Flaaffy', '', 'The tails tip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ampharos', '181', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '78', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-79', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Lost Voltage\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If you have any Lightning Energy cards in the Lost Zone, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', '', '', 'This rough Pokémon stores energy inside its body, then sweeps across the land, shooting off electricity.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Raikou', '243', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-8', '[{\'name\': \'Quick-Ripening Herb\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may use this Ability. Choose 1 of your Basic Pokémon in play. If you have a Stage 2 card in your hand that evolves from that Pokémon, put that card onto the Basic Pokémon to evolve it. You can use this Ability during your first turn or on a Pokémon that was put into play this turn.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '2', 'Bayleef', '', 'Meganiums breath has the power to revive dead grass and plants. It can make them healthy again.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Meganium', '154', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/02/2018', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '8', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm8-80', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Overshort\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"Before doing damage, discard all Pokémon Tool cards from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon. If you discarded a Pokémon Tool card in this way, this attack does 40 more damage, and your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', '', 'A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pachirisu', '417', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '80', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-81', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Flop\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Zap Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', '', 'Zebstrika', 'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Blitzle', '522', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-82', '[{\'name\': \'Sprint\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard your hand and draw 4 cards.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Head Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '1', 'Blitzle', '', 'They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zebstrika', '523', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '82', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm8-83', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Flail\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunder Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Discard a Lightning Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Lost Thunder', '3', '', '', 'It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm8/sm8-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stunfisk', '618', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/02/2018', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
