('sm9-128', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Fast Evolution\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Evolution Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mega Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Team Up', '2', '', '', 'Kangaskhan protects its child by keeping it in its pouch. It has zero forgiveness for those who harm its child and will beat them down.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kangaskhan', '115', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '128', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm9-129', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Raging Herd\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on all of your Tauros and Tauros-GX.\'}]', 'Team Up', '2', '', '', 'They live in groups. The one with the longest, thickest, and most-scarred horns is the boss of the herd.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tauros', '128', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '129', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm9-13', '', '', 'Ayaka Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Fire Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}]', 'Team Up', '2', 'Charmander', 'Charizard', 'It lashes about with its tail to knock down its foe. It then tears up the fallen opponent with sharp claws.', 'Seventh', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charmeleon', '5', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '13', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm9-130', '', '', 'hatachu', '[{\'name\': \'Supersonic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fossil Fangs\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \"If you don\'t have any Pokémon-GX or Pokémon-EX on your Bench, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}]', 'Team Up', '1', 'Unidentified Fossil', '', 'Restored from DNA found in amber, this Pokémon exhibited ferocity that was greater than expected. Some casualties resulted.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Aerodactyl', '142', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2019', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '130', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm9-131', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Power Charger\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a basic Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Blasting Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Team Up', '2', '', '', 'It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lugia', '249', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2019', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '131', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sm9-132', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Head Hunt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 6 cards of your deck, reveal any number of Pokémon you find there, and put them into your hand. Discard the other cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Team Up', '1', '', '', 'Its fur would all stand on end if it smelled a Seviper nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zangoose', '335', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '132', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm9-133', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bills Analysis', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Look at the top 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal up to 2 Trainer cards you find there and put them into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '133', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-134', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Black Market ◇', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"When a Darkness Pokémon (yours or your opponent\'s) that has any Darkness Energy attached to it is Knocked Out by damage from an opponent\'s attack, that player takes 1 fewer Prize card.\", \'Whenever any player plays an Item or Supporter card from their hand, prevent all effects of that card done to this Stadium card.\', \"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\", \"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '134', 'Stadium, Prism Star', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-135', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Brocks Grit', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Shuffle 6 in any combination of Pokémon and basic Energy cards from your discard pile into your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '135', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-136', '', '', 'Yoshinobu Saito', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Buff Padding', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \'If the Pokémon this card is attached to has a Retreat Cost of exactly 4, it gets +50 HP.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '136', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-137', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dana', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"You can play this card only if your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Stage 2 Pokémon.\", \'Search your deck for up to 2 cards and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '137', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-138', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dangerous Drill', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'You can play this card only if you discard a Darkness Pokémon from your hand.\', \"Discard a Pokémon Tool or Special Energy card from 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon, or discard any Stadium card in play.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '138', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-139', '', '', 'Eske Yoshinob', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Electrocharger', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Flip 2 coins. For each heads, shuffle an Electropower card from your discard pile into your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '139', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-14', '[{\'name\': \'Roaring Resolve\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may put 2 damage counters on this Pokémon. If you do, search your deck for up to 2 Fire Energy cards and attach them to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Continuous Blaze Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Discard all Fire Energy from this Pokémon. This attack does 50 more damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Team Up', '2', 'Charmeleon', '', 'When expelling a blast of superhot fire, the red flame at the tip of its tail burns more intensely.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charizard', '6', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '14', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm9-140', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Erikas Hospitality', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'You can play this card only if you have 4 or fewer other cards in your hand.\', \"Draw a card for each of your opponent\'s Pokémon in play.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '140', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-141', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-141.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Evelyn', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"You can play this card only if your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Stage 1 Pokémon.\", \'Draw 4 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '141', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-142', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-142.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Fairy Charm UB', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"Prevent all damage done to the Fairy Pokémon this card is attached to by attacks from your opponent\'s Ultra Beast Pokémon-GX and Ultra Beast Pokémon-EX.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '142', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-143', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-143.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grass Memory', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \'The Silvally-GX this card is attached to is a Grass Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '143', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-144', '', '', 'Yusuke Ohmura', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-144.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ingo & Emmet', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Look at the top card of your deck, and then choose 1:\\n• Discard your hand and draw 5 cards.\\n• Discard your hand and draw 5 cards from the bottom of your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '144', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-145', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-145.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jasmine', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Search your deck for a Metal Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you go second and it\'s your first turn, search for 5 Metal Pokémon instead of 1. Then, shuffle your deck.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '145', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-146', '', '', 'Ayaka Yoshida', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-146.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Judge Whistle', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Choose 1:\\n• Draw a card\\n• Put a Judge card from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '146', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-147', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-147.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lavender Town', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Once during each player\'s turn, that player may have their opponent reveal their hand.\", \"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '147', 'Stadium', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-148', '', '', 'Yoshinobu Saito', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-148.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Metal Goggles', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \"The Metal Pokémon this card is attached to takes 30 less damage from your opponent\'s attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance), and your opponent\'s attacks and Abilities can\'t put damage counters on it.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '148', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-149', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-149.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Morgan', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'You can play this card only if you discard Dana, Evelyn, and Nita from your hand.\', \'Look at the top 12 cards of your deck and attach any number of Energy cards you find there to your Pokémon in any way you like. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '149', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-15', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Team Up', '1', '', 'Ninetales', 'Its beautiful tails have made it very popular. However, if its not brushed diligently, it will be a mass of tangles before you know it.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vulpix', '37', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '15', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sm9-150', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-150.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nanu', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Choose a Basic Darkness Pokémon in your discard pile. Switch it with 1 of your Pokémon in play. Any attached cards, damage counters, Special Conditions, turns in play, and any other effects remain on the new Pokémon.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '150', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-151', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-151.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nita', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"You can play this card only if your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon.\", \"Put an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon on top of their deck.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '151', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-152', '', '', 'Ayaka Yoshida', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-152.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pokémon Communication', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Reveal a Pokémon from your hand and put it into your deck. If you do, search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '152', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-152a', '', '', 'Studio Bora Inc.', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-152a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pokémon Communication', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Reveal a Pokémon from your hand and put it into your deck. If you do, search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '152a', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-152b', '', '', 'OOYAMA', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-152b.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pokémon Communication', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Reveal a Pokémon from your hand and put it into your deck. If you do, search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '152b', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-153', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-153.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Return Label', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Put a card from your opponent\'s discard pile on the bottom of their deck.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '153', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-154', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-154.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sabrinas Suggestion', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Your opponent reveals their hand. You may choose a Supporter card you find there and use the effect of that card as the effect of this card.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '154', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-155', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-155.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Unidentified Fossil', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\'Play this card as if it were a 60-HP Colorless Basic Pokémon. At any time during your turn (before your attack), you may discard this card from play.\', \"This card can\'t retreat.\", \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '155', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-156', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-156.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Viridian Forest', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Once during each player\'s turn, that player may discard a card from their hand. If they do, that player searches their deck for a basic Energy card, reveals it, and puts it into their hand. Then, that player shuffles their deck.\", \"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '156', 'Stadium', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-157', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-157.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Water Memory', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.\", \'The Silvally-GX this card is attached to is a Water Pokémon.\', \'You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).\']', 'Sun & Moon', '157', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-158', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'Team Up', '', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-158.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wondrous Labyrinth ◇', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Prism Star', '', '02/01/2019', '', '', '[\"The attacks of non-Fairy Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s) cost Colorless more.\", \'Whenever any player plays an Item or Supporter card from their hand, prevent all effects of that card done to this Stadium card.\', \"This card stays in play when you play it. Discard this card if another Stadium card comes into play. If another card with the same name is in play, you can\'t play this card.\", \"◇ (Prism Star) Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 ◇ card with the same name in your deck. If a ◇ card would go to the discard pile, put it in the Lost Zone instead.\"]', 'Sun & Moon', '158', 'Stadium, Prism Star', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sm9-159', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Pollen Hazard\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned, Confused, and Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Evergreen-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"Heal all damage from this Pokémon. If this Pokémon has at least 1 extra Grass Energy attached to it (in addition to this attack\'s cost), shuffle all cards from your discard pile into your deck. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Team Up', '4', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '270', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-159.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Celebi & Venusaur-GX', '3, 251', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'TAG TEAM rule: When your TAG TEAM is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '159', 'Basic, TAG TEAM, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm9-16', '[{\'name\': \'Nine Temptations\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard 2 Fire Energy cards from your hand. If you do, switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'You Iribi', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Team Up', '1', 'Vulpix', '', 'It is vindictive and relentless by nature. Those who cross it even once will be cursed for a thousand years, along with their descendants.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ninetales', '38', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '16', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
