('sm9-76', '[{\'name\': \'Fossil Bind\', \'text\': \"As long as you have fewer Pokémon in play than your opponent, they can\'t play any Item cards from their hand.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Team Up', '2', 'Omanyte', '', 'Its heavy shell is thought to be the reason this ancient Pokémon died out. Its apparently a distant ancestor of Octillery.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Omastar', '139', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '76', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
