('sm9-78', '[{\'name\': \'Fossilized Memories\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, your opponent can\'t play any Supporter cards from their hand.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Slide\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Team Up', '2', 'Kabuto', '', 'Its body had begun to change so it could function on land. But it didnt adapt in time and went extinct.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kabutops', '141', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '78', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
