('sm9-8', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Bullet Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Team Up', '1', '', 'Exeggutor', 'Six of them form a single Pokémon. Should one of the six be lost, the next morning there will once more be six.', 'Seventh', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Exeggcute', '102', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sm9-80', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Payback\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has exactly 1 Prize card remaining, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', 'Team Up', '1', 'Larvitar', 'Tyranitar', 'Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain.', 'Seventh', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pupitar', '247', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '80', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm9-81', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Arm Thrust\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon. If tails, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Team Up', '2', '', 'Pangoro', 'Theres no point to the leaf in its mouth, aside from an effort to look cool. Its mischievous, so its not well suited to inexperienced Trainers.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pancham', '674', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sm9-82', '[{\'name\': \'Twilight Eyes\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may discard an Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Accelerock\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Splintered Shards-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage for each Energy card in your opponent\'s discard pile. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'Team Up', '2', 'Rockruff', '', '', 'Seventh', '200', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lycanroc-GX', '745', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo GX', '', '02/01/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-GX rule: When your Pokémon-GX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', '82', 'Stage 1, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sm9-83', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Chemical Breath\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 more damage for each Special Condition affecting your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Team Up', '3', '', 'Muk', 'The crystals on Grimers body are lumps of toxins. If one falls off, lethal poisons leak out.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Grimer', '88', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm9-84', '[{\'name\': \'Adventurous Appetite\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may look at the top 6 cards of your opponent\'s deck and discard any number of Item cards you find there. Your opponent shuffles the other cards back into their deck.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Gunk Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}]', 'Team Up', '3', 'Alolan Grimer', '', 'While its unexpectedly quiet and friendly, if its not fed any trash for a while, it will smash its Trainers furnishings and eat up the fragments.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alolan Muk', '89', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '02/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '84', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm9-85', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite Off\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon-GX or a Pokémon-EX, this attack does 100 more damage.\"}]', 'Team Up', '4', 'Pupitar', '', 'If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.', 'Seventh', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyranitar', '248', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '02/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '85', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sm9-86', '', '', 'Ken Sugimori', '[{\'name\': \'Howl in the Dark\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Darkness Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Team Up', '1', '', 'Mightyena', 'It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.', 'Seventh', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sm9/sm9-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Poochyena', '261', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/01/2019', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
