('smp-SM13', '[{\'name\': \'Instruct\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may draw cards until you have 3 cards in your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 more damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'Deep in the jungle, high in the lofty canopy, this Pokémon abides. On rare occasions, it shows up at the beach to match wits with Slowking.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Oranguru', '765', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
