('smp-SM20', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Enhanced Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'High Horsepower\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 40 damage to itself.\'}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '4', 'Mudbray', '', 'It spits a mud that provides resistance to both wind and rain, so the walls of old houses were often coated with it.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM20.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mudsdale', '750', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM20', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM200', '', '', 'Framestore', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Paralyzing Gaze\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Granbull', 'It grows close to others easily and is also easily spoiled. The disparity between its face and its actions makes many young people wild about it.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM200.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snubbull', '209', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM200', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM201', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Outrage\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flare Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'230\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Flare Strike during your next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Double Blaze-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'200+\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon has at least 3 extra Fire Energy attached to it (in addition to this attack\'s cost), this attack does 100 more damage, and this attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon. (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '3', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '270', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM201.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Reshiram & Charizard-GX', '6, 643', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'TAG TEAM rule: When your TAG TEAM is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM201', 'Basic, TAG TEAM, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM202', '[{\'name\': \'Bursting Spores\', \'text\': \"Whenever you play a Pokémon that has the Spore attack from your hand during your turn, you may leave your opponent\'s Active Pokémon Asleep and Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Venoshock\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Poisoned, this attack does 70 more damage.\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '2', 'Foongus', '', 'They show off their Poké Ball caps to lure prey, but very few Pokémon are fooled by this.', 'Seventh', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM202.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Amoonguss', '591', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM202', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM203', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Fin\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Nature Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has any Ultra Beasts in play, this attack can be used for Colorless.\'}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'This guardian deity of Poni Island manipulates water. Because it lives deep within a thick fog, it came to be both feared and revered.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM203.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tapu Fini', '788', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM203', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM204', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Barrier Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Special Laser\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Special Energy attached to it, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'It looks somehow pained as it rages around in search of light, which serves as its energy. Its apparently from another world.', 'Seventh', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM204.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Necrozma', '800', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM204', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM205', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Cavern Counter\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'If all of your Benched Pokémon have at least 1 damage counter on them, this attack does 150 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Boulder Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '4', '', '', 'Its charge is strong enough to break through a giant castle wall in one blow. This Pokémon is spoken of in legends.', 'Seventh', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM205.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Terrakion', '639', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM205', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM206', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Raichu', 'Its nature is to store up electricity. Forests where nests of Pikachu live are dangerous, since the trees are so often struck by lightning.', 'Seventh', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM206.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pikachu', '25', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM206', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM207', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Territorial Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"If you don\'t have a Stadium card in play, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'Its so popular with the elderly that theres a magazine devoted to this Pokémon. Fans obsess over the particular length and angle of its arms.', 'Seventh', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM207.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sudowoodo', '185', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM207', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM208', '[{\'name\': \'Stealthy Body\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this Pokémon has no Weakness.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Electricannon\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120+\', \'text\': \'You may discard all Lightning Energy from this Pokémon. If you do, this attack does 100 more damage.\'}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '2', 'Charjabug', '', 'It has an organ that generates electricity in its abdomen. It concentrates energy in its strong jaws and fires off powerful jolts of electricity.', 'Seventh', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM208.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vikavolt', '738', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM208', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM209', '[{\'name\': \'Wall of Stone\', \'text\': \"If your opponent has 3 or fewer Prize cards remaining, this Pokémon\'s maximum HP is 200.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Top Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '4', '', '', 'It appeared from an Ultra Wormhole. Each one appears to be made up of many life-forms stacked one on top of each other.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM209.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stakataka', '805', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM209', 'Basic, Ultra Beast', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM21', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Amass\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a basic Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Power Cyclone\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Move an Energy from this Pokémon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'It has a compassionate personality, but if it is angered, it completely destroys its surroundings with its intense breath.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM21.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drampa', '780', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM21', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM210', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Trinity Burn\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Water\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'210\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Sky Legends-GX\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Shuffle this Pokémon and all cards attached to it into your deck. If this Pokémon has at least 1 extra Fire, Water, and Lightning Energy attached to it (in addition to this attack\'s cost), this attack does 110 damage to 3 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) (You can\'t use more than 1 GX attack in a game.)\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '3', '', '', '', 'Seventh', '300', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM210.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Moltres & Zapdos & Articuno-GX', '144, 145, 146', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'TAG TEAM rule: When your TAG TEAM is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM210', 'Basic, TAG TEAM, GX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
