('smp-SM53', '[{\'name\': \'Steelworker\', \'text\': \"Your Metal Pokémon\'s attacks do 10 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Anchor Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '2', '', '', 'Swinging its massive anchor, it can KO Wailord in a single blow. What appears to be green seaweed is actually its body.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dhelmise', '781', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('smp-SM54', '[{\'name\': \'Stance\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may prevent all effects of your opponent\'s attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon until the end of your opponent\'s next turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Submarine Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SM Black Star Promos', '1', 'Riolu', '', 'Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle.', 'Seventh', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/smp/smp-SM54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '02/03/2017', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sun & Moon', 'SM54', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
