('sv1-11', '', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Vine Whip\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Smash Kick\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'Until recently, people living in the mountains would ride on the back of these Pokémon to traverse the mountain paths.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Skiddo', '672', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '11', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv1-110', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Feint\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'It never skips its daily yoga training. It heightens its inner strength through meditation.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Meditite', '307', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '110', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-111', '', '', 'Jerky', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Acu-Punch-Ture\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks. During your opponent\'s next turn, that Pokémon can\'t use that attack.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Kick Shot\', \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', 'Meditite', '', 'Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe’s next move.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Medicham', '308', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '111', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-112', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Jab\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-112.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '112', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-113', '', '', 'chibi', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Punch\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 20 damage to itself.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '113', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-114', '', '', 'Nurikabe', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Avenging Knuckle\', \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Fighting Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an attack during your opponent\'s last turn, this attack does 120 more damage.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Accelerating Stab\', \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t use Accelerating Stab.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', 'Riolu', '', 'It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to Lucario, since it can detect auras—even those of foes it could not otherwise see.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '114', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-115', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Ram\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', '', '', 'It submerges itself in sand and moves as if swimming. This wise behavior keeps its enemies from finding it and maintains its temperature.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandile', '551', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '115', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-116', '', '', 'kantaro', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Payback\', \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has exactly 1 Prize card remaining, this attack does 90 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Corkscrew Punch\', \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', 'Sandile', '', 'Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Krokorok', '552', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '116', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-117', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Chomp Chomp Bite\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '3', 'Krokorok', '', 'After clamping down with its powerful jaws, it twists its body around to rip its prey in half.', 'Ninth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-117.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Krookodile', '553', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '117', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-118', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Flying Entry\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may choose 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon and put 1 damage counter on each of them.\"}]', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'Its elegant finishing moves—performed by nimbly leaping around using its wings—are polished in the forest where it was born and raised.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hawlucha', '701', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '118', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-119', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mud-Slap\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', '', '', 'Silicobra’s neck pouch, which can inflate and deflate like a balloon, gets more elastic each time Silicobra sheds its skin.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Silicobra', '843', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '119', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-12', '', '', 'Gemi', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Rising Lunge\', \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', 'Skiddo', '', 'It can sense the feelings of others by touching them with its horns. This species has assisted people with their work since 5,000 years ago.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gogoat', '673', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '12', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv1-120', '', '', 'Yuya Oka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Skull Bash\', \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Sandstorm Spray\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon. If you discarded any Energy in this way, your opponent shuffles their Active Pokémon and all attached cards into their deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '3', 'Silicobra', '', 'It will expand its body as much as it can and then contract itself, blasting out sand with enough force to wash away a dump truck.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandaconda', '844', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '120', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-121', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Exoskeleton\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 20 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\'}]', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mega Kick\', \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', '', '', 'The elemental composition of the rocks that form its body were found to match the bedrock of a land far away from this Pokémon’s habitat.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stonjourner', '874', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '121', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-122', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Vise Grip\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Adrenaline Hammer\', \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon is now Confused.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '3', '', '', 'Klawf hangs upside-down from cliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf can’t remain in this position for long because its blood rushes to its head.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Klawf', '950', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '122', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-123', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Bedrock Breaker\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Discard a Stadium in play.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Gigantic Tusks\', \'damage\': \'250\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 50 damage to itself.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '4', '', '', 'Klawf hangs upside-down from cliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf can’t remain in this position for long because its blood rushes to its head.', 'Ninth', '250', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Great Tusk ex', '984', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '123', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-124', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Claw Slash\', \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Rampaging Fang\', \'damage\': \'190\', \'text\': \'Discard 3 Energy from this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', '', '', 'This seems to be the Winged King mentioned in an old expedition journal. It was said to have split the land with its bare fists.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Koraidon', '1007', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '124', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
