('sv1-125', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Dino Cry\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may attach up to 2 Basic Fighting Energy cards from your discard pile to your Basic Fighting Pokémon in any way you like. If you use this Ability, your turn ends.\'}]', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Wild Impact\', \'damage\': \'220\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', '', '', 'This seems to be the Winged King mentioned in an old expedition journal. It was said to have split the land with its bare fists.', 'Ninth', '230', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Koraidon ex', '1007', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '125', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv1-126', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Super Poison Breath\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '3', '', '', 'Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grimer', '88', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '126', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv1-127', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Poison Sacs\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Poisoned Pokémon don\'t recover from that Special Condition when they evolve or devolve.\"}]', '', 'Haru Akasaka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Toxic Strike\', \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '4', 'Grimer', '', 'It’s thickly covered with a filthy, vile sludge. It is so toxic, even its footprints contain poison.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Muk', '89', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '127', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv1-128', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Spit Poison\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Venoshock\', \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Poisoned, this attack does 120 more damage.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '2', '', '', 'It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seviper', '336', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '128', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv1-129', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Taunt\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch in 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon to the Active Spot.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Doom Decree\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip 2 coins. If both of them are heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Knocked Out.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'It was formed by uniting 108 spirits. It has been bound to the Odd Keystone to keep it from doing any mischief.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spiritomb', '442', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '129', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv1-13', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Scratch\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Leafage\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'Its fluffy fur is similar in composition to plants. This Pokémon frequently washes its face to keep it from drying out.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sprigatito', '906', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
