('sv1-75', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Head Bolt\', \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', 'Pawmi', '', 'Pawmo uses a unique fighting technique in which it uses its forepaws to strike foes and zap them with electricity from its paw pads simultaneously.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pawmo', '922', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '75', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv1-76', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Electrogenesis\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for a Basic Lightning Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Electro Paws\', \'damage\': \'230\', \'text\': \'Discard all Energy from this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '', 'Pawmo', '', 'Pawmot’s fluffy fur acts as a battery. It can store the same amount of electricity as an electric car.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pawmot', '923', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '3/31/2023', '', '', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '76', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv1-77', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Collect\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Glide\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', '', '', 'When its wings catch the wind, the bones within produce electricity. This Pokémon dives into the ocean, catching prey by electrocuting them.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv1/sv1-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wattrel', '940', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '3/31/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
