('sv2-109', '', '', 'Jerky', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Hit and Hide\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage from and effects of attacks done to this Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Elbow Strike\', \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears more similar to rock than to vegetation.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sudowoodo', '185', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '109', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-11', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Freezing Disaster\', \'text\': \"Pokémon\\xa0(both yours and your opponent\'s) can\'t be healed.\"}]', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Magnum Punch\', \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Snover', '', 'It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Abomasnow', '460', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '11', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-110', '', '', 'Haru Akasaka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Double Stab\', \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'Born deep underground, this Pokémon becomes a pupa after eating enough dirt to make a mountain.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Larvitar', '246', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '110', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-111', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Headbutt Bounce\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Larvitar', '', 'This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pupitar', '247', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '111', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-112', '', '', 'Kurata So', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Slap Push\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'It grows stronger by enduring harsh training. It is a gutsy Pokémon that can withstand any attack.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-112.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Makuhita', '296', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '112', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv2-113', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Arm Thrust Practice\', \'text\': \"All of your Pokémon take 10 less damage from attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Rocket Slap\', \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Makuhita', '', 'It loves challenging others to tests of strength. It has the power to stop a train with a slap.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hariyama', '297', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '113', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv2-114', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Poison Sting\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Croagunk', '453', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '114', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv2-115', '', '', 'Yuya Oka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Pierce\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Knuckle Claws\', \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Croagunk', '', 'Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxicroak', '454', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '115', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv2-116', '', '', '313', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Bite\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon is very friendly when it’s young. Its disposition becomes vicious once it matures, but it never forgets the kindness of its master.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rockruff', '744', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '116', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-117', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Scary Fangs\', \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if this Pokémon is damaged by an attack (even if it is Knocked Out), put 10 damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Rockruff', '', '', 'Ninth', '260', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-117.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lycanroc ex', '745', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '117', 'Stage 1, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-118', '', '', 'Jerky', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Make the Assist\', \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'Move an Energy from this Pokémon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon battles by throwing hard berries. It won’t obey a Trainer who throws Poké Balls without skill.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Passimian', '766', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '118', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv2-119', '', '', 'kurumitsu', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Reckless Charge Together\', \'damage\': \'70+\', \'text\': \'If Falinks is on your Bench, this attack does 90 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'The brass, which is the one that stands at the front and issues orders, is the strongest and smartest of the six.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Falinks', '870', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '119', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv2-12', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Gather Sunlight\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Energy cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Its fluffy fur is similar in composition to plants. This Pokémon frequently washes its face to keep it from drying out.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sprigatito', '906', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-120', '', '', 'yuu', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'It was born in a layer of rock salt deep under the earth. This species was particularly treasured in the old days, as they would share precious salt.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nacli', '932', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '120', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-121', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Salt Coating\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Tackle\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'It was born in a layer of rock salt deep under the earth. This species was particularly treasured in the old days, as they would share precious salt.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nacli', '932', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '121', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-122', '', '', 'GIDORA', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Salt Cannon\', \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 60 damage for each heads.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Nacli', '', 'This Pokémon dry cures its prey by spraying salt over them. The curing process steals away the water in the prey’s body.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Naclstack', '933', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '122', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-123', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Blessed Salt\', \'text\': \'During Pokémon Checkup, heal 20 damage from each of your Pokémon.\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Knocking Hammer\', \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Naclstack', '', 'Garganacl will rub its fingertips together and sprinkle injured Pokémon with salt. Even severe wounds will promptly heal afterward.', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Garganacl', '934', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '123', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-124', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Ascension\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'It absorbs nutrients from cave walls. The petals it wears are made of crystallized poison.', 'Ninth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Glimmet', '969', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '124', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-125', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'It absorbs nutrients from cave walls. The petals it wears are made of crystallized poison.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Glimmet', '969', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '125', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2');
