('sv2-126', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Shattering Crystal\', \'text\': \"When this Pokémon is Knocked Out, flip a coin. If heads, your opponent can\'t take any Prize cards for it.\"}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Poison Petals\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned. During Pokémon Checkup, put 6 damage counters on that Pokémon instead of 1.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Glimmet', '', 'When this Pokémon detects danger, it will open up its crystalline petals and fire beams from its conical body.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Glimmora', '970', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '126', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
