('sv2-128', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Find a Home\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Stadium card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Ram\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'After losing a territorial struggle, Wooper began living on land. The Pokémon changed over time, developing a poisonous film to protect its body.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Paldean Wooper', '194', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '128', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
