('sv2-134', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Assaulting Hunt\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, when this Pokémon moves from your Bench to the Active Spot, you may switch in 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Basic Pokémon to the Active Spot.\"}]', '', 'saino misaki', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Slashing Claw\', \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Sneasel', '', 'Evolution made it even more devious. It communicates by clawing signs in boulders.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Weavile', '461', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '134', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-135', '', '', 'hncl', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Rout\', \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Dread Mountain\', \'damage\': \'230\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 4 cards of your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Pupitar', '', 'Extremely strong, it can change the landscape. It is so insolent that it doesn’t care about others.', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyranitar', '248', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '135', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-136', '', '', 'Nagomi Nijo', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Night Eyes\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Unseen Claw\', \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is affected by a Special Condition, this attack does 70 more damage.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'It dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sableye', '302', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '136', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-137', '', '', 'Nisota Niso', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Sharp Fang\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Cross-Cut\', \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is an Evolution Pokémon, this attack does 50 more damage.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seviper', '336', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '137', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv2-138', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Ambush\', \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'It can’t see, so its first approach to examining things is to bite them. You will be covered in wounds until a Deino warms up to you.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Deino', '633', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '138', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-139', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Find a Friend\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Headbutt Bounce\', \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Deino', '', 'The two heads do not get along at all. If you don’t give each head the same amount of attention, they’ll begin fighting out of jealousy.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zweilous', '634', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '139', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-14', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Magic Whip\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Switch out your opponent\'s Active Pokémon to the Bench. (Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Sprigatito', '', 'Floragato deftly wields the vine hidden beneath its long fur, slamming the hard flower bud against its opponents.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Floragato', '907', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '14', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-140', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Tri Howl\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may look at the top 3 cards of your deck and attach any number of Energy cards you find there to your Pokémon in any way you like. Discard the other cards.\'}]', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Dark Cutter\', \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Zweilous', '', 'Only the central head has a brain. It is very intelligent, but it thinks only of destruction.', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hydreigon', '635', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '140', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
