('sv2-214', '', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mumble\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mud Shot\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'If it loses its shovel, it will stick something else— like a branch—in its head to make do until it finds another shovel.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-214.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandygast', '769', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '214', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-215', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Revival Blessing\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put a Pokémon from your discard pile onto your Bench.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'name\': \'Psybeam\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Rellor', '', 'The body that supports the ball barely moves. Therefore, it is thought that the true body of this Pokémon is actually inside the ball.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-215.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rabsca', '954', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '215', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-216', '', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Scrap Pickup\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put an Item card from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Fairy Wind\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'It swings its handmade hammer around to protect itself, but the hammer is often stolen by Pokémon that eat metal.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-216.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tinkatink', '957', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '216', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-217', '', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Play Rough\', \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Pulverizing Press\', \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Tinkatink', '', 'This Pokémon will attack groups of Pawniard and Bisharp, gathering metal from them in order to create a large and sturdy hammer.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-217.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tinkatuff', '958', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '217', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-218', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Raging Horns\', \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Combat Tackle\', \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 30 damage to itself.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'This kind of Tauros, known as the Combat Breed, is distinguished by its thick, powerful muscles and its fierce disposition.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-218.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Paldean Tauros', '128', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '218', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv2-219', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Hit and Hide\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage from and effects of attacks done to this Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Elbow Strike\', \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears more similar to rock than to vegetation.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-219.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sudowoodo', '185', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '219', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-22', '', '', 'Pani Kobayashi', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Ride the Wind\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'A soul unable to move on to the afterlife was blown around by the wind until it got tangled up with dried grass and became a Pokémon.', 'Ninth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-22.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bramblin', '946', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '22', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-220', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Salt Coating\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'name\': \'Tackle\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'It was born in a layer of rock salt deep under the earth. This species was particularly treasured in the old days, as they would share precious salt.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-220.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nacli', '932', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '220', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-221', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Find a Home\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Stadium card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Ram\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'After losing a territorial struggle, Wooper began living on land. The Pokémon changed over time, developing a poisonous film to protect its body.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-221.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Paldean Wooper', '194', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '221', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv2-222', '', '', 'Nurikabe', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Rout\', \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Dread Mountain\', \'damage\': \'230\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 4 cards of your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Pupitar', '', 'Extremely strong, it can change the landscape. It is so insolent that it doesn’t care about others.', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-222.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyranitar', '248', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '222', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv2-223', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Spit Poison\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'name\': \'Colorful Graffiti\', \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'You may discard as many Basic Energy cards as you like from your hand. This attack does 40 damage for each type of Basic Energy you discarded in this way.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Shroodle', '', 'The color of the poisonous saliva depends on what the Pokémon eats. Grafaiai covers its fingers in its saliva and draws patterns on trees in forests.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-223.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grafaiai', '945', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '223', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv2-224', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Nutritional Iron\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has 3 or more Metal Energy attached, it gets +100 HP.\'}]', '', 'OKACHEKE', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Shoot Through\', \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'When attacked, this Pokémon will wield the tendrils on its body like fists and pelt the opponent with a storm of punches.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-224.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Orthworm', '968', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '224', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-225', '', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Send Back\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Switch out your opponent\'s Active Pokémon to the Bench.\\xa0(Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon is brave and reckless. The white markings around a Rookidee’s eyes intimidate fainthearted Pokémon.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-225.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rookidee', '821', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '225', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-226', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Gentle Slap\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Gnaw Relentlessly\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on each of your opponent\'s Pokémon for each of your Maushold in play.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Tandemaus', '', 'They build huge nests with many rooms that are used for different purposes, such as eating and sleeping.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-226.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Maushold', '925', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '226', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv2-227', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Insta-Flock\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 3 Flamigo, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'United Wings\', \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each Pokémon in your discard pile that has the United Wings attack.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon apparently ties the base of its neck into a knot so that the energy stored in its belly does not escape from its beak.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-227.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flamigo', '973', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '227', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-228', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Either Face\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Choose a player. That player shuffles their hand into their deck and draws 4 cards.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Power Beam\', \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Girafarig', '', 'Now that the brain waves from the head and tail are synced up, the psychic power of this Pokémon is 10 times stronger than Girafarig’s.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-228.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Farigiraf', '981', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '228', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv2-229', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mud-Slap\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Dig Away Flash\', \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed. Shuffle this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Dunsparce', '', 'This Pokémon uses its hard tail to make its nest by boring holes into bedrock deep underground. The nest can reach lengths of over six miles.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-229.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dudunsparce', '982', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '229', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
