('sv2-264', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Squawk and Seize\', \'text\': \"Once during your first turn, you may discard your hand and draw 6 cards. You can\'t use more than 1 Squawk and Seize Ability during your turn.\"}]', '', 'Amelicart', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Motivate\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Attach up to 2 Basic Energy cards from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-264.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Squawkabilly ex', '931', 'TPCI', 'Special Illustration Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '264', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
