('sv2-35', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Spacing Out\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Flare\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'It lies on warm rocks and uses the heat absorbed by its square-shaped scales to create fire energy.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Fuecoco', '909', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '35', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv2-36', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'name\': \'Steady Firebreathing\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'name\': \'Hyper Voice\', \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Fuecoco', '', 'The combination of Crocalor’s fire energy and overflowing vitality has caused an egg-shaped fireball to appear on the Pokémon’s head.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crocalor', '910', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '36', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv2-37', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'name\': \'Vitality Song\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from each of your Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'name\': \'Burning Voice\', \'damage\': \'270-\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 less damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Crocalor', '', '', 'Ninth', '340', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Skeledirge ex', '911', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '37', 'Stage 2, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv2-38', '', '', 'takuyoa', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Kick\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Burnt charcoal came to life and became a Pokémon. Possessing a fiery fighting spirit, Charcadet will battle even tough opponents.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charcadet', '935', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '38', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv2-39', '', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Live Coal\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Magnum Punch\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'Burnt charcoal came to life and became a Pokémon. Possessing a fiery fighting spirit, Charcadet will battle even tough opponents.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charcadet', '935', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '39', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv2-4', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Rollout\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'It likes to make its shell thicker by adding layers of tree bark. The additional weight doesn’t bother it.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pineco', '204', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-40', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'name\': \'Jealously Singe\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard the top 2 cards of your opponent\'s deck.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'name\': \'Flame Surge\', \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Choose up to 3 of your Benched Pokémon. For each of those Pokémon, search your deck for a Basic Fire Energy card and attach it to that Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chi-Yu ex', '1004', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '40', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv2-41', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Raging Horns\', \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Aqua Dive\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 60 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'It swims by jetting water from its horns. The most notable characteristic of the Aqua Breed is its high body fat, which allows it to float easily.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Paldean Tauros', '128', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '41', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-42', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Expert Splasher\', \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If both of them are heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'An underpowered, pathetic Pokémon. It may jump high on rare occasions but never more than seven feet.', 'Ninth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magikarp', '129', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '42', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-43', '', '', 'Yuya Oka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Revengeful Storm\', \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If you have more Prize cards remaining than your opponent, this attack does 100 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Berserker Tackle\', \'damage\': \'200\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 50 damage to itself.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '4', 'Magikarp', '', 'Once it appears, it goes on a rampage. It remains enraged until it demolishes everything around it.', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gyarados', '130', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '43', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-44', '', '', 'saino misaki', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Bubble Drain\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'The fur on its body naturally repels water. It can stay dry even when it plays in the water.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Marill', '183', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '44', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('sv2-45', '', '', 'En Morikura', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Bubble Drain\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Slam\', \'damage\': \'100×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 100 damage for each heads.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Marill', '', 'Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Azumarill', '184', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-46', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Double Draw\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Ice Wing\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'It carries food all day long. There are tales about lost people who were saved by the food it had.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Delibird', '225', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '46', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-47', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Matching\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Supporter cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Water Pulse\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a Luvdisc to someone you love.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Luvdisc', '370', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-48', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'name\': \'Frigid Block\', \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Discard all Energy from this Pokémon. During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 100 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'On hot days, these Pokémon press their ice cube heads together and pass the time cooling each other down.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eiscue', '875', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '48', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-49', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Apply Gel\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if the Defending Pokémon tries to attack, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack doesn\'t happen.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon migrated to Paldea from distant lands long ago. The gel secreted by its feathers repels water and grime.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Quaxly', '912', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '49', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-5', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Exploding Energy\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 5 Basic Grass Energy cards and attach them to your Pokémon in any way you like. Then, shuffle your deck. If you searched your deck in this way, this Pokémon is Knocked Out.\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Pineco', '', '', 'Ninth', '270', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Forretress ex', '205', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\"As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks (both yours and your opponent\'s).\", \'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '5', 'Stage 1, Tera, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-50', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 10 damage to itself.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon migrated to Paldea from distant lands long ago. The gel secreted by its feathers repels water and grime.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Quaxly', '912', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '50', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-51', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Quaxly', '', 'These Pokémon constantly run through shallow waters to train their legs, then compete with each other to see which of them kicks most gracefully.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Quaxwell', '913', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-52', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Exciting Dance\', \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. If you do, switch out your opponent\'s Active Pokémon to the Bench.\\xa0(Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Spiral Shot\', \'damage\': \'230\', \'text\': \'Put 2 Energy attached to this Pokémon into your hand.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Quaxwell', '', '', 'Ninth', '320', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Quaquaval ex', '914', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '52', 'Stage 2, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-53', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Avalanche\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'This species left the ocean and began living on land a very long time ago. It seems to be closely related to Wailmer.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cetoddle', '974', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-54', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Rest\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon is now Asleep. Heal 60 damage from it.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Double-Edge\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 10 damage to itself.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'This species left the ocean and began living on land a very long time ago. It seems to be closely related to Wailmer.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cetoddle', '974', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '54', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-55', '', '', 'Pani Kobayashi', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Icicle Missile\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Special Horn\', \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Special Energy attached, this attack does 140 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Cetoddle', '', 'This Pokémon wanders around snowy, icy areas. It protects its body with powerful muscles and a thick layer of fat under its skin.', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cetitan', '975', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '55', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-56', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Ram\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Slim Screw\', \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'If you have no cards in your hand, this attack can be used for Water.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'When Veluza discards unnecessary flesh, its mind becomes honed and its psychic power increases. The spare flesh has a mild but delicious flavor.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Veluza', '976', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv2-57', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Tackle\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and converts the heat into ice energy. The higher the temperature, the more energy Frigibax stores.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Frigibax', '996', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-58', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'name\': \'Chilly\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Bite\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and converts the heat into ice energy. The higher the temperature, the more energy Frigibax stores.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Frigibax', '996', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-59', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Sharp Fin\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Frost Smash\', \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Frigibax', '', 'Arctibax freezes the air around it, protecting its face with an ice mask and turning its dorsal fin into a blade of ice.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arctibax', '997', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '59', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-6', '', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Tackle\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Smashing Horn\', \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'It loves sweet nectar. To keep all the nectar to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Heracross', '214', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
