('sv2-85', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'name\': \'Tail-Fishing\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a card and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck. If tails, discard a card from your hand.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'name\': \'Zen Headbutt\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'It is incredibly slow and dopey. It takes five seconds for it to feel pain when under attack.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Slowpoke', '79', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '85', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-86', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'name\': \'Profound Knowledge\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'name\': \'Wise Headbutt\', \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'You may search your deck for up to 2 cards and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', 'Slowpoke', '', '', 'Ninth', '270', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Slowking ex', '199', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\"As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks (both yours and your opponent\'s).\", \'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '86', 'Stage 1, Tera, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-87', '', '', 'Megumi Higuchi', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Misdreavus', '200', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '87', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-88', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Magical Flick\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may move an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon to 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\"}]', '', 'Atsushi Furusawa', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Psychic Sphere\', \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Misdreavus', '', 'Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mismagius', '429', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '88', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-89', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Fettered in Misfortune\', \'text\': \"Basic Pokémon V in play\\xa0(both yours and your opponent\'s)\\xa0have no Abilities.\"}]', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Fade Out\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Put this Pokémon and all attached cards into your hand.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spiritomb', '442', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '89', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-9', '', '', 'Megumi Higuchi', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Double Stab\', \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage for each heads.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'name\': \'Order a Raid\', \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your Benched Combee and shuffle that Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck. If you can\'t shuffle a Combee into your deck, this attack does nothing.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Combee', '', 'It houses its colony in cells in its body and releases various pheromones to make those grubs do its bidding.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vespiquen', '416', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '9', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv2-90', '', '', '313', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Pound\', \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Eerie Wave\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon is normally very innocent. When it is staring at something invisible, it is unblinking and utterly silent.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothita', '574', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '90', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-91', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mind Bend\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Super Psy Bolt\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', 'Gothita', '', 'This Pokémon will hypnotize children to put them to sleep before carrying them away. Be wary of nights when the starlight is bright.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothorita', '575', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '91', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-92', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Read the Stars\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may look at the top 2 cards of your opponent\'s deck and put 1 of them back. Put the other card on the bottom of their deck.\"}]', '', 'Shiburingaru', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Psych Out\', \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Discard a random card from your opponent\'s hand.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Gothorita', '', 'Gothitelle unleashes psychic energy and shows opponents dreams of the universe’s end. These dreams are apparently ethereal and beautiful.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothitelle', '576', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '92', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-93', '', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'name\': \'Tail Swap\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Move all damage counters from 1 of your Benched Pokémon to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'name\': \'Wondrous Shot\', \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dedenne ex', '702', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '[\"As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks (both yours and your opponent\'s).\", \'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '93', 'Basic, Tera, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-94', '', '', 'Toshinao Aoki', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Plotter’s Command\', \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks. During your opponent\'s next turn, that Pokémon can\'t use that attack.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Super Psy Bolt\', \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', '', '', 'People used to mistake Oranguru for a human when they saw it issue command after command to the other Pokémon of the forest.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Oranguru', '765', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '94', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-95', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mumble\', \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Mud Shot\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '3', '', '', 'If it loses its shovel, it will stick something else— like a branch—in its head to make do until it finds another shovel.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandygast', '769', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '95', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-96', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Spooky Shot\', \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Earthen Power\', \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If you have a Stadium in play, this attack does 80 more damage.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '4', 'Sandygast', '', 'The terrifying Palossand drags smaller Pokémon into its sandy body. Once its victims are trapped, it drains them of their vitality whenever it pleases.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palossand', '770', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '96', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv2-97', '[{\'type\': \'Ability\', \'name\': \'Safeguard\', \'text\': \"Prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon ex and Pokémon V.\"}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Ghost Eye\', \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 7 damage counters on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon lives in dark places untouched by sunlight. When it appears before humans, it hides itself under a cloth that resembles a Pikachu.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mimikyu', '778', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '97', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv2-98', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Life Sucker\', \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\', \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2}, {\'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'name\': \'Fighting Sword\', \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon ex or Pokémon V, this attack does 100 more damage.\", \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3}]', 'Paldea Evolved', '2', 'Charcadet', '', 'The fiery blades on its arms burn fiercely with the lingering resentment of a sword wielder who fell before accomplishing their goal.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv2/sv2-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ceruledge', '937', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '06/09/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '98', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2');
