('sv3-151', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Defense Curl\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks.\"}, {\'name\': \'Rolling Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', '', 'When its in trouble, it curls up into a ball, makes its fur spikes stand on end, and then discharges electricity indiscriminately.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-151.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Togedemaru', '777', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '151', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
