('sv3-200', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Jet Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Justice Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'210\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon didn\'t move from the Bench to the Active Spot this turn, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Finizen', '', 'This Pokémons ancient genes have awakened. It is now so extraordinarily strong that it can easily lift a cruise ship with one fin.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-200.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palafin', '964', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '200', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
