('sv3-204', '', '', 'KYUPIYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Coordinated Pack\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'For each of your Benched Houndour, search your deck for a Basic Darkness Energy card and attach it to that Houndour. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Focus Fangs\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Houndoom', 'It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-204.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Houndour', '228', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '204', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv3-205', '', '', 'Oku', '[{\'name\': \'Punishing Scissors\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 more damage for each of your opponent\'s Pokémon in play that has an Ability.\"}, {\'name\': \'Cut\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Scyther', '', 'This Pokémons pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object they get ahold of into bits.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-205.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scizor', '212', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '205', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3-206', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Revavroom', 'It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-206.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Varoom', '965', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '206', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3-207', '', '', 'Jerky', '[{\'name\': \'Gust\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Pidgeotto', 'It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-207.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pidgey', '16', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '207', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-208', '', '', 'Jerky', '[{\'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', 'Pidgey', 'Pidgeot', 'Very protective of its sprawling territorial area, this Pokémon will fiercely peck at any intruder.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-208.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pidgeotto', '17', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '208', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-209', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Oinkologne', 'It searches for food all day. It possesses a keen sense of smell but doesnt use it for anything other than foraging.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-209.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lechonk', '915', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '209', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-21', '', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'name\': \'Healing Fruit\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal all damage from 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Oil Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Dolliv', '', 'This calm Pokémon is very compassionate. It will share its delicious, nutrient-rich oil with weakened Pokémon.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-21.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arboliva', '930', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '21', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2');
