('sv3-48', '', '', 'Jerky', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Floatzel', 'It spins its two tails like a screw to propel itself through water. The tails also slice clinging seaweed.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Buizel', '418', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '48', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-49', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Swirling Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, put your opponent\'s Active Pokémon and all attached cards into your opponent\'s hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Waterfall\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', 'Buizel', '', 'With its flotation sac inflated, it can carry people on its back. It deflates the sac before it dives.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Floatzel', '419', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '49', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-5', '', '', 'Kurata So', '[{\'name\': \'Berry Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', '', 'The berries stored in its vaselike shell eventually become a thick, pulpy juice.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shuckle', '213', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '5', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3-50', '', '', 'OKUBO', '[{\'name\': \'Screw Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Palpitoad', 'It uses sound waves to communicate with others of its kind. People and other Pokémon species cant hear its cries of warning.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tympole', '535', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '50', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-51', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Tympole', 'Seismitoad', 'On occasion, their cries are sublimely pleasing to the ear. Palpitoad with larger lumps on their bodies can sing with a wider range of sounds.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palpitoad', '536', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '51', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-52', '[{\'name\': \'Quaking Zone\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, attacks used by your opponent\'s Active Pokémon cost Colorless more.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Echoed Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Echoed Voice attack does 100 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '3', 'Palpitoad', '', 'This Pokémon is popular among the elderly, who say the vibrations of its lumps are great for massages.', 'Ninth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seismitoad', '537', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '52', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-53', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Smash Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Trip Over\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', '', 'Beartic', 'Many of this species can be found along the shorelines of cold regions. If a Cubchoo lacks dangling snot, theres a chance it is sick.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cubchoo', '613', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv3-54', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Icicle Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Frost Purge\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, discard all Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '3', 'Cubchoo', '', 'It is a ferocious, carnivorous Pokémon. Once it captures its prey, it will breathe cold air onto the prey to freeze and preserve it.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beartic', '614', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '54', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv3-55', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'First Freeze\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"If you go second and it\'s your first turn, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', '', 'Cryogonal appear during cold seasons. It is said that people and Pokémon who die on snowy mountains are reborn into these Pokémon.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cryogonal', '615', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv3-56', '', '', 'Atsuya Uki', '[{\'name\': \'Try Bouncing\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Frogadier', 'It protects its skin by covering its body in delicate bubbles. Beneath its happy-go-lucky air, it keeps a watchful eye on its surroundings.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Froakie', '656', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-57', '', '', 'Tonji Matsuno', '[{\'name\': \'Strafe\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'You may switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', 'Froakie', 'Greninja', 'Its swiftness is unparalleled. It can scale a tower of more than 600 metres in a minutes time.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Frogadier', '657', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '57', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-58', '', '', 'Pani Kobayashi', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Wugtrio', 'This Pokémon can pick up the scent of a Veluza just over 65 feet away and will hide itself in the sand.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wiglett', '960', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-59', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Entwining Entrapment\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', 'Wiglett', '', 'It has a vicious temperament, contrary to what its appearance may suggest. It wraps its long bodies around prey, then drags the prey into its den.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wugtrio', '961', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '59', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
