('sv3-6', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Lunge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Masquerain', 'They usually live on ponds, but after an evening shower, they may appear on puddles in towns.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Surskit', '283', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3-60', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Valiant Evolution\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. If you do, search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Fin\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', '', 'Palafin', 'It likes playing with others of its kind using the water ring on its tail. It uses ultrasonic waves to sense the emotions of other living creatures.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Finizen', '963', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-61', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', '', 'Palafin', 'It likes playing with others of its kind using the water ring on its tail. It uses ultrasonic waves to sense the emotions of other living creatures.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Finizen', '963', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-62', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Jet Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Justice Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'210\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon didn\'t move from the Bench to the Active Spot this turn, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Finizen', '', 'This Pokémons ancient genes have awakened. It is now so extraordinarily strong that it can easily lift a cruise ship with one fin.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palafin', '964', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '62', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3-63', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Speed Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Magneton', 'The electromagnetic waves emitted by the units at the sides of its head expel antigravity, which allows it to float.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magnemite', '81', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-64', '', '', 'kurumitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Magnemite', 'Magnezone', 'Three Magnemite are linked by a strong magnetic force. Earaches will occur if you get too close.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magneton', '82', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-65', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Magnetic Repulsion\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"You may switch out your opponent\'s Active Pokémon to the Bench. (Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Magneton', '', 'As it zooms through the sky, this Pokémon seems to be receiving signals of unknown origin while transmitting signals of unknown purpose.', 'Ninth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magnezone', '462', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '65', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-66', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Mountain Hurl\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 2 cards of your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Lightning Rampage\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'150+\', \'text\': \'If your Benched Pokémon have any damage counters on them, this attack does 100 more damage.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '4', 'Pupitar', '', '', 'Ninth', '340', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyranitar ex', '248', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\', \"Tera: As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks (both yours and your opponent\'s).\"]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '66', 'Stage 2, ex, Tera', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-67', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Tiny Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Eelektrik', 'While one alone doesnt have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning.', 'Ninth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tynamo', '602', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-68', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Volt Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Electric Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Tynamo', 'Eelektross', 'They coil around foes and shock them with electricity-generating organs that seem simply to be circular patterns.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eelektrik', '603', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '68', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-69', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Suction Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch in 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon to the Active Spot. If you do, this attack does 60 damage to the new Active Pokémon, and then flip a coin. If heads, that Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Head Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '3', 'Eelektrik', '', 'They crawl out of the ocean using their arms. They will attack prey on shore and immediately drag it into the ocean.', 'Ninth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eelektross', '604', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '69', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-7', '', '', 'Haru Akasaka', '[{\'name\': \'Panic-Prompting Pattern\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, discard a random card from your opponent\'s hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bug Buzz\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', 'Surskit', '', 'It flaps its four wings to hover and fly freely in any direction—to and fro and sideways.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Masquerain', '284', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3-70', '[{\'name\': \'Adverse Weather\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, prevent all damage done to your Benched Pokémon by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'name\': \'Gigantic Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 90 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', '', '', 'As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Thundurus', '642', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3-71', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'name\': \'Slight Intrusion\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Toxtricity', 'It has no problem drinking dirty water. An organ inside Toxels body filters such water into a poisonous liquid that is harmless to Toxel.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxel', '848', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
