('sv3-97', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Cold Tea\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '1', '', 'Polteageist', 'The soul of someone who died alone possessed some leftover tea. This Pokémon appears in hotels and houses.', 'Ninth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sinistea', '854', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '97', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3-98', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Antique Collecting\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put up to 2 in any combination of Item cards and Pokémon Tool cards from your discard pile into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Pour Tea\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 5 damage counters on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', 'Sinistea', '', 'The tea that composes Polteageists body has a distinct and enjoyable flavor. Drinking too much, however, can be fatal.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Polteageist', '855', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '98', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3-99', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Spooky Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Obsidian Flames', '2', '', 'Houndstone', 'It is said that a dog Pokémon that died in the wild without ever interacting with a human was reborn as this Pokémon.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3/sv3-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Greavard', '971', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '08/11/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '99', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-1', '', '', 'Yuu Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Leech Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', '151', '2', '', 'Ivysaur', 'While it is young, it uses the nutrients that are stored in the seed on its back in order to grow.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bulbasaur', '1', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-10', '', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'name\': \'Leaf Munch\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Grass Pokémon, this attack does 30 more damage.\"}]', '151', '1', '', 'Metapod', 'Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Caterpie', '10', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-100', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Tumbling Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', '151', '1', '', 'Electrode', 'It rolls to move. If the ground is uneven, a sudden jolt from hitting a bump can cause it to explode.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Voltorb', '100', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '100', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-101', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Bang Boom Chain\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Before doing damage, you may discard any number of Pokémon Tools from your Pokémon. This attack does 40 more damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}, {\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', 'Voltorb', '', 'The more energy it charges up, the faster it gets. But this also makes it more likely to explode.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Electrode', '101', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '101', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-102', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Ball Roll\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 damage for each heads.\'}]', '151', '1', '', 'Exeggutor', 'These Pokémon get nervous when theyre not in a group of six. The minute even one member of the group goes missing, Exeggcute become cowardly.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-102.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Exeggcute', '102', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '102', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-103', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '3', 'Exeggcute', '', 'When they work together, Exeggutors three heads can put out powerful psychic energy. Cloudy days make this Pokémon sluggish.', 'Ninth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-103.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Exeggutor', '103', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '103', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-104', '[{\'name\': \'Cheering Bone\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is on your Bench, attacks used by your Marowak do 30 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shinya Komatsu', '[{\'name\': \'Hit Twice\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', '151', '1', '', 'Marowak', 'This Pokémon wears the skull of its deceased mother. Sometimes Cubones dreams make it cry, but each tear Cubone sheds makes it stronger.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-104.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cubone', '104', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '104', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-105', '', '', 'Shinya Komatsu', '[{\'name\': \'Bone Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Boundless Power\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', '151', '2', 'Cubone', '', 'When this Pokémon evolved, the skull of its mother fused to it. Marowaks temperament also turned vicious at the same time.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Marowak', '105', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '105', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-106', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Twister Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '2', '', '', 'The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hitmonlee', '106', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '106', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-107', '[{\'name\': \'Counterattack\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is in the Active Spot and is damaged by an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), put 3 damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'DOM', '[{\'name\': \'Excited Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Excited Punch attack does 60 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', '151', '1', '', '', 'Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-107.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hitmonchan', '107', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '107', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-108', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Tongue-Tied\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', '151', '4', '', 'Lickilicky', 'Bug Pokémon are Lickitungs main food source. This Pokémon paralyzes its prey with a lick from its long tongue, then swallows the prey whole.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-108.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lickitung', '108', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '108', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-109', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Suspicious Gas\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', '151', '1', '', 'Weezing', 'Its body is full of poisonous gas. It floats into garbage dumps, seeking out the fumes of raw, rotting trash.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Koffing', '109', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '109', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-11', '', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Defensive Posture\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks.\"}]', '151', '3', 'Caterpie', 'Butterfree', 'Even though it is encased in a sturdy shell, the body inside is tender. It cant withstand a harsh attack.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Metapod', '11', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '11', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-110', '[{\'name\': \"Let\'s Have a Blast\", \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is in the Active Spot and is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon, flip a coin. If heads, the Attacking Pokémon is Knocked Out.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Fumes\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', '151', '2', 'Koffing', '', 'Very rarely, a sudden mutation can result in two small Koffing twins becoming conjoined as a Weezing.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Weezing', '110', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '110', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-111', '', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'name\': \'Push Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Switch out your opponent\'s Active Pokémon to the Bench. (Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Boulder Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '3', '', 'Rhydon', 'It can remember only one thing at a time. Once it starts rushing, it forgets why it started.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rhyhorn', '111', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '111', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-112', '', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'name\': \'Wrack Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Charismatic Drill\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \"If you played Giovanni\'s Charisma from your hand during this turn, this attack does 140 more damage.\"}]', '151', '4', 'Rhyhorn', 'Rhyperior', 'Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-112.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rhydon', '112', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '112', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('sv3pt5-113', '[{\'name\': \'Lucky Bonus\', \'text\': \"If you took this Pokémon as a face-down Prize card during your turn and your Bench isn\'t full, before you put it into your hand, you may put it onto your Bench. If you put this Pokémon onto your Bench in this way, flip a coin. If heads, take 1 more Prize card.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Taiga Kayama', '[{\'name\': \'Gentle Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '2', '', 'Blissey', 'This kindly Pokémon lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chansey', '113', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '113', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-114', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Tactful Tangling\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"If you played Erika\'s Invitation from your hand during this turn, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}]', '151', '2', '', 'Tangrowth', 'Hidden beneath a tangle of vines that grows nonstop even if the vines are torn off, this Pokémons true appearance remains a mystery.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tangela', '114', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '114', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-115', '', '', 'N-DESIGN Inc.', '[{\'name\': \'Triple Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 3 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Incessant Punching\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 100 damage for each heads.\'}]', '151', '2', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '230', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-115.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kangaskhan ex', '115', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '115', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-116', '', '', 'aspara', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sharp Fin\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Seadra', 'They swim with dance-like motions and cause whirlpools to form. Horsea compete to see which of them can generate the biggest whirlpool.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Horsea', '116', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '116', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-117', '', '', 'aspara', '[{\'name\': \'Blinding Ink\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if the Defending Pokémon tries to use an attack, your opponent flips 2 coins. If either of them is tails, that attack doesn\'t happen.\"}]', '151', '1', 'Horsea', 'Kingdra', 'Seadras mouth is slender, but its suction power is strong. In an instant, Seadra can suck in food thats larger than the opening of its mouth.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-117.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seadra', '117', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '117', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-118', '', '', 'SIE NANAHARA', '[{\'name\': \'Triple Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sprinkle Water\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Seaking', 'Its dorsal and pectoral fins are strongly developed like muscles. It can swim at a speed of five knots.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-118.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Goldeen', '118', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '118', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-119', '', '', 'SIE NANAHARA', '[{\'name\': \'Swim Freely\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage from and effects of attacks done to this Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Horn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', '151', '2', 'Goldeen', '', 'Using its horn, it bores holes in riverbed boulders, making nests to prevent its eggs from washing away.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seaking', '119', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '119', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-12', '', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'name\': \'Whirlwind\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Switch out your opponent\'s Active Pokémon to the Bench. (Your opponent chooses the new Active Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Bye-Bye Flight\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. Shuffle that Pokémon and all attached cards into their deck, and then shuffle this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck. If your opponent has no Benched Pokémon, this attack does nothing.\"}]', '151', '1', 'Metapod', '', 'It collects honey every day. It rubs honey onto the hairs on its legs to carry it back to its nest.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Butterfree', '12', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '12', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-120', '', '', 'Arai Kiriko', '[{\'name\': \'Swift\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance, or by any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', '151', '1', '', 'Starmie', 'Fish Pokémon nibble at it, but Staryu isnt bothered. Its body regenerates quickly, even if part of it is completely torn off.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Staryu', '120', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '120', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-121', '[{\'name\': \'Mysterious Comet\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may put 2 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. If you placed any damage counters in this way, discard this Pokémon and all attached cards.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Arai Kiriko', '[{\'name\': \'Speed Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', 'Staryu', '', 'Starmie swims by spinning its body at high speed. As this Pokémon cruises through the ocean, it absorbs tiny plankton.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Starmie', '121', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '121', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-122', '[{\'name\': \'Mimic Barrier\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon and your opponent\'s Active Pokémon have the same amount of Energy attached, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'OOYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Psypower\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', '151', '1', '', '', 'Its known for its top-notch pantomime skills. It protects itself from all sorts of attacks by emitting auras from its fingers to create walls.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mr. Mime', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '122', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-123', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Helpful Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Attach a Basic Grass Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slicing Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '', '', 'Scizor', 'It slashes through grass with its sharp scythes, moving too fast for the human eye to track.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scyther', '123', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '123', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-124', '', '', 'Ayaka Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Heart-Stopping Kiss\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Asleep, it is Knocked Out.\"}, {\'name\': \'Icy Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', '151', '2', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '200', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jynx ex', '124', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '124', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-125', '', '', 'NC Empire', '[{\'name\': \'Electro Combo\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Magmar is on your Bench, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Light Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '2', '', 'Electivire', 'With the coming of a storm, many of these Pokémon will gather under tall trees and sit there waiting for lightning to strike.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Electabuzz', '125', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '125', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-126', '', '', 'Toshinao Aoki', '[{\'name\': \'Live Coal\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Flare Combo\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If Electabuzz is on your Bench, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', '151', '2', '', 'Magmortar', 'These Pokémons bodies are constantly burning. Magmar are feared as one of the causes behind fires.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magmar', '126', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '126', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-127', '', '', 'Yuya Oka', '[{\'name\': \'Vise Grip\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Reckless Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \'If you have more Prize cards remaining than your opponent, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', '151', '2', '', '', 'This Pokémon clamps its pincers down on its prey and then either splits the prey in half or flings it away.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pinsir', '127', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '127', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-128', '', '', 'Takeshi Nakamura', '[{\'name\': \'Gather the Crew\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Rage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}]', '151', '2', '', '', 'When it targets an enemy, it charges furiously while whipping its body with its long tails.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tauros', '128', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '128', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-129', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Splashy Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, draw a card.\'}]', '151', '1', '', 'Gyarados', 'An underpowered, pathetic Pokémon. It may jump high on rare occasions but never more than seven feet.', 'Ninth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magikarp', '129', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '129', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-13', '', '', 'nisimono', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bug Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Kakuna', 'Its poison stinger is very powerful. Its bright-colored body is intended to warn off its enemies.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Weedle', '13', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-130', '[{\'name\': \'Untamed One\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you must discard the top 5 cards of your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Hyper Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'200\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', '151', '4', 'Magikarp', '', 'Once it appears, it goes on a rampage. It remains enraged until it demolishes everything around it.', 'Ninth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gyarados', '130', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '130', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-131', '', '', 'LINNE', '[{\'name\': \'Hop on My Back\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Edge\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', '', 'Crossing icy seas is no issue for this cold-resistant Pokémon. Its smooth skin is a little cool to the touch.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '131', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-132', '[{\'name\': \'Transformative Start\', \'text\': \'Once during your first turn, if this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, you may search your deck and choose a Basic Pokémon you find there, except any Ditto. If you do, discard this Pokémon and all attached cards, and put the chosen Pokémon in its place. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Splup\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', '', 'Its transformation ability is perfect. However, if made to laugh, it cant maintain its disguise.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ditto', '132', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '132', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-133', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Colorful Friends\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Pokémon of different types, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Skip\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Vaporeon, Jolteon, Flareon, Sylveon, Espeon, Umbreon, Leafeon, Glaceon', 'Its ability to evolve into many forms allows it to adapt smoothly and perfectly to any environment.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eevee', '133', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '133', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-134', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Spiral Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Fighting Whirlpool\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon ex or Pokémon V, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}]', '151', '2', 'Eevee', '', 'It lives close to water. Its long tail is ridged with a fin, which is often mistaken for a mermaids.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vaporeon', '134', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '134', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-135', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Linear Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Fighting Lightning\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon ex or Pokémon V, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}]', '151', '', 'Eevee', '', 'It concentrates the weak electric charges emitted by its cells and launches wicked lightning bolts.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jolteon', '135', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '135', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-136', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Destructive Flame\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fighting Blaze\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon ex or Pokémon V, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}]', '151', '2', 'Eevee', '', 'Inhaled air is carried to its flame sac, heated, and exhaled as fire that reaches over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flareon', '136', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '136', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-137', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Conversion 4\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose Grass, Fire, Water, Lightning, Psychic, Fighting, Darkness, Metal, or Dragon type. Until the Defending Pokémon leaves the Active Spot, its Weakness is now that type. (The amount of Weakness doesn\'t change.)\"}]', '151', '1', '', 'Porygon2', 'In recent years, this species has been very helpful in cyberspace. These Pokémon will go around checking to make sure no suspicious data exists.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Porygon', '137', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '137', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-138', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Tentacular Return\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Put an Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon into their hand.\"}]', '151', '2', 'Antique Helix Fossil', 'Omastar', 'This Pokémon is a member of an ancient, extinct species. Omanyte paddles through water with its 10 tentacles, looking like its just drifting along.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Omanyte', '138', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '138', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-139', '[{\'name\': \'Primordial Tentacles\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon can\'t retreat.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Split\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', '151', '3', 'Omanyte', '', 'Omastars sharp fangs could crush rock, but the Pokémon can attack only the prey that come within reach of its tentacles.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Omastar', '139', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '139', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-14', '[{\'name\': \'Cocoon Cover\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of attacks used by your opponent\'s Pokémon done to this Pokémon. (Damage is not an effect.)\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nisimono', '[{\'name\': \'Zzzt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '3', 'Weedle', 'Beedrill', 'While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kakuna', '14', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '14', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-140', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Double Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 70 damage for each heads.\'}]', '151', '2', 'Antique Dome Fossil', 'Kabutops', 'While some say this species has gone extinct, Kabuto sightings are apparently fairly common in some places.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kabuto', '140', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '140', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
