('sv3pt5-143', '[{\'name\': \'Voraciousness\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may put up to 2 Leftovers cards from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Thudding Press\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', '151', '4', '', '', 'This Pokémons stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-143.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorlax', '143', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '143', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-144', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Float\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Water Energy attached, it has no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'chibi', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzard\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', '151', '2', '', '', 'This Pokémon can control ice at will. Articuno is said to live in snowy mountains riddled with permafrost.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-144.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Articuno', '144', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '144', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-145', '[{\'name\': \'Voltaic Float\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Lightning Energy attached, it has no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'takuyoa', '[{\'name\': \'Multishot Lightning\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 90 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon that has any damage counters on it. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', '151', '2', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '200', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-145.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zapdos ex', '145', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '145', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-146', '[{\'name\': \'Flare Float\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Fire Energy attached, it has no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'name\': \'Blazing Flight\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard 2 Fire Energy from this Pokémon. This attack does 120 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', '151', '2', '', '', 'There are stories of this Pokémon using its radiant, flame-cloaked wings to light up paths for those lost in the mountains.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-146.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Moltres', '146', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '146', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-147', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Draconic Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Dragonair', 'It sheds many layers of skin as it grows larger. During this process, it is protected by a rapid waterfall.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-147.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dratini', '147', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '147', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', ''),
('sv3pt5-148', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', '151', '2', 'Dratini', 'Dragonite', 'They say that if it emits an aura from its whole body, the weather will begin to change instantly.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-148.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dragonair', '148', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '148', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', ''),
('sv3pt5-149', '[{\'name\': \'Jet Cruise\', \'text\': \'Your Pokémon in play have no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Dragon Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 2 cards of your deck.\'}]', '151', '3', 'Dragonair', '', 'It is said that somewhere in the ocean lies an island where these gather. Only they live there.', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-149.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dragonite', '149', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '149', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', ''),
('sv3pt5-15', '', '', 'nisimono', '[{\'name\': \'Nadir Needle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If you have no cards in your hand, this attack does 120 more damage, and your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed and Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', 'Kakuna', '', 'May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beedrill', '15', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '15', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-150', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'name\': \'Reflective Barrier\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if this Pokémon is damaged by an attack (even if it is Knocked Out), put damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon equal to the damage done to this Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psyslash\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', '151', '2', '', '', 'A Pokémon created by recombining Mews genes. Its said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-150.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mewtwo', '150', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '150', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-151', '[{\'name\': \'Restart\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may draw cards until you have 3 cards in your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Genome Hacking\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks and use it as this attack.\"}]', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-151.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mew ex', '151', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '151', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-152', '[{\'name\': \'Domed Armor\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'AYUMI ODASHIMA', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-152.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Antique Dome Fossil', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\"Play this card as if it were a 60-HP Basic Colorless Pokémon. This card can\'t be affected by any Special Conditions and can\'t retreat.  At any time during your turn, you may discard this card from play.\", \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '152', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-153', '[{\'name\': \'Helical Swell\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, your opponent can\'t play any Stadium cards from their hand.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'AYUMI ODASHIMA', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-153.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Antique Helix Fossil', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\"Play this card as if it were a 60-HP Basic Colorless Pokémon. This card can\'t be affected by any Special Conditions and can\'t retreat.  At any time during your turn, you may discard this card from play.\", \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '153', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-154', '[{\'name\': \'Amber Protection\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of your opponent\'s Pokémon\'s Abilities done to this Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'AYUMI ODASHIMA', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-154.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Antique Old Amber', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\"Play this card as if it were a 60-HP Basic Colorless Pokémon. This card can\'t be affected by any Special Conditions and can\'t retreat.  At any time during your turn, you may discard this card from play.\", \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '154', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-155', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-155.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Big Air Balloon', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\'The Stage 2 Pokémon this card is attached to has no Retreat Cost.\', \'You may attach any number of Pokémon Tools to your Pokémon during your turn. You may attach only 1 Pokémon Tool to each Pokémon, and it stays attached.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '155', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-156', '', '', 'GIDORA', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-156.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bills Transfer', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\'Look at the top 8 cards of your deck. You may reveal any number of Pokémon you find there and put them into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '156', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-157', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-157.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cycling Road', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\"Once during each player\'s turn, that player may discard a Basic Energy card from their hand in order to draw a card.\", \"You may play only 1 Stadium card during your turn. Put it next to the Active Spot, and discard it if another Stadium comes into play. A Stadium with the same name can\'t be played.\"]', 'Scarlet & Violet', '157', 'Stadium', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-158', '', '', 'Tomomi Kaneko', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-158.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Daisys Help', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\'Draw 2 cards. Look at your face-down Prize cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '158', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-159', '', '', 'Ayaka Yoshida', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-159.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Energy Sticker', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\'Flip a coin. If heads, attach a Basic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '159', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-16', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Pidgeotto', 'It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pidgey', '16', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-160', '', '', 'saino misaki', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-160.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Erikas Invitation', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\"Your opponent reveals their hand, and you put a Basic Pokémon you find there onto your opponent\'s Bench. If you put a Pokémon onto their Bench in this way, switch in that Pokémon to the Active Spot.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '160', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-161', '', '', 'hncl', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-161.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Giovannis Charisma', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\"Put an Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon into their hand. If you do, attach an Energy card from your hand to your Active Pokémon.\", \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '161', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-162', '', '', 'inose yukie', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-162.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grabber', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\'Your opponent reveals their hand, and you put a Pokémon you find there on the bottom of their deck.\', \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '162', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-163', '', '', 'Studio Bora Inc.', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-163.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Leftovers', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\'At the end of your turn, if the Pokémon this card is attached to is in the Active Spot, heal 20 damage from it.\', \'You may attach any number of Pokémon Tools to your Pokémon during your turn. You may attach only 1 Pokémon Tool to each Pokémon, and it stays attached.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '163', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-164', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-164.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Protective Goggles', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\'The Basic Pokémon this card is attached to has no Weakness.\', \'You may attach any number of Pokémon Tools to your Pokémon during your turn. You may attach only 1 Pokémon Tool to each Pokémon, and it stays attached.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '164', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-165', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', '151', '', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-165.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rigid Band', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', '', '[\"The Stage 1 Pokémon this card is attached to takes 30 less damage from attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'You may attach any number of Pokémon Tools to your Pokémon during your turn. You may attach only 1 Pokémon Tool to each Pokémon, and it stays attached.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '165', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('sv3pt5-166', '', '', 'Yoriyuki Ikegami', '[{\'name\': \'Leech Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', '151', '2', '', 'Ivysaur', 'While it is young, it uses the nutrients that are stored in the seed on its back in order to grow.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-166.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bulbasaur', '1', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '166', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-167', '', '', 'Yoriyuki Ikegami', '[{\'name\': \'Leech Seed\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Vine Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '3', 'Bulbasaur', 'Venusaur', 'Exposure to sunlight adds to its strength. Sunlight also makes the bud on its back grow larger.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-167.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ivysaur', '2', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '167', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-168', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'name\': \'Blazing Destruction\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard a Stadium in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Steady Firebreathing\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Charmeleon', 'From the time it is born, a flame burns at the tip of its tail. Its life would end if the flame were to go out.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-168.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charmander', '4', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '168', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-169', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'name\': \'Combustion\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}, {\'name\': \'Fire Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', '151', '2', 'Charmander', 'Charizard', 'If it becomes agitated during battle, it spouts intense flames, incinerating its surroundings.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-169.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Charmeleon', '5', 'TPCI', 'Illustration Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '169', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-17', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'name\': \'Flap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '', 'Pidgey', 'Pidgeot', 'Very protective of its sprawling territorial area, this Pokémon will fiercely peck at any intruder.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-17.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pidgeotto', '17', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '17', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
