('sv3pt5-83', '', '', 'KG-2000', '[{\'name\': \'Package Deal\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leek Clobber\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Sirfetchd', 'They use a plant stalk as a weapon, but not all of them use it in the same way. Several distinct styles of stalk fighting have been observed.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Farfetchd', '83', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-84', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', '151', '1', '', 'Dodrio', 'The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Doduo', '84', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '84', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-85', '[{\'name\': \'Zooming Draw\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may put 1 damage counter on this Pokémon. If you do, draw a card.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Ballistic Beak\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}]', '151', '1', 'Doduo', '', 'An odd species that is rarely found. The three heads respectively represent joy, sadness, and anger.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dodrio', '85', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '85', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-86', '', '', 'aoki', '[{\'name\': \'Chilly\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '2', '', 'Dewgong', 'Thanks to its thick fat, cold seas dont bother it at all, but it gets tired pretty easily in warm waters.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seel', '86', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-87', '', '', 'aoki', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Aurora Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '2', 'Seel', '', 'It sunbathes on the beach after meals. The rise in its body temperature helps its digestion.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dewgong', '87', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '87', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-88', '', '', 'Nisota Niso', '[{\'name\': \'Gummy Press\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost is Colorless more.\"}]', '151', '2', '', 'Muk', 'Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grimer', '88', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '88', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-89', '', '', 'Nisota Niso', '[{\'name\': \'Sticky Jail\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, attacks used by the Defending Pokémon cost Colorless more, and its Retreat Cost is Colorless more.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sludge Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '4', 'Grimer', '', 'Its thickly covered with a filthy, vile sludge. It is so toxic, even its footprints contain poison.', 'Ninth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Muk', '89', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '89', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-9', '[{\'name\': \'Solid Shell\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'PLANETA Yamashita', '[{\'name\': \'Twin Cannons\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'140×\', \'text\': \'Discard up to 2 Basic Water Energy cards from your hand. This attack does 140 damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', '151', '3', 'Wartortle', '', '', 'Ninth', '330', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Blastoise ex', '9', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '9', 'Stage 2, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-90', '', '', 'Nelnal', '[{\'name\': \'Shell Press\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', '151', '2', '', 'Cloyster', 'It is encased in a shell that is harder than diamond. Inside, however, it is surprisingly tender.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shellder', '90', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '90', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-91', '', '', 'Nelnal', '[{\'name\': \'Protect Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 80 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', '151', '3', 'Shellder', '', 'Cloyster that live in seas with harsh tidal currents grow large, sharp spikes on their shells.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cloyster', '91', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '91', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-92', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Suffocating Gas\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', '', 'Haunter', 'It wraps its opponent in its gas-like body, slowly weakening its prey by poisoning it through the skin.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gastly', '92', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '92', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-93', '[{\'name\': \'Spirit Return\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may put a Supporter card from your opponent\'s discard pile into their hand.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Mumble\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '1', 'Gastly', 'Gengar', 'It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Haunter', '93', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '93', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-94', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Poltergeist\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. This attack does 50 damage for each Trainer card you find there.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hollow Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', '151', '', 'Haunter', '', 'To steal the life of its target, it slips into the preys shadow and silently waits for an opportunity.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gengar', '94', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '9/22/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '94', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv3pt5-95', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Thumpalanche\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80×\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 5 cards of your deck. This attack does 80 damage for each Pokémon with a Retreat Cost of exactly 4 that you discarded in this way.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heavy Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': None}]', '151', '4', '', 'Steelix', 'It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv3pt5/sv3pt5-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Onix', '95', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '9/22/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '95', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2');
