('sv4-60', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Plus Damage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Plusle', '311', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-61', '[{\'name\': \'Buddy Pulse\', \'text\': \"If you have Plusle in play, whenever your opponent attaches an Energy card from their hand to 1 of their Pokémon, put 2 damage counters on that Pokémon. The effect of Buddy Pulse doesn\'t stack.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Speed Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Minun', '312', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-62', '', '', 'Shinji Kanda', '[{\'name\': \'Rear Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Wild Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', 'Zebstrika', 'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Blitzle', '522', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-63', '', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'name\': \'Burst of Braying\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Choose Basic Lightning Energy cards from your discard pile up to the number of Prize cards your opponent has taken and attach them to your Pokémon in any way you like.\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 50 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', 'Blitzle', '', 'They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zebstrika', '523', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '63', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-64', '', '', 'Kedamahadaitai Yawarakai', '[{\'name\': \'Flail Around\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', 'Galvantula', 'Joltik latch on to other Pokémon and suck out static electricity. Theyre often found sticking to Yampers hindquarters.', 'Ninth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Joltik', '595', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-65', '', '', 'Taira Akitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Electrobullet\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', 'Joltik', '', 'It lays traps of electrified threads near the nests of bird Pokémon, aiming to snare chicks that are not yet good at flying.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galvantula', '596', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '65', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-66', '', '', 'Shiburingaru', '[{\'name\': \'Crushing Short\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Before doing damage, discard all Pokémon Tools from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Raging Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 40 damage to 1 of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', '', '', 'Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zekrom', '644', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-67', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Pep Up\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw a card for each Benched Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s).\"}, {\'name\': \'Volt Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'The energetic, cheerful dance of these Oricorio is popular with children, but the Oricorio themselves are hard to find in Paldea.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Oricorio', '741', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-68', '', '', 'hncl', '[{\'name\': \'Vengeful Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an attack during your opponent\'s last turn, this attack does 90 more damage, and your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Extreme Current\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tapu Koko ex', '', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '68', 'Basic, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-69', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Whimsy Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', '', 'Toxtricity', 'This selfish, attention-seeking Pokémon stores poison and electricity in two different sacs inside its body.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxel', '848', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-7', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Confront\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Crag Bash\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 100 less damage from attacks from Evolution Pokémon (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '3', 'Dwebble', '', 'Its thick claws are its greatest weapons. Theyre mighty enough to crack Rhyperiors carapace.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Crustle', '558', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv4-70', '', '', 'PLANETA Mochizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Arm Press\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Amp You Very Much\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from this attack, take 1 more Prize card.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '4', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '230', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Iron Hands ex', '', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '70', 'Basic, ex, Future', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('sv4-71', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Triple Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', 'Xatu', 'Because its wings arent yet fully grown, it has to hop to get around. It is always staring at something.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Natu', '177', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('sv4-72', '[{\'name\': \'Clairvoyant Sense\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may attach a Basic Psychic Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Benched Pokémon. If you attached Energy to a Pokémon in this way, draw 2 cards.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Tetsu Kayama', '[{\'name\': \'Super Psy Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', 'Natu', '', 'This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the suns movement all day.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Xatu', '178', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '72', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-73', '', '', 'chibi', '[{\'name\': \'Glide\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Luster Purge\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'Discard 3 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Latios', '381', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-74', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Psypunch\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Genome Spiral\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Move all Energy from this Pokémon to your Benched Pokémon in any way you like.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Deoxys', '386', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-75', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Ominous Eyes\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', '', 'Cofagrigus', 'The spirit of a person from a bygone age became this Pokémon. It rambles through ruins, searching for someone who knows its face.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Yamask', '562', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-76', '[{\'name\': \'Gold Coffin\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon, search your deck for a card and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Hollow Hands\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \"Put 5 damage counters on your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', 'Yamask', '', '', 'Ninth', '260', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cofagrigus ex', '563', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '76', 'Stage 1, ex', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-77', '', '', 'saino misaki', '[{\'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', '', 'Gourgeist', 'The light that streams out from the holes in the pumpkin can hypnotize and control the people and Pokémon that see it.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pumpkaboo', '710', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-78', '[{\'name\': \'Startling Pumpkin\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon, discard 2 random cards from your opponent\'s hand.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nisimono', '[{\'name\': \'Shadow Bind\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', 'Pumpkaboo', '', 'In the darkness of a new-moon night, Gourgeist will come knocking. Whoever answers the door will be swept off to the afterlife.', 'Ninth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gourgeist', '711', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '78', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-79', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'It spends its time running around wastelands. If anyone steals its beloved berries, it will chase them down and exact its revenge.', 'Ninth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flittle', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-8', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', 'Steenee', 'Its sweat is sweet, like syrup made from boiled- down fruit. Because of this, Bounsweet was highly valued in the past, when sweeteners were scarce.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bounsweet', '761', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv4-80', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'It spends its time running around wastelands. If anyone steals its beloved berries, it will chase them down and exact its revenge.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flittle', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '80', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-81', '[{\'name\': \'Stance\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may prevent all damage from and effects of attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon done to this Pokémon until the end of your opponent\'s next turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'name\': \'Glittering Eyes\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70+\', \'text\': \'If Tulip is in your discard pile, this attack does 70 more damage.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', 'Flittle', '', 'It emits psychic power from the gaps between its multicolored frills and sprints at speeds greater than 120 mph.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Espathra', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '81', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-82', '', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'name\': \'Mountain Scrounging\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top card of your deck. You may put that card into your hand. If you don\'t, discard that card and draw a card.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mumble\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon pounds iron scraps together to make a hammer. It will remake the hammer again and again until its satisfied with the result.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tinkatink', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '82', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv4-83', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'name\': \'Boundless Power\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', '', '', 'This Pokémon pounds iron scraps together to make a hammer. It will remake the hammer again and again until its satisfied with the result.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tinkatink', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv4-84', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Alloy Aswing\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Metal Energy attached, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', 'Tinkatink', '', 'These Pokémon make their homes in piles of scrap metal. They test the strength of each others hammers by smashing them together.', 'Ninth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tinkatuff', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '84', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv4-85', '', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'name\': \'Crushing Blow\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Alloyed Hammer\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Metal Energy attached, this attack does 120 more damage.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', 'Tinkatuff', '', 'The hammer tops 220 pounds, yet it gets swung around easily by Tinkaton as it steals whatever it pleases and carries its plunder back home.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tinkaton', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '85', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv4-86', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Roaring Scream\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon for each damage counter on this Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'There has been only one reported sighting of this Pokémon. It resembles a mysterious creature depicted in an old expedition journal.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scream Tail', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '86', 'Basic, Ancient', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('sv4-87', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Corkscrew Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', '', 'This Pokémon was born inside a treasure chest about 1,500 years ago. It sucks the life-force out of scoundrels who try to steal the treasure.', 'Ninth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gimmighoul', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '87', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
