('sv4-89', '[{\'name\': \'Tachyon Bits\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, when this Pokémon moves from your Bench to the Active Spot, you may put 2 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Laser Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'200\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', '', '', '', 'Ninth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Iron Valiant ex', '', 'TPCI', 'Double Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon ex rule: When your Pokémon ex is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Scarlet & Violet', '89', 'Basic, ex, Future', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('sv4-9', '', '', 'Kariya', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 40 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', 'Bounsweet', 'Tsareena', 'Steenee spreads a sweet scent that makes others feel invigorated. This same scent is popular for antiperspirants.', 'Ninth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Steenee', '762', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '9', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('sv4-90', '', '', 'Shiburingaru', '[{\'name\': \'Hard Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage from and effects of attacks done to this Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Land Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '4', '', 'Steelix', 'It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Onix', '95', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '90', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv4-91', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Toxic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned. During Pokémon Checkup, put 2 damage counters on that Pokémon instead of 1.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', 'Gliscor', 'It flies straight at its targets face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gligar', '207', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '91', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv4-92', '', '', 'GOSSAN', '[{\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Toxic Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned. During Pokémon Checkup, put 2 damage counters on that Pokémon instead of 1.\"}]', 'Paradox Rift', '2', 'Gligar', '', 'Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest.', 'Ninth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gliscor', '472', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '92', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv4-93', '', '', 'Uta', '[{\'name\': \'Swelling Power\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach a Basic Fighting Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Magma Purge\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \'Discard up to 4 Energy from your Pokémon. This attack does 60 damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '3', '', '', 'This legendary Pokémon is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling Kyogre.', 'Ninth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Groudon', '383', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '93', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv4-94', '', '', 'saino misaki', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', 'Gabite', 'It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth.', 'Ninth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gible', '443', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '94', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv4-95', '', '', 'Nisota Niso', '[{\'name\': \'Power Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', 'Gible', 'Garchomp', 'In rare cases, it molts and sheds its scales. Medicine containing its scales as an ingredient will make a weary body feel invigorated.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gabite', '444', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '95', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('sv4-96', '', '', 'Natsumi Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Beatdown\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', '', 'Mienshao', 'Though small, Mienfoos temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of graceful attacks.', 'Ninth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienfoo', '619', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '96', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('sv4-97', '', '', 'Mousho', '[{\'name\': \'Three-Step Strike\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Whip Expert\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'If you attached a Pokémon Tool card from your hand to this Pokémon during this turn, this attack does 70 more damage.\'}]', 'Paradox Rift', '1', 'Mienfoo', '', 'Delivered at blinding speeds, kicks from this Pokémon can shatter massive boulders into tiny pieces.', 'Ninth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/sv4/sv4-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienshao', '620', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'G', '11/03/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Scarlet & Violet', '97', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
