('swsh1-105', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Stampede\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rear Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', 'Mudsdale', 'Loads weighing up to 50 times as much as its own body weight pose no issue for this Pokémon. Its skilled at making use of mud.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mudbray', '749', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '105', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-106', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Double Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 120 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '3', 'Mudbray', '', 'Mud that hardens around a Mudsdales legs sets harder than stone. Its so hard that it allows this Pokémon to scrap a truck with a single kick.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mudsdale', '750', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '106', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-107', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if the Defending Pokémon tries to attack, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack doesn\'t happen.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', 'Sandaconda', 'It spews sand from its nostrils. While the enemy is blinded, it burrows into the ground to hide.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-107.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Silicobra', '843', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '107', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-108', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Whap\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Sandaconda', 'As it digs, it swallows sand and stores it in its neck pouch. The pouch can hold more than 17 pounds of sand.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-108.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Silicobra', '843', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '108', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-109', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Coil\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s attacks do 120 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Skull Bash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Silicobra', '', 'Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand out of its sand sac more efficiently.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandaconda', '844', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '109', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-11', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Thwackey', 'When it uses its special stick to strike up a beat, the sound waves produced carry revitalizing energy to the plants and flowers in the area.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grookey', '810', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '11', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-110', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Sac\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Power Press\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon has at least 1 extra Fighting Energy attached (in addition to this attack\'s cost), this attack does 70 more damage.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Silicobra', '', 'When it contracts its body, over 220 pounds of sand sprays from its nose. If it ever runs out of sand, it becomes disheartened.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandaconda', '844', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '110', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-111', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Bind\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', 'Grapploct', 'Its very curious, but its means of investigating things is to try to punch them with its tentacles. The search for food is what brings it onto land.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-111.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clobbopus', '852', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '111', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
