('swsh1-113', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Octolock\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Until this Grapploct leaves the Active Spot, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks cost ColorlessColorless more, and the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat. This effect can\'t be applied more than once.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tough Swing\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Clobbopus', '', 'A body made up of nothing but muscle makes the grappling moves this Pokémon performs with its tentacles tremendously powerful.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grapploct', '853', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '113', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
