('swsh1-126', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Thief\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. Choose a card you find there and put it on the bottom of their deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Darkness Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Nickit', '', 'It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Thievul', '828', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '126', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-127', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Hone Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Slash attack does 60 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Perrserker', 'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémons body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Meowth', '52', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '127', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-128', '[{\'name\': \'Steely Spirit\', \'text\': \"Your Metal Pokémon\'s attacks do 20 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Galarian Meowth', '', 'What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Perrserker', '863', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '128', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-129', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'name\': \'Find a Friend\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Crunch\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', '', 'It chomps with its gaping mouth. Its huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mawile', '303', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '129', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-13', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Ambush\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Grookey', 'Rillaboom', 'The faster a Thwackey can beat out a rhythm with its two sticks, the more respect it wins from its peers.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Thwackey', '811', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '13', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-130', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', 'Ferrothorn', 'It defends itself by launching spikes, but its aim isnt very good at first. Only after a lot of practice will it improve.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ferroseed', '597', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '130', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-131', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Triple Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 30 damage for each heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Energy Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'You may move all Energy from this Pokémon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Ferroseed', '', 'This Pokémon scrapes its spikes across rocks, and then uses the tips of its feelers to absorb the nutrients it finds within the stone.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ferrothorn', '598', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '131', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-132', '[{\'name\': \'Snap Trap\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is in the Active Spot and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if it is Knocked Out), discard an Energy from the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Damage Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', '', 'Living in mud with a high iron content has given it a strong steel body.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Stunfisk', '618', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '132', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-133', '', '', 'Motofumi Fujiwara', '[{\'name\': \'Cut Up\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Metal Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Bisharp', 'A pack of these Pokémon forms to serve a Bisharp boss. Each Pawniard trains diligently, dreaming of one day taking the lead.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pawniard', '624', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '133', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-134', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Charge Order\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each of your Benched Pawniard.\'}, {\'name\': \'Slicing Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Pawniard', '', 'Violent conflicts erupt between Bisharp and Fraxure over places where sharpening stones can be found.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bisharp', '625', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '134', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-135', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Iron Wings\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"You may discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon. If you do, during your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 100 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Corvisquire', '', 'This Pokémon reigns supreme in the skies of the Galar region. The black luster of its steel body could drive terror into the heart of any foe.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Corviknight', '823', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '135', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-136', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '3', '', 'Copperajah', 'If a job requires serious strength, this Pokémon will excel at it. Its copper body tarnishes in the rain, turning a vibrant green color.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cufant', '878', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '136', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-137', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Dig Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Muscular Nose\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'220\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has 8 or more damage counters on it, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '4', 'Cufant', '', 'These Pokémon live in herds. Their trunks have incredible grip strength, strong enough to crush giant rocks into powder.', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Copperajah', '879', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '137', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-138', '[{\'name\': \'Intrepid Sword\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may look at the top 3 cards of your deck and attach any number of Metal Energy cards you find there to this Pokémon. Put the other cards into your hand. If you use this Ability, your turn ends.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Brave Blade\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'230\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zacian V', '888', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '138', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-139', '[{\'name\': \'Dauntless Shield\', \'text\': \"Prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon VMAX.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Assault Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"Discard a Special Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '230', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zamazenta V', '889', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '139', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-14', '[{\'name\': \'Voltage Beat\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Grass Energy cards and attach them to 1 of your Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '3', 'Thwackey', '', 'By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rillaboom', '812', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '14', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-140', '', '', 'chibi', '[{\'name\': \'Rolling Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Heavy Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '4', '', '', 'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorlax', '143', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '140', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-141', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Swallow\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Heal from this Pokémon the same amount of damage you did to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Falling Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '4', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-141.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorlax V', '143', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '141', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-142', '', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'G-Max Fall\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '4', 'Snorlax V', '', '', 'Eighth', '340', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-142.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorlax VMAX', '143', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '142', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-143', '', '', 'Yumi', '[{\'name\': \'Send Back\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Noctowl', 'It begins to hoot at the same time every day. Some Trainers use them in place of clocks.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-143.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hoothoot', '163', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '143', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-144', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Wing Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Carry Off\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. They shuffle that Pokémon and all attached cards into their deck. Then, shuffle this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Hoothoot', '', 'When it needs to think, it rotates its head 180 degrees to sharpen its intellectual power.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-144.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Noctowl', '164', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '144', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-145', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Glance\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tail Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Cinccino', 'The way it brushes away grime with its tail can be helpful when cleaning. But its focus on spotlessness can make cleaning more of a hassle.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-145.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Minccino', '572', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '145', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-146', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Whap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Cinccino', 'The way it brushes away grime with its tail can be helpful when cleaning. But its focus on spotlessness can make cleaning more of a hassle.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-146.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Minccino', '572', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '146', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-147', '[{\'name\': \'Make Do\', \'text\': \'You must discard a card from your hand in order to use this Ability. Once during your turn, you may draw 2 cards.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Assist\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Minccino', '', 'Its body secretes oil that this Pokémon spreads over its nest as a coating to protect it from dust. Cinccino wont tolerate even a speck of the stuff.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-147.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cinccino', '573', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '147', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-148', '[{\'name\': \'Primate Wisdom\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may switch a card from your hand with the top card of your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Whap Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', '', 'It knows the forest inside and out. If it comes across a wounded Pokémon, Oranguru will gather medicinal herbs to treat it.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-148.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Oranguru', '765', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '148', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-149', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Dragon Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 2 cards of your deck.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', '', 'The mountains it calls home are nearly two miles in height. On rare occasions, it descends to play with the children living in the towns below.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-149.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drampa', '780', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '149', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-15', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Drum Roll\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Drum Beating\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t use Drum Beating.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '4', 'Thwackey', '', 'By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rillaboom', '812', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '15', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-150', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Flap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Glide\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Corvisquire', 'It will bravely challenge any opponent, no matter how powerful. This Pokémon benefits from every battle—even a defeat increases its strength a bit.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-150.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rookidee', '821', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '150', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-151', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Pluck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Before doing damage, discard all Pokémon Tools from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Drill Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Rookidee', 'Corviknight', 'Smart enough to use tools in battle, these Pokémon have been seen picking up rocks and flinging them or using ropes to wrap up enemies.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-151.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Corvisquire', '822', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '151', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
