('swsh1-43', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'name\': \'Super Slice\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. If either of them is tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', 'Kingler', 'It can be found near the sea. The large pincers grow back if they are torn out of their sockets.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Krabby', '98', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '43', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-44', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Heavy Pincers\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Claw Rend\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon already has any damage counters on it, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Krabby', '', 'The large and hard pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, being so big, it is unwieldy to move.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kingler', '99', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '44', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-45', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Horn Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Seaking', 'Its dorsal and pectoral fins are strongly developed like muscles. It can swim at a speed of five knots.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Goldeen', '118', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '45', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-46', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Waterfall\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Seaking', 'Its dorsal, pectoral, and tail fins wave elegantly in water. That is why it is known as the Water Dancer.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Goldeen', '118', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '46', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-47', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Ripping Horn\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip 3 coins. For each heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Goldeen', '', 'Using its horn, it bores holes in riverbed boulders, making nests to prevent its eggs from washing away.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seaking', '119', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '47', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-48', '', '', 'Kazuma Koda', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Wash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"You may put 2 Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon into their hand.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '3', '', '', 'A smart and kindhearted Pokémon, it glides across the surface of the sea while its beautiful song echoes around it.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '48', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-49', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Body Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach a Water Energy card from your hand to this Pokémon. If you do, switch it with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ocean Loop\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'210\', \'text\': \'Put 2 Water Energy attached to this Pokémon into your hand.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras V', '131', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '49', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-5', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Attach\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Whimsicott', 'It shoots cotton from its body to protect itself. If it gets caught up in hurricane-strength winds, it can get sent to the other side of the Earth.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cottonee', '546', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '5', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-50', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'G-Max Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '3', 'Lapras V', '', '', 'Eighth', '320', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras VMAX', '131', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '50', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-51', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Point\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if this Pokémon is Knocked Out), the Attacking Pokémon is now Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Venoshock\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Poisoned, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', '', 'The small spikes covering its body developed from scales. They inject a toxin that causes fainting.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Qwilfish', '211', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '51', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-52', '', '', 'Jumpei Akasaka', '[{\'name\': \'Water Reserve\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Water Energy cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', '', 'If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can jump out above the waves and glide for over 300 feet.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mantine', '226', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-53', '', '', 'PLANETA Igarashi', '[{\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Secret Sword\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Keldeo V', '647', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '53', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-54', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Drizzile', 'When scared, this Pokémon cries. Its tears pack the chemical punch of 100 onions, and attackers wont be able to resist weeping.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sobble', '816', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '54', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-55', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Drizzile', 'When scared, this Pokémon cries. Its tears pack the chemical punch of 100 onions, and attackers wont be able to resist weeping.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sobble', '816', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('swsh1-56', '[{\'name\': \'Shady Dealings\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may search your deck for a Trainer card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Water Drip\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Sobble', 'Inteleon', 'A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles using water balloons created with moisture secreted from its palms.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drizzile', '817', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-57', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Sobble', 'Inteleon', 'A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles using water balloons created with moisture secreted from its palms.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drizzile', '817', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '57', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-58', '[{\'name\': \'Shady Dealings\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Trainer cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Bullet\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Drizzile', '', 'It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips that can shoot water and a membrane on its back that it can use to glide through the air.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Inteleon', '818', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '58', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-59', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Silent Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Discard a random card from your opponent\'s hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hydro Snipe\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"You may put an Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon into their hand.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Drizzile', '', 'It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips that can shoot water and a membrane on its back that it can use to glide through the air.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Inteleon', '818', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '59', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-6', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Cotton Ride\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent shuffles their Active Pokémon and all attached cards into their deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leaf Step\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Cottonee', '', 'It scatters cotton all over the place as a prank. If it gets wet, itll become too heavy to move and have no choice but to answer for its mischief.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Whimsicott', '547', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '6', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-60', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', '', 'Drednaw', 'It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard horn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this Pokémon bites down and never lets go.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chewtle', '833', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-61', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Vise Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Colorless in your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost.\"}, {\'name\': \'Jaw Lock\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Sword & Shield', '3', 'Chewtle', '', 'This Pokémon rapidly extends its retractable neck to sink its sharp fangs into distant enemies and take them down.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drednaw', '834', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-62', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Water Arrow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', '', 'Its so strong that it can knock out some opponents in a single hit, but it also may forget what its battling midfight.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cramorant', '845', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-63', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Frosmoth', 'It eats snow that piles up on the ground. The more snow it eats, the bigger and more impressive the spikes on its back grow.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snom', '872', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-64', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Dance\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn, you may attach a Water Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Benched Water Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Aurora Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '2', 'Snom', '', 'It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Frosmoth', '873', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh1-65', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Lightning Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Sword & Shield', '1', '', 'Raichu', 'Pikachu that can generate powerful electricity have cheek sacs that are extra soft and super stretchy.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh1/swsh1-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pikachu', '25', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '02/07/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
