('swsh11-5', '[{\'name\': \'Lethargy Spores\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may make both Active Pokémon Asleep and Poisoned.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Pani Kobayashi', '[{\'name\': \'X-Scissor\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 50 more damage.\'}]', 'Lost Origin', '2', 'Paras', '', 'The bug is mostly dead, with the mushroom on its back having become the main body. If the mushroom comes off, the bug stops moving.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh11/swsh11-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Parasect', '47', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '09/09/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '5', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
