('swsh11-94', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'name\': \'Joust\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Before doing damage, discard all Pokémon Tools from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Impound\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Lost Origin', '2', '', '', 'Though it pretends to be a tree, it fails to fool even children. To the touch, its body feels more like rock than tree bark. Sudowoodos extreme aversion to water merits special note.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh11/swsh11-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sudowoodo', '185', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '09/09/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '94', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
