('swsh11-96', '', '', 'Shiburingaru', '[{\'name\': \'Hurricane Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \"Flip 4 coins. This attack does 50 damage for each heads. If at least 2 of them are heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Lost Origin', '2', 'Gligar', '', 'Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh11/swsh11-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gliscor', '472', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '09/09/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '96', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
