('swsh11-98', '', '', 'Scav', '[{\'name\': \'Shove\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Muscular Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Lost Origin', '3', 'Makuhita', '', 'Hariyama that are big and fat arent necessarily strong. There are some small ones that move nimbly and use moves skillfully.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh11/swsh11-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hariyama', '297', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '09/09/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '98', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
