('swsh11tg-TG10', '[{\'name\': \'Unfazed Fat\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon done to this Pokémon. (Damage is not an effect.)\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Thumping Snore\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon is now Asleep. During Pokémon Checkup, flip 2 coins instead of 1. If either of them is tails, this Pokémon is still Asleep.\'}]', 'Lost Origin Trainer Gallery', '4', '', '', 'This glutton appears in villages without warning and devours the entirety of their rice granaries—such occurrences have long been counted among the gravest of disasters.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh11tg/swsh11tg-TG10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorlax', '143', 'TPCI', 'Trainer Gallery Rare Holo', 'F', '09/09/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'TG10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
