('swsh12pt5-28', '', '', 'aoki', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Trickery\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Super Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Salandit', '', 'Only female Salazzle exist. They emit a gas laden with pheromones to captivate male Salandit.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Salazzle', '758', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '28', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-29', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Dewgong', 'Thanks to its thick fat, cold seas dont bother it at all, but it gets tired pretty easily in warm waters.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seel', '86', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '29', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-3', '', '', 'Nagomi Nijo', '[{\'name\': \'Flower Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 80 damage for each heads. Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Gloom', '', 'Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bellossom', '182', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '3', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-30', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Find It\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for an Item card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'It can radiate chilliness from the bottoms of its feet. Itll spend the whole day tap-dancing on a frozen floor.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Mr. Mime', '122', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '30', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-31', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Nap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '3', '', 'Wailord', 'It shows off by spraying jets of seawater from the nostrils above its eyes. It eats a solid ton of Wishiwashi every day.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wailmer', '320', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '31', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-32', '', '', 'KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Bubble Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heavy Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 5, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '4', 'Wailmer', '', 'It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wailord', '321', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '32', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-33', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Crabhammer\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', 'Crawdaunt', 'No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Corphish', '341', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '33', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-34', '', '', 'otumami', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Glalie, Froslass', 'It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as -150 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorunt', '361', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '34', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-35', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Emotional Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 5 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'Luvdisc makes its home in coral reefs in warm seas. It especially likes sleeping in the space between Corsolas branches.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Luvdisc', '370', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '35', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-36', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Wave Summoning\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Water Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Dynamic Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 Energy attached to this Pokémon into your hand. This attack does 180 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '3', '', '', 'It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kyogre', '382', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '36', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-37', '', '', 'PLANETA Tsuji', '[{\'name\': \'Dual Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Aqua Typhoon\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'210\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t use Aqua Typhoon.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '3', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '230', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kyogre V', '382', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '37', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-38', '', '', 'PLANETA Mochizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Frost Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Water Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Freezing Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Glaceon V', '471', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '38', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-39', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Rear Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Luxio', 'All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shinx', '403', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '39', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-4', '', '', 'kurumitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Vine Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', 'Tangrowth', 'Hidden beneath a tangle of vines that grows nonstop even if the vines are torn off, this Pokémons true appearance remains a mystery.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tangela', '114', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-40', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Jolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Luxio', 'This Pokémon generates electricity by contracting its muscles. Excited trembling is a sign that Shinx is generating a tremendous amount of electricity.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shinx', '403', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '40', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-41', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Jumping Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Head Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Shinx', 'Luxray', 'Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Luxio', '404', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '41', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-42', '', '', 'Eri Yamaki', '[{\'name\': \'Shorting Spark\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 90 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon that has a Pokémon Tool attached. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Shinx', 'Luxray', 'By joining its tail with that of another Luxio, this Pokémon can receive some of the other Luxios electricity and power up its own electric blasts.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Luxio', '404', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '42', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-43', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Electrostep\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 40 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Scar Strikes\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon already has any damage counters on it, this attack does 100 more damage.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Luxio', '', 'Luxrays ability to see through objects comes in handy when its scouting for danger.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Luxray', '405', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '43', 'Stage 2, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-44', '[{\'name\': \'Explosiveness\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon is in your hand when you are setting up to play, you may put it face down as your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Seeking Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Trainer cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '', 'Luxio', '', 'Luxray can see through solid objects. It will instantly spot prey trying to hide behind walls, even if the walls are thick.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Luxray', '405', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '44', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-45', '[{\'name\': \'Instant Charge\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may draw 3 cards. If you use this Ability, your turn ends.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Scrap Short\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Put any number of Pokémon Tool cards from your discard pile in the Lost Zone. This attack does 40 more damage for each card you put in the Lost Zone in this way.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rotom V', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '45', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-46', '[{\'name\': \'Conversion Star\', \'text\': \"During your turn, you may use this Ability. Discard any number of cards from your hand. Then, draw that many cards. (You can\'t use more than 1 VSTAR Power in a game.)\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Scrap Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'Put any number of Pokémon Tool cards from your discard pile in the Lost Zone. This attack does 40 more damage for each card you put in the Lost Zone in this way.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Rotom V', '', '', 'Eighth', '250', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rotom VSTAR', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VSTAR', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '[\'VSTAR rule: When your Pokémon VSTAR is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '46', 'VSTAR', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-47', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '', '', '', 'As it flies, it scatters electricity around, so bird Pokémon keep their distance. Thats why Emolga can keep all its food to itself.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Emolga', '587', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-48', '[{\'name\': \'Ad Hoc Shock\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'NC Empire', '[{\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', 'Tynamo', 'Eelektross', 'These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eelektrik', '603', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-49', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rear Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Heliolisk', 'When spread, the frills on its head act like solar panels, generating the power behind this Pokémons electric moves.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Helioptile', '694', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '49', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-5', '', '', 'zig', '[{\'name\': \'Suctioning Vines\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '4', 'Tangela', '', 'Tangrowth has two arms that it can extend as it pleases. Recent research has shown that these arms are, in fact, bundles of vines.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tangrowth', '465', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '5', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-50', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Wild Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 50 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Helioptile', '', 'A now-vanished desert culture treasured these Pokémon. Appropriately, when Heliolisk came to the Galar region, treasure came with them.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Heliolisk', '695', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-51', '[{\'name\': \'Shocking Block\', \'text\': \'Whenever any player attaches an Energy card from their hand to 1 of their Pokémon V, put 2 damage counters on that Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Linear Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', 'Vikavolt', 'While its durable shell protects it from attacks, Charjabug strikes at enemies with jolts of electricity discharged from the tips of its jaws.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Radiant Charjabug', '737', 'TPCI', 'Radiant Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\"Radiant Pokémon Rule: You can\'t have more than 1 Radiant Pokémon in your deck.\"]', 'Sword & Shield', '51', 'Basic, Radiant', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2');
