('swsh12pt5-52', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Wild Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'It approaches its enemies at the speed of lightning, then tears them limb from limb with its sharp claws.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zeraora', '807', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-53', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Claw Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Thunderous Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'190\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zeraora V', '807', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '53', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-54', '', '', 'Nisota Niso', '[{\'name\': \'Reactive Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 60 damage for each of your opponent\'s Pokémon in play that has an Ability.\"}, {\'name\': \'Max Fist\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'240\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', 'Zeraora V', '', '', 'Eighth', '320', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zeraora VMAX', '807', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '54', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-55', '', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Crushing Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'190\', \'text\': \'You may discard a Stadium in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Lightning Storm Star\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon 4 times. (You can choose the same Pokémon more than once.) For each time you chose a Pokémon, do 60 damage to it. This damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance. (You can\'t use more than 1 VSTAR Power in a game.)\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '', 'Zeraora V', '', '', 'Eighth', '270', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zeraora VSTAR', '807', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VSTAR', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', '', '[\'VSTAR rule: When your Pokémon VSTAR is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '55', 'VSTAR', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-56', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Continuous Tumble\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pincurchin', '871', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-57', '', '', 'zig', '[{\'name\': \'Psy Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Exeggutor', 'Though it may look like its just a bunch of eggs, its a proper Pokémon. Exeggcute communicates with others of its kind via telepathy, apparently.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Exeggcute', '102', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-58', '', '', 'Toshinao Aoki', '[{\'name\': \'Powerful Storm\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each Energy attached to all of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Stampede\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', 'Exeggcute', '', 'Each of Exeggutors three heads is thinking different thoughts. The three dont seem to be very interested in one another.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Exeggutor', '103', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '58', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-59', '', '', 'Atsushi Furusawa', '[{\'name\': \'Psypump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach up to 2 Psychic Energy cards from your discard pile to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Limit Break\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has 3 or fewer Prize cards remaining, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', '', 'A Pokémon created by recombining Mews genes. Its said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mewtwo', '150', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-6', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Mach Cut\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Discard a Special Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Scizor', 'As Scyther fights more and more battles, its scythes become sharper and sharper. With a single slice, Scyther can fell a massive tree.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scyther', '123', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-60', '', '', 'PLANETA Igarashi', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Mix\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for an Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Fusion Strike Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psychic Leap\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'You may shuffle this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mew V', '151', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Basic, V, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-61', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Double Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psybeam\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Girafarig', '203', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-62', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Cycle Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard a card from your hand. If you do, draw 3 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Moon Kinesis\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each Psychic Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. Its active on the night of a full moon.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lunatone', '337', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-63', '', '', 'DOM', '[{\'name\': \'Fade to Black\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', 'Duskull', 'Dusknoir', 'Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dusclops', '356', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '63', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-64', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Burst\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each Energy attached to both Active Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Spiral Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'Although called a guardian deity, Tapu Lele is devoid of guilt about its cruel disposition and can be described as nature incarnate.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tapu Lele', '786', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '64', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-65', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Horoscope\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 3 cards of your deck. You may attach any number of Energy cards you find there to this Pokémon. Put the other cards back in any order.\'}, {\'name\': \'Teleportation Burst\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '200', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hatterene V', '858', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '65', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-66', '[{\'name\': \"Witch\'s Domain\", \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may move up to 2 damage counters from your Pokémon to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'G-Max Smite\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', 'Hatterene V', '', '', 'Eighth', '320', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hatterene VMAX', '858', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'F', '1/20/2023', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '66', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-67', '', '', 'Jiro Sasumo', '[{\'name\': \'Draining Kiss\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Loving Sympathy\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70+\', \'text\': \'If you have the same number of cards in your hand as your opponent, this attack does 70 more damage.\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', '', 'When it flies to this land from across the sea, the bitter winter comes to an end. According to legend, this Pokémons love gives rise to the budding of fresh life across Hisui.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Enamorus', '905', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-68', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Boulder Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '4', 'Geodude', 'Golem', 'It travels by rolling down cliffs. If it falls into a river, it will explode with its last gasp.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Graveler', '75', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '68', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-69', '[{\'name\': \'Sun Energy\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may attach a Psychic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Lunatone.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'OKACHEKE', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', '', 'When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Solrock', '338', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-7', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Sunflora', 'It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else.', 'Eighth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sunkern', '191', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-70', '', '', 'Nagomi Nijo', '[{\'name\': \'Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Claydol', 'It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Baltoy', '343', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-71', '', '', 'Taira Akitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Lucario', 'Its exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-72', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '2', '', 'Pangoro', 'It chooses a Pangoro as its master and then imitates its masters actions. This is how it learns to battle and hunt for prey.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pancham', '674', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-73', '', '', 'OKACHEKE', '[{\'name\': \'Invite Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Smash Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', '', 'Lycanroc', 'This Pokémon can bond very strongly with its Trainer, but it also has a habit of biting. Raising a Rockruff for a long time can be challenging.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rockruff', '744', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh12pt5-74', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Midnight Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'240-\', \'text\': \"This attack does 80 less damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Crown Zenith', '1', 'Rockruff', '', 'This form of Lycanroc is reckless. It charges headlong at its opponents, attacking without any care about what injuries it might receive.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh12pt5/swsh12pt5-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lycanroc', '745', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '1/20/2023', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '74', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
