('swsh2-123', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Stampede\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Morgrem', 'Through its nose, it sucks in the emanations produced by people and Pokémon when they feel annoyed. It thrives off this negative energy.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-123.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Impidimp', '859', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '123', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-124', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'False Surrender\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', 'Impidimp', 'Grimmsnarl', 'When it gets down on all fours as if to beg for forgiveness, its trying to lure opponents in so that it can stab them with its spear-like hair.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-124.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Morgrem', '860', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '124', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-125', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Oath\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks cost Colorless more.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Press\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', 'Morgrem', '', 'With the hair wrapped around its body helping to enhance its muscles, this Pokémon can overwhelm even Machamp.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grimmsnarl', '861', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '125', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-126', '[{\'name\': \'Evolution Roar\', \'text\': \'You must discard 2 cards from your hand in order to use this Ability. Once during your turn, you may search your deck for a Galarian Perrserker, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', '', 'Perrserker', 'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémons body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Meowth', '52', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '126', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-127', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Claw Dagger\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 80 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', 'Galarian Meowth', '', 'What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Perrserker', '863', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '127', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-128', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Raid\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon evolved from Scyther during this turn, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Guard Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Scyther', '', 'Once it has identified something as an enemy, it will continue beating them with its steel-hard pincers until theres nothing left but scraps.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scizor', '212', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '128', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
