('swsh2-13', '', '', 'Kazuma Koda', '[{\'name\': \'Soothing Scent\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Megaton Lariat\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', 'Snover', '', 'If it sees any packs of Darumaka going after Snover, it chases them off, swinging its sizable arms like hammers.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Abomasnow', '460', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '13', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-130', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Gyro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. If you do, your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', 'Bronzor', '', 'Some believe it to be a deity that summons rain clouds. When angered, it lets out a warning cry that rings out like the tolling of a bell.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bronzong', '437', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '130', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-131', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Gravitational Drop\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Colorless in your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost.\"}, {\'name\': \'Heavy Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '4', 'Nosepass', '', 'It uses three small units to catch prey and battle enemies. The main body mostly just gives orders.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Probopass', '476', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '131', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-132', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Gathering Food\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'For each Energy attached to this Pokémon, search your deck for a Trainer card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Metal Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', '', 'They lay their eggs deep inside their nests. When attacked by Heatmor, they retaliate using their massive mandibles.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Durant', '632', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '132', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
