('swsh2-138', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Sharpener\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Attach a Metal Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Power Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', '', '', 'Its body resembles polished metal, and its both lightweight and strong. The only drawback is that it rusts easily.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duraludon', '884', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '138', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-139', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Stream\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Attach a Metal Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Smashing Edge\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', '', '', 'Now armed with a weapon it used in ancient times, this Pokémon needs only a single strike to fell even Gigantamax Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zacian', '888', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '139', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-14', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Guidance\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put a Basic Pokémon from your discard pile onto your Bench.\'}, {\'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Trevenant', 'After a lost child perished in the forest, their spirit possessed a tree stump, causing the spirits rebirth as this Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Phantump', '708', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '14', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-140', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 20 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Power Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If tails, this Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', '', '', 'Its ability to deflect any attack led to it being known as the Fighting Masters Shield. It was feared and respected by all.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zamazenta', '889', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '140', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-141', '', '', 'Eri Yamaki', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Collapse\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon is now Asleep.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '4', '', '', 'It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-141.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorlax', '143', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '141', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-142', '[{\'name\': \'Lucky Match\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may flip a coin. If heads, put a Supporter card from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Glide\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', '', 'It can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-142.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chatot', '441', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '142', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-143', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Chirp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Pokémon with Fighting Resistance, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Tranquill', 'Where people go, these Pokémon follow. If youre scattering food for them, be careful—several hundred of them can gather at once.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-143.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pidove', '519', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '143', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-144', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Gust\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Pidove', 'Unfezant', 'It can fly moderately quickly. No matter how far it travels, it can always find its way back to its master and its nest.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-144.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tranquill', '520', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '144', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-145', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Daunt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks do 50 less damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Air Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Tranquill', '', 'Unfezant are exceptional fliers. The females are known for their stamina, while the males outclass them in terms of speed.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-145.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Unfezant', '521', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '145', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-146', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Burrow\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Headbutt Bounce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Diggersby', 'It excels at digging holes. Using its ears, it can dig a nest 33 feet deep in one night.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-146.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bunnelby', '659', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '146', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-147', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Mining Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Discard up to 6 cards from the top of your deck. If you do, this attack does 30 damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}, {\'name\': \'Headbutt Bounce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', 'Bunnelby', '', 'With power equal to an excavator, it can dig through dense bedrock. Its a huge help during tunnel construction.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-147.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Diggersby', '660', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '147', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-148', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Windfall\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 5 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Speed Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', '', 'It drives its opponents to exhaustion with its agile maneuvers, then ends the fight with a flashy finishing move.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-148.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hawlucha', '701', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '148', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-149', '', '', 'so-taro', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Jump On\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', '', 'Bewear', 'Its fluffy fur is a delight to pet, but carelessly reaching out to touch this Pokémon could result in painful retaliation.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-149.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stufful', '759', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '149', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-15', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Seed Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Shadow Cage\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', 'Phantump', '', 'People fear it due to a belief that it devours any who try to cut down trees in its forest, but to the Pokémon it shares its woods with, its kind.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Trevenant', '709', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '15', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-150', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer Arm\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Big Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard your opponent\'s Active Pokémon and all attached cards.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', 'Stufful', '', 'Once it accepts you as a friend, it tries to show its affection with a hug. Letting it do that is dangerous—it could easily shatter your bones.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-150.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bewear', '760', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '150', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-151', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Greedent', 'Found throughout the Galar region, this Pokémon becomes uneasy if its cheeks are ever completely empty of berries.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-151.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Skwovet', '819', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '151', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-152', '[{\'name\': \'Greedy Tail\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for a Pokémon Tool card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Skwovet', '', 'It stashes berries in its tail—so many berries that they fall out constantly. But this Pokémon is a bit slow-witted, so it doesnt notice the loss.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-152.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Greedent', '820', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '152', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
