('swsh2-3', '', '', 'Taira Akitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Panic Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned, Confused, and Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Cutting Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Metapod', '', 'In battle, it flaps its wings at great speed to release highly toxic dust into the air.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Butterfree', '12', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '3', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
