('swsh2-78', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Cursed Drop\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', '', 'Cursola', 'Watch your step when wandering areas oceans once covered. What looks like a stone could be this Pokémon, and it will curse you if you kick it.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Corsola', '222', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
