('swsh2-81', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Sneaky Placement\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', '', 'Palossand', 'If you build sand mounds when youre playing, destroy them before you go home, or they may get possessed and become Sandygast.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandygast', '769', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-82', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Sink\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck. If this Pokémon has a Cursed Shovel attached, discard 2 more cards from the top of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Super Absorption\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '4', 'Sandygast', '', 'Once it has whipped up a sandstorm to halt its opponents in their tracks, this terrifying Pokémon snatches away their vitality.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palossand', '770', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '82', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-83', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Find a Friend\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psyshot\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Hattrem', 'Via the protrusion on its head, it senses other creatures emotions. If you dont have a calm disposition, it will never warm up to you.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hatenna', '856', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '83', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-84', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Calm Mind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Brutal Swing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Hatenna', 'Hatterene', 'No matter who you are, if you bring strong emotions near this Pokémon, it will silence you violently.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hattrem', '857', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '84', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-85', '[{\'name\': \'Mind Hat\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may use this Ability. Each player discards a card from their hand. (Your opponent discards first.)\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Dripping Grudge\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon for each Pokémon in your discard pile.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', 'Hattrem', '', 'It emits psychic power strong enough to cause headaches as a deterrent to the approach of others.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hatterene', '858', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '85', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-86', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Aromatherapy\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 10 damage from each of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Alcremie', 'This Pokémon was born from sweet-smelling particles in the air. Its body is made of cream.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Milcery', '868', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-87', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Decorate\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach any number of basic Energy cards from your hand to your Pokémon in any way you like.\'}, {\'name\': \'Draining Kiss\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Milcery', '', 'When it trusts a Trainer, it will treat them to berries its decorated with cream.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alcremie', '869', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '87', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-88', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Replenish Time\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from each of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psybeam\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', '', 'These intelligent Pokémon touch horns with each other to share information between them.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Indeedee', '876', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '88', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-89', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Drakloak', 'After being reborn as a ghost Pokémon, Dreepy wanders the areas it used to inhabit back when it was alive in prehistoric seas.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dreepy', '885', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '89', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-9', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Spirited Rushdown\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 60 damage for each Prize card you have taken.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mega Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', 'Lombre', '', 'The rhythm of bright, festive music activates Ludicolos cells, making it more powerful.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ludicolo', '272', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '9', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-90', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Summon\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Dreepy and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Dreepy', 'Dragapult', 'Its capable of flying faster than 120 mph. It battles alongside Dreepy and dotes on them until they successfully evolve.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drakloak', '886', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '90', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-91', '[{\'name\': \'Infiltrator\', \'text\': \'If any damage is done to this Pokémon by attacks, flip a coin. If heads, prevent that damage.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Phantom Force\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '', 'Drakloak', '', 'When it isnt battling, it keeps Dreepy in the holes on its horns. Once a fight starts, it launches the Dreepy like supersonic missiles.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-91.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dragapult', '887', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '91', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-92', '', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Jet Assault\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon moved from your Bench to the Active Spot this turn, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dragapult V', '887', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '92', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-93', '', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Shred\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Max Phantom\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"Put 5 damage counters on your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon in any way you like.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Dragapult V', '', '', 'Eighth', '320', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-93.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dragapult VMAX', '887', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'D', '05/01/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '93', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-94', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Sirfetchd', 'The Farfetchd of the Galar region are brave warriors, and they wield thick, tough leeks in battle.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-94.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Farfetchd', '83', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '94', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-95', '', '', 'You Iribi', '[{\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Meteor Assault\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Meteor Assault again until it leaves the Active Spot.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', 'Galarian Farfetchd', '', 'Only Farfetchd that have survived many battles can attain this evolution. When this Pokémons leek withers, it will retire from combat.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-95.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Sirfetchd', '865', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '95', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-96', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rolling Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '3', '', 'Probopass', 'It hunts without twitching a muscle by pulling in its prey with powerful magnetism. But sometimes it pulls natural enemies in close.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nosepass', '299', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '96', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-97', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Yoga Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', '', 'Medicham', 'It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-97.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Meditite', '307', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '97', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-98', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Yoga Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Rebel Clash', '1', 'Meditite', '', 'Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foes next move.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-98.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Medicham', '308', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '98', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh2-99', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Fin\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Rebel Clash', '2', '', 'Whiscash', 'Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh2/swsh2-99.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Barboach', '339', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '05/01/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '99', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-1', '', '', 'Saki Hayashiro', '[{\'name\': \'Dizzying Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused and Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Blasting Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Butterfree V', '12', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2');
