('swsh3-130', '', '', 'NC Empire', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Link\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Attach an Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heavy Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '4', 'Meltan', '', 'At the end of its life-span, Melmetal will rust and fall apart. The small shards left behind will eventually be reborn as Meltan.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Melmetal', '809', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '130', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-131', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Strength\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '3', '', 'Copperajah', 'It digs up the ground with its trunk. Its also very strong, being able to carry loads of over five tons without any problem at all.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cufant', '878', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '131', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-132', '[{\'name\': \'Antibacterial Skin\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t be affected by any Special Conditions.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Vengeful Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120+\', \'text\': \'If your Benched Pokémon have any damage counters on them, this attack does 120 more damage.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '4', 'Cufant', '', 'They came over from another region long ago and worked together with humans. Their green skin is resistant to water.', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Copperajah', '879', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '132', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-133', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Rally Back\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon during their last turn, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '2', '', '', 'You shouldnt get close to the child when its playing outside its mothers pouch. Its mother is always nearby watching over it.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kangaskhan', '115', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '133', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-134', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Horn Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '2', '', '', 'They live in groups. The one with the longest, thickest, and most-scarred horns is the boss of the herd.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tauros', '128', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '134', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-135', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Furret', 'It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sentret', '161', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '135', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-136', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \"Feelin\' Fine\", \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 3 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', 'Sentret', '', 'It makes a nest to suit its long and skinny body. The nest is impossible for other Pokémon to enter.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Furret', '162', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '136', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-137', '[{\'name\': \'Final Dig\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon, discard the top 2 cards of your opponent\'s deck.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kazuma Koda', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', '', 'When it sees a person, it digs a hole with its tail to make its escape. If you happen to find one, consider yourself lucky.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dunsparce', '206', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '137', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-138', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Baby-Doll Eyes\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dig Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '2', '', 'Ursaring', 'Before food becomes scarce in wintertime, its habit is to hoard food in many hidden locations.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Teddiursa', '216', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '138', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-139', '', '', 'Uta', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer Arm\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Claw Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '3', 'Teddiursa', '', 'Although it has a large body, it is quite skilled at climbing trees. It eats and sleeps in the treetops.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ursaring', '217', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '139', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-14', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Synthesis\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Grass Energy card and attach it to 1 of your Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flop\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Steenee', 'Its body gives off a sweet, fruity scent that is extremely appetizing to bird Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bounsweet', '761', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '14', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
