('swsh3-154', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Pluck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Before doing damage, discard all Pokémon Tools from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Corvisquire', 'It will bravely challenge any opponent, no matter how powerful. This Pokémon benefits from every battle—even a defeat increases its strength a bit.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-154.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rookidee', '821', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '154', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
