('swsh3-197', '[{\'name\': \'Voltage Beat\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Grass Energy cards and attach them to 1 of your Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '3', 'Thwackey', '', 'By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-197.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rillaboom', '812', 'TPCI', 'Rare Secret', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '197', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-198', '[{\'name\': \'Tar Generator\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may attach a Fire Energy card, a Fighting Energy card, or 1 of each from your discard pile to your Pokémon in any way you like.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'PLANETA Tsuji', '[{\'name\': \'Flaming Avalanche\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '4', 'Carkol', '', 'Its usually peaceful, but the vandalism of mines enrages it. Offenders will be incinerated with flames that reach 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-198.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Coalossal', '839', 'TPCI', 'Rare Secret', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '198', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-199', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Darkness Ablaze', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-199.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Big Parasol', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Secret', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', '', '[\"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached.\", \"As long as the Pokémon this card is attached to is in the Active Spot, prevent all effects of attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon done to all of your Pokémon. (Existing effects are not removed. Damage is not an effect.)\", \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '199', 'Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
