('swsh3-72', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Future Sight\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top 4 cards of either player\'s deck and put them back in any order.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', '', 'The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. Its active on the night of a full moon.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lunatone', '337', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-73', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Fortunate Eye\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top 5 cards of your opponent\'s deck and put them back in any order.\"}, {\'name\': \'Gentle Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Gothorita', 'Though theyre still only babies, theres psychic power stored in their ribbonlike feelers, and sometimes they use that power to fight.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothita', '574', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-74', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Whiny Voice\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Choose a random card from your opponent\'s hand. Your opponent reveals that card and shuffles it into their deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Double Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '2', 'Gothita', 'Gothitelle', 'Its said that when stars shine in the night sky, this Pokémon will spirit away sleeping children. Some call it the Witch of Punishment.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothorita', '575', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '74', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
