('swsh3-76', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '3', '', 'Golurk', 'They were sculpted from clay in ancient times. No one knows why, but some of them are driven to continually line up boulders.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golett', '622', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '76', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-77', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Dynamic Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Golurk Hammer\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 5, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '4', 'Golett', '', 'Artillery platforms built into the walls of ancient castles served as perches from which Golurk could fire energy beams.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golurk', '623', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '77', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-78', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Mad Party\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each Pokémon in your discard pile that has the Mad Party attack.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', '', 'Its upper whiskers are sensors that survey its surroundings. Its lower whiskers are organs that shoot electricity.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dedenne', '702', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-79', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Spore\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Flop\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Shiinotic', 'Pokémon living in the forest eat the delicious caps on Morelulls head. The caps regrow overnight.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Morelull', '755', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-8', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Continuous Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Escavalier', 'Its strange physiology reacts to electrical energy in interesting ways. The presence of a Shelmet will cause this Pokémon to evolve.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Karrablast', '588', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '8', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-80', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Flickering Light\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fear the Forest\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If Glimwood Tangle is in play, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '2', 'Morelull', '', 'Its flickering spores lure in prey and put them to sleep. Once this Pokémon has its prey snoozing, it drains their vitality with its fingertips.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shiinotic', '756', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '80', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-81', '[{\'name\': \'Heal Jamming\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon can\'t be healed.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Claw Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', '', 'It wears a rag fashioned into a Pikachu costume in an effort to look less scary. Unfortunately, the costume only makes it creepier.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mimikyu', '778', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-82', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Furtive Drop\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 2 damage counters on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Polteageist', 'This Pokémon is said to have been born when a lonely spirit possessed a cold, leftover cup of tea.', 'Eighth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-82.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sinistea', '854', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '82', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-83', '[{\'name\': \'Tea Break\', \'text\': \'You must discard a Pokémon that has the Mad Party attack from your hand in order to use this Ability. Once during your turn, you may draw 2 cards.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Mad Party\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each Pokémon in your discard pile that has the Mad Party attack.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', 'Sinistea', '', 'This species lives in antique teapots. Most pots are forgeries, but on rare occasions, an authentic work is found.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-83.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Polteageist', '855', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '83', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-84', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Dugtrio', 'If a Diglett digs through a field, it leaves the soil perfectly tilled and ideal for planting crops.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-84.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Diglett', '50', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '84', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-85', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Dig\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage from and effects of attacks done to this Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mud Bomb\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', 'Diglett', '', 'A team of Diglett triplets. It triggers huge earthquakes by burrowing 60 miles underground.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-85.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dugtrio', '51', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '85', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-86', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Spray\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Pupitar', 'Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-86.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Larvitar', '246', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '86', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-87', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Spray\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rocket Evolution\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '3', 'Larvitar', 'Tyranitar', 'Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-87.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pupitar', '247', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '87', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-88', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Bedrock Breaker\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Discard a Stadium in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mountain Swing\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'250\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 5 cards of your deck.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '4', 'Pupitar', '', 'Its body cant be harmed by any sort of attack, so it is very eager to make challenges against enemies.', 'Eighth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-88.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyranitar', '248', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '88', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-89', '', '', 'Asako Ito', '[{\'name\': \"Land\'s Pulse\", \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If a Stadium is in play, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', '', 'Vibrava', 'Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-89.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Trapinch', '328', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '89', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-9', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Spray Fluid\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '3', '', 'Accelgor', 'When attacked, it tightly shuts the lid of its shell. This reaction fails to protect it from Karrablast, however, because they can still get into the shell.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shelmet', '616', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '9', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh3-90', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Darkness Ablaze', '1', 'Trapinch', 'Flygon', 'The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh3/swsh3-90.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vibrava', '329', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '8/14/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '90', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2');
