('swsh35-34', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Sharp Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Snap\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', 'Ekans', '', 'After stunning its opponents with the pattern on its stomach, it quickly wraps them up in its body and waits for them to stop moving.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arbok', '24', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '34', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-35', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Pin Missile\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Champions Path', '2', '', 'Linoone', 'Its restlessness has it constantly running around. If it sees another Pokémon, it will purposely run into them in order to start a fight.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Zigzagoon', '263', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '35', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-36', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Double-Edge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Champions Path', '2', 'Galarian Zigzagoon', 'Obstagoon', 'It uses its long tongue to taunt opponents. Once the opposition is enraged, this Pokémon hurls itself at the opponent, tackling them forcefully.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Linoone', '264', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '36', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-37', '[{\'name\': \'Wicked Ruler\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may have your opponent discard cards from their hand until they have 4 cards in their hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Knuckle Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Champions Path', '2', 'Galarian Linoone', '', 'Its voice is staggering in volume. Obstagoon has a tendency to take on a threatening posture and shout—this move is known as Obstruct.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Obstagoon', '862', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '37', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-38', '', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Cutter\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', '', 'The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Absol', '359', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '38', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-39', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Dig Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Fake Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Liepard', 'It steals things from people just to amuse itself with their frustration. A rivalry exists between this Pokémon and Nickit.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Purrloin', '509', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '39', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-4', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}]', 'Champions Path', '1', 'Kakuna', '', 'May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beedrill', '15', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '4', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-40', '[{\'name\': \'Limber\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t be Paralyzed.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Slashing Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', 'Purrloin', '', 'Dont be fooled by its gorgeous fur and elegant figure. This is a moody and vicious Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Liepard', '510', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '40', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-41', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'name\': \'Stampede\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Scrafty', 'If it locks eyes with you, watch out! Nothing and no one is safe from the reckless headbutts of this troublesome Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scraggy', '559', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '41', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-42', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Corner\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}, {\'name\': \'Bad Brawl\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \'If you played Piers from your hand during this turn, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', 'Champions Path', '2', 'Scraggy', '', 'As halfhearted as this Pokémons kicks may seem, they pack enough power to shatter Conkeldurrs concrete pillars.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scrafty', '560', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '42', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-43', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Venoshock\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Poisoned, this attack does 50 more damage.\"}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Garbodor', 'Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Trubbish', '568', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '43', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-44', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Attack from Behind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is Confused, this attack does 50 more damage.\"}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Malamar', 'It spins while making its luminescent spots flash. These spots allow it to communicate with others by using different patterns of light.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Inkay', '686', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '44', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-45', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Eerie Wave\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Random Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 40 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Champions Path', '3', 'Inkay', '', 'Gazing at its luminescent spots will quickly induce a hypnotic state, putting the observer under Malamars control.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Malamar', '687', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-46', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Filch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Tail Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Thievul', 'Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon. It survives off its ill-gotten gains.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nickit', '827', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '46', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-47', '[{\'name\': \'Hard Coat\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Gatling Slug\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 40 more damage for each Metal Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Champions Path', '3', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duraludon V', '884', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '9/25/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '47', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-48', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Altaria', 'It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Swablu', '333', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '48', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-49', '[{\'name\': \'Miraculous Charm\', \'text\': \"Prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon V and Pokémon-GX.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Taira Akitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Speed Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', 'Swablu', '', 'On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Altaria', '334', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '9/25/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '49', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-5', '[{\'name\': \'Happy Match\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may put a Supporter card from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Float Up\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'You may shuffle this Pokémon and all cards attached to it into your deck.\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eldegoss V', '830', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '5', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-50', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bede', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Attach a basic Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '50', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-51', '', '', 'Yoshinobu Saito', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Full Heal', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Remove all Special Conditions from your Active Pokémon.\', \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '51', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-52', '', '', 'Toyste Beach', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Great Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Look at the top 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal a Pokémon you find there and put it into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '52', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-53', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hop', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Draw 3 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '53', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-54', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hyper Potion', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Heal 120 damage from 1 of your Pokémon that has at least 2 Energy attached. If you healed any damage in this way, discard 2 Energy from it.\', \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '54', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-55', '', '', 'take', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kabu', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 4 cards. If your Active Pokémon is your only Pokémon in play, draw 8 cards instead.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '55', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-56', '', '', 'kirisAki', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Marnie', '', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Each player shuffles their hand and puts it on the bottom of their deck. If either player put any cards on the bottom of their deck in this way, you draw 5 cards, and your opponent draws 4 cards.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '56', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-57', '', '', 'take', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Milo', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Discard up to 2 cards from your hand, and draw 2 cards for each card you discarded in this way.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '57', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-58', '', '', 'take', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Piers', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Search your deck for an Energy card and a Darkness Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '58', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-59', '', '', 'Studio Bora Inc.', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Poké Ball', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '59', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-6', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Gnaw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Singe\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Ninetales', 'While young, it has six gorgeous tails. When it grows, several new tails are sprouted.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vulpix', '37', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh35-60', '', '', 'kirisAki', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pokémon Center Lady', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Heal 60 damage from 1 of your Pokémon, and it recovers from all Special Conditions.\', \'You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Supporter', 'Trainer', '', ''),
('swsh35-61', '', '', 'Ryo Ueda', '', 'Champions Path', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Potion', '', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', '', '[\'Heal 30 damage from 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Item', 'Trainer', '', '');
