('swsh35-9', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Combustion\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Champions Path', '1', '', 'Centiskorch', 'It stores flammable gas in its body and uses it to generate heat. The yellow sections on its belly get particularly hot.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh35/swsh35-9.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sizzlipede', '850', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '9/25/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '9', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-1', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Bug Hunch\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Grass Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Kakuna', 'Its poison stinger is very powerful. Its bright-colored body is intended to warn off its enemies.', 'Eighth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Weedle', '13', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-10', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Nuzleaf', 'If it remains still, it looks just like a real nut. It delights in surprising foraging Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seedot', '273', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '10', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-100', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', '', 'Grapploct', 'Its very curious, but its means of investigating things is to try to punch them with its tentacles. The search for food is what brings it onto land.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clobbopus', '852', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '100', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-101', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Full Nelson\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tentacle Buster\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon used Full Nelson during your last turn, this attack does 120 more damage.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', 'Clobbopus', '', 'A body made up of nothing but muscle makes the grappling moves this Pokémon performs with its tentacles tremendously powerful.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grapploct', '853', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '101', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-102', '', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Armament\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Amazing Shield\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Fighting\', \'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from Pokémon VMAX.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', '', '', 'Its ability to deflect any attack led to it being known as the Fighting Masters Shield. It was feared and respected by all.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-102.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zamazenta', '889', 'TPCI', 'Amazing Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '102', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-103', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rear Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Mightyena', 'It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-103.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Poochyena', '261', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '103', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-104', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Ferocious Bellow\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks do 50 less damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Pitch-Black Fangs\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', 'Poochyena', '', 'It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-104.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mightyena', '262', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '104', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
