('swsh4-113', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Stealy Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip 3 coins. If any of them are heads, your opponent reveals their hand. Then, for each heads, discard a Trainer card from your opponent\'s hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Claw Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', 'Galarian Meowth', '', 'What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-113.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Perrserker', '863', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '113', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-114', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Take Down\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 30 damage to itself.\'}, {\'name\': \'Double KO\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Both Active Pokémon are Knocked Out.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '3', 'Pineco', '', 'In the moment that it gulps down its prey, the inside of its shell is exposed, but to this day, no one has ever seen that sight.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-114.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Forretress', '205', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '114', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
