('swsh4-116', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', '', 'Metang', 'If you anger it, it will do more than rampage. It will also burst out strong magnetism, causing nearby machines to break.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beldum', '374', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '116', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
