('swsh4-128', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'name\': \'Overhaul\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw 6 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Windup Cannon\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 more damage for each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', '', 'Built roughly 500 years ago by a scientist, the part called the Soul-Heart is the actual life-form.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magearna', '801', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '128', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-129', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Raging Claws\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Power Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', '', '', 'Its body resembles polished metal, and its both lightweight and strong. The only drawback is that it rusts easily.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duraludon', '884', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '129', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-13', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Absorb\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Heal 10 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Ninjask', 'Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead.', 'Eighth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nincada', '290', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
