('swsh4-55', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Bug Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Galvantula', 'Joltik can be found clinging to other Pokémon. Its soaking up static electricity because it cant produce a charge on its own.', 'Eighth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Joltik', '595', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-56', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Stun Needle\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Shocking Pursuit\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage for each damage counter on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', 'Joltik', '', 'It launches electrified fur from its abdomen as its means of attack. Opponents hit by the fur could be in for three full days and nights of paralysis.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galvantula', '596', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-57', '[{\'name\': \'Levitate\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Energy attached, it has no Retreat Cost.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Tiny Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Eelektrik', 'One alone can emit only trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock.', 'Eighth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tynamo', '602', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-58', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Shocking Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Head Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', 'Tynamo', 'Eelektross', 'These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eelektrik', '603', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '58', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-59', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Electrified Bite Mark\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if they attach an Energy card from their hand to the Defending Pokémon, put 6 damage counters on that Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Electro Sprinkler\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 1 of your Benched Pokémon and 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '3', 'Eelektrik', '', 'They crawl out of the ocean using their arms. They will attack prey on shore and immediately drag it into the ocean.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eelektross', '604', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '59', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-6', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'U-turn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'You may switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Cutting Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Yanmega', 'If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Yanma', '193', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-60', '', '', 'hatachu', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Wild Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon also does 60 damage to itself. Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '3', '', '', 'When the interior part of its tail spins like a motor, Zekrom can generate many bolts of lightning to blast its surroundings.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zekrom', '644', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-61', '', '', 'so-taro', '[{\'name\': \'Fighting Lightning\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon V or Pokémon-GX, this attack does 80 more damage.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '', '', '', 'It runs as fast as lightning strikes, shredding its opponents with its high-voltage claws.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zeraora', '807', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-62', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Fan\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', '', 'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pincurchin', '871', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-63', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Mini-Metronome\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, choose 1 of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks and use it as this attack.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Clefable', 'It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clefairy', '35', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-64', '[{\'name\': \'Lunar Blessing\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, if your Active Pokémon has any Psychic Energy attached, you may heal 20 damage from it, and it recovers from a Special Condition.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Magical Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', 'Clefairy', '', 'A timid fairy Pokémon that is rarely seen, it will run and hide the moment it senses people.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clefable', '36', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-65', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Psypower\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 2 damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon in any way you like.\"}, {\'name\': \'Commanding Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'You may have your opponent shuffle their hand into their deck. If you do, your opponent draws 4 cards.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', '', 'Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Girafarig', '203', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '65', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-66', '[{\'name\': \'Shell Survival\', \'text\': \"Put this Pokémon into play only with the effect of Ninjask\'s Cast-Off Shell Ability. (When you are setting up to play, you cannot put it face down as your Active Pokémon or on your Bench.)\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Life Squeeze\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put damage counters on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon until its remaining HP is 10.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', '', 'A most peculiar Pokémon that somehow appears in a Poké Ball when a Nincada evolves.', 'Eighth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shedinja', '292', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', ''),
('swsh4-67', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Haunt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 1 damage counter on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Banette', 'Theres a proverb that says, Shun the house where Shuppet gather in the growing dusk.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shuppet', '353', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-68', '[{\'name\': \'Curse of Devolution\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may devolve 1 of your opponent\'s Benched evolved Pokémon by putting the highest Stage Evolution card on it into your opponent\'s hand.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kodama', '[{\'name\': \'Spooky Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', 'Shuppet', '', 'Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Banette', '354', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '68', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-69', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Future Sight\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top 4 cards of either player\'s deck and put them back in any order.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Dusclops', 'If it finds bad children who wont listen to their parents, it will spirit them away—or so its said.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duskull', '355', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-7', '', '', 'Uta', '[{\'name\': \'U-turn\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'You may switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Cutting Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '', 'Yanma', '', 'This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Yanmega', '469', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-70', '', '', 'Kazuma Koda', '[{\'name\': \'Confuse Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psypunch\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', 'Duskull', 'Dusknoir', 'Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dusclops', '356', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '70', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-71', '[{\'name\': \'Spectral Breach\', \'text\': \"All Special Energy attached to Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s) provide Colorless Energy and have no other effect.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Spooky Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', 'Dusclops', '', 'At the bidding of transmissions from the spirit world, it steals people and Pokémon away. No one knows whether it has a will of its own.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dusknoir', '477', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '71', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-72', '', '', 'Asako Ito', '[{\'name\': \'Auspicious Tone\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Pokémon and a Supporter card, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', '', 'Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chimecho', '358', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '72', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-73', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Unamplified Soundwave\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) If you have any cards in your hand, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Swoobat', 'While inside a cave, if you look up and see lots of heart-shaped marks lining the walls, its evidence that Woobat live there.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Woobat', '527', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('swsh4-74', '[{\'name\': \'Unaware\', \'text\': \"Prevent all effects of your opponent\'s attacks, except damage, done to this Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Heart Stamp\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', 'Woobat', '', 'Emitting powerful sound waves tires it out. Afterward, it wont be able to fly for a little while.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Swoobat', '528', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '11/13/2020', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '74', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-75', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Rolling Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', 'Whimsicott', 'It shoots cotton from its body to protect itself. If it gets caught up in hurricane-strength winds, it can get sent to the other side of the Earth.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cottonee', '546', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '75', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-76', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Triple Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 3 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Flying Fury\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Before doing damage, you may discard any number of Pokémon Tools from your Pokémon. This attack does 40 more damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '', 'Cottonee', '', 'It scatters cotton all over the place as a prank. If it gets wet, itll become too heavy to move and have no choice but to answer for its mischief.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Whimsicott', '547', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '76', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-77', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Tail Trickery\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', '', 'Its upper whiskers are sensors that survey its surroundings. Its lower whiskers are organs that shoot electricity.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dedenne', '702', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '77', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-78', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Geo Hunt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put a card from your discard pile into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Aurora Gain\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '2', '', '', 'When the horns on its head shine in seven different colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Xerneas', '716', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh4-79', '[{\'name\': \'Sparkle Veil\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, any damage done to your Pokémon by an opponent\'s attack is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Sensitive Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'If you played a Supporter card from your hand during this turn, this attack does 70 more damage.\'}]', 'Vivid Voltage', '1', '', '', 'It can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh4/swsh4-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Diancie', '719', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'D', '11/13/2020', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '79', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
