('swsh45-7', '', '', 'AKIRA EGAWA', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shining Fates', '1', 'Rowlet', 'Decidueye', 'It throws one knifelike feather after another at its enemies, and each one precisely strikes a weak point. These feathers are known as blade quills.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45/swsh45-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dartrix', '723', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
