('swsh45sv-SV006', '[{\'name\': \'Voltage Beat\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Grass Energy cards and attach them to 1 of your Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Thwackey', '', 'By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV006.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rillaboom', '812', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV006', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
