('swsh45sv-SV008', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Reflect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 40 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Blipbug', 'Orbeetle', 'As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV008.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dottler', '825', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV008', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV009', '[{\'name\': \"Bug\'s Radar\", \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may look at the top 3 cards of your opponent\'s deck and put them back in any order.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Brainwave\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each Psychic Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Dottler', '', 'It emits psychic energy to observe and study whats around it—and whats around it can include things over six miles away.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV009.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Orbeetle', '826', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV009', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV010', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Eldegoss', 'It whirls around in the wind while singing a joyous song. This delightful display has charmed many into raising this Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV010.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gossifleur', '829', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV010', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV011', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Blessing of Fluff\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Grass Energy cards and attach them to your Benched Pokémon in any way you like. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leafage\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Gossifleur', '', 'The cotton on the head of this Pokémon can be spun into a glossy, gorgeous yarn—a Galar regional specialty.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV011.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eldegoss', '830', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV011', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV012', '', '', 'otumami', '[{\'name\': \'Withdraw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Flapple', 'It spends its entire life inside an apple. It hides from its natural enemies, bird Pokémon, by pretending its just an apple and nothing more.', 'Eighth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV012.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Applin', '840', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV012', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV013', '[{\'name\': \'Apple Drop\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may put 2 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. If you placed any damage counters in this way, shuffle this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Acid Spray\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Applin', '', 'It ate a sour apple, and that induced its evolution. In its cheeks, it stores an acid capable of causing chemical burns.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV013.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flapple', '841', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV013', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV014', '[{\'name\': \'Delicious Aroma\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may flip a coin. If heads, switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Basic Pokémon with their Active Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Applin', '', 'Eating a sweet apple caused its evolution. A nectarous scent wafts from its body, luring in the bug Pokémon it preys on.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV014.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Appletun', '842', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV014', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV015', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Ember\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Raboot', 'It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once its raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV015.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scorbunny', '813', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV015', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV016', '', '', 'Lee HyunJung', '[{\'name\': \'Flame Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Fire Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Magnum Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Scorbunny', 'Cinderace', 'It kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV016.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Raboot', '814', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV016', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV017', '[{\'name\': \'Libero\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, when this Pokémon moves from your Bench to the Active Spot, you may attach up to 2 Fire Energy cards from your discard pile to it.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Flare Striker\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'190\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Raboot', '', 'Its skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV017.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cinderace', '815', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV017', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV018', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Combustion\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Centiskorch', 'It stores flammable gas in its body and uses it to generate heat. The yellow sections on its belly get particularly hot.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV018.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sizzlipede', '850', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV018', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV019', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Hundred Foot Flames\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"For each Fire Energy attached to this Pokémon, discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Searing Flame\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Burned.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Sizzlipede', '', 'When it heats up, its body temperature reaches about 1,500 degrees Fahrenheit. It lashes its body like a whip and launches itself at enemies.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV019.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Centiskorch', '851', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV019', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV020', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Reflect\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Icy Snow\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Mr. Rime', 'Its talent is tap-dancing. It can also manipulate temperatures to create a floor of ice, which this Pokémon can kick up to use as a barrier.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV020.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Mr. Mime', '122', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV020', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV021', '[{\'name\': \'Shuffle Dance\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may switch 1 of your opponent\'s face-down Prize cards with the top card of their deck. (The cards stay face down.)\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Mad Party\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each Pokémon in your discard pile that has the Mad Party attack.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Galarian Mr. Mime', '', 'Its highly skilled at tap-dancing. It waves its cane of ice in time with its graceful movements.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV021.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Mr. Rime', '866', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV021', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV022', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Aurora Loop\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'Put 2 Water Energy attached to this Pokémon into your hand.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', '', 'Said to be the embodiment of north winds, it can instantly purify filthy, murky water.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV022.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Suicune', '245', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV022', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV023', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Darmanitan', 'It lived in snowy areas for so long that its fire sac cooled off and atrophied. It now has an organ that generates cold instead.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV023.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Darumaka', '554', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV023', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV024', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzard\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Crushing Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t use Crushing Headbutt.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Galarian Darumaka', '', 'On days when blizzards blow through, it comes down to where people live. It stashes food in the snowball on its head, taking it home for later.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV024.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Darmanitan', '555', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV024', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV025', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Drizzile', 'When scared, this Pokémon cries. Its tears pack the chemical punch of 100 onions, and attackers wont be able to resist weeping.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV025.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sobble', '816', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV025', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV026', '[{\'name\': \'Shady Dealings\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Trainer cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Water Drip\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Sobble', 'Inteleon', 'A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles using water balloons created with moisture secreted from its palms.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV026.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drizzile', '817', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV026', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('swsh45sv-SV027', '[{\'name\': \'Shady Dealings\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Trainer cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Bullet\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Drizzile', '', 'It has many hidden capabilities, such as fingertips that can shoot water and a membrane on its back that it can use to glide through the air.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV027.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Inteleon', '818', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV027', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV028', '', '', 'otumami', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Drednaw', 'It starts off battles by attacking with its rock-hard horn, but as soon as the opponent flinches, this Pokémon bites down and never lets go.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV028.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chewtle', '833', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV028', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV029', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Vise Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Colorless in your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost.\"}, {\'name\': \'Jaw Lock\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Chewtle', '', 'This Pokémon rapidly extends its retractable neck to sink its sharp fangs into distant enemies and take them down.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV029.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drednaw', '834', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV029', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV030', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Dive\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all effects of attacks, including damage, done to this Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hydro Pump\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 more damage for each Water Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', '', 'Its so strong that it can knock out some opponents in a single hit, but it also may forget what its battling midfight.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV030.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cramorant', '845', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV030', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV031', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Barraskewda', 'If it sees any movement around it, this Pokémon charges for it straightaway, leading with its sharply pointed jaw. Its very proud of that jaw.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV031.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arrokuda', '846', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV031', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV032', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Spiral Jet\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"Discard 2 Water Energy cards from your hand. If you don\'t, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Arrokuda', '', 'This Pokémon has a jaw thats as sharp as a spear and as strong as steel. Apparently Barraskewdas flesh is surprisingly tasty, too.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV032.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Barraskewda', '847', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV032', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV033', '', '', 'Yumi', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Basic Pokémon and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Frosmoth', 'It spits out thread imbued with a frigid sort of energy and uses it to tie its body to branches, disguising itself as an icicle while it sleeps.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV033.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snom', '872', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV033', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV034', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Dance\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn, you may attach a Water Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Benched Water Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Aurora Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Snom', '', 'It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV034.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Frosmoth', '873', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV034', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV035', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Face\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon has full HP, it takes 60 less damage from your opponent\'s attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzard\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', '', 'It drifted in on the flow of ocean waters from a frigid place. It keeps its head iced constantly to make sure it stays nice and cold.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV035.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eiscue', '875', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV035', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV036', '[{\'name\': \'Primal Law\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, your opponent can\'t play any Pokémon from their hand to evolve their Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Rare Fossil', '', 'Powerful legs and jaws made it the apex predator of its time. Its own overhunting of its prey was what drove it to extinction.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV036.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dracovish', '882', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV036', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV037', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Hard Face\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 60 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Cold Breath\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Rare Fossil', '', 'Though its able to capture prey by freezing its surroundings, it has trouble eating the prey afterward because its mouth is on top of its head.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV037.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arctovish', '883', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV037', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV038', '[{\'name\': \'Roto Choice\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Item cards that have the word \"Rotom\" in their name, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', '', 'One boys invention led to the development of many different machines that take advantage of Rotoms unique capabilities.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV038.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rotom', '479', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV038', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV039', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Roar\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Boltund', 'This Pokémon is very popular as a herding dog in the Galar region. As it runs, it generates electricity from the base of its tail.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV039.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Yamper', '835', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV039', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV040', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Big Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fighting Fangs\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon V or Pokémon-GX, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Yamper', '', 'This Pokémon generates electricity and channels it into its legs to keep them going strong. Boltund can run nonstop for three full days.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV040.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Boltund', '836', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV040', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV041', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Toxtricity', 'It stores poison in an internal poison sac and secretes that poison through its skin. If you touch this Pokémon, a tingling sensation follows.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV041.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxel', '848', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV041', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV042', '', '', 'Hideki Ishikawa', '[{\'name\': \'Risk Taker\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard the top 5 cards of your opponent\'s deck. If tails, discard the top 5 cards of your deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Thunder Jolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Toxel', '', 'When this Pokémon sounds as if its strumming a guitar, its actually clawing at the protrusions on its chest to generate electricity.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV042.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxtricity', '849', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV042', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV043', '', '', 'Motofumi Fujiwara', '[{\'name\': \'Shocking Needles\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \"Flip 4 coins. This attack does 30 damage for each heads. If at least 2 of them are heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', '', 'It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to scrape it off rocks. Electric current flows from the tips of its spines.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV043.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pincurchin', '871', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV043', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV044', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Torment\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Choose 1 of your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks. During your opponent\'s next turn, that Pokémon can\'t use that attack.\"}, {\'name\': \'Spark\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', '', 'As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its constant hunger. Its also generating electricity.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV044.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Morpeko', '877', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV044', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV045', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Amping Up\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s Amping Up attack does 90 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Giga Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'200\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '4', 'Rare Fossil', '', 'In ancient times, it was unbeatable thanks to its powerful lower body, but it went extinct anyway after it depleted all its plant-based food sources.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV045.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dracozolt', '880', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV045', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV046', '[{\'name\': \'Biting Whirlpool\', \'text\': \'Whenever your opponent attaches an Energy card from their hand to 1 of their Pokémon, put 2 damage counters on that Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Rare Fossil', '', 'The shaking of its freezing upper half is what generates its electricity. It has a hard time walking around.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV046.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arctozolt', '881', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV046', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV047', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Psy Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Rapidash', 'This Pokémon will look into your eyes and read the contents of your heart. If it finds evil there, it promptly hides away.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV047.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Ponyta', '77', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV047', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
