('swsh45sv-SV067', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Carkol', 'Most of its body has the same composition as coal. Fittingly, this Pokémon was first discovered in coal mines about 400 years ago.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV067.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rolycoly', '837', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV067', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV068', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Heat Crash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Rolycoly', 'Coalossal', 'It forms coal inside its body. Coal dropped by this Pokémon once helped fuel the lives of people in the Galar region.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV068.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Carkol', '838', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV068', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV069', '[{\'name\': \'Tar Generator\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may attach a Fire Energy card, a Fighting Energy card, or 1 of each from your discard pile to your Pokémon in any way you like.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Flaming Avalanche\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '4', 'Carkol', '', 'Its usually peaceful, but the vandalism of mines enrages it. Offenders will be incinerated with flames that reach 2,700 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV069.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Coalossal', '839', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV069', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV070', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Sand Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if the Defending Pokémon tries to attack, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack doesn\'t happen.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Sandaconda', 'It spews sand from its nostrils. While the enemy is blinded, it burrows into the ground to hide.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV070.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Silicobra', '843', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV070', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV071', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Coil\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon\'s attacks do 120 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Skull Bash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Silicobra', '', 'Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand out of its sand sac more efficiently.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV071.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandaconda', '844', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV071', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV072', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Bind\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Grapploct', 'Its very curious, but its means of investigating things is to try to punch them with its tentacles. The search for food is what brings it onto land.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV072.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clobbopus', '852', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV072', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV073', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Octolock\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Until this Grapploct leaves the Active Spot, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks cost ColorlessColorless more, and the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat. This effect can\'t be applied more than once.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tough Swing\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Clobbopus', '', 'A body made up of nothing but muscle makes the grappling moves this Pokémon performs with its tentacles tremendously powerful.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV073.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grapploct', '853', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV073', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV074', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Team Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 damage for each of your Benched Pokémon that has \"Falinks\" in its name.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', '', 'Five of them are troopers, and one is the brass. The brasss orders are absolute.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV074.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Falinks', '870', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV074', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV075', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Mega Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Power Press\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120+\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon has at least 1 extra Energy attached (in addition to this attack\'s cost), this attack does 60 more damage.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '4', '', '', 'It stands in grasslands, watching the suns descent from zenith to horizon. This Pokémon has a talent for delivering dynamic kicks.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV075.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stonjourner', '874', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV075', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV076', '', '', 'Yumi', '[{\'name\': \'Ascension\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Weezing', 'Its body is full of poisonous gas. It floats into garbage dumps, seeking out the fumes of raw, rotting trash.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV076.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Koffing', '109', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV076', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV077', '[{\'name\': \'Neutralizing Gas\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, your opponent\'s Pokémon in play have no Abilities, except for Neutralizing Gas.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Severe Poison\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned. Put 4 damage counters instead of 1 on that Pokémon during Pokémon Checkup.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Koffing', '', 'This Pokémon consumes particles that contaminate the air. Instead of leaving droppings, it expels clean air.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV077.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Weezing', '110', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV077', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV078', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt Tantrum\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may put 1 damage counter on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Surprise Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Linoone', 'Thought to be the oldest form of Zigzagoon, it moves in zigzags and wreaks havoc upon its surroundings.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV078.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Zigzagoon', '263', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV078', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV079', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Night Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Galarian Zigzagoon', 'Obstagoon', 'This very aggressive Pokémon will recklessly challenge opponents stronger than itself.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV079.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Linoone', '264', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV079', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV080', '[{\'name\': \'Untamed Shout\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may put 3 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Obstruct\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from Basic Pokémon.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Galarian Linoone', '', 'It evolved after experiencing numerous fights. While crossing its arms, it lets out a shout that would make any opponent flinch.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV080.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Obstagoon', '862', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV080', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV081', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Instigate\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent shuffles their hand and puts it on the bottom of their deck. If they put any cards on the bottom of their deck in this way, they draw 3 cards.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Thievul', 'Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon. It survives off its ill-gotten gains.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV081.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Nickit', '827', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV081', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV082', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Thief\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. Choose a card you find there and put it on the bottom of their deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Darkness Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Nickit', '', 'It secretly marks potential targets with a scent. By following the scent, it stalks its targets and steals from them when they least expect it.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV082.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Thievul', '828', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV082', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV083', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Stampede\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Morgrem', 'Through its nose, it sucks in the emanations produced by people and Pokémon when they feel annoyed. It thrives off this negative energy.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV083.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Impidimp', '859', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV083', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('swsh45sv-SV084', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'False Surrender\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by any effects on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Impidimp', 'Grimmsnarl', 'When it gets down on all fours as if to beg for forgiveness, its trying to lure opponents in so that it can stab them with its spear-like hair.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV084.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Morgrem', '860', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV084', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV085', '[{\'name\': \'Dark Oath\', \'text\': \"As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s attacks cost Colorless more.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Press\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', 'Morgrem', '', 'With the hair wrapped around its body helping to enhance its muscles, this Pokémon can overwhelm even Machamp.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV085.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grimmsnarl', '861', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV085', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV086', '[{\'name\': \'Evolution Roar\', \'text\': \'You must discard 2 cards from your hand in order to use this Ability. Once during your turn, you may search your deck for a Galarian Perrserker, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', 'Perrserker', 'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokémons body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV086.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Meowth', '52', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV086', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV087', '[{\'name\': \'Steely Spirit\', \'text\': \"Your Metal Pokémon\'s attacks do 20 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Galarian Meowth', '', 'What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV087.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Perrserker', '863', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV087', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV088', '[{\'name\': \'Snap Trap\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is in the Active Spot and is damaged by an opponent\'s attack (even if it is Knocked Out), discard an Energy from the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Damage Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', '', 'Living in mud with a high iron content has given it a strong steel body.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV088.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Stunfisk', '618', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV088', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV089', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Iron Wings\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \"You may discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon. If you do, during your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 100 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', 'Corvisquire', '', 'This Pokémon reigns supreme in the skies of the Galar region. The black luster of its steel body could drive terror into the heart of any foe.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV089.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Corviknight', '823', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV089', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV090', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Strength\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '3', '', 'Copperajah', 'It digs up the ground with its trunk. Its also very strong, being able to carry loads of over five tons without any problem at all.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV090.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cufant', '878', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV090', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV091', '[{\'name\': \'Antibacterial Skin\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t be affected by any Special Conditions.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Vengeful Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120+\', \'text\': \'If your Benched Pokémon have any damage counters on them, this attack does 120 more damage.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '4', 'Cufant', '', 'They came over from another region long ago and worked together with humans. Their green skin is resistant to water.', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV091.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Copperajah', '879', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV091', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV092', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Sharpener\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Attach a Metal Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Power Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '2', '', '', 'Its body resembles polished metal, and its both lightweight and strong. The only drawback is that it rusts easily.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV092.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duraludon', '884', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV092', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV093', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Glance\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Tail Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Cinccino', 'The way it brushes away grime with its tail can be helpful when cleaning. But its focus on spotlessness can make cleaning more of a hassle.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV093.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Minccino', '572', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV093', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV094', '[{\'name\': \'Make Do\', \'text\': \'You must discard a card from your hand in order to use this Ability. Once during your turn, you may draw 2 cards.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Assist\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', 'Minccino', '', 'Its body secretes oil that this Pokémon spreads over its nest as a coating to protect it from dust. Cinccino wont tolerate even a speck of the stuff.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV094.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cinccino', '573', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV094', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh45sv-SV095', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Flap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Shiny Vault', '1', '', 'Swanna', 'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh45sv/swsh45sv-SV095.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ducklett', '580', 'TPCI', 'Rare Shiny', 'D', '2/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SV095', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
