('swsh5-56', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Dazzle Dance\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Power Gem\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '3', 'Spoink', '', 'It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grumpig', '326', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-57', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Self-Destruct\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 60 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', 'Claydol', 'It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Baltoy', '343', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-58', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Power Split\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Attach Psychic Energy cards from your discard pile to your Pokémon in any way you like until your Pokémon and your opponent\'s Pokémon have the same total amount of Energy attached.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psyshot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '2', 'Baltoy', '', 'It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Claydol', '344', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '58', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-59', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Minor Errand-Running\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 basic Energy cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Pleasant Tone\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', '', 'Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chimecho', '358', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-6', '[{\'name\': \'Exciting Stage\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may draw cards until you have 3 cards in your hand. If this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, you may draw cards until you have 4 cards in your hand instead. You can\'t use more than 1 Exciting Stage Ability each turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Satoshi Shirai', '[{\'name\': \'X-Scissor\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kricketune V', '402', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '6', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-60', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Focused Wish\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', 'Meowstic', 'Theres enough psychic power in Espurr to send a wrestler flying, but because this power cant be controlled, Espurr finds it troublesome.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Espurr', '677', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-61', '[{\'name\': \'Ear Moves\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may move 1 damage counter from 1 of your Pokémon to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Yuu Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Psychic Sphere\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', 'Espurr', '', 'The defensive instinct of the males is strong. Its when theyre protecting themselves or their partners that they unleash their full power.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Meowstic', '678', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-62', '[{\'name\': \'Dummy Doll\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may prevent all damage done to this Mimikyu V by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon until the end of your opponent\'s next turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Eske Yoshinob', '[{\'name\': \'Jealous Eyes\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon for each Prize card your opponent has taken.\"}]', 'Battle Styles', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mimikyu V', '778', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '62', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-63', '', '', 'PLANETA Tsuji', '[{\'name\': \'Prismatic Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 20 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Special Laser\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Special Energy attached, this attack does 120 more damage.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '3', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Necrozma V', '800', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '63', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-64', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Radar\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 4 cards of your deck and put them back in any order.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '2', 'Blipbug', 'Orbeetle', 'As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dottler', '825', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '64', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-65', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Evomancy\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'For each Energy attached to this Pokémon, search your deck for a Stage 2 Pokémon, except Orbeetle, and put it onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Zen Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', 'Dottler', '', 'It emits psychic energy to observe and study whats around it—and whats around it can include things over six miles away.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Orbeetle', '826', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '3/19/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '65', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-66', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Focus Fist\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', 'Primeape', 'If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mankey', '56', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '66', 'Basic, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
