('swsh5-67', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Field Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'If your opponent has a Stadium in play, discard it.\'}, {\'name\': \"Steamin\' Mad Strike\", \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 50 damage for each of your Benched Pokémon that has any damage counters on it.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '2', 'Mankey', '', 'The blood vessels in its brain are sturdier than those of other Pokémon, so it can stay healthy despite its constant raging.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Primeape', '57', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '67', 'Stage 1, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-68', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rocky Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 5, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 60 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '4', '', 'Steelix', 'It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Onix', '95', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-69', '', '', 'You Iribi', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', 'Marowak', 'It wears its mothers skull on its head, so no one knows what its bare face looks like. However, its clear that its always crying.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cubone', '104', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '69', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-7', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Leafage\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', 'Cherrim', 'The deeper a Cherubis red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cherubi', '420', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-70', '[{\'name\': \'Battle Armor\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Bonemerang\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 90 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '2', 'Cubone', '', 'They thump their bones rhythmically to communicate among themselves. There are nearly 50 different rhythmic patterns.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Marowak', '105', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '70', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-71', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', 'Gliscor', 'It flies straight at its targets face then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gligar', '207', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-72', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Acrobatics\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 40 more damage for each heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Guillotine\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', 'Gligar', '', 'Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey… Then its elongated fangs do the rest.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gliscor', '472', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '72', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-73', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '2', '', 'Gurdurr', 'Timburr that have started carrying logs that are about three times their size are nearly ready to evolve.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-73.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Timburr', '532', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '73', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-74', '', '', 'Uta', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '3', 'Timburr', 'Conkeldurr', 'Gurdurr excels at demolition—construction is not its forte. In any case, theres skill in the way this Pokémon wields its metal beam.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gurdurr', '533', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '74', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-75', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer Pressure\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon is an Evolution Pokémon, it can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mega Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '3', 'Gurdurr', '', 'When going all out, this Pokémon throws aside its concrete pillars and leaps at opponents to pummel them with its fists.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Conkeldurr', '534', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '75', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-76', '', '', 'NC Empire', '[{\'name\': \'Double Stab\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 30 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', '', 'Mienshao', 'They seclude themselves in the mountains and devote themselves to training. The form of their kicks and chops differs from pack to pack.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienfoo', '619', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '76', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-77', '', '', 'Taira Akitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Spinning Whip\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused. Shuffle this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck.\"}]', 'Battle Styles', '1', 'Mienfoo', '', 'When Mienshao lets out a bizarre wail, youre in danger. A flurry of kicks and chops too fast to see is about to be unleashed!', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienshao', '620', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '77', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh5-78', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Battle Styles', '2', '', 'Carkol', 'It can race around like a unicycle, even on rough, rocky terrain. Burning coal sustains it.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh5/swsh5-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rolycoly', '837', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '3/19/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
