('swsh6-10', '[{\'name\': \'Toughness Boost\', \'text\': \"Your Single Strike Pokémon in play, except any Abomasnow, get +50 HP. You can\'t apply more than 1 Toughness Boost Ability at a time.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Mega Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '3', 'Snover', '', 'This Pokémon is known to bring blizzards. A shake of its massive body is enough to cause whiteout conditions.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Abomasnow', '460', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '10', 'Stage 1, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
