('swsh6-24', '', '', 'Mika Pikazo', '[{\'name\': \'Combustion\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Fire Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'170\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', 'Larvesta', '', 'According to legends, it was hatched from a flaming cocoon to save people and Pokémon that were suffering from the cold.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-24.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Volcarona', '637', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '24', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-25', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Heat Blast\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Dynamite Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has 10 or more damage counters on it, this attack does 150 more damage.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '3', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-25.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Volcanion V', '721', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '25', 'Basic, V, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-26', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', 'Raboot', 'It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once its raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-26.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Scorbunny', '813', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '26', 'Basic, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-27', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Volley Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Scorbunny', 'Cinderace', 'It kicks berries right off the branches of trees and then juggles them with its feet, practicing its footwork.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-27.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Raboot', '814', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '27', 'Stage 1, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-28', '[{\'name\': \'Crisis Power\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon\'s attacks do 30 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon for each Prize card your opponent has taken (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Fireball Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Raboot', '', 'Its skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-28.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cinderace', '815', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '28', 'Stage 2, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-29', '', '', 'Atsushi Furusawa', '[{\'name\': \'Wintry Call\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Melony cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Icy Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', '', 'Crossing icy seas is no issue for this cold-resistant Pokémon. Its smooth skin is a little cool to the touch.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-29.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '29', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-3', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Persist Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon has any Special Energy attached, it is Knocked Out.\"}, {\'name\': \'Jet Spear\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Kakuna', '', 'May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Beedrill', '15', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '3', 'Stage 2, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-30', '', '', 'NC Empire', '[{\'name\': \'Cut Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', 'Weavile', 'It has a cunning yet savage disposition. It waits for parents to leave their nests, and then it sneaks in to steal their eggs.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sneasel', '215', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '30', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-31', '', '', 'Taira Akitsu', '[{\'name\': \'Two-Hit KO\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'During your next turn, if the Defending Pokémon is damaged by an attack from a Rapid Strike Pokémon, it will be Knocked Out.\'}, {\'name\': \'Nasty Plot\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 cards and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Sneasel', '', 'With its claws, it leaves behind signs for its friends to find. The number of distinct signs is said to be over 500.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Weavile', '461', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '31', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-32', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Icy Snow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Package Delivery\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck. If you do, search your deck for a card and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', '', 'It has a generous habit of sharing its food with people and Pokémon, so its always scrounging around for more food.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Delibird', '225', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '32', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('swsh6-33', '[{\'name\': \'Weather Reading\', \'text\': \"If you have 8 or more Stadium cards in your discard pile, ignore all Energy in this Pokémon\'s attack costs.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Rainfall\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '', '', '', 'This is Castforms form when pelted by rain. In an experiment where it was placed in a shower, this Pokémon didnt change to this form.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Castform Rainy Form', '351', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '33', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-34', '[{\'name\': \'Weather Reading\', \'text\': \"If you have 8 or more Stadium cards in your discard pile, ignore all Energy in this Pokémon\'s attack costs.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'name\': \'Frosty Typhoon\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t use Frosty Typhoon.\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '', '', '', 'This is Castforms form when caught in a hailstorm. Its whole body is chilled, and its skin is partially frozen!', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Castform Snowy Form', '351', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '34', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-35', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', 'Glalie, Froslass', 'It can only survive in cold areas. It bounces happily around, even in environments as cold as −150 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Snorunt', '361', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '35', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-36', '[{\'name\': \'Frost Over\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may attach a Water Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Crystal Breath\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Snorunt', '', 'It spits out cold air of nearly −60 degrees Fahrenheit to freeze its quarry. It brings frozen prey back to its lair and neatly lines them up.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Froslass', '478', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '36', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-37', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', '', 'Sealeo', 'Its body is covered in fluffy fur. The fur keeps it from feeling cold while it is rolling on ice.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spheal', '363', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '37', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-38', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Aurora Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '4', 'Spheal', 'Walrein', 'Be it Spheal or a Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sealeo', '364', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '38', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-39', '', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'name\': \'Aurora Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hail Prison\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \"Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon. Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '4', 'Sealeo', '', 'It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Walrein', '365', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '39', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-4', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', 'Ledian', 'These very cowardly Pokémon join together and use Reflect to protect their nest.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ledyba', '165', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '4', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-40', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Smash Turn\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'You may switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ocean Loop\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Put an Energy attached to this Pokémon into your hand.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', '', 'Although its called a guardian deity, terrible calamities sometimes befall those who recklessly approach Tapu Fini.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tapu Fini', '788', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '40', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-41', '', '', 'Yuu Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Keep Calling\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Basic Rapid Strike Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Double Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', 'Drizzile', 'When it gets wet, its skin changes color, and this Pokémon becomes invisible as if it were camouflaged.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sobble', '816', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '41', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-42', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Bounce\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Sobble', 'Inteleon', 'Highly intelligent but also very lazy, it keeps enemies out of its territory by laying traps everywhere.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drizzile', '817', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '42', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-43', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Shooting\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn, you may put 2 damage counters on 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'NC Empire', '[{\'name\': \'Waterfall\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Drizzile', '', 'Its nictitating membranes let it pick out foes weak points so it can precisely blast them with water that shoots from its fingertips at Mach 3.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Inteleon', '818', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '43', 'Stage 2, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-44', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Slashing Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rapid-Fisted Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 damage for each of your Rapid Strike Pokémon in play.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', 'Kubfu', '', 'This form of Urshifu is a strong believer in defeating foes by raining many blows down on them. Its strikes are nonstop, flowing like a river.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rapid Strike Urshifu', '892', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '44', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-45', '', '', 'D.A.G Inc.', '[{\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Glacial Lance\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'200\', \'text\': \'Discard 2 Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ice Rider Calyrex V', '898', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '45', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-46', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Ride of the High King\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Max Lance\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'You may discard up to 2 Energy from this Pokémon. If you do, this attack does 120 more damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', 'Ice Rider Calyrex V', '', '', 'Eighth', '320', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ice Rider Calyrex VMAX', '898', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '46', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-47', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Growl\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks do 20 less damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', '', 'Flaaffy', 'Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. Youll want to pet it because its cute, but if you use your bare hand, youll get a painful shock.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mareep', '179', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-48', '', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', 'Mareep', 'Ampharos', 'It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flaaffy', '180', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '48', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-49', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Searchlight Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90+\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. If you find any Energy cards there, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '2', 'Flaaffy', '', 'Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ampharos', '181', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '49', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-5', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Rapid Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Air Slash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'Discard an Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Ledyba', '', 'It flies through the night sky, sprinkling sparkly dust. According to some, if that dust sticks to you, good things will happen to you.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ledian', '166', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '5', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-50', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Spear\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', '', 'Zebstrika', 'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Blitzle', '522', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '50', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh6-51', '', '', 'Hasuno', '[{\'name\': \'Coordinated Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'If 1 of your other Rapid Strike Pokémon used an attack during your last turn, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Spark Rush\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 90 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Chilling Reign', '1', 'Blitzle', '', 'They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh6/swsh6-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Zebstrika', '523', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '6/18/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '51', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
