('swsh7-31', '[{\'name\': \'Fleet-Footed\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, if this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, you may draw a card.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Ayaka Yoshida', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzard Rondo\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 more damage for each Benched Pokémon (both yours and your opponent\'s).\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Suicune V', '245', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '31', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
