('swsh7-34', '[{\'name\': \'Enthusiastic Dance\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may use this Ability. During this turn, your Basic Pokémon\'s attacks do 100 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Lombre', '', 'If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in order to amplify its power.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ludicolo', '272', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '34', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-35', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Fin\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', 'Sharpedo', 'With its sturdy jaws and fangs, it can easily chomp wooden boats to splinters. It fights with Basculin over food.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Carvanha', '318', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '35', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-36', '', '', 'Kazuma Koda', '[{\'name\': \'Taunt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Jet Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', 'Carvanha', '', 'It drinks in seawater and jets it from its rear to propel itself. Its very sensitive to the scent of blood.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sharpedo', '319', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '36', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-37', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Flail Around\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. This attack does 10 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', 'Milotic', 'It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.', 'Eighth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Feebas', '349', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '37', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-38', '[{\'name\': \'Dew Guard\', \'text\': \'Whenever your opponent plays a Supporter card from their hand, prevent all effects of that card done to you or your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sui', '[{\'name\': \'Double Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70×\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 70 damage for each heads.\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Feebas', '', 'Its said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions youre feeling.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Milotic', '350', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '38', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-39', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Synchrodraw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Shuffle your hand into your deck. Then, draw a card for each card in your opponent\'s hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Water Gun\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', '', 'Luvdisc makes its home in coral reefs in warm seas. It especially likes sleeping in the space between Corsolas branches.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Luvdisc', '370', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '39', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-4', '[{\'name\': \'Fluffy Barrage\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon may attack twice each turn. If the first attack Knocks Out your opponent\'s Active Pokémon, you may attack again after your opponent chooses a new Active Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '', 'Skiploom', '', 'Even in the fiercest wind, it can control its fluff to make its way to any place in the world it wants.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jumpluff', '189', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '4', 'Stage 2, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-40', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Frozen Awakening\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon to evolve it. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heavy Snow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Discard a Stadium in play.\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Glaceon V', '471', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '40', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-41', '[{\'name\': \'Crystal Veil\', \'text\': \"Prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon VMAX, except any Glaceon VMAX.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'PLANETA Tsuji', '[{\'name\': \'Max Icicle\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Glaceon V', '', '', 'Eighth', '310', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Glaceon VMAX', '471', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '41', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-42', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Mud-Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', 'Palpitoad', 'It uses sound waves to communicate with others of its kind. People and other Pokémon species cant hear its cries of warning.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tympole', '535', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '42', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('swsh7-43', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Element Chain\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top 6 cards of your deck and attach any number of basic Energy cards you find there to your Pokémon in any way you like. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Icy Snow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', '', 'They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148 degrees Fahrenheit.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cryogonal', '615', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '43', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-44', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', 'Avalugg', 'This Pokémon lives in areas of frigid cold. It secures itself to the back of an Avalugg by freezing its feet in place.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bergmite', '712', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '44', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-45', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Frost Barrier\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '4', 'Bergmite', '', 'As Avalugg moves about during the day, the cracks in its body deepen. The Pokémons body returns to a pristine state overnight.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Avalugg', '713', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-46', '[{\'name\': \'Group Power\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has 3 or more Water Energy attached, it gets +150 HP.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'name\': \'Schooling Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each basic Energy attached to this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', '', 'When it senses danger, its eyes tear up. The sparkle of its tears signals other Wishiwashi to gather.', 'Eighth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wishiwashi', '746', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '46', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-47', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Icy Snow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Blockface\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from Basic Pokémon.\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', '', 'This Pokémon keeps its heat-sensitive head cool with ice. It fishes for its food, dangling its single hair into the sea to lure in prey.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Eiscue', '875', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-48', '', '', 'Eske Yoshinob', '[{\'name\': \'Ancient Freeze\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon is a Pokémon V or a Pokémon-GX, it can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Giga Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'220\', \'text\': \"During your next turn, this Pokémon can\'t attack.\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Arctovish V', '883', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '48', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-49', '', '', 'chibi', '[{\'name\': \'Energize\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach a Lightning Energy card from your discard pile to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', 'Raichu', 'When Pikachu meet, theyll touch their tails together and exchange electricity through them as a form of greeting.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pikachu', '25', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '49', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-5', '', '', 'otumami', '[{\'name\': \'Astonish\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Choose a random card from your opponent\'s hand. Your opponent reveals that card and shuffles it into their deck.\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', 'Nuzleaf', 'It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Seedot', '273', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '5', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-50', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Big Sparking\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage to each Pokémon V and Pokémon-GX (both yours and your opponent\'s). (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Thunderbolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'Discard all Energy from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Pikachu', '', 'If its electric pouches run empty, it raises its tail to gather electricity from the atmosphere.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Raichu', '26', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-51', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Max Thunder Rumble\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 100 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon that has any damage counters on it. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '', 'Jolteon V', '', '', 'Eighth', '300', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jolteon VMAX', '135', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', '', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '51', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-52', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', 'Lanturn', 'On the dark ocean floor, its only means of communication is its constantly flashing lights.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chinchou', '170', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '52', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-53', '', '', 'ryoma uratsuka', '[{\'name\': \'Blinding Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if the Defending Pokémon tries to attack, your opponent flips a coin. If tails, that attack doesn\'t happen.\"}, {\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Chinchou', '', 'This Pokémon flashes a bright light that blinds its prey. This creates an opening for it to deliver an electrical attack.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lanturn', '171', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '53', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-54', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Rear Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', 'Flaaffy', 'Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. Youll want to pet it because its cute, but if you use your bare hand, youll get a painful shock.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mareep', '179', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '54', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-55', '[{\'name\': \'Dynamotor\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may attach a Lightning Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'OKACHEKE', '[{\'name\': \'Electro Ball\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Mareep', 'Ampharos', 'It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flaaffy', '180', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '55', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-56', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}, {\'name\': \'Electron Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100+\', \'text\': \'You may discard 3 Lightning Energy from this Pokémon. If you do, this attack does 120 more damage.\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Flaaffy', '', 'Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ampharos', '181', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '56', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-57', '', '', 'Nagomi Nijo', '[{\'name\': \'Thunder Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '', '', '', 'As it flies, it scatters electricity around, so bird Pokémon keep their distance. Thats why Emolga can keep all its food to itself.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Emolga', '587', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '57', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-58', '', '', 'Ryota Murayama', '[{\'name\': \'Primeval Beak\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, Energy cards can\'t be attached from your opponent\'s hand to the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mountain Swing\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \'Discard the top 3 cards of your deck.\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '3', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dracozolt V', '880', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '58', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-59', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Spark Trap\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, if this Pokémon is damaged by an attack (even if it is Knocked Out), put 12 damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Max Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'200\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '3', 'Dracozolt V', '', '', 'Eighth', '330', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dracozolt VMAX', '880', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '59', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-6', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'name\': \'Rally Back\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If any of your Pokémon were Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon during their last turn, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '1', '', '', 'Bunches of delicious fruit grow around its neck. In warm areas, many ranches raise Tropius.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tropius', '357', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '6', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-60', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Teraspark\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Discard all Lightning Energy from this Pokémon. This attack also does 40 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', '', 'Its entire body is made up of a single organ that generates electrical energy. Regieleki is capable of creating all Galars electricity.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Regieleki', '894', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '8/27/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-61', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', 'Hypno', 'It puts its prey to sleep and devours their dreams. It seems that bad dreams taste sour, so Drowzee doesnt particularly like eating them.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drowzee', '96', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '8/27/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-62', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnosis\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Wake-Up Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is affected by a Special Condition, this attack does 90 more damage. Then, that Pokémon recovers from all Special Conditions.\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', 'Drowzee', '', 'There are some Hypno that assist doctors with patients who cant sleep at night in hospitals.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hypno', '97', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '8/27/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '62', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh7-63', '[{\'name\': \'Cruel Charge\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may attach up to 2 Psychic Energy cards from your hand to this Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Psylaser\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard all Psychic Energy from this Pokémon. This attack does 120 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Evolving Skies', '2', '', '', 'Known as Articuno, this Pokémon fires beams that can immobilize opponents as if they had been frozen solid.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh7/swsh7-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Articuno', '144', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '8/27/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
