('swsh8-116', '[{\'name\': \'Dig Up\', \'text\': \'When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may put up to 2 Pokémon Tool cards from your discard pile into your hand.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Bite\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Snubbull', '', 'Although its popular with young people, Granbull is timid and sensitive, so its totally incompetent as a watchdog.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-116.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Granbull', '210', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '116', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
