('swsh8-119', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Chomp Chomp Hold\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks cost Colorless more, and its Retreat Cost is Colorless more.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'It chomps with its gaping mouth. Its huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-119.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mawile', '303', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '119', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-12', '', '', '313', '[{\'name\': \'Peck\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Ditch and Shake\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'Discard any number of Pokémon Tool cards from your hand. This attack does 50 damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', '', 'Once each year, this Pokémon scatters its seeds. Theyre jam-packed with nutrients, making them a precious food source out in the desert.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Maractus', '556', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-120', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Photon Boost\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any Fusion Strike Energy attached, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-120.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Deoxys', '386', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '120', 'Basic, Fusion Strike, Single Strike, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-121', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', 'Musharna', 'It eats dreams and releases mist. The mist is pink when its eating a good dream, and black when its eating a nightmare.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-121.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Munna', '517', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '121', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-122', '', '', 'Tika Matsuno', '[{\'name\': \'Sleep Inducer\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Switch 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon. The new Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Munna', '', 'It drowses and dreams all the time. Its best to leave it be if its just woken up, as its a terrible grump when freshly roused from sleep.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-122.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Musharna', '518', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '122', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
