('swsh8-125', '', '', 'KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Vibration\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Spooky Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '3', '', 'Palossand', 'If you build sand mounds when youre playing, destroy them before you go home, or they may get possessed and become Sandygast.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-125.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandygast', '769', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '125', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-126', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Spooky Sand\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Oppressing Sandstorm\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon, it is Knocked Out.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '4', 'Sandygast', '', 'Once it has whipped up a sandstorm to halt its opponents in their tracks, this terrifying Pokémon snatches away their vitality.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-126.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Palossand', '770', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '126', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-127', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Call for Family\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Heart Sign\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'They diligently serve people and Pokémon so they can gather feelings of gratitude. The females are particularly good at babysitting.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-127.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Indeedee', '876', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '127', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-128', '', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'name\': \'Infestation\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Drakloak', 'If this weak Pokémon is by itself, a mere child could defeat it. But if Dreepy has friends to help it train, it can evolve and become much stronger.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-128.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dreepy', '885', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '128', 'Basic, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-129', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Spooky Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'U-turn\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Dreepy', 'Dragapult', 'Without a Dreepy to place on its head and care for, it gets so uneasy itll try to substitute any Pokémon it finds for the missing Dreepy.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-129.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drakloak', '886', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '129', 'Stage 1, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-13', '', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Spit Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '3', '', 'Accelgor', 'It has a strange physiology that responds to electricity. When together with Karrablast, Shelmet evolves for some reason.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Shelmet', '616', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '13', 'Basic, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-130', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Fusion Strike Assault\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 damage for each of your Fusion Strike Pokémon in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Speed Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '', 'Drakloak', '', 'Apparently the Dreepy inside Dragapults horns eagerly look forward to being launched out at Mach speeds.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-130.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dragapult', '887', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', '', '', 'Sword & Shield', '130', 'Stage 2, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-131', '', '', 'Yuka Morii', '[{\'name\': \'Dig It Up\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Look at the top card of your deck. You may discard that card.\'}, {\'name\': \"Let\'s All Rollout\", \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage for each of your Benched Pokémon that has the Let\'s All Rollout attack.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Sandslash', 'When its skin gets wrinkled from moisture, it heads for a volcano. It lies flat on a spot with a lot of geothermal heat and dries itself out.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-131.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandshrew', '27', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '131', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-132', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Dig Uppercut\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Put a card from your discard pile into your hand.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Sandshrew', '', 'Thanks to its thick claws, its good at climbing trees. There are plenty of Sandslash that park themselves in trees and go right to sleep.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-132.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sandslash', '28', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '132', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-133', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Primeape', 'If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-133.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mankey', '56', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '133', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-134', '', '', 'Yuya Oka', '[{\'name\': \'Gut Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon V, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Mankey', '', 'The blood vessels in its brain are sturdier than those of other Pokémon, so it can stay healthy despite its constant raging.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-134.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Primeape', '57', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '134', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-135', '', '', 'OKACHEKE', '[{\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Light Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '3', '', 'Graveler', 'It uses both hands to climb precipitous cliffs. People who see it in action have been known to take up bouldering.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-135.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Geodude', '74', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '135', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-136', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Boulder Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '4', 'Geodude', 'Golem', 'It travels by rolling down cliffs. If it falls into a river, it will explode with its last gasp.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-136.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Graveler', '75', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '136', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-137', '[{\'name\': \'Desperate Blast\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon is in the Active Spot and is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon, put 10 damage counters on the Attacking Pokémon.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'name\': \'Double-Edge\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon also does 30 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '4', 'Graveler', '', 'It detonates its own body. The power from that explosion can propel it up steep mountain paths with amazing speed.', 'Eighth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-137.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golem', '76', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '137', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-138', '', '', 'KEIICHIRO ITO', '[{\'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Rock Throw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '4', '', 'Steelix', 'It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-138.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Onix', '95', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '138', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-139', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Powerful Rage\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '4', 'Onix', '', 'It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-139.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Steelix', '208', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '139', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-14', '', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Ninja Tornado\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon moved from your Bench to the Active Spot this turn, this attack can be used for Grass.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Shelmet', '', 'Discarding its shell made it nimble. To keep itself from dehydrating, it wraps its body in bands of membrane.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Accelgor', '617', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '14', 'Stage 1, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-140', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Gliscor', 'It flies straight at its targets face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-140.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gligar', '207', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '140', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-141', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Cut Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Venomous Hit\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Gligar', '', 'Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-141.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gliscor', '472', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '141', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-142', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'name\': \'Lunge Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '3', '', 'Hariyama', 'Theres a rumor of a traditional recipe for stew that Trainers can use to raise strong Makuhita.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-142.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Makuhita', '296', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '142', 'Basic, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-143', '[{\'name\': \'Guts\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon would be Knocked Out by damage from an attack, flip a coin. If heads, this Pokémon is not Knocked Out, and its remaining HP becomes 10.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '4', 'Makuhita', '', 'Hariyama that are big and fat arent necessarily strong. There are some small ones that move nimbly and use moves skillfully.', 'Eighth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-143.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hariyama', '297', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '143', 'Stage 1, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-144', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Claydol', 'It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-144.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Baltoy', '343', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '144', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-145', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Rapid Spin\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. If you do, your opponent switches their Active Pokémon with 1 of their Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ancient Imprint\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put damage counters on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon until its remaining HP is 60.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Baltoy', '', 'It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-145.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Claydol', '344', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '145', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-146', '', '', 'aky CG Works', '[{\'name\': \'Aura Sphere\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-146.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario V', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '146', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-147', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', 'Excadrill', 'Its a digger, using its claws to burrow through the ground. It causes damage to vegetable crops, so many farmers have little love for it.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-147.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drilbur', '529', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '147', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-148', '', '', 'NC Empire', '[{\'name\': \'Strafe\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'You may switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Earthen Boom\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'Move all Energy from this Pokémon to your Benched Pokémon in any way you like.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'From the forces of lightning and wind, it creates energy to give nutrients to the soil and make the land abundant.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-148.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Landorus', '645', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '148', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('swsh8-149', '', '', 'Mina Nakai', '[{\'name\': \'Raised Bad\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Darkness Energy cards and attach them to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Smash Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', 'Pangoro', 'Wanting to make sure its taken seriously, Panchams always giving others a glare. But if its not focusing, it ends up smiling.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-149.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pancham', '674', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '149', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-15', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Bail Out\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put up to 2 Pokémon from your discard pile into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Virizion', '640', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '15', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-150', '', '', 'OKACHEKE', '[{\'name\': \'Beat\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rollout\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', 'Bewear', 'The way it protects itself by flailing its arms may be an adorable sight, but stay well away. This is flailing that can snap thick tree trunks.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-150.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Stufful', '759', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '150', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-151', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Split Spiral Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}, {\'name\': \'Strength\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '3', 'Stufful', '', 'The moves it uses to take down its prey would make a martial artist jealous. It tucks subdued prey under its arms to carry them to its nest.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-151.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Bewear', '760', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '151', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
