('swsh8-173', '', '', 'Narumi Sato', '[{\'name\': \'Bone Block\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, Pokémon can\'t be played from your opponent\'s hand to evolve the Defending Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Dark Cutter\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Vullaby', '', 'They adorn themselves with bones. There seem to be fashion trends among them, as different bones come into and fall out of popularity.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-173.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mandibuzz', '630', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '173', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
