('swsh8-190', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Steel Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Power Cyclone\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'Move an Energy from this Pokémon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Corvisquire', '', 'With their great intellect and flying skills, these Pokémon very successfully act as the Galar regions airborne taxi service.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-190.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Corviknight', '823', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '190', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
