('swsh8-234', '', '', 'AYUMI ODASHIMA', '', 'Fusion Strike', '', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-234.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Farewell Bell', '', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', '', '[\"If the Pokémon VMAX this card is attached to is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent\'s Pokémon, search your deck for a card and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\", \'You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.\', \"Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn\'t already have a Pokémon Tool attached.\"]', 'Sword & Shield', '234', 'Item, Pokémon Tool', 'Trainer', '', ''),
