('swsh8-51', '[{\'name\': \'Shell Armor\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'nagimiso', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Split\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 30 damage to 2 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Shellder', '', 'Once it slams its shell shut, it is impossible to open, even by those with superior strength.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cloyster', '91', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '51', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-52', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Soak in Water\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Attach a Water Energy card from your hand to this Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Spinning Attack\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Starmie', 'No number of injuries can bother Staryu. Its amazing regenerative powers return it to its previous state in half a day!', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Staryu', '120', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '52', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-53', '', '', 'Megumi Mizutani', '[{\'name\': \'Multishot Star\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard any amount of Water Energy from this Pokémon. Then, for each Energy card you discarded in this way, choose 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon and do 30 damage to it. (You can choose the same Pokémon more than once.) This damage isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Staryu', '', 'It rotates its geometrically shaped body to swim through the water. It always seems to be sending out mysterious radio waves.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Starmie', '121', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '53', 'Stage 1, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-54', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Icy Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Splash Arch\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put all Energy attached to this Pokémon into your hand. This attack does 100 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', '', 'Crossing icy seas is no issue for this cold-resistant Pokémon. Its smooth skin is a little cool to the touch.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lapras', '131', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '54', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-55', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Rain Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Croconaw', 'Its powerful, well-developed jaws are capable of crushing anything. Even its Trainer must be careful.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Totodile', '158', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '55', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-56', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Totodile', 'Feraligatr', 'Once it bites down, it wont let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Croconaw', '159', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '56', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-57', '[{\'name\': \'Rowdy\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you must flip a coin. If heads, discard the top 5 cards of your opponent\'s deck. If tails, discard the top 5 cards of your deck.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Crunch\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '3', 'Croconaw', '', 'When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears its victim up.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Feraligatr', '160', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '57', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-58', '', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Aqua Liner\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \"Let\'s All Rollout\", \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage for each of your Benched Pokémon that has the Let\'s All Rollout attack.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Azumarill', 'Even after Marill swims in a cold sea, its water- repellent fur dries almost as soon as Marill leaves the water. Thats why this Pokémon is never cold.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Marill', '183', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-59', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Dive and Rescue\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put up to 3 in any combination of Pokémon and Supporter cards from your discard pile into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Surf\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Marill', '', 'The bubble-like pattern on its stomach helps it camouflage itself when its in the water.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Azumarill', '184', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '59', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-6', '', '', 'PLANETA Mochizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Counter\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon was damaged by an attack during your opponent\'s last turn, this attack does that much more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mach Cross\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '210', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-6.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Breloom V', '286', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '6', 'Basic, V, Single Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-60', '', '', 'HYOGONOSUKE', '[{\'name\': \'Collect\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Spike Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'The small spikes covering its body developed from scales. They inject a toxin that causes fainting.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Qwilfish', '211', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-61', '', '', 'Saya Tsuruta', '[{\'name\': \'Bounce\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'You may switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Wave Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'As it majestically swims, it doesnt care if Remoraid attach to it to scavenge for its leftovers.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mantine', '226', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-62', '', '', 'KIYOTAKA OSHIYAMA', '[{\'name\': \'Mud-Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Playful Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Marshtomp', 'To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mudkip', '258', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-63', '', '', 'tetsuya koizumi', '[{\'name\': \'Mud-Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Energy Loop\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'Put an Energy attached to this Pokémon into your hand.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Mudkip', 'Swampert', 'Living on muddy ground that provides poor footing has made its legs sturdy.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Marshtomp', '259', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '63', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-64', '[{\'name\': \'Muddy Maker\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may attach a Water Energy card or a Fighting Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Earthquake\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180\', \'text\': \"This attack also does 20 damage to each of your Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '3', 'Marshtomp', '', 'It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Swampert', '260', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '64', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-65', '', '', 'Anesaki Dynamic', '[{\'name\': \'Bursting Bubble\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', 'Huntail, Gorebyss', 'Clamperls pearls are exceedingly precious. They can be more than 10 times as costly as Shellders pearls.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Clamperl', '366', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '65', 'Basic, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-66', '[{\'name\': \'Single Strike Jammer\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Single Strike Pokémon\'s attacks cost Colorless more.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'otumami', '[{\'name\': \'Cavernous Chomp\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Clamperl', '', 'Deep seas are their habitat. According to tradition, when Huntail wash up onshore, something unfortunate will happen.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Huntail', '367', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '66', 'Stage 1, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-67', '[{\'name\': \'Rapid Strike Canceler\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Rapid Strike Pokémon in play have no Abilities.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Draining Kiss\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Clamperl', '', 'It sucks bodily fluids out of its prey. The leftover meat sinks to the seafloor, where it becomes food for other Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gorebyss', '368', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '67', 'Stage 1, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-68', '', '', 'Sekio', '[{\'name\': \'Pry\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Simipour', 'The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Panpour', '515', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '68', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2');
