('swsh8-69', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Water Pulse\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Circus Soaking\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60×\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals their hand. This attack does 60 damage for each Supporter card you find there.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', 'Panpour', '', 'It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Simipour', '516', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '69', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-7', '', '', 'Nagomi Nijo', '[{\'name\': \'Scratch\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', 'Simisage', 'Its good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. Its kind enough to share them with friends.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pansage', '511', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '7', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-70', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Swarm the Wound\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 more damage for each damage counter on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Fusion Strike', '1', '', '', 'Known for their violence, these Pokémon have the most fights with schools of red-striped Basculin.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Basculin', '550', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '70', 'Basic, Rapid Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-71', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Reckless Charge\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this Pokémon also does 10 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', '', 'Darmanitan', 'The colder they get, the more energetic they are. They freeze their breath to make snowballs, using them as ammo for playful snowball fights.', 'Eighth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Darumaka', '554', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '71', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh8-72', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Powder Snow\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}, {\'name\': \'Daruma Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'130\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon has any damage counters on it, this attack can be used for Water.\'}]', 'Fusion Strike', '2', 'Galarian Darumaka', '', 'Though it has a gentle disposition, its also very strong. It will quickly freeze the snowball on its head before going for a headbutt.', 'Eighth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh8/swsh8-72.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Darmanitan', '555', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'E', '11/12/2021', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '72', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
