('swsh9-60', '', '', 'SATOSHI NAKAI', '[{\'name\': \'Perplex\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', 'Dusclops', 'If it finds bad children who wont listen to their parents, it will spirit them away—or so its said.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-60.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duskull', '355', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '2/25/2022', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '60', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-61', '', '', 'miki kudo', '[{\'name\': \'Fade to Black\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '2', 'Duskull', 'Dusknoir', 'Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-61.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dusclops', '356', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '2/25/2022', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '61', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-62', '[{\'name\': \'Special Transfer\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn, you may move a Special Energy from 1 of your Pokémon to another of your Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'otumami', '[{\'name\': \'Devour Soul\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '3', 'Dusclops', '', 'At the bidding of transmissions from the spirit world, it steals people and Pokémon away. No one knows whether it has a will of its own.', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dusknoir', '477', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'F', '2/25/2022', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '62', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-63', '', '', 'MAHOU', '[{\'name\': \'Clear Tone\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Special Energy cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hang Down\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', '', 'Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chimecho', '358', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '2/25/2022', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-64', '', '', 'Saki Hayashiro', '[{\'name\': \'Fluff Gets in the Way\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"If the Defending Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon, it can\'t attack during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Cotton Guard\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, this Pokémon takes 30 less damage from attacks (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-64.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Whimsicott V', '547', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '64', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-65', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Trick Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, they can\'t play any Pokémon Tool or Special Energy cards from their hand.\"}, {\'name\': \'Fluffball Star\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 60 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon for each Energy attached to this Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.) (You can\'t use more than 1 VSTAR Power in a game.)\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', 'Whimsicott V', '', '', 'Eighth', '250', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-65.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Whimsicott VSTAR', '547', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VSTAR', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '[\'VSTAR rule: When your Pokémon VSTAR is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '65', 'VSTAR', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-66', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Tri Recharge\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip 3 coins. Attach a number of basic Energy cards up to the number of heads from your discard pile to your Benched Pokémon in any way you like.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psychic\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 more damage for each Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', '', 'Psychic power allows these Pokémon to fly. Some say they were the guardians of an ancient city. Others say they were the guardians emissaries.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-66.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sigilyph', '561', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '2/25/2022', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '66', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-67', '', '', 'Nagomi Nijo', '[{\'name\': \'Dede-Flash\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent has exactly 1 Prize card remaining, this attack does 60 more damage, and your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', '', 'Since Dedenne cant generate as much electricity on its own, it steals electricity from outlets or other electric Pokémon.', 'Eighth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-67.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dedenne', '702', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '67', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-68', '[{\'name\': \'Dummy Doll\', \'text\': \"When you play this Pokémon from your hand onto your Bench during your turn, you may prevent all damage done to this Mimikyu V by attacks from your opponent\'s Pokémon until the end of your opponent\'s next turn.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Eske Yoshinob', '[{\'name\': \'Jealous Eyes\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 3 damage counters on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon for each Prize card your opponent has taken.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '2', '', '', '', 'Eighth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-68.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mimikyu V', '778', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo V', 'E', '2/25/2022', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'V rule: When your Pokémon V is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '68', 'Basic, V', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-69', '', '', 'Studio Bora Inc.', '[{\'name\': \'Ominous Numbers\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put 4 damage counters on your opponent\'s Pokémon in any way you like. If you played Acerola\'s Premonition from your hand during this turn, place 13 damage counters instead.\"}, {\'name\': \'Max Shadow\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"Discard a random card from your opponent\'s hand.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', 'Mimikyu V', '', '', 'Eighth', '300', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-69.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mimikyu VMAX', '778', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo VMAX', 'E', '2/25/2022', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '[\'VMAX rule: When your Pokémon VMAX is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 3 Prize cards.\']', 'Sword & Shield', '69', 'VMAX', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-7', '[{\'name\': \'Sun-Drenched Shell\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for a Grass Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Nisota Niso', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '3', 'Turtwig', 'Torterra', 'It knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.', 'Eighth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-7.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grotle', '388', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '7', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-70', '', '', 'Misa Tsutsui', '[{\'name\': \'Lead\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Supporter card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', 'Alcremie', 'They say that any patisserie visited by Milcery is guaranteed success and good fortune.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-70.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Milcery', '868', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'E', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '70', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-71', '[{\'name\': \'Additional Order\', \'text\': \'As long as this Pokémon is in the Active Spot, your turn does not end when you use Café Master.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'sowsow', '[{\'name\': \'Rainbow Flavor\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 40 more damage for each type of basic Energy attached to all of your Pokémon.\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', 'Milcery', '', 'When Alcremie is content, the cream it secretes from its hands becomes sweeter and richer.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-71.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Alcremie', '869', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'E', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '71', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Metal, value: ×2');
