('swsh9-74', '', '', 'zig', '[{\'name\': \'Rising Lunge\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', 'Vibrava', 'Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-74.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Trapinch', '328', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '74', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-75', '', '', 'Tomokazu Komiya', '[{\'name\': \'Razor Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', 'Trapinch', 'Flygon', 'The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-75.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Vibrava', '329', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '75', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-76', '', '', 'Shin Nagasawa', '[{\'name\': \'Desert Pillar\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 50 damage for each Colorless in your opponent\'s Active Pokémon\'s Retreat Cost.\"}, {\'name\': \'Blasting Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', 'Vibrava', '', 'This Pokémon hides in the heart of sandstorms it creates and seldom appears where people can see it.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-76.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flygon', '330', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '76', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-77', '', '', 'Lee HyunJung', '[{\'name\': \"Matron\'s Anger\", \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 more damage for each Pokémon in your discard pile.\'}, {\'name\': \'Bind Down\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '2', 'Burmy', '', 'When Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémons body. The cloak is never shed.', 'Eighth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-77.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wormadam', '413', 'TPCI', 'Rare', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '77', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-78', '', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'name\': \'Low Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', 'Lucario', 'Its exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-78.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Riolu', '447', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '78', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-79', '[{\'name\': \'Roaring Resolve\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may put 2 damage counters on this Pokémon. If you do, search your deck for a Fighting Energy card and attach it to this Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'GIDORA', '[{\'name\': \'Aura Sphere Volley\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Discard all Fighting Energy from this Pokémon. This attack does 60 more damage for each card you discarded in this way.\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '2', 'Riolu', '', 'It controls waves known as auras, which are powerful enough to pulverize huge rocks. It uses these waves to take down its prey.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-79.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '79', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-8', '', '', 'Oswaldo KATO', '[{\'name\': \'Evopress\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 50 damage for each of your Evolution Pokémon in play.\'}, {\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'160\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '4', 'Grotle', '', 'Small Pokémon occasionally gather on its unmoving back to begin building their nests.', 'Eighth', '190', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-8.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Torterra', '389', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '8', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-80', '', '', 'Teeziro', '[{\'name\': \'Lunge Out\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Seismic Toss\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'110\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '3', '', '', 'It performs throwing moves with first-rate skill. Over the course of many battles, Throhs belt grows darker as it absorbs its wearers sweat.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-80.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Throh', '538', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '80', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('swsh9-81', '', '', 'Shinji Kanda', '[{\'name\': \'Sweep the Leg\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy from your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Brilliant Stars', '1', '', '', 'If you see a Sawk training in the mountains in its single-minded pursuit of strength, its best to quietly pass by.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swsh9/swsh9-81.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Sawk', '539', 'TPCI', 'Common', 'F', '2/25/2022', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', '81', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
