('swshp-SWSH006', '[{\'name\': \'Voltage Beat\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may search your deck for up to 2 Grass Energy cards and attach them to 1 of your Pokémon. Then, shuffle your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer In\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '3', 'Thwackey', '', 'By drumming, it taps into the power of its special tree stump. The roots of the stump follow its direction in battle.', 'Eighth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH006.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Rillaboom', '812', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'D', '11/15/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH006', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swshp-SWSH007', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Dance\', \'text\': \'As often as you like during your turn, you may attach a Water Energy card from your hand to 1 of your Benched Water Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Aurora Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '2', 'Snom', '', 'It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH007.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Frosmoth', '873', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'D', '11/15/2019', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH007', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('swshp-SWSH008', '[{\'name\': \'Steely Spirit\', \'text\': \"Your Metal Pokémon\'s attacks do 20 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Metal Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '2', 'Galarian Meowth', '', 'What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.', 'Eighth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH008.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Galarian Perrserker', '863', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'D', '11/15/2019', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH008', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swshp-SWSH009', '[{\'name\': \'Make Do\', \'text\': \'You must discard a card from your hand in order to use this Ability. Once during your turn, you may draw 2 cards.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Shibuzoh.', '[{\'name\': \'Energy Assist\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '1', 'Minccino', '', 'Its body secrets oil that this Pokémon spreads over its nest as a coating to protect it from dust. Cinccino wont tolerate even a speck of the stuff.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH009.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Cinccino', '573', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'D', '11/15/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH009', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swshp-SWSH010', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Sing\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Eldegoss', 'It anchors itself in the ground with its single leg, then basks in the sun. After absorbing enough sunlight, its petals spread as it blooms brilliantly.', 'Eighth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH010.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gossifleur', '829', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'D', '11/15/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH010', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swshp-SWSH011', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Defense Curl\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, prevent all damage done to this Pokémon by attacks during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Headbutt\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Dubwool', 'Its curly fleece is such an effective cushion that this Pokémon could fall off a cliff and stand right back up at the bottom, unharmed.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH011.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wooloo', '831', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'D', '11/15/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH011', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Colorless', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
