('swshp-SWSH208', '[{\'name\': \'Giga Magnet\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn, you may look at the top 6 cards of your deck and attach any number of Metal Energy cards you find there to your Pokémon in any way you like. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'zig', '[{\'name\': \'Power Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '2', 'Magneton', '', 'Some say that Magnezone receives signals from space via the antenna on its head and that its being controlled by some mysterious being.', 'Eighth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH208.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Magnezone', '462', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'F', '11/15/2019', 'type: Grass, value: -30', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH208', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Metal', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('swshp-SWSH209', '', '', 'Souichirou Gunjima', '[{\'name\': \'Growl\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, the Defending Pokémon\'s attacks do 30 less damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Tiny Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '1', '', 'Toxtricity', 'It manipulates the chemical makeup of its poison to produce electricity. The voltage is weak, but it can cause a tingling paralysis.', 'Eighth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH209.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Toxel', '848', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'E', '11/15/2019', '', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH209', 'Basic, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('swshp-SWSH210', '', '', 'Ryuta Fuse', '[{\'name\': \'Mixed Call\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for a Pokémon and a Supporter card, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.\'}, {\'name\': \'Razor Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'SWSH Black Star Promos', '1', '', '', 'This Oricorio has sipped purple nectar. Some dancers use its graceful, elegant dancing as inspiration.', 'Eighth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/swshp/swshp-SWSH210.png', 'unlimited: Legal, standard: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Oricorio', '741', 'TPCI', 'Promo', 'E', '11/15/2019', 'type: Fighting, value: -30', 'Colorless', '', 'Sword & Shield', 'SWSH210', 'Basic, Fusion Strike', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2');
