('xy10-3', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Solar Ray\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Heal 20 damage from each of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Leaf Cutter\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Fates Collide', '2', 'Burmy', '', 'When Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémons body. The cloak is never shed.', 'Sixth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Wormadam', '413', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/02/2016', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '3', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy10-30', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Rocket Jump\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Fates Collide', '1', '', 'Grumpig', 'It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from Clamperl on its head.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spoink', '325', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/02/2016', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '30', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy10-31', '', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Head Walking\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Put a Basic Pokémon from your opponent\'s discard pile onto his or her Bench. Then, put 3 damage counters on that Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Knock Back\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches his or her Active Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Fates Collide', '2', 'Spoink', '', 'It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.', 'Sixth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Grumpig', '326', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/02/2016', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '31', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy10-32', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Psybeam\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'Fates Collide', '1', '', 'Gothorita', 'They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something only Gothita can see.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothita', '574', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/02/2016', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '32', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy10-33', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Mini Link\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Solosis is on your Bench, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Fates Collide', '1', '', 'Duosion', 'They drive away attackers by unleashing psychic power. They can use telepathy to talk with others.', 'Sixth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Solosis', '577', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/02/2016', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '33', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy10-34', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Double Link\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Solosis is on your Bench, this attack does 30 more damage. If Duosion is on your Bench, this attack does 60 more damage.\'}]', 'Fates Collide', '1', 'Solosis', 'Reuniclus', 'When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Duosion', '578', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/02/2016', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '34', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy10-35', '', '', 'Yukiko Baba', '[{\'name\': \'Link Fusion\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'If Solosis is on your Bench, this attack does 30 more damage. If Duosion is on your Bench, this attack does 60 more damage. If Reuniclus is on your Bench, this attack does 90 more damage.\'}]', 'Fates Collide', '1', 'Duosion', '', 'When Reuniclus shake hands, a network forms between their brains, increasing their psychic power.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Reuniclus', '579', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/02/2016', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '35', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy10-36', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Ram\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Fates Collide', '', '', 'Dugtrio', 'Its skin is very thin. If it is exposed to light, its blood heats up, causing it to grow weak.', 'Sixth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy10/xy10-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Diglett', '50', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '05/02/2016', '', '', '', 'XY', '36', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
