('xy3-14', '', '', 'PLANETA', '[{\'name\': \'Clutch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'50\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}, {\'name\': \'Burning Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Fire\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard 2 Energy attached to this Pokémon. This attack does 150 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Combusken', '', 'It can clear a 30-story building in a leap. Its fiery punches scorch its foes.', 'Sixth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Blaziken', '257', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '14', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
