('xy3-19', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzard\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Ice Edge\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', 'Eevee', '', 'By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-19.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Glaceon', '471', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '19', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
