('xy3-3', '[{\'name\': \'Wafting Scent\', \'text\': \"Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard a Grass Energy attached to this Pokémon. If you do, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused and Poisoned.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Sanosuke Sakuma', '[{\'name\': \'Spiral Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Weepinbell', '', 'Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there.', 'Sixth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-3.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Victreebel', '71', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '3', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy3-30', '', '', 'PLANETA', '[{\'name\': \'Tag Team Spark\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 20 more damage for each Energy attached to your Magmortar.\'}, {\'name\': \'Gigavolt\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage. If tails, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '3', 'Electabuzz', '', 'As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns.', 'Sixth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-30.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Electivire', '466', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '30', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('xy3-31', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Positive Hand\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Discard a basic Energy card from your hand. If you do, draw 2 cards.\'}, {\'name\': \'Electric Tail\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-31.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Plusle', '311', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '31', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('xy3-32', '', '', 'Akira Komayama', '[{\'name\': \'Negative Discard\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put 2 basic Energy cards from your discard pile into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Static Shock\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'Exposure to electricity from Minun and Plusle promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-32.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Minun', '312', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '32', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('xy3-33', '', '', 'Hajime Kusajima', '[{\'name\': \'Raging Thunder Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon has a Pokémon Tool card attached to it, this attack does 30 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Lightning Slam\', \'cost\': [\'Lightning\', \'Lightning\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t use Lightning Slam during your next turn.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of lightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off lightning bolts.', 'Sixth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-33.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Thundurus', '642', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '33', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('xy3-34', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Entrainment\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 2 Basic Pokémon and put them onto your Bench. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Energy Short\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20×\', \'text\': \"This attack does 20 damage times the amount of Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'Its whiskers serve as antennas. By sending and receiving electrical waves, it can communicate with others over vast distances.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-34.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Dedenne', '702', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '34', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
('xy3-35', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Sinister Suggestion\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Whenever your opponent flips a coin during his or her next turn, treat it as tails.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psyshot\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', '', 'Hypno', 'Puts enemies to sleep, then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating only bad dreams.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-35.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Drowzee', '96', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '35', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-36', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Hand Control\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals his or her hand. You may choose a Supporter card you find there. If you do, your opponent plays that Supporter card. However, you make all decisions for that card. (That Supporter card is discarded.)\'}, {\'name\': \'Hypnoblast\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Psychic\', \'Psychic\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Asleep.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Drowzee', '', 'It carries a pendulum-like device. There once was an incident in which it took away a child it hypnotized.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-36.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hypno', '97', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '36', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-37', '[{\'name\': \'Victory Kiss\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), if this Pokémon is on your Bench, you may heal 10 damage from your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Hug\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'It wiggles its hips as it walks. It can cause people to dance in unison with it.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-37.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Jynx', '124', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '37', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-38', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Poison Sting\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned.\"}, {\'name\': \'Pierce\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', '', 'Drapion', 'It grips prey with its tail claws and injects poison. It tenaciously hangs on until the poison takes.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-38.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Skorupi', '451', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '38', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-39', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Psy Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', 'Gothorita', 'Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.', 'Sixth', '50', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-39.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothita', '574', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '39', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-4', '', '', 'Eske Yoshinob', '[{\'name\': \'Guard Press\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}, {\'name\': \'Giga Power\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'You may do 40 more damage. If you do, this Pokémon does 20 damage to itself. | When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '3', '', 'M Heracross-EX', '', 'Sixth', '170', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-4.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Heracross-EX', '214', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'XY', '4', 'Basic, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy3-40', '', '', 'Suwama Chiaki', '[{\'name\': \'Fortunate Eye\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Look at the top 5 cards of your opponent\'s deck and put them back on top of his or her deck in any order.\"}, {\'name\': \'Smack\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', 'Gothita', 'Gothitelle', 'Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones.', 'Sixth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-40.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothorita', '575', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '40', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-41', '[{\'name\': \'Teleport Room\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may discard any Stadium card in play. If you do, put a Stadium card with a different name from your discard pile into play.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Psy Report\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'Your opponent reveals his or her hand.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Gothorita', '', 'Starry skies thousands of light-years away are visible in the space distorted by their intense psychic power.', 'Sixth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-41.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gothitelle', '576', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '41', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-42', '', '', 'Sumiyoshi Kizuki', '[{\'name\': \'Pound\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Rock Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 30 more damage.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '3', '', 'Golurk', 'The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-42.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golett', '622', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '42', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('xy3-43', '', '', 'PLANETA', '[{\'name\': \'Wreck\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'If there is any Stadium card in play, this attack does 60 more damage. Discard that Stadium card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Golurk Hammer\', \'cost\': [\'Psychic\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '4', 'Golett', '', 'It is said that Golurk were ordered to protect people and Pokémon by the ancient people who made them.', 'Sixth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-43.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Golurk', '623', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '43', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Psychic', 'type: Darkness, value: ×2'),
('xy3-44', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Knuckle Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', '', 'Machoke', 'It hefts a Graveler repeatedly to strengthen its entire body. It uses every type of martial arts.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-44.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Machop', '66', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '44', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-45', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Beatdown\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Machop', 'Machamp', 'Its muscular body is so powerful, it must wear a power-save belt to be able to regulate its motions.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-45.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Machoke', '67', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '45', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-46', '[{\'name\': \'Fighting Fury\', \'text\': \"Each of your Fighting Pokémon\'s attacks do 20 more damage to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'PLANETA', '[{\'name\': \'Machamp Crush\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done by attacks from the Defending Pokémon is reduced by 40 (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Machoke', '', 'Its four ruggedly developed arms can launch a flurry of 1,000 punches in just two seconds.', 'Sixth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-46.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Machamp', '68', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '46', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-47', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Stretch Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"This attack does 30 damage to 1 of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}, {\'name\': \'Spiral Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-47.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hitmonlee', '106', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '47', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-48', '', '', 'match', '[{\'name\': \'Bullet Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip 2 coins. This attack does 20 more damage for each heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Mach Cross\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-48.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hitmonchan', '107', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '48', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2');
INSERT INTO `cards` (`id`, `abilities`, `ancient_trait`, `artist`, `attacks`, `card_set`, `converted`, `evolves_from`, `evolves_to`, `flavor_text`, `generation`, `hp`, `img`, `legalities`, `level`, `name`, `national_pokedex_numbers`, `publisher`, `rarity`, `regulation_mark`, `release_date`, `resistances`, `retreat_cost`, `rules`, `series`, `set_num`, `subtypes`, `supertype`, `types`, `weakness`) VALUES
('xy3-49', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Quick Draw\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Helicoptero\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by 10.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hitmontop', '237', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '49', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-5', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Big Bang Horn\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'180-\', \'text\': \'This attack does 180 damage minus 10 damage for each damage counter on this Pokémon.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '3', 'Heracross-EX', '', '', 'Sixth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-5.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'M Heracross-EX', '214', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Mega Evolution rule: When 1 of your Pokémon becomes a Mega Evolution Pokémon, your turn ends.\', \'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'XY', '5', 'MEGA, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy3-50', '', '', 'Hitoshi Ariga', '[{\'name\': \'Giga Drain\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Heal from this Pokémon the same amount of damage you did to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Sky Uppercut\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Shroomish', '', 'Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.', 'Sixth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Breloom', '286', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-51', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Punch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Strength\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '3', '', 'Hariyama', 'It toughens up by slamming into thick trees over and over. It gains a sturdy body and dauntless spirit.', 'Sixth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Makuhita', '296', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '51', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-52', '[{\'name\': \'Thick Fat\', \'text\': \"Any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks from your opponent\'s Fire or Water Pokémon is reduced by 30 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Rocket Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '4', 'Makuhita', '', 'It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch.', 'Sixth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-52.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hariyama', '297', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '52', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-53', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Mountain Munch\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Discard the top card of your opponent\'s deck.\"}, {\'name\': \'Mud-Slap\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', 'Vibrava', 'It lives in arid deserts. It makes a sloping pit trap in sand where it patiently awaits prey.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-53.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Trapinch', '328', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '53', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('xy3-54', '', '', 'Eske Yoshinob', '[{\'name\': \'Missile Jab\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"This attack\'s damage isn\'t affected by Resistance.\"}, {\'name\': \'Corkscrew Smash\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'You may draw cards until you have 6 cards in your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Somersault Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', '', 'M Lucario-EX', '', 'Sixth', '180', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-54.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Lucario-EX', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'XY', '54', 'Basic, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-55', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Rising Fist\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Lucario-EX', '', '', 'Sixth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-55.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'M Lucario-EX', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo EX', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Mega Evolution rule: When 1 of your Pokémon becomes a Mega Evolution Pokémon, your turn ends.\', \'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'XY', '55', 'MEGA, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-55a', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Rising Fist\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'140\', \'text\': \"Discard an Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '2', 'Lucario-EX', '', '', 'Sixth', '220', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-55a.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'M Lucario-EX', '448', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Mega Evolution rule: When 1 of your Pokémon becomes a Mega Evolution Pokémon, your turn ends.\', \'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'XY', '55a', 'MEGA, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-56', '', '', 'Shigenori Negishi', '[{\'name\': \'Flop\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Lunge\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing.\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', 'Mienshao', 'It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-56.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienfoo', '619', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '56', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-57', '', '', 'TOKIYA', '[{\'name\': \'Aero Turn\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'Return this Pokémon and all cards attached to it to your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'High Jump Kick\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', 'Mienfoo', '', 'It wields the fur on its arm like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-57.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Mienshao', '620', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '57', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xy3-58', '', '', 'PLANETA', '[{\'name\': \'Shout of Power\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'Attach a basic Energy card from your discard pile to 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Sky Lariat\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', '', 'Lands visited by Landorus grant such bountiful crops that it has been hailed as The Guardian of the Fields.', 'Sixth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Landorus', '645', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '58', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('xy3-59', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Bad-Influence Evolution\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'If you have any Darkness Pokémon on your Bench, search your deck for a card that evolves from this Pokémon and put it onto this Pokémon. (This counts as evolving this Pokémon.) Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Confront\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Furious Fists', '1', '', 'Pangoro', 'It does its best to be taken seriously by its enemies, but its glare is not sufficiently intimidating. Chewing on a leaf is its trademark.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-59.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pancham', '674', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '59', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
