('xy3-62', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Chew Up\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon has any Special Energy attached to it, this attack does 90 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Giga Impact\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"This Pokémon can\'t attack during your next turn.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '3', 'Tyrunt', '', 'Thanks to its gargantuan jaws, which could shred thick metal plates as if they were paper, it was invincible in the ancient world it once inhabited.', 'Sixth', '150', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tyrantrum', '697', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '8/13/2014', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '62', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('xy3-63', '[{\'name\': \'Shining Spirit\', \'text\': \"Damage from this Pokémon\'s attacks isn\'t affected by Weakness or Resistance.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Flying Press\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon isn\'t a Pokémon-EX, this attack does nothing.\"}]', 'Furious Fists', '', '', '', 'Although its body is small, its proficient fighting skills enable it to keep up with big bruisers like Machamp and Hariyama.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy3/xy3-63.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Hawlucha', '701', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '8/13/2014', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', '', '', 'XY', '63', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Lightning, value: ×2'),
