('xy5-62', '', '', 'Atsuko Nishida', '[{\'name\': \'Water Splash\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 10 more damage.\'}]', 'Primal Clash', '1', '', 'Eelektrik', 'One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock.', 'Sixth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy5/xy5-62.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tynamo', '602', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '02/04/2015', 'type: Metal, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '62', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Lightning', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
