('xy6-12', '', '', 'Kyoko Umemoto', '[{\'name\': \'Stomp\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'50+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage.\'}, {\'name\': \'Solar Beam\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Roaring Skies', '2', '', '', 'The bunch of fruit around its neck ripens twice a year and is delicious. Its a highly favored tropical snack.', 'Sixth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy6/xy6-12.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Tropius', '357', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/06/2015', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '12', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy6-13', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Me First\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw a card.\'}, {\'name\': \'Psy Bolt\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed.\"}]', 'Roaring Skies', '1', '', '', 'When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that beings entire body will be overflowing with power.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy6/xy6-13.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Victini', '494', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/06/2015', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '13', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('xy6-14', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Peck Off\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \"Before doing damage, discard all Pokémon Tool cards attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Roaring Skies', '', 'Fletchling', 'Talonflame', 'The hotter the flame sac on its belly, the faster it can fly, but it takes some time to get the fire going.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy6/xy6-14.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Fletchinder', '662', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '05/06/2015', '', '', '', 'XY', '14', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('xy6-15', '', '', 'Masakazu Fukuda', '[{\'name\': \'Grand Loop\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Draw 3 cards. You may switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Brave Bird\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'90\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 20 damage to itself.\'}]', 'Roaring Skies', '', 'Fletchinder', '', 'When attacking prey, it can reach speeds of up to 310 mph. It finishes its prey off with a colossal kick.', 'Sixth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy6/xy6-15.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Talonflame', '663', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/06/2015', '', '', '', 'XY', '15', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
('xy6-16', '', '', 'Naoki Saito', '[{\'name\': \'Find Ice\', \'cost\': [\'Water\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Search your deck for up to 3 Water Energy cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}, {\'name\': \'Freezing Wind\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'Roaring Skies', '1', '', '', 'A legendary bird Pokémon that is said to appear to doomed people who are lost in icy mountains.', 'Sixth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy6/xy6-16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Articuno', '144', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '05/06/2015', 'type: Fighting, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '16', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
