('xy7-92', '', 'name: θ Double, text: This Pokémon may have up to 2 Pokémon Tool cards attached to it.', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Destroyer King\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'110+\', \'text\': \"This attack does 60 more damage for each damage counter on your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}]', 'Ancient Origins', '4', 'Tyranitar-EX', '', '', 'Sixth', '240', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy7/xy7-92.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'M Tyranitar-EX', '248', 'TPCI', 'Rare Ultra', '', '08/12/2015', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Mega Evolution rule: When 1 of your Pokémon becomes a Mega Evolution Pokémon, your turn ends.\', \'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'XY', '92', 'MEGA, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
