('xy7-96', '', 'name: θ Max, text: When 1 of your Pokémon becomes this Pokémon, heal all damage from it.', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Tidal Storm\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'150\', \'text\': \"Move 2 Energy from this Pokémon to 1 of your Benched Pokémon. This attack does 30 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon-EX. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'Ancient Origins', '4', 'Kyogre-EX', '', '', 'Sixth', '240', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy7/xy7-96.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Primal Kyogre-EX', '382', 'TPCI', 'Rare Secret', '', '08/12/2015', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '[\'Primal Reversion rule: When 1 of your Pokémon becomes Primal Kyogre-EX, your turn ends.\', \'Pokémon-EX rule: When a Pokémon-EX has been Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\']', 'XY', '96', 'MEGA, EX', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
