('xy8-1', '', '', 'Hajime Kusajima', '[{\'name\': \'Blot\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'Heal 10 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '1', '', 'Parasect', 'Burrows under the ground to gnaw on tree roots. The mushrooms on its back absorb most of the nutrition.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-1.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Paras', '46', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2015', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '1', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy8-10', '', '', 'Miki Tanaka', '[{\'name\': \'Tackle\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Pin Missile\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40×\', \'text\': \'Flip 4 coins. This attack does 40 damage times the number of heads.\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '3', 'Chespin', 'Chesnaught', 'They strengthen their lower bodies by running into one another. They are very kind and wont start fights.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-10.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Quilladin', '651', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2015', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '10', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy8-100', '', '', 'Aya Kusube', '[{\'name\': \'Mumble\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Magical Shot\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '1', '', 'Kirlia', 'It is highly attuned to the emotions of people and Pokémon. It hides if it senses hostility.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-100.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Ralts', '280', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2015', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '100', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('xy8-101', '', '', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Wish\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for a card and put it into your hand. Shuffle your deck afterward.\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '1', '', 'Floette', 'When it finds a flower it likes, it dwells on that flower its whole life long. It floats in the winds embrace with an untroubled heart.', 'Sixth', '30', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-101.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Flabébé', '669', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2015', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '101', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('xy8-102', '', '', 'Midori Harada', '[{\'name\': \'Aromatherapy\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Heal 30 damage from each of your Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Magical Leaf\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'20+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 20 more damage and heal 20 damage from this Pokémon.\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '1', 'Flabébé', 'Florges', 'When the flowers of a well-tended flower bed bloom, it appears and celebrates with an elegant dance.', 'Sixth', '70', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-102.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Floette', '670', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2015', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '102', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('xy8-103', '[{\'name\': \'Calming Aroma\', \'text\': \"Each of your Pokémon\'s attacks costs Fairy less.\", \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', 'Hajime Kusajima', '[{\'name\': \'Wonder Shine\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Fairy\', \'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'70\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'BREAKthrough', '1', 'Floette', '', 'In times long past, governors of castles would invite Florges to create flower gardens to embellish the castle domains.', 'Sixth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-103.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Florges', '671', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/04/2015', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '103', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('xy8-104', '[{\'name\': \'Floral Breeze\', \'text\': \'Once during your turn (before your attack), you may heal 30 damage and remove a Special Condition from your Active Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '', 'BREAKthrough', '', 'Florges', '', '', 'Sixth', '140', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-104.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Florges BREAK', '671', 'TPCI', 'Rare BREAK', '', '11/04/2015', '', '', '[\'BREAK Evolution Rule: Florges BREAK retains the attacks, Abilities, Weakness, Resistance, and Retreat Cost of its previous Evolution.\']', 'XY', '104', 'BREAK', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', ''),
('xy8-105', '', '', 'Naoyo Kimura', '[{\'name\': \'Flail\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'10×\', \'text\': \'This attack does 10 damage times the number of damage counters on this Pokémon.\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '1', '', 'Aromatisse', 'In the past, rather than using perfume, royal ladies carried a Spritzee that would waft a fragrance they liked.', 'Sixth', '40', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-105.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Spritzee', '682', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2015', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '105', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('xy8-106', '', '', 'Mizue', '[{\'name\': \'Heavy Perfume\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \"Your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused. Put 6 damage counters instead of 3 on that Pokémon for this Special Condition.\"}, {\'name\': \'Hug\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \"The Defending Pokémon can\'t retreat during your opponent\'s next turn.\"}]', 'BREAKthrough', '1', 'Spritzee', '', 'Its scent is so overpowering that, unless a Trainer happens to really enjoy the smell, he or she will have a hard time walking alongside it.', 'Sixth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-106.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Aromatisse', '683', 'TPCI', 'Rare', '', '11/04/2015', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', '106', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('xy8-107', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Rainbow Force\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'10+\', \'text\': \'This attack does 30 more damage for each different type of Pokémon on your Bench.\'}, {\'name\': \'Power Creation\', \'cost\': [\'Fairy\', \'Fairy\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon was healed during this turn, this attack does 80 more damage.\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '2', '', '', 'When the horns on its head shine in seven different colors, it is said to be sharing everlasting life.', 'Sixth', '120', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-107.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Xerneas', '716', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/04/2015', 'type: Darkness, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '107', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fairy', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
