('xy8-109', '', '', 'Kagemaru Himeno', '[{\'name\': \'Extra Chop\', \'cost\': [\'Metal\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'This Pokémon does 10 damage to itself.\'}, {\'name\': \'Dragon Claw\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'BREAKthrough', '2', '', 'Fraxure', 'They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly.', 'Sixth', '60', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-109.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Axew', '610', 'TPCI', 'Common', '', '11/04/2015', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '109', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2'),
('xy8-11', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Spike Lariat\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon already has any damage counters on it, this attack does 60 more damage.\"}, {\'name\': \'Adamantine Press\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'100\', \'text\': \"During your opponent\'s next turn, any damage done to this Pokémon by attacks is reduced by 20 (after applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'BREAKthrough', '4', 'Quilladin', '', 'When it takes a defensive posture with its fists guarding its face, it could withstand a bomb blast.', 'Sixth', '160', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-11.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Chesnaught', '652', 'TPCI', 'Rare Holo', '', '11/04/2015', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '11', 'Stage 2', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xy8-110', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Sharp Fang\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Dragon Slayer\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Metal\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \"If your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is a Dragon Pokémon, this attack does 40 more damage (before applying Weakness and Resistance).\"}]', 'BREAKthrough', '2', 'Axew', 'Haxorus', 'A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle.', 'Sixth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xy8/xy8-110.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Fraxure', '611', 'TPCI', 'Uncommon', '', '11/04/2015', '', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', '110', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Dragon', 'type: Fairy, value: ×2');
