('xyp-XY16', '', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Push Down\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'Your opponent switches his or her Active Pokémon with 1 of his or her Benched Pokémon.\'}, {\'name\': \'Forest Press\', \'cost\': [\'Grass\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin for each Grass Energy attached to this Pokémon. This attack does 30 more damage for each heads.\'}]', 'XY Black Star Promos', '3', 'Skiddo', '', 'It can tell how its trainer is feeling by subtle shifts in the grip on its horns. This empathetic sense lets them run as if one being.', 'Fifth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xyp/xyp-XY16.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Gogoat', '673', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '10/12/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', 'XY16', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Grass', 'type: Fire, value: ×2'),
('xyp-XY160', '', '', 'kawayoo', '[{\'name\': \'Ice Wing\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'60\', \'text\': \'\'}, {\'name\': \'Frosty Thunder\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'120\', \'text\': \"If this Pokémon has any Lightning Energy attached to it, this attack does 20 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'XY Black Star Promos', '3', '', '', 'It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xyp/xyp-XY160.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Black Kyurem', '646', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '10/12/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', 'XY160', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Metal, value: ×2'),
('xyp-XY161', '', '', 'kirisAki', '[{\'name\': \'Destructive Flame\', \'cost\': [\'Fire\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'20\', \'text\': \"Flip a coin. If heads, discard an Energy attached to your opponent\'s Active Pokémon.\"}, {\'name\': \'Crackling Ribbon\', \'cost\': [\'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30\', \'text\': \'\'}]', 'XY Black Star Promos', '1', 'Fennekin', 'Delphox', 'When the twig is plucked from its tail, friction sets the twig alight. The flame is used to send signals to its allies.', 'Fifth', '80', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xyp/xyp-XY161.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Braixen', '654', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '10/12/2013', '', 'Colorless', '', 'XY', 'XY161', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fire', 'type: Water, value: ×2'),
