('xyp-XY49', '', 'name: Ω Barrier, text: Whenever your opponent plays a Trainer card excluding Pokémon Tools and Stadium cards, prevent all effects of that card done to this Pokémon.', 'Kouki Saitou', '[{\'name\': \'Land Maker\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 1, \'damage\': \'\', \'text\': \'Put 2 Stadium cards from your discard pile into your hand.\'}, {\'name\': \'Stone Edge\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin. If heads, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}]', 'XY Black Star Promos', '3', '', '', 'The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world.', 'Fifth', '110', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xyp/xyp-XY49.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Regirock', '377', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '10/12/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', 'XY49', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
('xyp-XY50', '[{\'name\': \'Benevolent Boss\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, it gets +20 HP for each of your Benched Pokémon.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', '', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Crazy Knuckle\', \'cost\': [\'Fighting\', \'Fighting\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'80+\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon is affected by a Special Condition, this attack does 40 more damage.\'}]', 'XY Black Star Promos', '3', 'Pancham', '', 'Although it possesses a violent temperament, it wont put up with bullying. It uses the leaf in its mouth to sense the movements of its enemies.', 'Fifth', '100', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xyp/xyp-XY50.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Pangoro', '675', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '10/12/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', 'XY50', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Fighting', 'type: Psychic, value: ×2'),
('xyp-XY51', '', '', 'Mitsuhiro Arita', '[{\'name\': \'Spring Tides\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 2, \'damage\': \'30×\', \'text\': \'Flip a coin until you get tails. This attack does 30 damage times the number of heads.\'}, {\'name\': \'Ocean Cyclone\', \'cost\': [\'Water\', \'Water\', \'Water\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 4, \'damage\': \'80\', \'text\': \"This attack does 10 damage to each of your opponent\'s Benched Pokémon. (Don\'t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)\"}]', 'XY Black Star Promos', '4', '', '', 'It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.', 'Fifth', '130', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xyp/xyp-XY51.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Kyogre', '382', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '10/12/2013', '', 'Colorless, Colorless, Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', 'XY51', 'Basic', 'Pokémon', 'Water', 'type: Grass, value: ×2'),
