('xyp-XY58', '[{\'name\': \'Contrary\', \'text\': \'If this Pokémon is your Active Pokémon, whenever your opponent flips a coin during his or her turn, treat it as tails.\', \'type\': \'Ability\'}]', 'name: θ Stop, text: Prevent all effects of your opponents Pokémons Abilities done to this Pokémon.', '5ban Graphics', '[{\'name\': \'Conform\', \'cost\': [\'Darkness\', \'Colorless\', \'Colorless\'], \'convertedEnergyCost\': 3, \'damage\': \'40\', \'text\': \"If you have the same number of cards in your hand as your opponent, your opponent\'s Active Pokémon is now Confused.\"}]', 'XY Black Star Promos', '2', 'Inkay', '', 'It lures its prey close with hypnotic motions, then wraps its tentacles around it before finishing it off with digestive fluids.', 'Fifth', '90', 'https://images.pokemoncard.io/images/xyp/xyp-XY58.png', 'unlimited: Legal, expanded: Legal', '', 'Malamar', '687', 'TPCI', 'Promo', '', '10/12/2013', 'type: Psychic, value: -20', 'Colorless, Colorless', '', 'XY', 'XY58', 'Stage 1', 'Pokémon', 'Darkness', 'type: Fighting, value: ×2'),
